{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_15","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now have a clear picture of the codebase. I am examining how audio is started and whether an offline render function exists.\n\nI am searching app.rs for a precise hook in the frame loop. The engine will render the scene and HUD text. Merc's build() will create a standalone room with ground, sky, props, and player. Game rules run in post(). Browser tests validate JSON state rather than pixels.\n\nI will publish window.__game from Rust every frame while the merc game runs. web_sys is already available in pav_app, so the hook belongs there rather than pav_core. I am now reading the app.rs frame loop around lines 1200-1400 and the input handling to find the exact insertion point.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06002fb1-b6ff-484a-a08c-27247d3ad35b-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"rig\\.(update|snap|params)|builder\\.build|hud\\.lines|controls card|show_fps|footer","glob":"**/app.rs","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06002fb1-b6ff-484a-a08c-27247d3ad35b-34","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06002fb1-b6ff-484a-a08c-27247d3ad35b-35","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"history_seconds|pub fn new\\(","glob":"**/sim.rs","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06002fb1-b6ff-484a-a08c-27247d3ad35b-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn render_events|pub fn play|Audio","glob