{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_16","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have a clear implementation plan.\n\nI'm examining app.rs and input.rs to locate the frame update loop and mouse input hooks. I'll also check for a test mode and see how the HUD is drawn so I can render large text via egui from inside the game.\n\nA simpler DOM overlay approach is better than embedding egui in app.rs. The HTML title will be \"Jam Cry\", the canvas will render the 3D scene, and a JS overlay will display the 10-foot menu from `window.__game.ui`. Browser tests also require gamepad prompt glyphs to flip for PlayStation, Xbox settings to change them, pointer-lock mouse movement to rotate yaw, and losing lock to open pause.\n\nMore browser tests need coverage: phone profile notices, WebKit GPU checks, dev mode toggles, file:// Continue, music gain 0.10, and About text fields. The shell will publish state through JSON so JavaScript can render it and the test harness can read it. Keyboard events already reach the engine via InputFrame, but I still need to map keys to game actions and menu navigation. I'll check pav_app/src/input.rs for the current key mapping.\n\nI mapped the existing InputFrame buttons to merc controls: fire, aim, interact, jump, crouch, sprint, and use. I also realized InputFrame lacks a look vector, so I need to add `look: Vec2` to the struct.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bcbf41e4-00c3-4f55-a09a-54d205424c69-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"InputFrame \\{","glob":"**/*.rs","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bcbf41e4-00c3-4f55-a09a-54d205424c69-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":1140,"limit":150}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bcbf41e4-00c3-4f55-a09a-54d205424c69-39","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn poll|MouseMotion|movement|buttons::PRIMARY|keyboard","glob":"**/input.rs","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2823,"output_tokens":925,"cache_read_input_tokens":100608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"01045ad4-3e0f-43b4-8625-d00e5320c470"}
