-4fcc-ae24-cf4ad14a315f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_30","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation thread reads the input frame each tick.\n\nTest commands will be encoded in `input.act` as a `u32` bitfield. This keeps `InputFrame` `Copy`. JS can queue commands into a global that Rust reads each tick. Defined act codes include confirm, back, arrow keys, save, and developer functions.\n\nThe shell will also accept real keyboard input. gameTest.queue strings like \"god\" and \"slider:fire.spread_rate:+\" map to act codes and side-channel data. The high bits of the u32 command id encode the specific action.\n\nJS will set `window.gameTest.pending` to a command code. Rust copies it into `input.act` each tick and clears the global.\n\nSave and load commands trigger `world.save_to_storage()`.\n\nA `nodraw` query flag skips scene drawing for faster browser tests. The simulation still runs and status is published. The launch test does not use this flag because it needs a filled canvas.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e7bb39b3-f072-43a3-9dc1-8bda94cf6c4e-73","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Escape|menu_open","glob":"**/app.rs","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e7bb39b3-f072-43a3-9dc1-8bda94cf6c4e-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/simhost.rs","offset":216,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2585,"output_tokens":757,"cache_read_input_tokens":143872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"20416ec2-6e08-4137-bb2f-ac693f463059"}
