ir.y\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"8b7125dd-74c0-4fc0-8e6d-1293a2228c61"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_76","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing net.rs, shell.rs, world.rs, and mod.rs.\n\nFocusing on world.rs. Planning shell_tick, rows, and glyph methods. Considering pause logic and the fire tip fuel bug.\n\nShell tick will run at the start of world tick when not playing. Pause triggers on act 10 during gameplay. Button handling and stats references are verified. Now drafting world.rs with script step kinds for Burn and Human.\n\nRemoving the redundant `post_remanned` Flag step from the Burn script because the Sleep step already sets it. Also removing the `night_contract` flag since the Night step handles that. The remaining steps are Night, Boat, Stealth, Dart, contract flags, and Repair.\n\nContinuing the Burn script draft. Adding Rain, contract flags, Better, route-specific endings, Tape, Ceasefire, Convoy, Town, and Drive steps.\n\nFinalized the Burn script with an Ending step and contract_d2 flag. Defined the 12 ignite indices from flare to cigarette. Noted that Tanks may overlap with barrel ignite but that is acceptable. Wind rag triggers when Drive sets wind to (9, 0) and speed exceeds 6. Technical driven activates during Drive when movement occurs. Boot completes once the screen becomes Playing; the bot sends act 1.\n\nMap step: bot holds MAP. map_t increases while held. It completes at the 0.5 mark and sets a flag.\n\nWay step: bot act 1. Sets waypoint to (0, 460). Mark waypoint_set.\n\nReach step: bot_go. If gps is true, it marks gps_followed when distance exceeds 25. It completes when distance is under 10. On begin it stores step_x and step_z from the player position and exits the vehicle.\n\nFever step: begins by setting fever_state to 1 and fever_warn to 0. It marks fever_warned. It completes when fever_state reaches 1 and fever_warn exceeds 0.5. The warning preceding attack is the core mechanic.\n\nFever step logic refined: begin sets fever_t to the interval so the next update enters warning, then done waits for the flag. The pill step occurs during that warning window, which is valid since it stops the attack. The blackout route requires the full attack sequence.\n\nPill step: bot holds PILLS. pill_t accumulates while held and fever_state is active. It clears the fever at 2.5 seconds and marks pill_taken. It completes when that flag is set.\n\nBlackout step: sets pills to zero and fever_state to 2. The bot waits for the 60-second blackout() trigger. It completes when the blackout flag is set. The total budget is 70 seconds.\n\nFight step: spawns four soldiers 12 meters north of the player with 36 HP. The bot aims head and shoots. It completes when no living soldiers remain.\n\nEnemyJam spawns one soldier with gun condition 5, zero wear, 400 ammo, and combat alert. The NPC tick fires the weapon. It completes when the enemy_jam flag is set.\n\nJam forces the player gun to jam at condition 40. The bot fires then reloads with a slap. It completes once the jam is seen and cleared.\n\nBreak switches to an SMG with condition 5, zero wear, 999 ammo, and 999 reserve. The bot fires and slap-reloads. It completes when the weapon breaks.\n\nBreak restores a working pistol so later steps can shoot. Rescue restores 50 HP after 3 seconds and marks player_rescued. Wound(n) holds HEAL for 4 seconds to heal to 40 HP and mark the wound flag. Loot spawns a rifle pickup and claims it. Claim interacts at the safe house, marks safe_house_claimed, and heals fully.\n\nShop: spends 8 diamonds to buy a Battle or SMG and marks weapon_bought. Locker: interacts and switches the slot to the purchased gun, marking locker_used. Syrette: heals 60 HP at 50 HP, marks syrette, and requires 3 in inventory. Tracker: caches at a fixed point; no teleport since Reach handles positioning.\n\nTracker step: the bot walks to a cache at (90, 500). Beep rate depends on distance. It marks cache_tracker when within three meters.\n\nSleep step: the bot walks to the nearest safe house if not already there. It holds interact for one second. Then it advances minutes by hours, restores full HP, clears rescue_spent, and marks sleep_used. After twenty-four hours it respawns the post if post_clear is true and GP1 is not in view. The bot faces south so GP1 sits behind it.\n\nDrive spawns a technical at the player and enters it via USE. Wind rag is marked immediately. Technical driven is marked after moving more than thirty meters. Mono spawns a soldier and holds MONOCULAR for half a second to tag it. Ignite steps call the igniter at a grass point near the depot, each setting its own flag; tracer fires the gun, and cigarette is an interact.\n\nLightning sets storm and strikes. Person sets an NPC on fire. Vehicle ignites the vehicle and a cell. Barrel places two barrels and fires one; Tanks handles the larger chain, while barrel ignite can be a single explosion.\n\nTracer: bot holds primary fire, aiming slightly down to hit grass. Every third shot has a 25% chance to ignite. The step's tick fires shots along the ground.\n\nTanks: places a grid of barrels, fires one, and the chain explosion ignites a disk of radius six.\n\nMounted step: USE to the gunner seat in the technical and fire. Mark mounted_gun.\n\nPanic step: spawn a soldier, ignite a cell beneath them, and mark enemy_panicked when they move away from the fire.\n\nAnimals step: spawn an animal, have the player shoot it to create noise, and mark animals_fled when distance increases by eight meters.\n\nBus step: must be near a stop. The three stops are town (0,380), junction (20,-420), and mission (380,400). If the drive ended at the depot, the nearest stop is junction.\n\nBus step: the bot drives to the junction stop, pays one diamond, and arrives at the target. The depot-to-junction leg takes roughly thirty-five seconds.\n\nA problem emerged for the twenty-six-hour sleep after the bus. Town is at (0, 380) but the safe house is at (-260, -700). Walking that distance would take over six minutes. That is too long.\n\nThe bus target is changed to town. The bot drives to the junction stop, takes the bus there, and then drives to SH2 for the long sleep. This avoids the slow walk from town to the safe house.\n\nThe full route from depot to safe house takes roughly one hundred ten seconds, which is acceptable. Night sets the hour to twenty-two and marks the flag immediately. Boat exits the vehicle, drives to the nearest water, enters the boat, and moves more than twenty meters on deep water.\n\nThe boat step will drive to the nearest water, spawn the boat there, and mark boat_driven once it moves more than twenty meters on deep water. From SH2 the nearest river is roughly 760 meters away. The total estimated simulation time is about eight hundred seconds.\n\nStealth spawns a soldier facing away, crouches behind it, and kills with melee. Dart equips a dart gun, fires at an eighteen-meter target, waits three seconds for poison, and marks the kill. Repair damages the vehicle to thirty-five health, exits, holds interact for six seconds, and restores seventy health. Rain ignites a cell, sets rain weather, lets fire ticks extinguish it, and marks rain_extinguished before clearing weather. Better marks better_way when a companion offers the route.\n\nThe better_way flag is set at the start of the Patch, Overdose, or Die branch. Patch holds interact for three seconds to revive a downed companion and consume one syrette. It marks both companion_patched and better_way.\n\nOverdose holds interact for three seconds while the companion is too far away, marking companion_overdosed and better_way. Die waits forty-five seconds without approaching a downed companion, marking companion_died and better_way. Tape holds interact for two seconds to mark tape_played. Ceasefire ends by shooting a target with a sniper, marking ceasefire_ended. Convoy spawns a truck body that is shot or rocketed until it explodes. Town ignites a disk in town while ceasefire is already false, marking town_burned.\n\nThree endings are defined. Ending 0 ignites a cement cell and marks ending_burn. Ending 1 holds in a zone for 180 seconds while spawning enemies, marking ending_read. Ending 2 interacts with a chair, marking ending_chair.\n\nContract flags are set on instant Flag steps.\n\npost_remanned is set inside the long sleep step rather than as a separate flag step. The eight-hour sleep occurs before the post is cleared, so it cannot trigger remanning. The twenty-six-hour sleep later crosses the timer.\n\nThe 26-hour sleep adds 1560 minutes, which is enough to trigger the post reman timer. The 8-hour sleep only adds 480 minutes, so it cannot do so. The post_clear flag stays true until that later sleep. During the long sleep, the bot will look away before checking for reman. At SH2 the player is far behind, so the distance check passes and remanning occurs. A separate unit test covers the case where the player looks directly at GP1 and remanning is avoided.\n\nWind during the drive cannot start fires unless the bot ignites something. The starting diamonds cover the shop and bus fare, and the blackout on the read route deducts twenty percent before the shop so the budget remains sufficient. After the blackout, the player wakes at the nearest safe house; from town the closest is SH1, and the reach step still works to get to GP1.\n\nBlackout at the fever step wakes the player at SH1, so the next step is reach GP1. The pill route stays at the town gate and then walks to GP1. God mode is disabled. During the ending, enemy damage is multiplied by 0.05 and enemies miss unless a random check succeeds; the player also regenerates health.\n\nRescue triggers if the player dies outside the rescue step. Break will not reduce health. Enemy damage during fights is low and the player regenerates ten health per second above twenty. NPC damage scales with accuracy and difficulty. The shell must be complete for boot to reach playing. shell.rs and the world will be written together. MenuInput converts buttons to menu actions when not playing.\n\nThe shell tick function checks for active input from buttons, actions, look, and movement. Confirm activation will use the CONFIRM or JUMP action. Focus navigation maps act 3 to up, 4 to down, 5 to left, and 6 to right. Confirming selects the focused menu row. Row actions include strings like new, easy, normal, hard, merc0 through merc3, begin, resume, settings, and dev. The rows() function will be built using screen, tab, and page state.\n\nThe main menu shows New, Multiplayer, Settings, and About when no save exists. Focus starts on New. Confirming selects the focused row. Difficulty selection uses Easy, Normal, and Hard with focus set to one. Mercenary selection follows. Prologue is next. Begin starts the game.\n\nFocus is set at the exact moment of menu transition, and the one-press-per-tick logic prevents double-fires. The boot sequence sends act=1 every tick for four ticks to confirm through the title screen. Leaving the title resets attract mode. Settings from the title screen are unnecessary for boot. The Dev mode row appears in the pause menu but not the hub. Slider controls for balance adjustments will be implemented when the Dev screen is active.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The map, guns, and fire grid are in place. The campaign world and the menu shell are next."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58c3fa66-2292-416f-a0e8-84fdf73bc58c-69","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/net.rs","new_string":"//! Host-authoritative messages on an in-memory link. Latency, jitter and loss are seeded.\n\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n\nuse super::world::World;\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Msg {\n    pub at: f32,\n    pub reliable: bool,\n    pub body: String,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Link {\n    pub latency: f32,\n    pub jitter: f32,\n    pub loss: f32,\n    pub rng: Rng,\n    pub now: f32,\n    pub queue: Vec<Msg>,\n    pub sent: u32,\n    pub window: u32,\n    pub window_t: f32,\n    pub max_per_sec: u32,\n    pub max_bytes: usize,\n    pub finishes: u32,\n}\n\nimpl Link {\n    pub fn new(seed: u64, latency: f32, jitter: f32, loss: f32) -> Self {\n        Self {\n            latency,\n            jitter,\n            loss,\n            rng: Rng::new(seed),\n            now: 0.0,\n            queue: Vec::new(),\n            sent: 0,\n            window: 0,\n            window_t: 0.0,\n            max_per_sec: 0,\n            max_bytes: 0,\n            finishes: 0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn advance(&mut self, dt: f32) {\n        self.now += dt;\n        self.window_t += dt;\n        if self.window_t >= 1.0 {\n            self.max_per_sec = self.max_per_sec.max(self.window);\n            self.window = 0;\n            self.window_t = 0.0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn send(&mut self, reliable: bool, body: String) {\n        self.sent += 1;\n        self.window += 1;\n        self.max_bytes = self.max_bytes.max(body.len());\n        if !reliable && self.rng.f32() < self.loss {\n            return;\n        }\n        let j = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * 2.0 * self.jitter;\n        let at = self.now + self.latency + j.max(0.0);\n        self.queue.push(Msg { at, reliable, body });\n    }\n\n    pub fn poll(&mut self) -> Vec<String> {\n        let mut out = Vec::new();\n        let mut stay = Vec::new();\n        for m in self.queue.drain(..) {\n            if m.at <= self.now {\n                out.push(m.body);\n            } else {\n                stay.push(m);\n            }\n        }\n        self.queue = stay;\n        out\n    }\n}\n\n/// One host tick of the depot contract: fire deltas and, once, the finish.\npub fn host_publish(host: &World, link: &mut Link, finished: bool) {\n    if link.finishes > 0 {\n        return;\n    }\n    // Reliable fire runs, at most a few a second.\n    let mut n = 0;\n    for (cell, c) in &host.fire.cells {\n        if !c.burning || n >= 4 {\n            break;\n        }\n        link.send(true, format!(\"{{\\\"t\\\":\\\"fire\\\",\\\"x\\\":{},\\\"z\\\":{}}}\", cell.0, cell.1));\n        n += 1;\n    }\n    if finished {\n        link.finishes += 1;\n        link.send(true, \"{\\\"t\\\":\\\"finish\\\",\\\"won\\\":true}\".into());\n    }\n}\n\npub fn client_apply(client: &mut World, bodies: &[String]) {\n    for b in bodies {\n        if let Some(rest) = b.strip_prefix(\"{\\\"t\\\":\\\"fire\\\"\") {\n            // {\"t\":\"fire\",\"x\":N,\"z\":M}\n            let nums: Vec<i32> = rest\n                .split(|ch: char| !ch.is_ascii_digit() && ch != '-')\n                .filter_map(|s| if s.is_empty() { None } else { s.parse().ok() })\n                .collect();\n            if nums.len() >= 2 {\n                let _ = client.fire.ignite_cell((nums[0], nums[1]), client.tune.burn_time, client.minutes);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4267,"output_tokens":6497,"cache_read_input_tokens":172928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"2a1a0782-2a0f-4009-a93d-9c91022ff5ff"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-58c3fa66-2292-416f-a0e8-84fdf73bc58c-69","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Host-authoritative messages on an in-memory link. Latency, jitter and loss are seeded.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::world::World;\\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Msg {\\n    pub at: f32,\\n    pub reliable: bool,\\n    pub body: String,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Link {\\n    pub latency: f32,\\n    pub jitter: f32,\\n    pub loss: f32,\\n    pub rng: Rng,\\n    pub now: f32,\\n    pub queue: Vec<Msg>,\\n    pub sent: u32,\\n    pub window: u32,\\n    pub window_t: f32,\\n    pub max_per_sec: u32,\\n    pub max_bytes: usize,\\n    pub finishes: u32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Link {\\n    pub fn new(seed: u64, latency: f32, jitter: f32, loss: f32) -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            latency,\\n            jitter,\\n            loss,\\n            rng: Rng::new(seed),\\n            now: 0.0,\\n            queue: Vec::new(),\\n            sent: 0,\\n            window: 0,\\n            window_t: 0.0,\\n            max_per_sec: 0,\\n            max_bytes: 0,\\n            finishes: 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn advance(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        self.now += dt;\\n        self.window_t += dt;\\n        if self.window_t >= 1.0 {\\n            self.max_per_sec = self.max_per_sec.max(self.window);\\n            self.window = 0;\\n            self.window_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn send(&mut self, reliable: bool, body: String) {\\n        self.sent += 1;\\n        self.window += 1;\\n        self.max_bytes = self.max_bytes.max(body.len());\\n        if !reliable && self.rng.f32() < self.loss {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let j = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * 2.0 * self.jitter;\\n        let at = self.now + self.latency + j.max(0.0);\\n        self.queue.push(Msg { at, reliable, body });\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn poll(&mut self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let mut out = Vec::new();\\n        let mut stay = Vec::new();\\n        for m in self.queue.drain(..) {\\n            if m.at <= self.now {\\n                out.push(m.body);\\n            } else {\\n                stay.push(m);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.queue = stay;\\n        out\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// One host tick of the depot contract: fire deltas and, once, the finish.\\npub fn host_publish(host: &World, link: &mut Link, finished: bool) {\\n    if link.finishes > 0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    // Reliable fire runs, at most a few a second.\\n    let mut n = 0;\\n    for (cell, c) in &host.fire.cells {\\n        if !c.burning || n >= 4 {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        link.send(true, format!(\\\"{{\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fire\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"x\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"z\\\\\\\":{}}}\\\", cell.0, cell.1));\\n        n += 1;\\n    }\\n    if finished {\\n        link.finishes += 1;\\n        link.send(true, \\\"{\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"finish\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"won\\\\\\\":true}\\\".into());\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn client_apply(client: &mut World, bodies: &[String]) {\\n    for b in bodies {\\n        if let Some(rest) = b.strip_prefix(\\\"{\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fire\\\\\\\"\\\") {\\n            // {\\\"t\\\":\\\"fire\\\",\\\"x\\\":N,\\\"z\\\":M}\\n            let nums: Vec<i32> = rest\\n                .split(|ch: char| !ch.is_ascii_digit() && ch != '-')\\n                .filter_map(|s| if s.is_empty() { None } else { s.parse().ok() })\\n                .collect();\\n            if nums.len() >= 2 {\\n                let _ = client.fire.ignite_cell((nums[0], nums[1]), client.tune.burn_time, client.minutes);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/net.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/net.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/net.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Host-authoritative messages on an in-memory link. Latency, jitter and loss are seeded.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::world::World;\\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Msg {\\n    pub at: f32,\\n    pub reliable: bool,\\n    pub body: String,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Link {\\n    pub latency: f32,\\n    pub jitter: f32,\\n    pub loss: f32,\\n    pub rng: Rng,\\n    pub now: f32,\\n    pub queue: Vec<Msg>,\\n    pub sent: u32,\\n    pub window: u32,\\n    pub window_t: f32,\\n    pub max_per_sec: u32,\\n    pub max_bytes: usize,\\n    pub finishes: u32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Link {\\n    pub fn new(seed: u64, latency: f32, jitter: f32, loss: f32) -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            latency,\\n            jitter,\\n            loss,\\n            rng: Rng::new(seed),\\n            now: 0.0,\\n            queue: Vec::new(),\\n            sent: 0,\\n            window: 0,\\n            window_t: 0.0,\\n            max_per_sec: 0,\\n            max_bytes: 0,\\n            finishes: 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn advance(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        self.now += dt;\\n        self.window_t += dt;\\n        if self.window_t >= 1.0 {\\n            self.max_per_sec = self.max_per_sec.max(self.window);\\n            self.window = 0;\\n            self.window_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn send(&mut self, reliable: bool, body: String) {\\n        self.sent += 1;\\n        self.window += 1;\\n        self.max_bytes = self.max_bytes.max(body.len());\\n        if !reliable && self.rng.f32() < self.loss {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let j = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * 2.0 * self.jitter;\\n        let at = self.now + self.latency + j.max(0.0);\\n        self.queue.push(Msg { at, reliable, body });\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn poll(&mut self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let mut out = Vec::new();\\n        let mut stay = Vec::new();\\n        for m in self.queue.drain(..) {\\n            if m.at <= self.now {\\n                out.push(m.body);\\n            } else {\\n                stay.push(m);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.queue = stay;\\n        out\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// One host tick of the depot contract: fire deltas and, once, the finish.\\npub fn host_publish(host: &World, link: &mut Link, finished: bool) {\\n    if link.finishes > 0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    // Reliable fire runs, at most a few a second.\\n    let mut n = 0;\\n    for (cell, c) in &host.fire.cells {\\n        if !c.burning || n >= 4 {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        link.send(true, format!(\\\"{{\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fire\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"x\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"z\\\\\\\":{}}}\\\", cell.0, cell.1));\\n        n += 1;\\n    }\\n    if finished {\\n        link.finishes += 1;\\n        link.send(true, \\\"{\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"finish\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"won\\\\\\\":true}\\\".into());\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn client_apply(client: &mut World, bodies: &[String]) {\\n    for b in bodies {\\n        if let Some(rest) = b.strip_prefix(\\\"{\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fire\\\\\\\"\\\") {\\n            // {\\\"t\\\":\\\"fire\\\",\\\"x\\\":N,\\\"z\\\":M}\\n            let nums: Vec<i32> = rest\\n                .split(|ch: char| !ch.is_ascii_digit() && ch != '-')\\n                .filter_map(|s| if s.is_empty() { None } else { s.parse().ok() })\\n                .collect();\\n            if nums.len() >= 2 {\\n                let _ = client.fire.ignite_cell((nums[0], nums[1]), client.tune.burn_time, client.minutes);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"be5b184e-3672-4388-90d7-828acce9e7fd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_77","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The fire code uses step for an i32 value.\n\nI will write world.rs, shell.rs, and campaign.rs. World.rs will contain the main game logic, enums, structs, and methods for ticks, combat, movement, and saving. Shell.rs needs Screen to be public.\n\nShell methods will stay in shell.rs. I drafted the tick function: it clamps delta time, toggles the device and Xbox mode, routes to shell_tick when not playing, and handles pause or simulation otherwise.\n\nCampaign logic only runs during active play outside sandbox mode. The game clock advances by real delta time each tick, while sleep adds extra minutes as a lump sum. Fever and combat timers will use real delta time instead of the clock.\n\nCampaign logic must also run during the title screen so the boot step advances. The bot sends confirmations via shell during title, and tick consumes them. Boot is considered complete only once the screen becomes Playing.\n\nThe tick sequence is shell first, then simulate, then campaign. On the transition tick that sets playing, simulate runs with the confirm input before campaign advances to map. This creates a one-tick delay before map begins, but the confirm already applies during simulation.\n\nThe player will spawn at the airstrip when leaving Boot and entering Map. Both the shell begin handler and the Map spec's Begin method will set this position. The sandbox route starts at (200, -200) in screen Playing mode with no campaign.\n\nThe shell begin handler will set the player's yaw to 0 so they face north toward town. Simulation will only run while the screen is playing, handling both vehicle and on-foot movement. Campaign's begin method can set the vehicle and spawn bodies. Look input will be applied in simulation every tick, with yaw wrapping and pitch clamped between -1.15 and 1.15.\n\nSimulation will handle look, stance, eye smoothing, movement, vehicle control, guns, healing, body AI, fire, fever, rescue, and regeneration. Campaign done checks run after simulation, so the step advance loop can detect completion immediately.\n\nEnemy spawns in fight steps will happen after simulation so they survive the first tick. The campaign loop advances to the next step once done is true, and it skips steps that are already complete.\n\nCampaign logic will not use input directly; the bot generates actions from the previous state, creating a classic one-tick delay. The Jam step's begin() method will set force_jam so the bot fires on the next tick. Flag steps consume the campaign loop in a single tick. I will set self.goal_label for status display and implement current() using a OnceLock script. The route indices are Sandbox=0, Burn=1, Read=2, and Chair=3. I will write large match blocks for begin, done, and bot methods.\n\nShop purchases now correctly mark diamonds_spent when diamonds decrease. The try_buy function returns false and leaves state unchanged if diamonds are below eight. Syrette healing accumulates over 1.5 seconds at a rate of 40 health per second.\n\nSyrette activation requires health above 20 and below 100, plus an empty syrette timer. The pill button now suppresses shooting while healing a wound. Pills consume one pill after holding for 2.5 seconds to clear fever.\n\nJam clearing now triggers from the RELOAD input. Fire requires the primary button held, no active wound treatment, and a non-holstered weapon. Town holsters suppress firing during ceasefire while inside town. The force_jam flag is consumed by pulling the trigger. Shot spread will be implemented via a resolve function. I am also defining Wall and Body structs for hit detection and AI.\n\nBody structs now include poison, burn, doomed status, and home coordinates. A separate Companion struct tracks three NPCs: Tomek, Rafael, and Mirela. Ada is the default player character. Rescue logic triggers when the player dies and a companion is alive but has not yet been rescued; it consumes that companion's rescue token and starts a 3-second recovery timer.\n\nRescue drag pulls the player backward at two units per second. Once the timer finishes, health resets to fifty and the pistol slot reverts to the default. If no companion is available, death proceeds normally instead of triggering a rescue. A Ride struct is being added for vehicle types and seat assignments.\n\nThe Ride struct now tracks position, speed, roll, pitch, health, fuse, repair stage, distance to player, and an NPC flag. USE cycles seats near vehicles or enters them when close; if no vehicle exists but the step spawned one at the player, distance is zero. NPC drivers steer along road points. Roll recovery reduces roll by three percent per second.\n\nVehicle damage now triggers a fuse countdown when health drops below 15, causing an explosion at stage 4. Repair requires the player to be outside the vehicle within five units while holding interact; six seconds of repair restores health to seventy and marks completion. Shot resolution will also be implemented in world.rs.\n\nThe Screen enum will be defined in world.rs as public so shell.rs can use it. The Glyph function will remain a free function in shell.rs. A circular dependency prevents the game from calling pav_audio directly, so the audio test will invoke pav_audio::render_music directly and the game will only store music gain.\n\nThe game will report a fixed MUSIC_GAIN constant for audio status. Integration tests in pav_core cannot access pav_audio because the crate does not depend on it, and adding that dependency would create a circular build dependency.\n\nCargo allows dev-dependency cycles, so pav_core can safely depend on pav_audio for tests. The audio test will live in pav_audio/src/lib.rs and run via `cargo test -p pav_audio`. The run.sh script will execute both the merc test and the audio test.\n\nShot and explosion events will be emitted as SimEvent::Shot and SimEvent::Explosion. The engine mixer already handles these through sounds_for, so no extra audio hook is needed.\n\nI will write world.rs and shell.rs next. The audio tests will be added to the pav_audio module. run.sh will aggregate failures from multiple cargo test commands into a single line.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5145cec-f0d3-4569-ba85-5467d4da908c-70","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs","new_string":"//! 10-foot shell. Every screen has at most seven focusable rows. Hover moves focus. Click confirms.\n\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n\nuse super::world::{Screen, World};\nuse crate::input::buttons;\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub enum Device {\n    Gamepad,\n    Keyboard,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\npub struct MenuInput {\n    pub up: bool,\n    pub down: bool,\n    pub left: bool,\n    pub right: bool,\n    pub confirm: bool,\n    pub back: bool,\n    pub pointer: Option<(f32, f32)>,\n    pub click: bool,\n    pub device: Option<Device>,\n}\n\nimpl Default for MenuInput {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self { up: false, down: false, left: false, right: false, confirm: false, back: false, pointer: None, click: false, device: None }\n    }\n}\n\npub fn glyph(action: &str, device: Device, xbox: bool) -> &'static str {\n    match (device, xbox, action) {\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \"confirm\") => \"Enter\",\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \"back\") => \"Esc\",\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \"fire\") => \"LMB\",\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \"aim\") => \"RMB\",\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \"reload\") => \"R\",\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \"map\") => \"M\",\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \"jump\") => \"Space\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \"confirm\") => \"Cross\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \"confirm\") => \"A\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \"back\") => \"Circle\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \"back\") => \"B\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \"reload\") => \"Square\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \"reload\") => \"X\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \"fire\") => \"R2\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \"fire\") => \"RT\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \"aim\") => \"L2\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \"aim\") => \"LT\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, _, \"map\") => \"D-pad\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \"jump\") => \"Cross\",\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \"jump\") => \"A\",\n        _ => \"Button\",\n    }\n}\n\nfn menu_of(input: &InputFrame) -> MenuInput {\n    MenuInput {\n        up: input.act == 3,\n        down: input.act == 4,\n        left: input.act == 5,\n        right: input.act == 6,\n        confirm: input.act == 1 || input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) || input.just(buttons::JUMP),\n        back: input.act == 2,\n        pointer: None,\n        click: false,\n        device: None,\n    }\n}\n\nimpl World {\n    pub fn shell_tick(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        if input.act == 14 {\n            self.xbox = !self.xbox;\n        }\n        let typed = input.pressed != 0\n            || input.act != 0\n            || input.look.length_squared() > 1e-8\n            || input.move_dir.length_squared() > 1e-8;\n        if typed && self.device_lock == 0 {\n            // A pointer-only hover does not arrive through InputFrame. Keyboard buttons do.\n            if input.pressed & (buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::JUMP | buttons::MAP | buttons::RELOAD) != 0 || input.act != 0 {\n                self.device = Device::Keyboard;\n            }\n        }\n        if self.screen == Screen::Attract {\n            if typed {\n                self.screen = Screen::Title;\n                self.focus = 0;\n                self.idle = 0.0;\n                self.attract_t = 0.0;\n                return;\n            }\n            self.attract_t += dt;\n            let seg = ((self.attract_t / 16.0) as u32) % 10;\n            self.attract_seen |= 1u16 << seg;\n            self.attract_loops = (self.attract_t / 160.0) as u32;\n            return;\n        }\n        let shell = self.screen != Screen::Playing;\n        if shell {\n            if typed {\n                self.idle = 0.0;\n            } else if !self.hub {\n                self.idle += dt;\n            }\n            if self.idle >= 10.0 && !self.hub {\n                self.screen = Screen::Attract;\n                return;\n            }\n            let mut m = menu_of(input);\n            if self.touch_only && input.act == 0 && input.pressed == 0 {\n                // Touch does not drive the menu. Settings is still a row a pointer can hit.\n            }\n            self.apply_menu(m);\n            let _ = &mut m;\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn apply_menu(&mut self, m: MenuInput) {\n        if let Some(d) = m.device {\n            self.device = d;\n        }\n        if self.screen == Screen::Playing || self.screen == Screen::Attract {\n            if m.confirm || m.back || m.up || m.down || m.click || m.pointer.is_some() {\n                if self.screen == Screen::Attract {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                    self.idle = 0.0;\n                    self.attract_t = 0.0;\n                }\n            }\n            if self.screen != Screen::Title {\n                return;\n            }\n        }\n        let n = self.rows().len();\n        if n == 0 {\n            return;\n        }\n        if let Some((px, py)) = m.pointer {\n            for i in 0..n {\n                let y0 = 220.0 + i as f32 * 80.0;\n                if px >= 160.0 && px <= 900.0 && py >= y0 && py <= y0 + 64.0 {\n                    self.focus = i;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if m.up {\n            self.focus = if self.focus == 0 { n - 1 } else { self.focus - 1 };\n        }\n        if m.down {\n            self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\n        }\n        self.focus = self.focus.min(n - 1);\n        let activate = m.confirm || m.click;\n        if m.left || m.right {\n            self.nudge_slider(if m.right { 1.0 } else { -1.0 });\n        }\n        if m.back {\n            self.go_back();\n        }\n        if activate {\n            let rows = self.rows();\n            let label = rows.get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default();\n            self.activate(&label);\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\n        self.focus = 0;\n        match self.screen {\n            Screen::Difficulty | Screen::Settings | Screen::About | Screen::Mp => self.screen = Screen::Title,\n            Screen::Merc => self.screen = Screen::Difficulty,\n            Screen::Prologue => self.screen = Screen::Merc,\n            Screen::Dev if self.tab != 0 => self.tab = 0,\n            Screen::Dev => self.screen = Screen::Pause,\n            Screen::Pause => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn nudge_slider(&mut self, dir: f32) {\n        if self.screen != Screen::Dev || self.tab != 5 {\n            if self.screen == Screen::Settings && self.tab == 0 && self.focus == 1 {\n                self.music = (self.music + dir * 0.05).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        let count = self.tune.count();\n        let page_size = 6;\n        let index = self.page * page_size + self.focus;\n        if self.focus == 6 || index >= count {\n            if dir < 0.0 && self.page > 0 {\n                self.page -= 1;\n                self.focus = 0;\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        let (lo, hi, step) = self.tune.range(index);\n        let v = (self.tune.get(index) + dir * step).clamp(lo, hi);\n        self.tune.set(index, v);\n    }\n\n    fn activate(&mut self, label: &str) {\n        match self.screen {\n            Screen::Title => match label {\n                \"Continue\" => {\n                    if self.has_save {\n                        if let Ok(w) = World::load_json(&self.save_blob) {\n                            let saves = self.saves_written;\n                            let blob = self.save_blob.clone();\n                            *self = w;\n                            self.saves_written = saves;\n                            self.save_blob = blob;\n                            self.has_save = true;\n                            self.screen = Screen::Playing;\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                \"New contract\" => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Difficulty;\n                    self.focus = 1;\n                }\n                \"Multiplayer\" => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Mp;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                \"Settings\" => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\n                    self.tab = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                \"About\" => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::About;\n                    self.page = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            Screen::Difficulty => {\n                self.difficulty = match label {\n                    \"Easy\" => 0,\n                    \"Hard\" => 2,\n                    _ => 1,\n                };\n                self.screen = Screen::Merc;\n                self.focus = 0;\n            }\n            Screen::Merc => {\n                self.merc = match label {\n                    \"Tomek Wrona\" => 1,\n                    \"Rafael Quintero\" => 2,\n                    \"Mirela Dragan\" => 3,\n                    _ => 0,\n                };\n                self.screen = Screen::Prologue;\n                self.focus = 0;\n            }\n            Screen::Prologue => {\n                if label == \"Begin\" {\n                    self.start_playing();\n                }\n            }\n            Screen::Pause => match label {\n                \"Resume\" => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\n                \"Settings\" => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                \"Controls\" => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\n                    self.tab = 1;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                \"Dev mode\" if !self.hub => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Dev;\n                    self.tab = 0;\n                    self.page = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                \"Quit to title\" => {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            Screen::Settings => {\n                if label == \"Xbox glyphs\" {\n                    self.xbox = true;\n                } else if label == \"PlayStation glyphs\" {\n                    self.xbox = false;\n                } else if label.starts_with(\"Page\") {\n                    self.tab = (self.tab + 1) % 4;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n            }\n            Screen::Dev => {\n                if self.tab == 0 {\n                    self.tab = match label {\n                        \"Cheats\" => 1,\n                        \"Teleport\" => 2,\n                        \"Spawn\" => 3,\n                        \"World\" => 4,\n                        \"Balance\" => 5,\n                        _ => 0,\n                    };\n                    self.page = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                    return;\n                }\n                if label == \"Reset to defaults\" {\n                    self.tune = self.tune0;\n                    return;\n                }\n                if label == \"Next page\" {\n                    self.page += 1;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                    return;\n                }\n                if self.tab == 1 {\n                    self.toggle_cheat(label);\n                }\n            }\n            Screen::About => {\n                if label == \"Next\" {\n                    self.page += 1;\n                } else if label == \"Back\" && self.page > 0 {\n                    self.page -= 1;\n                } else if label == \"Back\" {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n            }\n            Screen::Mp => {\n                if label == \"Back\" {\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\n                }\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn toggle_cheat(&mut self, label: &str) {\n        let d = &mut self.dev;\n        match label {\n            \"God mode\" => d.god = !d.god,\n            \"Infinite ammo\" => d.infinite = !d.infinite,\n            \"No jams\" => d.no_jams = !d.no_jams,\n            \"No fever\" => d.no_fever = !d.no_fever,\n            \"Noclip\" => d.noclip = !d.noclip,\n            \"Invisible\" => d.invisible = !d.invisible,\n            \"Show AI\" => d.show_ai = !d.show_ai,\n            \"Show fire\" => d.show_fire = !d.show_fire,\n            \"Show nav\" => d.show_nav = !d.show_nav,\n            \"Show stats\" => d.show_stats = !d.show_stats,\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\n        let all: Vec<String> = match self.screen {\n            Screen::Title => {\n                let mut r = Vec::new();\n                if self.has_save {\n                    r.push(\"Continue\".into());\n                }\n                r.extend([\"New contract\".into(), \"Multiplayer\".into(), \"Settings\".into(), \"About\".into()]);\n                r\n            }\n            Screen::Difficulty => vec![\"Easy\".into(), \"Normal\".into(), \"Hard\".into()],\n            Screen::Merc => vec![\"Ada Okoro\".into(), \"Tomek Wrona\".into(), \"Rafael Quintero\".into(), \"Mirela Dragan\".into()],\n            Screen::Prologue => vec![\"Begin\".into()],\n            Screen::Pause => vec![\"Resume\".into(), \"Settings\".into(), \"Controls\".into(), \"Dev mode\".into(), \"Quit to title\".into()],\n            Screen::Settings => self.settings_rows(),\n            Screen::About => vec![\"Next\".into(), \"Back\".into()],\n            Screen::Dev => self.dev_rows(),\n            Screen::Mp => vec![\"This computer\".into(), \"Invite code\".into(), \"Back\".into()],\n            Screen::Attract => vec![\"Press any button\".into()],\n            Screen::Playing => vec![],\n        };\n        all.into_iter().take(7).collect()\n    }\n\n    fn settings_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\n        match self.tab % 4 {\n            0 => vec![\"Master\".into(), \"Music\".into(), \"Effects\".into(), \"Voices\".into(), \"Page\".into()],\n            1 => vec![\"PlayStation glyphs\".into(), \"Xbox glyphs\".into(), \"Invert look\".into(), \"Sensitivity\".into(), \"Aim assist\".into(), \"Page\".into()],\n            2 => vec![\"Fullscreen\".into(), \"Field of view\".into(), \"Brightness\".into(), \"Head bob\".into(), \"Page\".into()],\n            _ => vec![\"Subtitle size\".into(), \"Reduce motion\".into(), \"Assist markers\".into(), \"Immersive hud\".into(), \"Page\".into()],\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn dev_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\n        match self.tab {\n            0 => vec![\"Cheats\".into(), \"Teleport\".into(), \"Spawn\".into(), \"World\".into(), \"Balance\".into()],\n            1 => {\n                let names = [\"God mode\", \"Infinite ammo\", \"No jams\", \"No fever\", \"Noclip\", \"Invisible\", \"Show AI\", \"Show fire\", \"Show nav\", \"Show stats\"];\n                self.page_of(names)\n            }\n            2 => {\n                let names: Vec<&str> = super::geom::PLACES.iter().map(|p| p.name).collect();\n                self.page_of_owned(names)\n            }\n            5 => {\n                let mut rows = Vec::new();\n                let start = self.page * 6;\n                for i in start..(start + 6).min(self.tune.count()) {\n                    rows.push(format!(\"{} {:.2}\", self.tune.name(i), self.tune.get(i)));\n                }\n                rows.push(\"Reset to defaults\".into());\n                if start + 6 < self.tune.count() {\n                    rows.pop();\n                    rows.push(\"Next page\".into());\n                    // Keep reset reachable: the last page holds it. Mid pages use Next.\n                }\n                if start + 6 >= self.tune.count() && !rows.iter().any(|r| r == \"Reset to defaults\") {\n                    rows.push(\"Reset to defaults\".into());\n                }\n                rows\n            }\n            _ => vec![\"Next page\".into(), \"Reset to defaults\".into()],\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn page_of(&self, names: &[&str]) -> Vec<String> {\n        let start = self.page * 6;\n        let mut rows: Vec<String> = names.iter().skip(start).take(6).map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect();\n        if start + 6 < names.len() {\n            rows.push(\"Next page\".into());\n        } else {\n            rows.push(\"Reset to defaults\".into());\n        }\n        rows\n    }\n\n    fn page_of_owned(&self, names: Vec<&str>) -> Vec<String> {\n        self.page_of(&names)\n    }\n\n    pub fn notice(&self) -> Option<&'static str> {\n        if self.touch_only { Some(\"Controller or keyboard required\") } else { None }\n    }\n}\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6638,"output_tokens":7980,"cache_read_input_tokens":177152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"97326d99-2643-4b3a-9458-2d5ce2152314"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f5145cec-f0d3-4569-ba85-5467d4da908c-70","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! 10-foot shell. Every screen has at most seven focusable rows. Hover moves focus. Click confirms.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::world::{Screen, World};\\nuse crate::input::buttons;\\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum Device {\\n    Gamepad,\\n    Keyboard,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct MenuInput {\\n    pub up: bool,\\n    pub down: bool,\\n    pub left: bool,\\n    pub right: bool,\\n    pub confirm: bool,\\n    pub back: bool,\\n    pub pointer: Option<(f32, f32)>,\\n    pub click: bool,\\n    pub device: Option<Device>,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for MenuInput {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self { up: false, down: false, left: false, right: false, confirm: false, back: false, pointer: None, click: false, device: None }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn glyph(action: &str, device: Device, xbox: bool) -> &'static str {\\n    match (device, xbox, action) {\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"confirm\\\") => \\\"Enter\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"back\\\") => \\\"Esc\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"fire\\\") => \\\"LMB\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"aim\\\") => \\\"RMB\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"reload\\\") => \\\"R\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"map\\\") => \\\"M\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"jump\\\") => \\\"Space\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"confirm\\\") => \\\"Cross\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"confirm\\\") => \\\"A\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"back\\\") => \\\"Circle\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"back\\\") => \\\"B\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"reload\\\") => \\\"Square\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"reload\\\") => \\\"X\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"fire\\\") => \\\"R2\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"fire\\\") => \\\"RT\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"aim\\\") => \\\"L2\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"aim\\\") => \\\"LT\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, _, \\\"map\\\") => \\\"D-pad\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"jump\\\") => \\\"Cross\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"jump\\\") => \\\"A\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"Button\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn menu_of(input: &InputFrame) -> MenuInput {\\n    MenuInput {\\n        up: input.act == 3,\\n        down: input.act == 4,\\n        left: input.act == 5,\\n        right: input.act == 6,\\n        confirm: input.act == 1 || input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) || input.just(buttons::JUMP),\\n        back: input.act == 2,\\n        pointer: None,\\n        click: false,\\n        device: None,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl World {\\n    pub fn shell_tick(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if input.act == 14 {\\n            self.xbox = !self.xbox;\\n        }\\n        let typed = input.pressed != 0\\n            || input.act != 0\\n            || input.look.length_squared() > 1e-8\\n            || input.move_dir.length_squared() > 1e-8;\\n        if typed && self.device_lock == 0 {\\n            // A pointer-only hover does not arrive through InputFrame. Keyboard buttons do.\\n            if input.pressed & (buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::JUMP | buttons::MAP | buttons::RELOAD) != 0 || input.act != 0 {\\n                self.device = Device::Keyboard;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.screen == Screen::Attract {\\n            if typed {\\n                self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.idle = 0.0;\\n                self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            self.attract_t += dt;\\n            let seg = ((self.attract_t / 16.0) as u32) % 10;\\n            self.attract_seen |= 1u16 << seg;\\n            self.attract_loops = (self.attract_t / 160.0) as u32;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let shell = self.screen != Screen::Playing;\\n        if shell {\\n            if typed {\\n                self.idle = 0.0;\\n            } else if !self.hub {\\n                self.idle += dt;\\n            }\\n            if self.idle >= 10.0 && !self.hub {\\n                self.screen = Screen::Attract;\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            let mut m = menu_of(input);\\n            if self.touch_only && input.act == 0 && input.pressed == 0 {\\n                // Touch does not drive the menu. Settings is still a row a pointer can hit.\\n            }\\n            self.apply_menu(m);\\n            let _ = &mut m;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn apply_menu(&mut self, m: MenuInput) {\\n        if let Some(d) = m.device {\\n            self.device = d;\\n        }\\n        if self.screen == Screen::Playing || self.screen == Screen::Attract {\\n            if m.confirm || m.back || m.up || m.down || m.click || m.pointer.is_some() {\\n                if self.screen == Screen::Attract {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.idle = 0.0;\\n                    self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if self.screen != Screen::Title {\\n                return;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let n = self.rows().len();\\n        if n == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if let Some((px, py)) = m.pointer {\\n            for i in 0..n {\\n                let y0 = 220.0 + i as f32 * 80.0;\\n                if px >= 160.0 && px <= 900.0 && py >= y0 && py <= y0 + 64.0 {\\n                    self.focus = i;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if m.up {\\n            self.focus = if self.focus == 0 { n - 1 } else { self.focus - 1 };\\n        }\\n        if m.down {\\n            self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\\n        }\\n        self.focus = self.focus.min(n - 1);\\n        let activate = m.confirm || m.click;\\n        if m.left || m.right {\\n            self.nudge_slider(if m.right { 1.0 } else { -1.0 });\\n        }\\n        if m.back {\\n            self.go_back();\\n        }\\n        if activate {\\n            let rows = self.rows();\\n            let label = rows.get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default();\\n            self.activate(&label);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Difficulty | Screen::Settings | Screen::About | Screen::Mp => self.screen = Screen::Title,\\n            Screen::Merc => self.screen = Screen::Difficulty,\\n            Screen::Prologue => self.screen = Screen::Merc,\\n            Screen::Dev if self.tab != 0 => self.tab = 0,\\n            Screen::Dev => self.screen = Screen::Pause,\\n            Screen::Pause => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn nudge_slider(&mut self, dir: f32) {\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Dev || self.tab != 5 {\\n            if self.screen == Screen::Settings && self.tab == 0 && self.focus == 1 {\\n                self.music = (self.music + dir * 0.05).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let count = self.tune.count();\\n        let page_size = 6;\\n        let index = self.page * page_size + self.focus;\\n        if self.focus == 6 || index >= count {\\n            if dir < 0.0 && self.page > 0 {\\n                self.page -= 1;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let (lo, hi, step) = self.tune.range(index);\\n        let v = (self.tune.get(index) + dir * step).clamp(lo, hi);\\n        self.tune.set(index, v);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => match label {\\n                \\\"Continue\\\" => {\\n                    if self.has_save {\\n                        if let Ok(w) = World::load_json(&self.save_blob) {\\n                            let saves = self.saves_written;\\n                            let blob = self.save_blob.clone();\\n                            *self = w;\\n                            self.saves_written = saves;\\n                            self.save_blob = blob;\\n                            self.has_save = true;\\n                            self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                \\\"New contract\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Difficulty;\\n                    self.focus = 1;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Multiplayer\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Mp;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"About\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::About;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Difficulty => {\\n                self.difficulty = match label {\\n                    \\\"Easy\\\" => 0,\\n                    \\\"Hard\\\" => 2,\\n                    _ => 1,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Merc;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Merc => {\\n                self.merc = match label {\\n                    \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\" => 1,\\n                    \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\" => 2,\\n                    \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\" => 3,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Prologue;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Prologue => {\\n                if label == \\\"Begin\\\" {\\n                    self.start_playing();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Pause => match label {\\n                \\\"Resume\\\" => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Controls\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Dev mode\\\" if !self.hub => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Dev;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Quit to title\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Settings => {\\n                if label == \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = true;\\n                } else if label == \\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = false;\\n                } else if label.starts_with(\\\"Page\\\") {\\n                    self.tab = (self.tab + 1) % 4;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Dev => {\\n                if self.tab == 0 {\\n                    self.tab = match label {\\n                        \\\"Cheats\\\" => 1,\\n                        \\\"Teleport\\\" => 2,\\n                        \\\"Spawn\\\" => 3,\\n                        \\\"World\\\" => 4,\\n                        \\\"Balance\\\" => 5,\\n                        _ => 0,\\n                    };\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Reset to defaults\\\" {\\n                    self.tune = self.tune0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Next page\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if self.tab == 1 {\\n                    self.toggle_cheat(label);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::About => {\\n                if label == \\\"Next\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" && self.page > 0 {\\n                    self.page -= 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Mp => {\\n                if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn toggle_cheat(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        let d = &mut self.dev;\\n        match label {\\n            \\\"God mode\\\" => d.god = !d.god,\\n            \\\"Infinite ammo\\\" => d.infinite = !d.infinite,\\n            \\\"No jams\\\" => d.no_jams = !d.no_jams,\\n            \\\"No fever\\\" => d.no_fever = !d.no_fever,\\n            \\\"Noclip\\\" => d.noclip = !d.noclip,\\n            \\\"Invisible\\\" => d.invisible = !d.invisible,\\n            \\\"Show AI\\\" => d.show_ai = !d.show_ai,\\n            \\\"Show fire\\\" => d.show_fire = !d.show_fire,\\n            \\\"Show nav\\\" => d.show_nav = !d.show_nav,\\n            \\\"Show stats\\\" => d.show_stats = !d.show_stats,\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let all: Vec<String> = match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => {\\n                let mut r = Vec::new();\\n                if self.has_save {\\n                    r.push(\\\"Continue\\\".into());\\n                }\\n                r.extend([\\\"New contract\\\".into(), \\\"Multiplayer\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"About\\\".into()]);\\n                r\\n            }\\n            Screen::Difficulty => vec![\\\"Easy\\\".into(), \\\"Normal\\\".into(), \\\"Hard\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Merc => vec![\\\"Ada Okoro\\\".into(), \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(), \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(), \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Prologue => vec![\\\"Begin\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Pause => vec![\\\"Resume\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"Controls\\\".into(), \\\"Dev mode\\\".into(), \\\"Quit to title\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Settings => self.settings_rows(),\\n            Screen::About => vec![\\\"Next\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Dev => self.dev_rows(),\\n            Screen::Mp => vec![\\\"This computer\\\".into(), \\\"Invite code\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Attract => vec![\\\"Press any button\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Playing => vec![],\\n        };\\n        all.into_iter().take(7).collect()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn settings_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab % 4 {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Master\\\".into(), \\\"Music\\\".into(), \\\"Effects\\\".into(), \\\"Voices\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            1 => vec![\\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Invert look\\\".into(), \\\"Sensitivity\\\".into(), \\\"Aim assist\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            2 => vec![\\\"Fullscreen\\\".into(), \\\"Field of view\\\".into(), \\\"Brightness\\\".into(), \\\"Head bob\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            _ => vec![\\\"Subtitle size\\\".into(), \\\"Reduce motion\\\".into(), \\\"Assist markers\\\".into(), \\\"Immersive hud\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn dev_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Cheats\\\".into(), \\\"Teleport\\\".into(), \\\"Spawn\\\".into(), \\\"World\\\".into(), \\\"Balance\\\".into()],\\n            1 => {\\n                let names = [\\\"God mode\\\", \\\"Infinite ammo\\\", \\\"No jams\\\", \\\"No fever\\\", \\\"Noclip\\\", \\\"Invisible\\\", \\\"Show AI\\\", \\\"Show fire\\\", \\\"Show nav\\\", \\\"Show stats\\\"];\\n                self.page_of(names)\\n            }\\n            2 => {\\n                let names: Vec<&str> = super::geom::PLACES.iter().map(|p| p.name).collect();\\n                self.page_of_owned(names)\\n            }\\n            5 => {\\n                let mut rows = Vec::new();\\n                let start = self.page * 6;\\n                for i in start..(start + 6).min(self.tune.count()) {\\n                    rows.push(format!(\\\"{} {:.2}\\\", self.tune.name(i), self.tune.get(i)));\\n                }\\n                rows.push(\\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into());\\n                if start + 6 < self.tune.count() {\\n                    rows.pop();\\n                    rows.push(\\\"Next page\\\".into());\\n                    // Keep reset reachable: the last page holds it. Mid pages use Next.\\n                }\\n                if start + 6 >= self.tune.count() && !rows.iter().any(|r| r == \\\"Reset to defaults\\\") {\\n                    rows.push(\\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into());\\n                }\\n                rows\\n            }\\n            _ => vec![\\\"Next page\\\".into(), \\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into()],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn page_of(&self, names: &[&str]) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let start = self.page * 6;\\n        let mut rows: Vec<String> = names.iter().skip(start).take(6).map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect();\\n        if start + 6 < names.len() {\\n            rows.push(\\\"Next page\\\".into());\\n        } else {\\n            rows.push(\\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into());\\n        }\\n        rows\\n    }\\n\\n    fn page_of_owned(&self, names: Vec<&str>) -> Vec<String> {\\n        self.page_of(&names)\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn notice(&self) -> Option<&'static str> {\\n        if self.touch_only { Some(\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\") } else { None }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! 10-foot shell. Every screen has at most seven focusable rows. Hover moves focus. Click confirms.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::world::{Screen, World};\\nuse crate::input::buttons;\\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum Device {\\n    Gamepad,\\n    Keyboard,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct MenuInput {\\n    pub up: bool,\\n    pub down: bool,\\n    pub left: bool,\\n    pub right: bool,\\n    pub confirm: bool,\\n    pub back: bool,\\n    pub pointer: Option<(f32, f32)>,\\n    pub click: bool,\\n    pub device: Option<Device>,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for MenuInput {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self { up: false, down: false, left: false, right: false, confirm: false, back: false, pointer: None, click: false, device: None }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn glyph(action: &str, device: Device, xbox: bool) -> &'static str {\\n    match (device, xbox, action) {\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"confirm\\\") => \\\"Enter\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"back\\\") => \\\"Esc\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"fire\\\") => \\\"LMB\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"aim\\\") => \\\"RMB\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"reload\\\") => \\\"R\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"map\\\") => \\\"M\\\",\\n        (Device::Keyboard, _, \\\"jump\\\") => \\\"Space\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"confirm\\\") => \\\"Cross\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"confirm\\\") => \\\"A\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"back\\\") => \\\"Circle\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"back\\\") => \\\"B\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"reload\\\") => \\\"Square\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"reload\\\") => \\\"X\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"fire\\\") => \\\"R2\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"fire\\\") => \\\"RT\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"aim\\\") => \\\"L2\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"aim\\\") => \\\"LT\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, _, \\\"map\\\") => \\\"D-pad\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, false, \\\"jump\\\") => \\\"Cross\\\",\\n        (Device::Gamepad, true, \\\"jump\\\") => \\\"A\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"Button\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn menu_of(input: &InputFrame) -> MenuInput {\\n    MenuInput {\\n        up: input.act == 3,\\n        down: input.act == 4,\\n        left: input.act == 5,\\n        right: input.act == 6,\\n        confirm: input.act == 1 || input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) || input.just(buttons::JUMP),\\n        back: input.act == 2,\\n        pointer: None,\\n        click: false,\\n        device: None,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl World {\\n    pub fn shell_tick(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if input.act == 14 {\\n            self.xbox = !self.xbox;\\n        }\\n        let typed = input.pressed != 0\\n            || input.act != 0\\n            || input.look.length_squared() > 1e-8\\n            || input.move_dir.length_squared() > 1e-8;\\n        if typed && self.device_lock == 0 {\\n            // A pointer-only hover does not arrive through InputFrame. Keyboard buttons do.\\n            if input.pressed & (buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::JUMP | buttons::MAP | buttons::RELOAD) != 0 || input.act != 0 {\\n                self.device = Device::Keyboard;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.screen == Screen::Attract {\\n            if typed {\\n                self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.idle = 0.0;\\n                self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            self.attract_t += dt;\\n            let seg = ((self.attract_t / 16.0) as u32) % 10;\\n            self.attract_seen |= 1u16 << seg;\\n            self.attract_loops = (self.attract_t / 160.0) as u32;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let shell = self.screen != Screen::Playing;\\n        if shell {\\n            if typed {\\n                self.idle = 0.0;\\n            } else if !self.hub {\\n                self.idle += dt;\\n            }\\n            if self.idle >= 10.0 && !self.hub {\\n                self.screen = Screen::Attract;\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            let mut m = menu_of(input);\\n            if self.touch_only && input.act == 0 && input.pressed == 0 {\\n                // Touch does not drive the menu. Settings is still a row a pointer can hit.\\n            }\\n            self.apply_menu(m);\\n            let _ = &mut m;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn apply_menu(&mut self, m: MenuInput) {\\n        if let Some(d) = m.device {\\n            self.device = d;\\n        }\\n        if self.screen == Screen::Playing || self.screen == Screen::Attract {\\n            if m.confirm || m.back || m.up || m.down || m.click || m.pointer.is_some() {\\n                if self.screen == Screen::Attract {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.idle = 0.0;\\n                    self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if self.screen != Screen::Title {\\n                return;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let n = self.rows().len();\\n        if n == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if let Some((px, py)) = m.pointer {\\n            for i in 0..n {\\n                let y0 = 220.0 + i as f32 * 80.0;\\n                if px >= 160.0 && px <= 900.0 && py >= y0 && py <= y0 + 64.0 {\\n                    self.focus = i;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if m.up {\\n            self.focus = if self.focus == 0 { n - 1 } else { self.focus - 1 };\\n        }\\n        if m.down {\\n            self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\\n        }\\n        self.focus = self.focus.min(n - 1);\\n        let activate = m.confirm || m.click;\\n        if m.left || m.right {\\n            self.nudge_slider(if m.right { 1.0 } else { -1.0 });\\n        }\\n        if m.back {\\n            self.go_back();\\n        }\\n        if activate {\\n            let rows = self.rows();\\n            let label = rows.get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default();\\n            self.activate(&label);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Difficulty | Screen::Settings | Screen::About | Screen::Mp => self.screen = Screen::Title,\\n            Screen::Merc => self.screen = Screen::Difficulty,\\n            Screen::Prologue => self.screen = Screen::Merc,\\n            Screen::Dev if self.tab != 0 => self.tab = 0,\\n            Screen::Dev => self.screen = Screen::Pause,\\n            Screen::Pause => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn nudge_slider(&mut self, dir: f32) {\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Dev || self.tab != 5 {\\n            if self.screen == Screen::Settings && self.tab == 0 && self.focus == 1 {\\n                self.music = (self.music + dir * 0.05).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let count = self.tune.count();\\n        let page_size = 6;\\n        let index = self.page * page_size + self.focus;\\n        if self.focus == 6 || index >= count {\\n            if dir < 0.0 && self.page > 0 {\\n                self.page -= 1;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let (lo, hi, step) = self.tune.range(index);\\n        let v = (self.tune.get(index) + dir * step).clamp(lo, hi);\\n        self.tune.set(index, v);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => match label {\\n                \\\"Continue\\\" => {\\n                    if self.has_save {\\n                        if let Ok(w) = World::load_json(&self.save_blob) {\\n                            let saves = self.saves_written;\\n                            let blob = self.save_blob.clone();\\n                            *self = w;\\n                            self.saves_written = saves;\\n                            self.save_blob = blob;\\n                            self.has_save = true;\\n                            self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                \\\"New contract\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Difficulty;\\n                    self.focus = 1;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Multiplayer\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Mp;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"About\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::About;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Difficulty => {\\n                self.difficulty = match label {\\n                    \\\"Easy\\\" => 0,\\n                    \\\"Hard\\\" => 2,\\n                    _ => 1,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Merc;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Merc => {\\n                self.merc = match label {\\n                    \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\" => 1,\\n                    \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\" => 2,\\n                    \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\" => 3,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Prologue;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Prologue => {\\n                if label == \\\"Begin\\\" {\\n                    self.start_playing();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Pause => match label {\\n                \\\"Resume\\\" => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Controls\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Dev mode\\\" if !self.hub => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Dev;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Quit to title\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Settings => {\\n                if label == \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = true;\\n                } else if label == \\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = false;\\n                } else if label.starts_with(\\\"Page\\\") {\\n                    self.tab = (self.tab + 1) % 4;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Dev => {\\n                if self.tab == 0 {\\n                    self.tab = match label {\\n                        \\\"Cheats\\\" => 1,\\n                        \\\"Teleport\\\" => 2,\\n                        \\\"Spawn\\\" => 3,\\n                        \\\"World\\\" => 4,\\n                        \\\"Balance\\\" => 5,\\n                        _ => 0,\\n                    };\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Reset to defaults\\\" {\\n                    self.tune = self.tune0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Next page\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if self.tab == 1 {\\n                    self.toggle_cheat(label);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::About => {\\n                if label == \\\"Next\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" && self.page > 0 {\\n                    self.page -= 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Mp => {\\n                if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn toggle_cheat(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        let d = &mut self.dev;\\n        match label {\\n            \\\"God mode\\\" => d.god = !d.god,\\n            \\\"Infinite ammo\\\" => d.infinite = !d.infinite,\\n            \\\"No jams\\\" => d.no_jams = !d.no_jams,\\n            \\\"No fever\\\" => d.no_fever = !d.no_fever,\\n            \\\"Noclip\\\" => d.noclip = !d.noclip,\\n            \\\"Invisible\\\" => d.invisible = !d.invisible,\\n            \\\"Show AI\\\" => d.show_ai = !d.show_ai,\\n            \\\"Show fire\\\" => d.show_fire = !d.show_fire,\\n            \\\"Show nav\\\" => d.show_nav = !d.show_nav,\\n            \\\"Show stats\\\" => d.show_stats = !d.show_stats,\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let all: Vec<String> = match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => {\\n                let mut r = Vec::new();\\n                if self.has_save {\\n                    r.push(\\\"Continue\\\".into());\\n                }\\n                r.extend([\\\"New contract\\\".into(), \\\"Multiplayer\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"About\\\".into()]);\\n                r\\n            }\\n            Screen::Difficulty => vec![\\\"Easy\\\".into(), \\\"Normal\\\".into(), \\\"Hard\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Merc => vec![\\\"Ada Okoro\\\".into(), \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(), \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(), \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Prologue => vec![\\\"Begin\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Pause => vec![\\\"Resume\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"Controls\\\".into(), \\\"Dev mode\\\".into(), \\\"Quit to title\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Settings => self.settings_rows(),\\n            Screen::About => vec![\\\"Next\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Dev => self.dev_rows(),\\n            Screen::Mp => vec![\\\"This computer\\\".into(), \\\"Invite code\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Attract => vec![\\\"Press any button\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Playing => vec![],\\n        };\\n        all.into_iter().take(7).collect()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn settings_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab % 4 {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Master\\\".into(), \\\"Music\\\".into(), \\\"Effects\\\".into(), \\\"Voices\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            1 => vec![\\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Invert look\\\".into(), \\\"Sensitivity\\\".into(), \\\"Aim assist\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            2 => vec![\\\"Fullscreen\\\".into(), \\\"Field of view\\\".into(), \\\"Brightness\\\".into(), \\\"Head bob\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            _ => vec![\\\"Subtitle size\\\".into(), \\\"Reduce motion\\\".into(), \\\"Assist markers\\\".into(), \\\"Immersive hud\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn dev_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Cheats\\\".into(), \\\"Teleport\\\".into(), \\\"Spawn\\\".into(), \\\"World\\\".into(), \\\"Balance\\\".into()],\\n            1 => {\\n                let names = [\\\"God mode\\\", \\\"Infinite ammo\\\", \\\"No jams\\\", \\\"No fever\\\", \\\"Noclip\\\", \\\"Invisible\\\", \\\"Show AI\\\", \\\"Show fire\\\", \\\"Show nav\\\", \\\"Show stats\\\"];\\n                self.page_of(names)\\n            }\\n            2 => {\\n                let names: Vec<&str> = super::geom::PLACES.iter().map(|p| p.name).collect();\\n                self.page_of_owned(names)\\n            }\\n            5 => {\\n                let mut rows = Vec::new();\\n                let start = self.page * 6;\\n                for i in start..(start + 6).min(self.tune.count()) {\\n                    rows.push(format!(\\\"{} {:.2}\\\", self.tune.name(i), self.tune.get(i)));\\n                }\\n                rows.push(\\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into());\\n                if start + 6 < self.tune.count() {\\n                    rows.pop();\\n                    rows.push(\\\"Next page\\\".into());\\n                    // Keep reset reachable: the last page holds it. Mid pages use Next.\\n                }\\n                if start + 6 >= self.tune.count() && !rows.iter().any(|r| r == \\\"Reset to defaults\\\") {\\n                    rows.push(\\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into());\\n                }\\n                rows\\n            }\\n            _ => vec![\\\"Next page\\\".into(), \\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into()],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn page_of(&self, names: &[&str]) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let start = self.page * 6;\\n        let mut rows: Vec<String> = names.iter().skip(start).take(6).map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect();\\n        if start + 6 < names.len() {\\n            rows.push(\\\"Next page\\\".into());\\n        } else {\\n            rows.push(\\\"Reset to defaults\\\".into());\\n        }\\n        rows\\n    }\\n\\n    fn page_of_owned(&self, names: Vec<&str>) -> Vec<String> {\\n        self.page_of(&names)\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn notice(&self) -> Option<&'static str> {\\n        if self.touch_only { Some(\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\") } else { None }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"4f605358-d5ae-4b94-a147-ac6add880996"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_78","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Dev balance rows are missing reset values on mid pages. The code pops reset and pushes next.\n\nThe last page will include reset. Mid pages will have six sliders plus a next button, totaling seven items. The test can reach reset by pressing next repeatedly. Focus on mid pages lands on the \"Next page\" button rather than a slider. Left and right keys change slider values. The fire spread slider index needs to be counted.\n\nCheats page layout is verified at seven items. The dev rows balance logic is messy but stays within the limit. A reset bug was fixed: the code now only adds reset when the current page is the last one. The world fields shell needs screen, focus, tab, page, xbox, device, device_lock, idle, attract_t, attract_seen, attract_loops, hub, touch_only, has_save, save_blob, saves_written, music, difficulty, merc, tune, tune0, and dev. It also needs start_playing(), load_json(), and a Screen enum. device_lock will be added as u8.\n\nI will write world.rs and campaign.rs next. The shell needs tune count, get, set, name, and range methods. I will keep world.rs dense rather than splitting it into state and logic files. I will also fix the unused mut m warning.\n\nWorld.rs will hold the core simulation and data. Campaign.rs will follow so methods compile. Body gun requires a Gun field, which is large but acceptable. Every field gets serde. Companion names are Strings. World excludes OnceLock because the script lives outside it. A simple raycast function for sphere intersection is being drafted.\n\nRaycast direction must be normalized. AABB slab intersection is planned next. fire_shot will be implemented in world.rs. The file will be written now and split if it becomes too long. world.rs needs `use shell::Device`. Shell and world reference each other through super paths, which Rust allows.\n\nDevice will be moved into world.rs to eliminate the circular type dependency. Shell.rs will import Device from there instead.\n\nI will keep world.rs concise by using small helpers. `start_playing` sets the screen to Playing, places the player at the airstrip, and resets yaw and eye height. `fresh()` does not call it; instead it positions the player at 200, -200 and initializes the pistol and AR.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8abeb369-a3c2-4a81-9888-3f5e2670ea3e-71","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","new_string":"//! Jam Cry simulation. One seeded `World::tick` drives movement, guns, fire, fever and the job.\n\nuse std::collections::BTreeSet;\nuse std::sync::OnceLock;\n\nuse glam::Vec2;\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\nuse serde_json::json;\n\nuse super::fire::FireMap;\nuse super::geom::{self, exposure, grass_factor};\nuse super::gun::{self, Gun, Pull, WeaponId};\nuse super::shell::{self, Device};\nuse crate::input::buttons;\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub enum Route {\n    Human,\n    Burn,\n    Read,\n    Chair,\n    Sandbox,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub enum Screen {\n    Title,\n    Difficulty,\n    Merc,\n    Prologue,\n    Playing,\n    Pause,\n    Settings,\n    About,\n    Dev,\n    Mp,\n    Attract,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Tune {\n    pub enemy_accuracy: f32,\n    pub enemy_damage: f32,\n    pub player_damage: f32,\n    pub detection: f32,\n    pub enemy_count: f32,\n    pub weapon_wear: f32,\n    pub jam_chance: f32,\n    pub break_threshold: f32,\n    pub fire_spread: f32,\n    pub burn_time: f32,\n    pub wind_strength: f32,\n    pub burn_damage: f32,\n    pub fever_interval: f32,\n    pub fever_severity: f32,\n    pub syrette_heal: f32,\n    pub rescue_window: f32,\n    pub vehicle_speed: f32,\n    pub vehicle_tough: f32,\n    pub contract_pay: f32,\n    pub post_reman_hours: f32,\n    pub player_speed: f32,\n}\n\nimpl Default for Tune {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            enemy_accuracy: 0.35,\n            enemy_damage: 8.0,\n            player_damage: 1.0,\n            detection: 1.0,\n            enemy_count: 1.0,\n            weapon_wear: 1.0,\n            jam_chance: 1.0,\n            break_threshold: 8.0,\n            fire_spread: 0.9,\n            burn_time: 10.0,\n            wind_strength: 1.0,\n            burn_damage: 20.0,\n            fever_interval: 15.0 * 60.0,\n            fever_severity: 1.0,\n            syrette_heal: 60.0,\n            rescue_window: 6.0,\n            vehicle_speed: 1.0,\n            vehicle_tough: 1.0,\n            contract_pay: 1.0,\n            post_reman_hours: 24.0,\n            player_speed: 1.0,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Tune {\n    pub fn count(&self) -> usize {\n        21\n    }\n    pub fn name(&self, i: usize) -> &'static str {\n        [\"Enemy accuracy\", \"Enemy damage\", \"Player damage\", \"Detection\", \"Enemy count\", \"Weapon wear\", \"Jam chance\", \"Break threshold\", \"Fire spread\", \"Burn time\", \"Wind strength\", \"Burn damage\", \"Fever interval\", \"Fever severity\", \"Syrette heal\", \"Rescue window\", \"Vehicle speed\", \"Vehicle toughness\", \"Contract pay\", \"Post reman hours\", \"Player speed\"]\n            .get(i)\n            .copied()\n            .unwrap_or(\"Value\")\n    }\n    pub fn get(&self, i: usize) -> f32 {\n        let v = [\n            self.enemy_accuracy, self.enemy_damage, self.player_damage, self.detection, self.enemy_count, self.weapon_wear, self.jam_chance,\n            self.break_threshold, self.fire_spread, self.burn_time, self.wind_strength, self.burn_damage, self.fever_interval, self.fever_severity,\n            self.syrette_heal, self.rescue_window, self.vehicle_speed, self.vehicle_tough, self.contract_pay, self.post_reman_hours, self.player_speed,\n        ];\n        v.get(i).copied().unwrap_or(0.0)\n    }\n    pub fn set(&mut self, i: usize, v: f32) {\n        let p = match i {\n            0 => &mut self.enemy_accuracy,\n            1 => &mut self.enemy_damage,\n            2 => &mut self.player_damage,\n            3 => &mut self.detection,\n            4 => &mut self.enemy_count,\n            5 => &mut self.weapon_wear,\n            6 => &mut self.jam_chance,\n            7 => &mut self.break_threshold,\n            8 => &mut self.fire_spread,\n            9 => &mut self.burn_time,\n            10 => &mut self.wind_strength,\n            11 => &mut self.burn_damage,\n            12 => &mut self.fever_interval,\n            13 => &mut self.fever_severity,\n            14 => &mut self.syrette_heal,\n            15 => &mut self.rescue_window,\n            16 => &mut self.vehicle_speed,\n            17 => &mut self.vehicle_tough,\n            18 => &mut self.contract_pay,\n            19 => &mut self.post_reman_hours,\n            _ => &mut self.player_speed,\n        };\n        *p = v;\n    }\n    pub fn range(&self, i: usize) -> (f32, f32, f32) {\n        match i {\n            0 | 3 | 5 | 6 | 10 | 13 | 16 | 17 | 18 | 20 => (0.0, 3.0, 0.05),\n            7 => (1.0, 40.0, 1.0),\n            8 => (0.05, 3.0, 0.05),\n            9 | 15 => (0.5, 30.0, 0.5),\n            12 => (30.0, 2000.0, 10.0),\n            19 => (1.0, 72.0, 1.0),\n            _ => (0.0, 200.0, 1.0),\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Dev {\n    pub god: bool,\n    pub infinite: bool,\n    pub no_jams: bool,\n    pub no_fever: bool,\n    pub noclip: bool,\n    pub invisible: bool,\n    pub show_ai: bool,\n    pub show_fire: bool,\n    pub show_nav: bool,\n    pub show_stats: bool,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Body {\n    pub kind: u8,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n    pub yaw: f32,\n    pub hp: f32,\n    pub alive: bool,\n    pub alert: u8,\n    pub gun: Gun,\n    pub see: f32,\n    pub poison: f32,\n    pub burn: f32,\n    pub doomed: bool,\n    pub flee: f32,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Wall {\n    pub min: [f32; 3],\n    pub max: [f32; 3],\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Companion {\n    pub name: String,\n    pub alive: bool,\n    pub down: bool,\n    pub down_t: f32,\n    pub rescue_spent: bool,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Ride {\n    pub kind: u8,\n    pub seat: u8,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n    pub yaw: f32,\n    pub speed: f32,\n    pub roll: f32,\n    pub pitch: f32,\n    pub health: f32,\n    pub fuse: f32,\n    pub repair: f32,\n    pub stage: u8,\n    pub dist: f32,\n    pub npc: bool,\n    pub npc_i: usize,\n}\n\nimpl Default for Ride {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self { kind: 0, seat: 0, x: 0.0, z: 0.0, yaw: 0.0, speed: 0.0, roll: 0.0, pitch: 0.0, health: 100.0, fuse: 0.0, repair: 0.0, stage: 0, dist: 0.0, npc: false, npc_i: 0 }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\nenum Spec {\n    Boot,\n    Map,\n    Way,\n    Reach { x: f32, z: f32, gps: bool },\n    Fever,\n    Pill,\n    Blackout,\n    Fight,\n    EnemyJam,\n    Jam,\n    Break,\n    Rescue,\n    Wound(u8),\n    Loot,\n    Claim,\n    Shop,\n    Locker,\n    Syrette,\n    Tracker,\n    Sleep { hours: f32 },\n    Drive { x: f32, z: f32 },\n    Mono,\n    Ignite(u8),\n    Tanks,\n    Mounted,\n    Panic,\n    Animals,\n    Bus { x: f32, z: f32 },\n    Night,\n    Boat,\n    Stealth,\n    Dart,\n    Repair,\n    Rain,\n    Better,\n    Patch,\n    Overdose,\n    Die,\n    Tape,\n    Ceasefire,\n    Convoy,\n    Town,\n    Ending(u8),\n    Flag(&'static str),\n}\n\nfn script(route: Route) -> &'static [Spec] {\n    static S: OnceLock<Vec<Vec<Spec>>> = OnceLock::new();\n    let all = S.get_or_init(|| vec![build_script(Route::Human), build_script(Route::Burn), build_script(Route::Read), build_script(Route::Chair)]);\n    let i = match route {\n        Route::Human => 0,\n        Route::Burn => 1,\n        Route::Read => 2,\n        Route::Chair => 3,\n        Route::Sandbox => return &[],\n    };\n    all[i].as_slice()\n}\n\nfn build_script(route: Route) -> Vec<Spec> {\n    let mut v = vec![\n        Spec::Boot,\n        Spec::Map,\n        Spec::Way,\n        Spec::Reach { x: 0.0, z: 460.0, gps: true },\n        Spec::Fever,\n    ];\n    if route == Route::Read {\n        v.push(Spec::Blackout);\n    } else {\n        v.push(Spec::Pill);\n    }\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_a0\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: -40.0, z: 640.0, gps: false });\n    v.push(Spec::Fight);\n    v.push(Spec::EnemyJam);\n    v.push(Spec::Jam);\n    v.push(Spec::Break);\n    v.push(Spec::Rescue);\n    for w in 1..=6 {\n        v.push(Spec::Wound(w));\n    }\n    v.push(Spec::Loot);\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: 170.0, z: 470.0, gps: false });\n    v.push(Spec::Claim);\n    v.push(Spec::Shop);\n    v.push(Spec::Locker);\n    v.push(Spec::Syrette);\n    v.push(Spec::Tracker);\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 8.0 });\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_a1\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -520.0, z: -520.0 });\n    v.push(Spec::Mono);\n    for ig in 0..12 {\n        v.push(Spec::Ignite(ig));\n    }\n    v.push(Spec::Tanks);\n    v.push(Spec::Mounted);\n    v.push(Spec::Panic);\n    v.push(Spec::Animals);\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_b1\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Bus { x: 0.0, z: 380.0 });\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -260.0, z: -700.0 });\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 26.0 });\n    v.push(Spec::Night);\n    v.push(Spec::Boat);\n    v.push(Spec::Stealth);\n    v.push(Spec::Dart);\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_b2\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Repair);\n    v.push(Spec::Rain);\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_b3\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Better);\n    match route {\n        Route::Read => v.push(Spec::Overdose),\n        Route::Chair => v.push(Spec::Die),\n        _ => v.push(Spec::Patch),\n    }\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_b4\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Tape);\n    v.push(Spec::Ceasefire);\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_c1\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Convoy);\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_c2\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Town);\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_c3\"));\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -760.0, z: 620.0 });\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_d1\"));\n    let end = match route {\n        Route::Read => 1,\n        Route::Chair => 2,\n        _ => 0,\n    };\n    v.push(Spec::Ending(end));\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\"contract_d2\"));\n    v\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct World {\n    pub seed: u64,\n    pub rng: Rng,\n    pub route: Route,\n    pub screen: Screen,\n    pub focus: usize,\n    pub tab: usize,\n    pub page: usize,\n    pub difficulty: u8,\n    pub merc: u8,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n    pub yaw: f32,\n    pub pitch: f32,\n    pub roll: f32,\n    pub eye: f32,\n    pub stance: u8,\n    pub stamina: f32,\n    pub hp: f32,\n    pub syrettes: u32,\n    pub pills: u32,\n    pub diamonds: u32,\n    pub infamy: i32,\n    pub guns: Vec<Gun>,\n    pub slot: usize,\n    pub syrette_t: f32,\n    pub heal_t: f32,\n    pub wound: u8,\n    pub pill_t: f32,\n    pub fever_t: f32,\n    pub fever_state: u8,\n    pub fever_warn: f32,\n    pub fever_attack: f32,\n    pub bodies: Vec<Body>,\n    pub walls: Vec<Wall>,\n    pub fire: FireMap,\n    pub wind: Vec2,\n    pub weather: u8,\n    pub minutes: f32,\n    pub ceasefire: bool,\n    pub companions: Vec<Companion>,\n    pub rescue_t: f32,\n    pub ride: Ride,\n    pub flags: BTreeSet<String>,\n    pub step: u16,\n    pub step_ready: bool,\n    pub step_t: f32,\n    pub step_x: f32,\n    pub step_z: f32,\n    pub waypoint: Option<(f32, f32)>,\n    pub map_t: f32,\n    pub mono_t: f32,\n    pub post_clear: bool,\n    pub post_reman_at: f32,\n    pub looking_at_post: bool,\n    pub saves_written: u32,\n    pub save_blob: String,\n    pub has_save: bool,\n    pub idle: f32,\n    pub attract_t: f32,\n    pub attract_seen: u16,\n    pub attract_loops: u32,\n    pub device: Device,\n    pub device_lock: u8,\n    pub xbox: bool,\n    pub tune: Tune,\n    pub tune0: Tune,\n    pub dev: Dev,\n    pub hub: bool,\n    pub touch_only: bool,\n    pub music: f32,\n    pub finished: bool,\n    pub hold_t: f32,\n    pub tracker_cache: (f32, f32),\n    pub treating: bool,\n    pub jam_seen: bool,\n    pub boat_dist: f32,\n}\n\nimpl World {\n    pub fn fresh(seed: u64) -> Self {\n        let mut w = Self::blank(seed, Route::Sandbox);\n        w.screen = Screen::Playing;\n        w.x = 200.0;\n        w.z = -200.0;\n        w.guns = vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol), Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar)];\n        w.diamonds = 40;\n        w.syrettes = 3;\n        w.pills = 3;\n        w.slot = 0;\n        w\n    }\n\n    pub fn campaign(seed: u64, route: Route) -> Self {\n        let mut w = Self::blank(seed, route);\n        w.screen = Screen::Title;\n        w.guns = vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol)];\n        w.diamonds = 40;\n        w.syrettes = 3;\n        w.pills = 3;\n        w\n    }\n\n    fn blank(seed: u64, route: Route) -> Self {\n        let tune = Tune::default();\n        Self {\n            seed,\n            rng: Rng::new(seed),\n            route,\n            screen: Screen::Title,\n            focus: 0,\n            tab: 0,\n            page: 0,\n            difficulty: 1,\n            merc: 0,\n            x: 0.0,\n            z: 0.0,\n            yaw: 0.0,\n            pitch: 0.05,\n            roll: 0.0,\n            eye: 1.58,\n            stance: 0,\n            stamina: 12.0,\n            hp: 100.0,\n            syrettes: 3,\n            pills: 3,\n            diamonds: 40,\n            infamy: 0,\n            guns: vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol)],\n            slot: 0,\n            syrette_t: 0.0,\n            heal_t: 0.0,\n            wound: 0,\n            pill_t: 0.0,\n            fever_t: 0.0,\n            fever_state: 0,\n            fever_warn: 0.0,\n            fever_attack: 0.0,\n            bodies: Vec::new(),\n            walls: Vec::new(),\n            fire: FireMap::default(),\n            wind: Vec2::new(2.0, 0.5),\n            weather: 0,\n            minutes: 12.0 * 60.0,\n            ceasefire: true,\n            companions: vec![\n                Companion { name: \"Tomek Wrona\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\n                Companion { name: \"Rafael Quintero\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\n                Companion { name: \"Mirela Dragan\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\n            ],\n            rescue_t: 0.0,\n            ride: Ride::default(),\n            flags: BTreeSet::new(),\n            step: 0,\n            step_ready: false,\n            step_t: 0.0,\n            step_x: 0.0,\n            step_z: 0.0,\n            waypoint: None,\n            map_t: 0.0,\n            mono_t: 0.0,\n            post_clear: false,\n            post_reman_at: 1.0e9,\n            looking_at_post: false,\n            saves_written: 0,\n            save_blob: String::new(),\n            has_save: false,\n            idle: 0.0,\n            attract_t: 0.0,\n            attract_seen: 0,\n            attract_loops: 0,\n            device: Device::Gamepad,\n            device_lock: 0,\n            xbox: false,\n            tune0: tune.clone(),\n            tune,\n            dev: Dev::default(),\n            hub: false,\n            touch_only: false,\n            music: 0.10,\n            finished: false,\n            hold_t: 0.0,\n            tracker_cache: (90.0, 500.0),\n            treating: false,\n            jam_seen: false,\n            boat_dist: 0.0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn mark(&mut self, flag: &str) {\n        self.flags.insert(flag.to_string());\n    }\n\n    pub fn gun(&self) -> &Gun {\n        &self.guns[self.slot.min(self.guns.len().saturating_sub(1))]\n    }\n    pub fn gun_mut(&mut self) -> &mut Gun {\n        let i = self.slot.min(self.guns.len().saturating_sub(1));\n        &mut self.guns[i]\n    }\n\n    pub fn spawn_dummy(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32, hp: f32) -> usize {\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\n            kind: 4,\n            x,\n            z,\n            yaw: 0.0,\n            hp,\n            alive: true,\n            alert: 0,\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\n            see: 0.0,\n            poison: 0.0,\n            burn: 0.0,\n            doomed: false,\n            flee: 0.0,\n        });\n        self.bodies.len() - 1\n    }\n\n    pub fn add_wall(&mut self, min: [f32; 3], max: [f32; 3]) {\n        self.walls.push(Wall { min, max });\n    }\n\n    pub fn tick(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        let dt = dt.clamp(0.0, 0.5);\n        if self.screen != Screen::Playing {\n            self.shell_tick(input, dt);\n        } else if input.act == 10 && !self.hub {\n            self.screen = Screen::Pause;\n            self.focus = 0;\n            self.idle = 0.0;\n        } else {\n            self.simulate(input, dt);\n        }\n        if self.route != Route::Sandbox {\n            self.campaign(dt);\n        }\n        if self.wind.length() > 6.0 && self.screen == Screen::Playing {\n            self.mark(\"wind_rag\");\n        }\n        self.minutes += dt;\n        self.maybe_reman();\n    }\n\n    pub fn bot_input(&self) -> InputFrame {\n        if self.screen != Screen::Playing {\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n            f.act = 1;\n            f.pressed = buttons::CONFIRM;\n            return f;\n        }\n        let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\n            return InputFrame::default();\n        };\n        self.bot_spec(spec)\n    }\n\n    fn current(&self) -> Option<Spec> {\n        script(self.route).get(self.step as usize).copied()\n    }\n\n    pub fn goal_name(&self) -> String {\n        if self.finished {\n            return \"done\".into();\n        }\n        match self.current() {\n            Some(Spec::Boot) => \"boot\",\n            Some(Spec::Map) => \"map\",\n            Some(Spec::Way) => \"waypoint\",\n            Some(Spec::Reach { .. }) => \"reach\",\n            Some(Spec::Fever) => \"fever\",\n            Some(Spec::Pill) => \"pill\",\n            Some(Spec::Blackout) => \"blackout\",\n            Some(Spec::Fight) => \"fight\",\n            Some(Spec::EnemyJam) => \"enemy_jam\",\n            Some(Spec::Jam) => \"jam\",\n            Some(Spec::Break) => \"break\",\n            Some(Spec::Rescue) => \"rescue\",\n            Some(Spec::Wound(n)) => return format!(\"wound{n}\"),\n            Some(Spec::Loot) => \"loot\",\n            Some(Spec::Claim) => \"claim\",\n            Some(Spec::Shop) => \"shop\",\n            Some(Spec::Locker) => \"locker\",\n            Some(Spec::Syrette) => \"syrette\",\n            Some(Spec::Tracker) => \"tracker\",\n            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) => \"sleep\",\n            Some(Spec::Drive { .. }) => \"drive\",\n            Some(Spec::Mono) => \"mono\",\n            Some(Spec::Ignite(n)) => return format!(\"ignite{n}\"),\n            Some(Spec::Tanks) => \"tanks\",\n            Some(Spec::Mounted) => \"mounted\",\n            Some(Spec::Panic) => \"panic\",\n            Some(Spec::Animals) => \"animals\",\n            Some(Spec::Bus { .. }) => \"bus\",\n            Some(Spec::Night) => \"night\",\n            Some(Spec::Boat) => \"boat\",\n            Some(Spec::Stealth) => \"stealth\",\n            Some(Spec::Dart) => \"dart\",\n            Some(Spec::Repair) => \"repair\",\n            Some(Spec::Rain) => \"rain\",\n            Some(Spec::Better) => \"better\",\n            Some(Spec::Patch) => \"patch\",\n            Some(Spec::Overdose) => \"overdose\",\n            Some(Spec::Die) => \"die\",\n            Some(Spec::Tape) => \"tape\",\n            Some(Spec::Ceasefire) => \"ceasefire\",\n            Some(Spec::Convoy) => \"convoy\",\n            Some(Spec::Town) => \"town\",\n            Some(Spec::Ending(n)) => return format!(\"ending{n}\"),\n            Some(Spec::Flag(s)) => s,\n            None => \"done\",\n        }\n        .into()\n    }\n\n    pub fn goal_budget(&self) -> f32 {\n        match self.current() {\n            Some(Spec::Reach { .. }) => 160.0,\n            Some(Spec::Drive { .. }) => 140.0,\n            Some(Spec::Boat) => 160.0,\n            Some(Spec::Bus { .. }) => 90.0,\n            Some(Spec::Blackout) => 80.0,\n            Some(Spec::Break) => 90.0,\n            Some(Spec::Die) => 55.0,\n            Some(Spec::Ending(1)) => 200.0,\n            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) => 40.0,\n            Some(Spec::Fight) | Some(Spec::EnemyJam) => 25.0,\n            _ => 30.0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn campaign(&mut self, dt: f32) {\n        if self.finished {\n            return;\n        }\n        self.step_t += dt;\n        for _ in 0..12 {\n            let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\n                self.finished = true;\n                break;\n            };\n            if !self.step_ready {\n                self.begin(spec);\n                self.step_ready = true;\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\n            }\n            if self.done(spec) {\n                self.step += 1;\n                self.step_ready = false;\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\n            } else {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn begin(&mut self, spec: Spec) {\n        self.step_x = self.x;\n        self.step_z = self.z;\n        self.hold_t = 0.0;\n        match spec {\n            Spec::Fever => {\n                self.fever_t = self.tune.fever_interval;\n            }\n            Spec::Blackout => {\n                self.pills = 0;\n                self.fever_state = 2;\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\n            }\n            Spec::Fight => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                for i in 0..4 {\n                    let ang = i as f32 * 0.4;\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + ang.sin() * 12.0, self.z - 12.0, 36.0, false);\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::EnemyJam => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 8.0, 80.0, true);\n            }\n            Spec::Jam => {\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\n                g.force_jam = true;\n                g.jammed = false;\n                g.broken = false;\n                g.ammo = 12;\n                g.condition = 40.0;\n                self.jam_seen = false;\n            }\n            Spec::Break => {\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Smg));\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\n                g.condition = 5.0;\n                g.wear = 0.0;\n                g.ammo = 999;\n                g.reserve = 999;\n                g.jammed = false;\n                g.broken = false;\n                g.cooldown = 0.0;\n            }\n            Spec::Rescue => {\n                self.hp = 0.0;\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\n                    c.alive = true;\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\n                    c.down = false;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Wound(n) => {\n                self.hp = 15.0;\n                self.wound = n;\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\n                self.treating = false;\n            }\n            Spec::Shop => {\n                if !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Battle) {\n                    // The shelf is stocked. Buying happens on the interact.\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\n                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Mono => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 24.0, 40.0, false);\n                self.mono_t = 0.0;\n            }\n            Spec::Tanks => {\n                self.spawn_tank_farm();\n            }\n            Spec::Panic => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, 40.0, false);\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n            }\n            Spec::Animals => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_animal(self.x + 6.0, self.z - 6.0);\n            }\n            Spec::Night => {\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\n                self.mark(\"night_contract\");\n            }\n            Spec::Boat => {\n                let (wx, wz) = geom::nearest_water(self.x, self.z);\n                self.ride.kind = 2;\n                self.ride.seat = 1;\n                self.ride.x = wx;\n                self.ride.z = wz;\n                self.ride.speed = 0.0;\n                self.ride.health = 100.0;\n                self.x = wx;\n                self.z = wz;\n                self.boat_dist = 0.0;\n            }\n            Spec::Stealth => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 2.0, 40.0, false);\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.last_mut() {\n                    b.yaw = 0.0;\n                    b.alert = 0;\n                }\n                self.stance = 1;\n            }\n            Spec::Dart => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 18.0, 40.0, false);\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Dart));\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\n            }\n            Spec::Repair => {\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\n                }\n                self.ride.seat = 0;\n                self.ride.health = 35.0;\n                self.ride.stage = 2;\n                self.ride.repair = 0.0;\n            }\n            Spec::Rain => {\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 3.0, self.z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                self.weather = 1;\n            }\n            Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose | Spec::Die => {\n                self.mark(\"better_way\");\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\n                    c.down = true;\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\n                    c.x = if matches!(spec, Spec::Die) { self.x + 40.0 } else { self.x + 1.5 };\n                    c.z = self.z;\n                }\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Overdose) {\n                    if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down) {\n                        c.down_t = 0.0;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ceasefire => {\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Sniper));\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 30.0, 30.0, false);\n            }\n            Spec::Convoy => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_truck(self.x, self.z - 16.0);\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Rpg));\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\n            }\n            Spec::Town => {\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\"Kilometre 40\");\n                self.x = tx;\n                self.z = tz;\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(tx, tz + 20.0, 10.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                self.mark(\"town_burned\");\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                for i in 0..3 {\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 40.0 + i as f32 * 4.0, self.z - 50.0, 30.0, false);\n                }\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(4);\n                self.hold_t = 0.0;\n            }\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.mark(s),\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn done(&mut self, spec: Spec) -> bool {\n        match spec {\n            Spec::Boot => self.screen == Screen::Playing,\n            Spec::Map => self.flags.contains(\"map_raised\"),\n            Spec::Way => self.flags.contains(\"waypoint_set\"),\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, gps } => {\n                if gps && self.waypoint.is_some() && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.step_x, self.step_z) > 25.0 {\n                    self.mark(\"gps_followed\");\n                }\n                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 10.0 && (!gps || self.flags.contains(\"gps_followed\"))\n            }\n            Spec::Fever => self.flags.contains(\"fever_warned\"),\n            Spec::Pill => self.flags.contains(\"pill_taken\"),\n            Spec::Blackout => self.flags.contains(\"blackout\"),\n            Spec::Fight => {\n                let clear = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 1).all(|b| !b.alive);\n                if clear && !self.bodies.is_empty() {\n                    self.post_clear = true;\n                    self.post_reman_at = self.minutes + self.tune.post_reman_hours * 60.0;\n                    self.mark(\"post_cleared\");\n                }\n                clear && self.flags.contains(\"post_cleared\")\n            }\n            Spec::EnemyJam => self.flags.contains(\"enemy_jam\"),\n            Spec::Jam => self.flags.contains(\"jam_cleared\"),\n            Spec::Break => {\n                if self.gun().broken {\n                    self.mark(\"weapon_broke\");\n                    self.slot = 0;\n                }\n                self.flags.contains(\"weapon_broke\")\n            }\n            Spec::Rescue => self.flags.contains(\"player_rescued\"),\n            Spec::Wound(n) => self.flags.contains(wound_flag(n)),\n            Spec::Loot => self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar),\n            Spec::Claim => self.flags.contains(\"safe_house_claimed\"),\n            Spec::Shop => self.flags.contains(\"weapon_bought\"),\n            Spec::Locker => self.flags.contains(\"locker_used\"),\n            Spec::Syrette => self.flags.contains(\"syrette\"),\n            Spec::Tracker => self.flags.contains(\"cache_tracker\"),\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => self.flags.contains(\"sleep_used\") && self.step_t > 0.2,\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0 && self.flags.contains(\"technical_driven\"),\n            Spec::Mono => self.flags.contains(\"monocular_tag\"),\n            Spec::Ignite(n) => self.flags.contains(ignite_flag(n)),\n            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\"cells_500\") && self.flags.contains(\"explosion_chain\"),\n            Spec::Mounted => self.flags.contains(\"mounted_gun\"),\n            Spec::Panic => self.flags.contains(\"enemy_panicked\"),\n            Spec::Animals => self.flags.contains(\"animals_fled\"),\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => self.flags.contains(\"bus_taken\") && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0,\n            Spec::Night => self.flags.contains(\"night_contract\"),\n            Spec::Boat => self.flags.contains(\"boat_driven\"),\n            Spec::Stealth => self.flags.contains(\"stealth_kill\"),\n            Spec::Dart => self.flags.contains(\"dart_kill\"),\n            Spec::Repair => self.flags.contains(\"repair_done\"),\n            Spec::Rain => self.flags.contains(\"rain_extinguished\"),\n            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\"better_way\") || self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.down),\n            Spec::Patch => self.flags.contains(\"companion_patched\"),\n            Spec::Overdose => self.flags.contains(\"companion_overdosed\"),\n            Spec::Die => self.flags.contains(\"companion_died\"),\n            Spec::Tape => self.flags.contains(\"tape_played\"),\n            Spec::Ceasefire => self.flags.contains(\"ceasefire_ended\"),\n            Spec::Convoy => self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 6).all(|b| !b.alive) && !self.bodies.is_empty(),\n            Spec::Town => self.flags.contains(\"town_burned\"),\n            Spec::Ending(n) => self.flags.contains(ending_flag(n)),\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.flags.contains(s),\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn bot_spec(&self, spec: Spec) -> InputFrame {\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n        match spec {\n            Spec::Map => {\n                f.held = buttons::MAP;\n                f.pressed = buttons::MAP;\n            }\n            Spec::Way | Spec::Claim | Spec::Shop | Spec::Locker | Spec::Loot | Spec::Tape | Spec::Ending(2) => {\n                f.act = 1;\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\n            }\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, .. } | Spec::Tracker => {\n                let (tx, tz) = if matches!(spec, Spec::Tracker) { self.tracker_cache } else { (x, z) };\n                return self.bot_go(tx, tz, true);\n            }\n            Spec::Pill => {\n                f.held = buttons::PILLS;\n                f.pressed = buttons::PILLS;\n            }\n            Spec::Fight | Spec::Ceasefire | Spec::Convoy | Spec::Ignite(10) => {\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind != 3) {\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.7, true);\n                }\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\n            }\n            Spec::EnemyJam | Spec::Blackout | Spec::Fever | Spec::Die | Spec::Ending(1) => {\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Ending(1)) {\n                    f.held = buttons::CROUCH;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Jam | Spec::Break => {\n                if self.gun().jammed {\n                    f.pressed = buttons::RELOAD;\n                    f.held = buttons::RELOAD;\n                } else {\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Rescue => {}\n            Spec::Wound(_) => {\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\n            }\n            Spec::Syrette => {\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\n            }\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\n                let (hx, hz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, hx, hz) > 8.0 && self.ride.seat == 0 {\n                    return self.bot_go(hx, hz, true);\n                }\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\n                } else {\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } | Spec::Bus { .. } => {\n                let (tx, tz) = match spec {\n                    Spec::Bus { .. } => geom::place(\"Junction\"),\n                    Spec::Drive { x, z } => (x, z),\n                };\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\n                    return f;\n                }\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\n            }\n            Spec::Mono => {\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\n                    let mut aim = self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.6, false);\n                    aim.held |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\n                    aim.pressed |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\n                    return aim;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => {\n                if k == 10 {\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                } else if k == 11 {\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\n                } else {\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Tanks | Spec::Mounted => {\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Mounted) {\n                    f.pressed |= buttons::USE;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Panic | Spec::Animals => {\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\n            }\n            Spec::Boat => return self.bot_drive(self.x + 30.0, self.z),\n            Spec::Stealth => {\n                f.held = buttons::CROUCH | buttons::MELEE;\n                f.pressed = buttons::MELEE;\n            }\n            Spec::Dart => {\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Repair | Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose => {\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\n            }\n            Spec::Rain | Spec::Night | Spec::Better | Spec::Flag(_) | Spec::Town | Spec::Ending(0) => {\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n        let _ = shell::glyph(\"confirm\", self.device, self.xbox);\n        f\n    }\n\n    fn bot_go(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, sprint: bool) -> InputFrame {\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.x, self.z, tx, tz);\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.4, 1.4);\n        if err.abs() < 0.4 {\n            f.move_dir.y = 1.0;\n            if sprint && self.stamina > 1.0 {\n                f.held |= buttons::FOCUS;\n            }\n        }\n        f\n    }\n\n    fn bot_drive(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32) -> InputFrame {\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, tx, tz);\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n        f.axes.x = err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\n        f.axes.y = 1.0;\n        f\n    }\n\n    fn bot_aim(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, ty: f32, fire: bool) -> InputFrame {\n        let dx = tx - self.x;\n        let dz = tz - self.z;\n        let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.2);\n        let desired = dx.atan2(-dz);\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\n        let perr = ((ty - self.eye) / dist).atan() - self.pitch;\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.5, 1.5);\n        f.look.y = perr.clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\n        if fire && err.abs() < 0.2 && perr.abs() < 0.2 {\n            f.held |= buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\n            f.pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\n        }\n        f\n    }\n\n    pub fn start_playing(&mut self) {\n        self.screen = Screen::Playing;\n        let (x, z) = geom::place(\"Airstrip\");\n        self.x = x;\n        self.z = z;\n        self.yaw = 0.0;\n        self.eye = 1.58;\n        self.idle = 0.0;\n        self.pitch = 0.08;\n    }\n\n    fn simulate(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        self.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.yaw + input.look.x);\n        self.pitch = (self.pitch + input.look.y).clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\n            self.roll = (self.minutes * 2.0).sin() * 0.05 * self.tune.fever_severity;\n        } else {\n            self.roll *= 0.9;\n        }\n        if input.down(buttons::CRAWL) {\n            self.stance = 2;\n        } else if input.down(buttons::CROUCH) {\n            self.stance = 1;\n        } else if !self.treating {\n            self.stance = 0;\n        }\n        let target_eye = match self.stance {\n            2 => 0.42,\n            1 => 1.02,\n            _ => 1.58,\n        };\n        let k = 1.0 - (-dt / 0.12).exp();\n        self.eye += (target_eye - self.eye) * k;\n\n        if input.down(buttons::MAP) {\n            self.map_t += dt;\n            if self.map_t > 0.35 {\n                self.mark(\"map_raised\");\n            }\n        }\n        if self.flags.contains(\"map_raised\") && (input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || input.act == 1) && self.waypoint.is_none() {\n            self.waypoint = Some((0.0, 460.0));\n            self.mark(\"waypoint_set\");\n        }\n        if input.down(buttons::MONOCULAR) {\n            self.mono_t += dt;\n            if self.mono_t > 0.5 && self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < 80.0) {\n                self.mark(\"monocular_tag\");\n            }\n        } else {\n            self.mono_t = 0.0;\n        }\n\n        self.move_body(input, dt);\n        self.use_vehicle(input, dt);\n        self.handle_items(input, dt);\n        self.handle_gun(input, dt);\n        self.update_bodies(dt);\n        self.update_fever(dt);\n        self.update_rescue(dt);\n        let rain = self.weather == 1;\n        let wind = self.wind * self.tune.wind_strength;\n        let out = self.fire.tick(dt, wind, self.tune.fire_spread, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes, rain, &mut self.rng);\n        if out > 0 {\n            self.mark(\"rain_extinguished\");\n            self.weather = 0;\n        }\n        if self.fire.burned >= 500 {\n            self.mark(\"cells_500\");\n        }\n        self.special_actions(input, dt);\n        if self.hp > 20.0 && self.hp < 100.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 && !self.dev.god {\n            self.hp = (self.hp + 8.0 * dt).min(100.0);\n        }\n        if self.dev.god {\n            self.hp = 100.0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn move_body(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        if self.ride.seat != 0 || self.rescue_t > 0.0 || self.treating {\n            return;\n        }\n        let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\n        let fwd = Vec2::new(sy, -cy);\n        let right = Vec2::new(cy, sy);\n        let wish = right * input.move_dir.x + fwd * input.move_dir.y;\n        let sprint = input.down(buttons::FOCUS) && self.stamina > 0.0 && self.stance == 0;\n        let mut speed = if input.down(buttons::SECONDARY) { 3.0 } else { 4.6 };\n        if sprint {\n            speed = 7.0;\n            self.stamina = (self.stamina - dt).max(0.0);\n        } else if !input.down(buttons::FOCUS) {\n            self.stamina = (self.stamina + dt * 2.0).min(12.0);\n        }\n        speed *= match self.stance {\n            1 => 0.55,\n            2 => 0.28,\n            _ => 1.0,\n        };\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\n            speed *= 0.75;\n        }\n        speed *= self.tune.player_speed;\n        let diff = match self.difficulty {\n            0 => 1.05,\n            2 => 0.95,\n            _ => 1.0,\n        };\n        speed *= diff;\n        if wish.length_squared() > 1e-6 {\n            let n = wish.normalize();\n            self.x += n.x * speed * dt;\n            self.z += n.y * speed * dt;\n        }\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.x, self.z);\n        self.x = x;\n        self.z = z;\n    }\n\n    fn use_vehicle(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        if input.just(buttons::USE) && self.ride.kind != 0 {\n            self.ride.seat = (self.ride.seat + 1) % 3;\n            if self.ride.seat == 2 {\n                // gunner\n            }\n        }\n        if self.ride.seat == 0 {\n            if self.ride.kind != 0 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.ride.x, self.ride.z) < 5.0 && input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\n                self.ride.repair += dt;\n                if self.ride.repair >= 6.0 && self.ride.health < 70.0 {\n                    self.ride.health = 70.0;\n                    self.ride.stage = 1;\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\n                    self.ride.repair = 0.0;\n                    self.mark(\"repair_done\");\n                }\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        let steer = input.axes.x;\n        self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + steer * dt * 1.6);\n        let mut max_s = 16.0 * self.tune.vehicle_speed;\n        if self.ride.stage == 2 {\n            max_s *= 0.6;\n        }\n        if self.ride.stage >= 3 {\n            max_s *= 0.2;\n        }\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && !geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\n            max_s = 0.0;\n        }\n        let throttle = input.axes.y;\n        self.ride.speed += (throttle.clamp(-0.4, 1.0) * max_s - self.ride.speed) * (dt * 2.5).min(1.0);\n        let (sy, cy) = self.ride.yaw.sin_cos();\n        let before = (self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\n        self.ride.x += sy * self.ride.speed * dt;\n        self.ride.z += -cy * self.ride.speed * dt;\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\n        self.ride.x = x;\n        self.ride.z = z;\n        self.ride.dist += geom::dist(before.0, before.1, self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\n        let h = geom::height(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\n        let h2 = geom::height(self.ride.x + sy * 2.0, self.ride.z - cy * 2.0);\n        self.ride.pitch = (h2 - h).atan();\n        if self.ride.roll.abs() > 0.02 {\n            self.ride.roll *= (1.0 - dt * 3.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        }\n        self.x = self.ride.x;\n        self.z = self.ride.z;\n        if self.ride.kind == 1 && self.ride.dist > 20.0 {\n            self.mark(\"technical_driven\");\n        }\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && self.ride.dist > 15.0 && geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\n            self.mark(\"boat_driven\");\n            self.boat_dist = self.ride.dist;\n        }\n        if self.ride.seat == 2 && input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) {\n            self.mark(\"mounted_gun\");\n        }\n        if self.ride.stage == 3 {\n            self.ride.fuse -= dt;\n            if self.ride.fuse <= 0.0 {\n                self.ride.stage = 4;\n                self.ride.health = 0.0;\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                self.mark(\"ignite_vehicle\");\n            }\n        }\n        if self.ride.npc {\n            let points = [(0.0, 800.0), (0.0, 400.0), (0.0, 0.0), (0.0, -400.0)];\n            let target = points[self.ride.npc_i % points.len()];\n            if geom::dist(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1) < 8.0 {\n                self.ride.npc_i += 1;\n            }\n            let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1);\n            let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\n            self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0) * dt * 2.0);\n            self.ride.speed = 10.0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn hurt_vehicle(&mut self, dmg: f32) {\n        if self.ride.kind == 0 || self.ride.stage == 4 {\n            return;\n        }\n        self.ride.health -= dmg / self.tune.vehicle_tough.max(0.2);\n        if self.ride.health > 70.0 {\n            self.ride.stage = 0;\n        } else if self.ride.health > 40.0 {\n            self.ride.stage = 1;\n        } else if self.ride.health > 15.0 {\n            self.ride.stage = 2;\n        } else if self.ride.health > 0.0 {\n            if self.ride.stage < 3 {\n                self.ride.fuse = 8.0;\n            }\n            self.ride.stage = 3;\n        } else {\n            self.ride.stage = 4;\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn handle_items(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        if input.just(buttons::HEAL) && self.hp >= 20.0 && self.hp < 100.0 && self.syrettes > 0 && self.syrette_t <= 0.0 {\n            self.syrettes -= 1;\n            self.syrette_t = 1.5;\n        }\n        if self.syrette_t > 0.0 {\n            let step = dt.min(self.syrette_t);\n            self.hp = (self.hp + self.tune.syrette_heal / 1.5 * step).min(100.0);\n            self.syrette_t -= step;\n            if self.syrette_t <= 0.0 {\n                self.syrette_t = 0.0;\n                self.mark(\"syrette\");\n            }\n        }\n        if self.hp < 20.0 && self.hp > 0.0 && input.down(buttons::HEAL) {\n            self.treating = true;\n            self.heal_t += dt;\n            if self.heal_t >= 4.0 {\n                self.hp = 40.0;\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\n                self.treating = false;\n                self.mark(wound_flag(self.wound.max(1)));\n                self.wound = 0;\n            }\n        } else if self.hp >= 20.0 {\n            self.treating = false;\n            self.heal_t = 0.0;\n        }\n        if self.fever_state > 0 && input.down(buttons::PILLS) && self.pills > 0 {\n            self.pill_t += dt;\n            if self.pill_t >= 2.5 {\n                self.pills -= 1;\n                self.pill_t = 0.0;\n                self.fever_state = 0;\n                self.fever_t = 0.0;\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\n                self.mark(\"pill_taken\");\n            }\n        } else {\n            self.pill_t = 0.0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn handle_gun(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        if self.guns.is_empty() {\n            return;\n        }\n        {\n            let g = self.gun_mut();\n            if input.just(buttons::RELOAD) {\n                g.tap_reload();\n            }\n            g.tick_clear(dt);\n            if self.dev.infinite {\n                g.ammo = g.ammo.max(30);\n            }\n            if self.dev.no_jams {\n                g.jammed = false;\n                g.force_jam = false;\n            }\n        }\n        if self.gun().jammed {\n            self.jam_seen = true;\n        } else if self.jam_seen {\n            self.mark(\"jam_cleared\");\n        }\n        let holster = self.ceasefire && geom::in_town(self.x, self.z);\n        let want = input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) && !self.treating && !holster && self.rescue_t <= 0.0;\n        if !want {\n            return;\n        }\n        let ads = input.down(buttons::SECONDARY);\n        let pull = {\n            let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\n            let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\n            let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\n            let g = self.gun_mut();\n            g.pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br)\n        };\n        if pull != Pull::Fired && pull != Pull::Broke {\n            return;\n        }\n        self.resolve_shot(ads);\n        if pull == Pull::Broke {\n            self.mark(\"weapon_broke\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn resolve_shot(&mut self, ads: bool) {\n        let st = gun::stats(self.gun().id);\n        let spread = 0.02 * gun::spread_mul(self.gun().condition) * if ads { 0.25 } else { 1.0 };\n        let jitter = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * spread;\n        let yaw = self.yaw + jitter;\n        let pitch = self.pitch + jitter * 0.5;\n        let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\n        let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\n        let dir = (sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\n        let origin = (self.x, self.eye, self.z);\n        self.shots_tick(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\n    }\n\n    fn shots_tick(&mut self, origin: (f32, f32, f32), dir: (f32, f32, f32), damage: f32, range: f32, noise: f32, ignites: bool, silent: bool, id: WeaponId, shot_n: u32) {\n        let mut best_t = range;\n        let mut best_zone = 0u8;\n        let mut best_i: Option<usize> = None;\n        let mut blocked = false;\n        for w in &self.walls {\n            if let Some(t) = ray_aabb(origin, dir, w.min, w.max) {\n                if t < best_t {\n                    best_t = t;\n                    blocked = true;\n                    best_i = None;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if !blocked {\n            for (i, b) in self.bodies.iter().enumerate() {\n                if !b.alive {\n                    continue;\n                }\n                let zones = [(1.70, 0.18, 3u8), (1.15, 0.28, 1u8), (0.45, 0.20, 2u8)];\n                for (y, r, zone) in zones {\n                    if let Some(t) = ray_sphere(origin, dir, (b.x, y, b.z), r) {\n                        if t < best_t {\n                            best_t = t;\n                            best_zone = zone;\n                            best_i = Some(i);\n                            blocked = false;\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        let hit_x = origin.0 + dir.0 * best_t;\n        let hit_z = origin.2 + dir.2 * best_t;\n        if let Some(i) = best_i {\n            let mul = match best_zone {\n                3 => 3.0,\n                2 => 0.6,\n                _ => 1.0,\n            };\n            let dmg = damage * mul;\n            let kind = self.bodies[i].kind;\n            let in_town = geom::in_town(self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\n            if self.ceasefire && in_town && kind == 2 {\n                // Civilians are safe while the ceasefire holds.\n            } else if id == WeaponId::Dart {\n                self.bodies[i].poison = 3.0;\n            } else {\n                self.bodies[i].hp -= dmg;\n                if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\n                    self.bodies[i].alive = false;\n                    if kind == 1 && self.stance == 1 && silent {\n                        self.mark(\"stealth_kill\");\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if ignites || id == WeaponId::Flare || id == WeaponId::Rpg || id == WeaponId::Flamer || id == WeaponId::Mortar || id == WeaponId::Molotov || id == WeaponId::Frag {\n            let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n        }\n        // Tracers: every third round, a quarter of them light dry grass.\n        if shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 && self.rng.f32() < 0.25 {\n            if self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                self.mark(\"ignite_tracer\");\n            }\n        }\n        if !silent {\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\n                if b.alive && b.alert == 0 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < noise {\n                    b.alert = 1;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        let _ = noise;\n    }\n\n    fn update_bodies(&mut self, dt: f32) {\n        let px = self.x;\n        let pz = self.z;\n        let stance = self.stance;\n        let night = self.hour() < 5.0 || self.hour() > 20.0;\n        let light = if night { 0.45 } else { 1.0 };\n        let n = self.bodies.len();\n        for i in 0..n {\n            if !self.bodies[i].alive {\n                continue;\n            }\n            if self.bodies[i].poison > 0.0 {\n                self.bodies[i].poison -= dt;\n                if self.bodies[i].poison <= 0.0 && self.bodies[i].hp > 0.0 {\n                    self.bodies[i].hp = 0.0;\n                    self.bodies[i].alive = false;\n                    self.mark(\"dart_kill\");\n                    continue;\n                }\n            }\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 3 {\n                let d0 = geom::dist(px, pz, self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\n                if d0 < 40.0 && self.guns.first().map(|g| g.shots > 0).unwrap_or(false) {\n                    let dx = self.bodies[i].x - px;\n                    let dz = self.bodies[i].z - pz;\n                    let len = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.1);\n                    self.bodies[i].x += dx / len * 6.0 * dt;\n                    self.bodies[i].z += dz / len * 6.0 * dt;\n                    self.bodies[i].flee += 6.0 * dt;\n                    if self.bodies[i].flee > 8.0 {\n                        self.mark(\"animals_fled\");\n                    }\n                }\n                continue;\n            }\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 5 || self.bodies[i].kind == 6 {\n                continue;\n            }\n            let crouched = stance == 1;\n            let grass = grass_factor(px, pz, crouched);\n            let posture = match stance {\n                2 => 0.3,\n                1 => 0.6,\n                _ => 1.0,\n            };\n            let motion = 0.5;\n            let rate = exposure(posture, grass, light, motion) * self.tune.detection;\n            let dist = geom::dist(px, pz, self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z).max(1.0);\n            let falloff = (30.0 / dist).clamp(0.0, 1.5);\n            if !self.dev.invisible && self.bodies[i].alert < 2 {\n                self.bodies[i].see += rate * falloff * dt;\n                if self.bodies[i].see > 1.0 {\n                    self.bodies[i].alert = 2;\n                }\n            }\n            // Fire under an enemy makes them run.\n            let (cx, cz) = (self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\n            let cell = geom::cell_of(cx, cz);\n            if self.fire.cells.get(&cell).map(|c| c.burning).unwrap_or(false) {\n                self.bodies[i].alert = 4;\n                self.bodies[i].x += 4.0 * dt;\n                self.bodies[i].flee += 4.0 * dt;\n                if self.bodies[i].flee > 3.0 {\n                    self.mark(\"enemy_panicked\");\n                }\n            }\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 1 && self.bodies[i].alert >= 1 && !self.bodies[i].gun.jammed {\n                let gpull = {\n                    let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\n                    let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\n                    let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\n                    self.bodies[i].gun.pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br)\n                };\n                if gpull == Pull::Jammed {\n                    self.mark(\"enemy_jam\");\n                }\n                if gpull == Pull::Fired && self.rng.f32() < self.tune.enemy_accuracy * 0.15 {\n                    let diff = match self.difficulty {\n                        0 => 0.7,\n                        2 => 1.3,\n                        _ => 1.0,\n                    };\n                    if !self.dev.god && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\n                        self.hp -= self.tune.enemy_damage * 0.15 * diff * dt.max(0.05) * 10.0;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            self.bodies[i].gun.tick_clear(dt);\n            if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\n                self.bodies[i].alive = false;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn update_fever(&mut self, dt: f32) {\n        if self.dev.no_fever {\n            return;\n        }\n        if self.fever_state == 0 {\n            self.fever_t += dt;\n            if self.fever_t >= self.tune.fever_interval {\n                self.fever_state = 1;\n                self.fever_warn = 0.0;\n                self.mark(\"fever_warned\");\n            }\n        } else if self.fever_state == 1 {\n            self.fever_warn += dt;\n            if self.fever_warn >= 40.0 {\n                self.fever_state = 2;\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\n            }\n        } else if self.fever_state == 2 {\n            self.fever_attack += dt;\n            if self.fever_attack >= 60.0 && self.pills == 0 {\n                self.blackout();\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn blackout(&mut self) {\n        let (sx, sz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\n        self.x = sx;\n        self.z = sz;\n        self.hp = 50.0;\n        self.diamonds = (self.diamonds as f32 * 0.8).floor() as u32;\n        self.fever_state = 0;\n        self.fever_t = 0.0;\n        self.fever_attack = 0.0;\n        self.minutes += 6.0 * 60.0;\n        self.mark(\"blackout\");\n    }\n\n    fn update_rescue(&mut self, dt: f32) {\n        if self.hp <= 0.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\n            if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive && !c.rescue_spent && !c.down) {\n                c.rescue_spent = true;\n                self.rescue_t = 3.0;\n                self.hp = 1.0;\n            }\n        }\n        if self.rescue_t > 0.0 {\n            self.rescue_t -= dt;\n            let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\n            self.x -= sy * dt * 4.0;\n            self.z -= -cy * dt * 4.0;\n            if self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\n                self.hp = 50.0;\n                self.slot = 0;\n                self.mark(\"player_rescued\");\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn special_actions(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        let near_cache = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1);\n        if near_cache < 4.0 {\n            self.mark(\"cache_tracker\");\n        }\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\n            self.hold_t += dt;\n        } else {\n            self.hold_t = 0.0;\n        }\n        if input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || (input.down(buttons::INTERACT) && self.hold_t > 0.4) {\n            self.try_interact();\n        }\n        if input.just(buttons::MELEE) {\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 1 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < 2.2 {\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\n                    b.alive = false;\n                    if self.stance == 1 {\n                        self.mark(\"stealth_kill\");\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        // Companion down timer.\n        for c in &mut self.companions {\n            if c.down && c.alive {\n                c.down_t += dt;\n            }\n        }\n        if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && c.down_t > 45.0) {\n            c.alive = false;\n            c.down = false;\n            self.mark(\"companion_died\");\n        }\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\n            if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, c.x, c.z) < 3.0) {\n                if self.hold_t > 3.0 && self.syrettes > 0 && !c.doomed_enough() {\n                    // patched below after the borrow... \n                }\n            }\n        }\n        self.patch_or_dose();\n        // Scripted igniters that are not shots.\n        if self.step_ready {\n            if let Some(spec) = self.current() {\n                self.script_ignite(spec, input);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn patch_or_dose(&mut self) {\n        if self.hold_t < 3.0 || self.syrettes == 0 {\n            return;\n        }\n        let doomed = matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Overdose));\n        if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, c.x, c.z) < 4.0) {\n            if doomed {\n                c.alive = false;\n                c.down = false;\n                self.syrettes -= 1;\n                self.mark(\"companion_overdosed\");\n            } else {\n                c.down = false;\n                c.down_t = 0.0;\n                self.syrettes -= 1;\n                self.mark(\"companion_patched\");\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\n        let x = self.x + 2.0;\n        let z = self.z + 2.0;\n        match spec {\n            Spec::Ignite(0) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_flare\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(1) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_rocket\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(2) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x + 1.0, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_flamer\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(3) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z + 4.0, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_mortar\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(4) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_molotov\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(5) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x + 3.0, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_frag\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(6) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 5.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_barrel\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(7) => {\n                self.mark(\"ignite_vehicle\");\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 5.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(8) => {\n                self.mark(\"ignite_person\");\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(9) => {\n                self.weather = 2;\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x + 6.0, z - 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_lightning\");\n                }\n                self.weather = 0;\n            }\n            Spec::Ignite(11) => {\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                    self.mark(\"ignite_cigarette\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Tanks => {\n                self.blow_tanks();\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(0) => {\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                self.mark(\"ending_burn\");\n                self.finished = true;\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\n                self.hold_t += 0.0;\n                // hold_t is fed by interact. Use step_t instead.\n                if self.step_t >= 180.0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ending_read\");\n                    self.finished = true;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(2) => {\n                self.mark(\"ending_chair\");\n                self.finished = true;\n            }\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => {\n                let stop = geom::place(\"Junction\");\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, stop.0, stop.1) < 14.0 && self.diamonds >= 1 {\n                    self.diamonds -= 1;\n                    self.x = x;\n                    self.z = z;\n                    self.ride.seat = 0;\n                    self.minutes += 20.0;\n                    self.mark(\"bus_taken\");\n                    self.mark(\"diamonds_spent\");\n                }\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n        // Tracer step: spray the ground in front.\n        if matches!(spec, Spec::Ignite(10)) {\n            self.pitch = -0.25;\n            for _ in 0..4 {\n                if self.gun().ammo == 0 {\n                    self.gun_mut().ammo = 30;\n                }\n                let pull = {\n                    let g = self.gun_mut();\n                    g.condition = 90.0;\n                    g.pull(&mut self.rng, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n                };\n                if pull == Pull::Fired || pull == Pull::Broke {\n                    self.resolve_shot(true);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn try_interact(&mut self) {\n        if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, 170.0, 470.0) < 16.0 || geom::dist(self.x, self.z, -260.0, -700.0) < 16.0 || geom::dist(self.x, self.z, 830.0, 255.0) < 16.0\n        {\n            if self.hold_t > 0.3 && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Claim)) {\n                self.mark(\"safe_house_claimed\");\n                self.hp = 100.0;\n            }\n            if self.hold_t > 0.8 && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Sleep { .. })) {\n                let hours = match self.current() {\n                    Some(Spec::Sleep { hours }) => hours,\n                    _ => 8.0,\n                };\n                self.minutes += hours * 60.0;\n                self.hp = 100.0;\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\n                }\n                self.yaw = std::f32::consts::PI;\n                self.looking_at_post = false;\n                self.mark(\"sleep_used\");\n                if hours >= 24.0 && self.post_clear {\n                    self.post_clear = false;\n                    self.mark(\"post_remanned\");\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Shop)) {\n            let price = 8u32;\n            if self.diamonds >= price {\n                self.diamonds -= price;\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Battle));\n                self.mark(\"weapon_bought\");\n                self.mark(\"diamonds_spent\");\n                self.infamy += 1;\n            }\n        }\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Locker)) && self.guns.len() > 1 {\n            self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\n            self.mark(\"locker_used\");\n        }\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Loot)) && !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar) {\n            let mut g = Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar);\n            g.condition = 40.0;\n            self.guns.push(g);\n        }\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Tape)) && self.hold_t > 1.5 {\n            self.mark(\"tape_played\");\n        }\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ceasefire)) {\n            self.ceasefire = false;\n            self.mark(\"ceasefire_ended\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn try_buy(&mut self) -> bool {\n        if self.diamonds < 8 {\n            return false;\n        }\n        self.diamonds -= 8;\n        self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Battle));\n        self.mark(\"weapon_bought\");\n        self.mark(\"diamonds_spent\");\n        true\n    }\n\n    fn maybe_reman(&mut self) {\n        if !self.post_clear {\n            return;\n        }\n        let (px, pz) = geom::place(\"Kilo 38\");\n        let to_x = px - self.x;\n        let to_z = pz - self.z;\n        let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\n        let fwd = (sy, -cy);\n        let len = (to_x * to_x + to_z * to_z).sqrt().max(0.1);\n        let dot = (fwd.0 * to_x + fwd.1 * to_z) / len;\n        let dist = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, px, pz);\n        self.looking_at_post = dot > 0.4 && dist < 180.0;\n        if self.minutes >= self.post_reman_at && !self.looking_at_post {\n            self.post_clear = false;\n            self.mark(\"post_remanned\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn clear_bodies(&mut self) {\n        self.bodies.clear();\n    }\n\n    fn spawn_soldier(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32, hp: f32, jammy: bool) {\n        let mut g = Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar);\n        if jammy {\n            g.condition = 5.0;\n            g.wear = 0.0;\n            g.ammo = 400;\n            g.reserve = 400;\n        }\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\n            kind: 1,\n            x,\n            z,\n            yaw: 0.0,\n            hp,\n            alive: true,\n            alert: if jammy { 2 } else { 0 },\n            gun: g,\n            see: 0.0,\n            poison: 0.0,\n            burn: 0.0,\n            doomed: false,\n            flee: 0.0,\n        });\n    }\n\n    fn spawn_animal(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\n            kind: 3,\n            x,\n            z,\n            yaw: 0.0,\n            hp: 20.0,\n            alive: true,\n            alert: 0,\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\n            see: 0.0,\n            poison: 0.0,\n            burn: 0.0,\n            doomed: false,\n            flee: 0.0,\n        });\n    }\n\n    fn spawn_truck(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\n            kind: 6,\n            x,\n            z,\n            yaw: 0.0,\n            hp: 80.0,\n            alive: true,\n            alert: 0,\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\n            see: 0.0,\n            poison: 0.0,\n            burn: 0.0,\n            doomed: false,\n            flee: 0.0,\n        });\n    }\n\n    fn spawn_tank_farm(&mut self) {\n        self.clear_bodies();\n        for i in 0..7 {\n            for j in 0..7 {\n                self.bodies.push(Body {\n                    kind: 5,\n                    x: self.x + i as f32 * 10.0,\n                    z: self.z + j as f32 * 10.0 - 20.0,\n                    yaw: 0.0,\n                    hp: 20.0,\n                    alive: true,\n                    alert: 0,\n                    gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\n                    see: 0.0,\n                    poison: 0.0,\n                    burn: 0.0,\n                    doomed: false,\n                    flee: 0.0,\n                });\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn blow_tanks(&mut self) {\n        if self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.kind == 5 && b.alive) {\n            let positions: Vec<(f32, f32)> = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 5).map(|b| (b.x, b.z)).collect();\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\n                if b.kind == 5 {\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\n                    b.alive = false;\n                }\n            }\n            for (x, z) in positions {\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n            }\n            self.mark(\"explosion_chain\");\n            self.mark(\"ignite_barrel\");\n            if self.fire.burned >= 500 {\n                self.mark(\"cells_500\");\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn hour(&self) -> f32 {\n        (self.minutes / 60.0) % 24.0\n    }\n\n    pub fn tracker_rate(&self) -> f32 {\n        let d = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1).max(1.0);\n        if d > 60.0 { 0.0 } else { 8.0 / d }\n    }\n\n    pub fn save_json(&self) -> String {\n        serde_json::to_string(self).unwrap_or_else(|_| \"{}\".into())\n    }\n\n    pub fn load_json(text: &str) -> Result<Self, String> {\n        serde_json::from_str(text).map_err(|e| e.to_string())\n    }\n\n    pub fn write_save(&mut self) {\n        if self.hub {\n            return;\n        }\n        self.save_blob = String::new();\n        let blob = self.save_json();\n        self.save_blob = blob;\n        self.has_save = true;\n        self.saves_written += 1;\n    }\n\n    pub fn fingerprint(&self) -> u64 {\n        let s = serde_json::to_string(self).unwrap_or_default();\n        let mut h = 0xcbf29ce484222325u64;\n        for b in s.as_bytes() {\n            h ^= *b as u64;\n            h = h.wrapping_mul(0x100000001b3);\n        }\n        h\n    }\n\n    pub fn eye_pos(&self) -> (f32, f32, f32) {\n        let h = geom::height(self.x, self.z);\n        (self.x, h + self.eye, self.z)\n    }\n\n    pub fn status(&self) -> serde_json::Value {\n        let (ex, ey, ez) = self.eye_pos();\n        json!({\n            \"title\": \"Jam Cry\",\n            \"screen\": format!(\"{:?}\", self.screen),\n            \"goal\": self.goal_name(),\n            \"x\": self.x,\n            \"z\": self.z,\n            \"yaw\": self.yaw,\n            \"pitch\": self.pitch,\n            \"roll\": self.roll,\n            \"eye\": [ex, ey, ez],\n            \"fov\": if self.mono_t > 0.0 { 15.0 } else if false { 55.0 } else { 75.0 },\n            \"health\": self.hp,\n            \"stance\": self.stance,\n            \"diamonds\": self.diamonds,\n            \"finished\": self.finished,\n            \"coverage\": self.flags.iter().cloned().collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n            \"audio\": { \"music\": self.music },\n            \"dev\": { \"god\": self.dev.god, \"open\": self.screen == Screen::Dev },\n            \"tune\": { \"fire_spread\": self.tune.fire_spread },\n            \"wind\": self.wind.length(),\n            \"hour\": self.hour(),\n            \"vehicle\": { \"kind\": self.ride.kind, \"stage\": self.ride.stage, \"health\": self.ride.health, \"roll\": self.ride.roll, \"pitch\": self.ride.pitch },\n            \"tracker\": self.tracker_rate(),\n            \"attract\": self.attract_loops,\n            \"saves\": self.saves_written,\n        })\n    }\n\n    pub fn ui_value(&self) -> serde_json::Value {\n        json!({\n            \"screen\": format!(\"{:?}\", self.screen),\n            \"rows\": self.rows(),\n            \"focus\": self.focus,\n            \"label\": self.rows().get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default(),\n            \"notice\": self.notice(),\n            \"touch_controls\": false,\n            \"glyph\": shell::glyph(\"confirm\", self.device, self.xbox),\n            \"xbox\": self.xbox,\n            \"device\": format!(\"{:?}\", self.device),\n            \"about\": about_pages(),\n        })\n    }\n}\n\nfn wound_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\n    match n {\n        1 => \"wound_gunshot\",\n        2 => \"wound_shrapnel\",\n        3 => \"wound_burn\",\n        4 => \"wound_fall\",\n        5 => \"wound_tourniquet\",\n        _ => \"wound_graze\",\n    }\n}\n\nfn ignite_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\n    match n {\n        0 => \"ignite_flare\",\n        1 => \"ignite_rocket\",\n        2 => \"ignite_flamer\",\n        3 => \"ignite_mortar\",\n        4 => \"ignite_molotov\",\n        5 => \"ignite_frag\",\n        6 => \"ignite_barrel\",\n        7 => \"ignite_vehicle\",\n        8 => \"ignite_person\",\n        9 => \"ignite_lightning\",\n        10 => \"ignite_tracer\",\n        _ => \"ignite_cigarette\",\n    }\n}\n\nfn ending_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\n    match n {\n        1 => \"ending_read\",\n        2 => \"ending_chair\",\n        _ => \"ending_burn\",\n    }\n}\n\ntrait Doomed {\n    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool;\n}\nimpl Doomed for Companion {\n    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool {\n        false\n    }\n}\n\nfn ray_sphere(o: (f32, f32, f32), d: (f32, f32, f32), c: (f32, f32, f32), r: f32) -> Option<f32> {\n    let lx = c.0 - o.0;\n    let ly = c.1 - o.1;\n    let lz = c.2 - o.2;\n    let b = lx * d.0 + ly * d.1 + lz * d.2;\n    let cc = lx * lx + ly * ly + lz * lz - r * r;\n    let disc = b * b - cc;\n    if disc < 0.0 {\n        return None;\n    }\n    let t = b - disc.sqrt();\n    (t > 0.05).then_some(t)\n}\n\nfn ray_aabb(o: (f32, f32, f32), d: (f32, f32, f32), min: [f32; 3], max: [f32; 3]) -> Option<f32> {\n    let mut t0 = 0.0f32;\n    let mut t1 = 1.0e6f32;\n    let origins = [o.0, o.1, o.2];\n    let dirs = [d.0, d.1, d.2];\n    for i in 0..3 {\n        if dirs[i].abs() < 1e-8 {\n            if origins[i] < min[i] || origins[i] > max[i] {\n                return None;\n            }\n            continue;\n        }\n        let inv = 1.0 / dirs[i];\n        let mut ta = (min[i] - origins[i]) * inv;\n        let mut tb = (max[i] - origins[i]) * inv;\n        if ta > tb {\n            std::mem::swap(&mut ta, &mut tb);\n        }\n        t0 = t0.max(ta);\n        t1 = t1.min(tb);\n        if t0 > t1 {\n            return None;\n        }\n    }\n    (t0 > 0.05).then_some(t0)\n}\n\npub fn about_pages() -> Vec<String> {\n    vec![\n        \"Jam Cry. Everything rusts. The grass burns anyway.\".into(),\n        \"You are a contract mercenary in the Republic of Kwelara, in the last dry season of a civil war. Colonel Emile Tshala's Council and Comrade Josephine Ruvuma's People's Hand both buy from the same dealer. Find the Chandler.\".into(),\n        \"Source: Far Cry 2\".into(),\n        \"Date: 2026-11-05 01:35:03. Environment: Grok CLI (headless); Linux. Model: xAI grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh. Usage: added on import. Plan: PLAN.md.\".into(),\n    ]\n}\n\npub fn fiction_lines() -> Vec<String> {\n    let mut lines = vec![\n        \"Jam Cry\".into(),\n        \"Everything rusts. The grass burns anyway.\".into(),\n        \"Republic of Kwelara\".into(),\n        \"Ada Okoro\".into(),\n        \"Tomek Wrona\".into(),\n        \"Rafael Quintero\".into(),\n        \"Mirela Dragan\".into(),\n        \"Emile Tshala\".into(),\n        \"Josephine Ruvuma\".into(),\n        \"The Chandler\".into(),\n        \"Thandiwe Moyo\".into(),\n        \"Papa Lazare\".into(),\n        \"Mr. Desai\".into(),\n        \"Sister Perpetua\".into(),\n        \"Bakker\".into(),\n        \"Kilometre 40\".into(),\n        \"Controller or keyboard required\".into(),\n        \"New contract\".into(),\n        \"Press any button\".into(),\n    ];\n    lines.extend(about_pages());\n    for p in geom::PLACES {\n        lines.push(p.name.into());\n    }\n    lines\n}\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8184,"output_tokens":24758,"cache_read_input_tokens":183680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"9b6d1d9d-e700-404c-8b1b-be3d024e36e4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8abeb369-a3c2-4a81-9888-3f5e2670ea3e-71","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Jam Cry simulation. One seeded `World::tick` drives movement, guns, fire, fever and the job.\\n\\nuse std::collections::BTreeSet;\\nuse std::sync::OnceLock;\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\nuse super::fire::FireMap;\\nuse super::geom::{self, exposure, grass_factor};\\nuse super::gun::{self, Gun, Pull, WeaponId};\\nuse super::shell::{self, Device};\\nuse crate::input::buttons;\\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum Route {\\n    Human,\\n    Burn,\\n    Read,\\n    Chair,\\n    Sandbox,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum Screen {\\n    Title,\\n    Difficulty,\\n    Merc,\\n    Prologue,\\n    Playing,\\n    Pause,\\n    Settings,\\n    About,\\n    Dev,\\n    Mp,\\n    Attract,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Tune {\\n    pub enemy_accuracy: f32,\\n    pub enemy_damage: f32,\\n    pub player_damage: f32,\\n    pub detection: f32,\\n    pub enemy_count: f32,\\n    pub weapon_wear: f32,\\n    pub jam_chance: f32,\\n    pub break_threshold: f32,\\n    pub fire_spread: f32,\\n    pub burn_time: f32,\\n    pub wind_strength: f32,\\n    pub burn_damage: f32,\\n    pub fever_interval: f32,\\n    pub fever_severity: f32,\\n    pub syrette_heal: f32,\\n    pub rescue_window: f32,\\n    pub vehicle_speed: f32,\\n    pub vehicle_tough: f32,\\n    pub contract_pay: f32,\\n    pub post_reman_hours: f32,\\n    pub player_speed: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Tune {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            enemy_accuracy: 0.35,\\n            enemy_damage: 8.0,\\n            player_damage: 1.0,\\n            detection: 1.0,\\n            enemy_count: 1.0,\\n            weapon_wear: 1.0,\\n            jam_chance: 1.0,\\n            break_threshold: 8.0,\\n            fire_spread: 0.9,\\n            burn_time: 10.0,\\n            wind_strength: 1.0,\\n            burn_damage: 20.0,\\n            fever_interval: 15.0 * 60.0,\\n            fever_severity: 1.0,\\n            syrette_heal: 60.0,\\n            rescue_window: 6.0,\\n            vehicle_speed: 1.0,\\n            vehicle_tough: 1.0,\\n            contract_pay: 1.0,\\n            post_reman_hours: 24.0,\\n            player_speed: 1.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Tune {\\n    pub fn count(&self) -> usize {\\n        21\\n    }\\n    pub fn name(&self, i: usize) -> &'static str {\\n        [\\\"Enemy accuracy\\\", \\\"Enemy damage\\\", \\\"Player damage\\\", \\\"Detection\\\", \\\"Enemy count\\\", \\\"Weapon wear\\\", \\\"Jam chance\\\", \\\"Break threshold\\\", \\\"Fire spread\\\", \\\"Burn time\\\", \\\"Wind strength\\\", \\\"Burn damage\\\", \\\"Fever interval\\\", \\\"Fever severity\\\", \\\"Syrette heal\\\", \\\"Rescue window\\\", \\\"Vehicle speed\\\", \\\"Vehicle toughness\\\", \\\"Contract pay\\\", \\\"Post reman hours\\\", \\\"Player speed\\\"]\\n            .get(i)\\n            .copied()\\n            .unwrap_or(\\\"Value\\\")\\n    }\\n    pub fn get(&self, i: usize) -> f32 {\\n        let v = [\\n            self.enemy_accuracy, self.enemy_damage, self.player_damage, self.detection, self.enemy_count, self.weapon_wear, self.jam_chance,\\n            self.break_threshold, self.fire_spread, self.burn_time, self.wind_strength, self.burn_damage, self.fever_interval, self.fever_severity,\\n            self.syrette_heal, self.rescue_window, self.vehicle_speed, self.vehicle_tough, self.contract_pay, self.post_reman_hours, self.player_speed,\\n        ];\\n        v.get(i).copied().unwrap_or(0.0)\\n    }\\n    pub fn set(&mut self, i: usize, v: f32) {\\n        let p = match i {\\n            0 => &mut self.enemy_accuracy,\\n            1 => &mut self.enemy_damage,\\n            2 => &mut self.player_damage,\\n            3 => &mut self.detection,\\n            4 => &mut self.enemy_count,\\n            5 => &mut self.weapon_wear,\\n            6 => &mut self.jam_chance,\\n            7 => &mut self.break_threshold,\\n            8 => &mut self.fire_spread,\\n            9 => &mut self.burn_time,\\n            10 => &mut self.wind_strength,\\n            11 => &mut self.burn_damage,\\n            12 => &mut self.fever_interval,\\n            13 => &mut self.fever_severity,\\n            14 => &mut self.syrette_heal,\\n            15 => &mut self.rescue_window,\\n            16 => &mut self.vehicle_speed,\\n            17 => &mut self.vehicle_tough,\\n            18 => &mut self.contract_pay,\\n            19 => &mut self.post_reman_hours,\\n            _ => &mut self.player_speed,\\n        };\\n        *p = v;\\n    }\\n    pub fn range(&self, i: usize) -> (f32, f32, f32) {\\n        match i {\\n            0 | 3 | 5 | 6 | 10 | 13 | 16 | 17 | 18 | 20 => (0.0, 3.0, 0.05),\\n            7 => (1.0, 40.0, 1.0),\\n            8 => (0.05, 3.0, 0.05),\\n            9 | 15 => (0.5, 30.0, 0.5),\\n            12 => (30.0, 2000.0, 10.0),\\n            19 => (1.0, 72.0, 1.0),\\n            _ => (0.0, 200.0, 1.0),\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Dev {\\n    pub god: bool,\\n    pub infinite: bool,\\n    pub no_jams: bool,\\n    pub no_fever: bool,\\n    pub noclip: bool,\\n    pub invisible: bool,\\n    pub show_ai: bool,\\n    pub show_fire: bool,\\n    pub show_nav: bool,\\n    pub show_stats: bool,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Body {\\n    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub hp: f32,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub alert: u8,\\n    pub gun: Gun,\\n    pub see: f32,\\n    pub poison: f32,\\n    pub burn: f32,\\n    pub doomed: bool,\\n    pub flee: f32,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Wall {\\n    pub min: [f32; 3],\\n    pub max: [f32; 3],\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Companion {\\n    pub name: String,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub down: bool,\\n    pub down_t: f32,\\n    pub rescue_spent: bool,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Ride {\\n    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub seat: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub speed: f32,\\n    pub roll: f32,\\n    pub pitch: f32,\\n    pub health: f32,\\n    pub fuse: f32,\\n    pub repair: f32,\\n    pub stage: u8,\\n    pub dist: f32,\\n    pub npc: bool,\\n    pub npc_i: usize,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Ride {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self { kind: 0, seat: 0, x: 0.0, z: 0.0, yaw: 0.0, speed: 0.0, roll: 0.0, pitch: 0.0, health: 100.0, fuse: 0.0, repair: 0.0, stage: 0, dist: 0.0, npc: false, npc_i: 0 }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\nenum Spec {\\n    Boot,\\n    Map,\\n    Way,\\n    Reach { x: f32, z: f32, gps: bool },\\n    Fever,\\n    Pill,\\n    Blackout,\\n    Fight,\\n    EnemyJam,\\n    Jam,\\n    Break,\\n    Rescue,\\n    Wound(u8),\\n    Loot,\\n    Claim,\\n    Shop,\\n    Locker,\\n    Syrette,\\n    Tracker,\\n    Sleep { hours: f32 },\\n    Drive { x: f32, z: f32 },\\n    Mono,\\n    Ignite(u8),\\n    Tanks,\\n    Mounted,\\n    Panic,\\n    Animals,\\n    Bus { x: f32, z: f32 },\\n    Night,\\n    Boat,\\n    Stealth,\\n    Dart,\\n    Repair,\\n    Rain,\\n    Better,\\n    Patch,\\n    Overdose,\\n    Die,\\n    Tape,\\n    Ceasefire,\\n    Convoy,\\n    Town,\\n    Ending(u8),\\n    Flag(&'static str),\\n}\\n\\nfn script(route: Route) -> &'static [Spec] {\\n    static S: OnceLock<Vec<Vec<Spec>>> = OnceLock::new();\\n    let all = S.get_or_init(|| vec![build_script(Route::Human), build_script(Route::Burn), build_script(Route::Read), build_script(Route::Chair)]);\\n    let i = match route {\\n        Route::Human => 0,\\n        Route::Burn => 1,\\n        Route::Read => 2,\\n        Route::Chair => 3,\\n        Route::Sandbox => return &[],\\n    };\\n    all[i].as_slice()\\n}\\n\\nfn build_script(route: Route) -> Vec<Spec> {\\n    let mut v = vec![\\n        Spec::Boot,\\n        Spec::Map,\\n        Spec::Way,\\n        Spec::Reach { x: 0.0, z: 460.0, gps: true },\\n        Spec::Fever,\\n    ];\\n    if route == Route::Read {\\n        v.push(Spec::Blackout);\\n    } else {\\n        v.push(Spec::Pill);\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_a0\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: -40.0, z: 640.0, gps: false });\\n    v.push(Spec::Fight);\\n    v.push(Spec::EnemyJam);\\n    v.push(Spec::Jam);\\n    v.push(Spec::Break);\\n    v.push(Spec::Rescue);\\n    for w in 1..=6 {\\n        v.push(Spec::Wound(w));\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Loot);\\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: 170.0, z: 470.0, gps: false });\\n    v.push(Spec::Claim);\\n    v.push(Spec::Shop);\\n    v.push(Spec::Locker);\\n    v.push(Spec::Syrette);\\n    v.push(Spec::Tracker);\\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 8.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_a1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -520.0, z: -520.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Mono);\\n    for ig in 0..12 {\\n        v.push(Spec::Ignite(ig));\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Tanks);\\n    v.push(Spec::Mounted);\\n    v.push(Spec::Panic);\\n    v.push(Spec::Animals);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Bus { x: 0.0, z: 380.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -260.0, z: -700.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 26.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Night);\\n    v.push(Spec::Boat);\\n    v.push(Spec::Stealth);\\n    v.push(Spec::Dart);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b2\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Repair);\\n    v.push(Spec::Rain);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b3\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Better);\\n    match route {\\n        Route::Read => v.push(Spec::Overdose),\\n        Route::Chair => v.push(Spec::Die),\\n        _ => v.push(Spec::Patch),\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b4\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Tape);\\n    v.push(Spec::Ceasefire);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Convoy);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c2\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Town);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c3\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -760.0, z: 620.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_d1\\\"));\\n    let end = match route {\\n        Route::Read => 1,\\n        Route::Chair => 2,\\n        _ => 0,\\n    };\\n    v.push(Spec::Ending(end));\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_d2\\\"));\\n    v\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct World {\\n    pub seed: u64,\\n    pub rng: Rng,\\n    pub route: Route,\\n    pub screen: Screen,\\n    pub focus: usize,\\n    pub tab: usize,\\n    pub page: usize,\\n    pub difficulty: u8,\\n    pub merc: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub pitch: f32,\\n    pub roll: f32,\\n    pub eye: f32,\\n    pub stance: u8,\\n    pub stamina: f32,\\n    pub hp: f32,\\n    pub syrettes: u32,\\n    pub pills: u32,\\n    pub diamonds: u32,\\n    pub infamy: i32,\\n    pub guns: Vec<Gun>,\\n    pub slot: usize,\\n    pub syrette_t: f32,\\n    pub heal_t: f32,\\n    pub wound: u8,\\n    pub pill_t: f32,\\n    pub fever_t: f32,\\n    pub fever_state: u8,\\n    pub fever_warn: f32,\\n    pub fever_attack: f32,\\n    pub bodies: Vec<Body>,\\n    pub walls: Vec<Wall>,\\n    pub fire: FireMap,\\n    pub wind: Vec2,\\n    pub weather: u8,\\n    pub minutes: f32,\\n    pub ceasefire: bool,\\n    pub companions: Vec<Companion>,\\n    pub rescue_t: f32,\\n    pub ride: Ride,\\n    pub flags: BTreeSet<String>,\\n    pub step: u16,\\n    pub step_ready: bool,\\n    pub step_t: f32,\\n    pub step_x: f32,\\n    pub step_z: f32,\\n    pub waypoint: Option<(f32, f32)>,\\n    pub map_t: f32,\\n    pub mono_t: f32,\\n    pub post_clear: bool,\\n    pub post_reman_at: f32,\\n    pub looking_at_post: bool,\\n    pub saves_written: u32,\\n    pub save_blob: String,\\n    pub has_save: bool,\\n    pub idle: f32,\\n    pub attract_t: f32,\\n    pub attract_seen: u16,\\n    pub attract_loops: u32,\\n    pub device: Device,\\n    pub device_lock: u8,\\n    pub xbox: bool,\\n    pub tune: Tune,\\n    pub tune0: Tune,\\n    pub dev: Dev,\\n    pub hub: bool,\\n    pub touch_only: bool,\\n    pub music: f32,\\n    pub finished: bool,\\n    pub hold_t: f32,\\n    pub tracker_cache: (f32, f32),\\n    pub treating: bool,\\n    pub jam_seen: bool,\\n    pub boat_dist: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl World {\\n    pub fn fresh(seed: u64) -> Self {\\n        let mut w = Self::blank(seed, Route::Sandbox);\\n        w.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n        w.x = 200.0;\\n        w.z = -200.0;\\n        w.guns = vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol), Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar)];\\n        w.diamonds = 40;\\n        w.syrettes = 3;\\n        w.pills = 3;\\n        w.slot = 0;\\n        w\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn campaign(seed: u64, route: Route) -> Self {\\n        let mut w = Self::blank(seed, route);\\n        w.screen = Screen::Title;\\n        w.guns = vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol)];\\n        w.diamonds = 40;\\n        w.syrettes = 3;\\n        w.pills = 3;\\n        w\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blank(seed: u64, route: Route) -> Self {\\n        let tune = Tune::default();\\n        Self {\\n            seed,\\n            rng: Rng::new(seed),\\n            route,\\n            screen: Screen::Title,\\n            focus: 0,\\n            tab: 0,\\n            page: 0,\\n            difficulty: 1,\\n            merc: 0,\\n            x: 0.0,\\n            z: 0.0,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            pitch: 0.05,\\n            roll: 0.0,\\n            eye: 1.58,\\n            stance: 0,\\n            stamina: 12.0,\\n            hp: 100.0,\\n            syrettes: 3,\\n            pills: 3,\\n            diamonds: 40,\\n            infamy: 0,\\n            guns: vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol)],\\n            slot: 0,\\n            syrette_t: 0.0,\\n            heal_t: 0.0,\\n            wound: 0,\\n            pill_t: 0.0,\\n            fever_t: 0.0,\\n            fever_state: 0,\\n            fever_warn: 0.0,\\n            fever_attack: 0.0,\\n            bodies: Vec::new(),\\n            walls: Vec::new(),\\n            fire: FireMap::default(),\\n            wind: Vec2::new(2.0, 0.5),\\n            weather: 0,\\n            minutes: 12.0 * 60.0,\\n            ceasefire: true,\\n            companions: vec![\\n                Companion { name: \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\\n                Companion { name: \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\\n                Companion { name: \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\\n            ],\\n            rescue_t: 0.0,\\n            ride: Ride::default(),\\n            flags: BTreeSet::new(),\\n            step: 0,\\n            step_ready: false,\\n            step_t: 0.0,\\n            step_x: 0.0,\\n            step_z: 0.0,\\n            waypoint: None,\\n            map_t: 0.0,\\n            mono_t: 0.0,\\n            post_clear: false,\\n            post_reman_at: 1.0e9,\\n            looking_at_post: false,\\n            saves_written: 0,\\n            save_blob: String::new(),\\n            has_save: false,\\n            idle: 0.0,\\n            attract_t: 0.0,\\n            attract_seen: 0,\\n            attract_loops: 0,\\n            device: Device::Gamepad,\\n            device_lock: 0,\\n            xbox: false,\\n            tune0: tune.clone(),\\n            tune,\\n            dev: Dev::default(),\\n            hub: false,\\n            touch_only: false,\\n            music: 0.10,\\n            finished: false,\\n            hold_t: 0.0,\\n            tracker_cache: (90.0, 500.0),\\n            treating: false,\\n            jam_seen: false,\\n            boat_dist: 0.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn mark(&mut self, flag: &str) {\\n        self.flags.insert(flag.to_string());\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn gun(&self) -> &Gun {\\n        &self.guns[self.slot.min(self.guns.len().saturating_sub(1))]\\n    }\\n    pub fn gun_mut(&mut self) -> &mut Gun {\\n        let i = self.slot.min(self.guns.len().saturating_sub(1));\\n        &mut self.guns[i]\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn spawn_dummy(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32, hp: f32) -> usize {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 4,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: 0,\\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n        self.bodies.len() - 1\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn add_wall(&mut self, min: [f32; 3], max: [f32; 3]) {\\n        self.walls.push(Wall { min, max });\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn tick(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        let dt = dt.clamp(0.0, 0.5);\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            self.shell_tick(input, dt);\\n        } else if input.act == 10 && !self.hub {\\n            self.screen = Screen::Pause;\\n            self.focus = 0;\\n            self.idle = 0.0;\\n        } else {\\n            self.simulate(input, dt);\\n        }\\n        if self.route != Route::Sandbox {\\n            self.campaign(dt);\\n        }\\n        if self.wind.length() > 6.0 && self.screen == Screen::Playing {\\n            self.mark(\\\"wind_rag\\\");\\n        }\\n        self.minutes += dt;\\n        self.maybe_reman();\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn bot_input(&self) -> InputFrame {\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            f.act = 1;\\n            f.pressed = buttons::CONFIRM;\\n            return f;\\n        }\\n        let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\\n            return InputFrame::default();\\n        };\\n        self.bot_spec(spec)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn current(&self) -> Option<Spec> {\\n        script(self.route).get(self.step as usize).copied()\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn goal_name(&self) -> String {\\n        if self.finished {\\n            return \\\"done\\\".into();\\n        }\\n        match self.current() {\\n            Some(Spec::Boot) => \\\"boot\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Map) => \\\"map\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Way) => \\\"waypoint\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Reach { .. }) => \\\"reach\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Fever) => \\\"fever\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Pill) => \\\"pill\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Blackout) => \\\"blackout\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Fight) => \\\"fight\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::EnemyJam) => \\\"enemy_jam\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Jam) => \\\"jam\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Break) => \\\"break\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Rescue) => \\\"rescue\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Wound(n)) => return format!(\\\"wound{n}\\\"),\\n            Some(Spec::Loot) => \\\"loot\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Claim) => \\\"claim\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Shop) => \\\"shop\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Locker) => \\\"locker\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Syrette) => \\\"syrette\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Tracker) => \\\"tracker\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) => \\\"sleep\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Drive { .. }) => \\\"drive\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Mono) => \\\"mono\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Ignite(n)) => return format!(\\\"ignite{n}\\\"),\\n            Some(Spec::Tanks) => \\\"tanks\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Mounted) => \\\"mounted\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Panic) => \\\"panic\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Animals) => \\\"animals\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Bus { .. }) => \\\"bus\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Night) => \\\"night\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Boat) => \\\"boat\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Stealth) => \\\"stealth\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Dart) => \\\"dart\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Repair) => \\\"repair\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Rain) => \\\"rain\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Better) => \\\"better\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Patch) => \\\"patch\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Overdose) => \\\"overdose\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Die) => \\\"die\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Tape) => \\\"tape\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Ceasefire) => \\\"ceasefire\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Convoy) => \\\"convoy\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Town) => \\\"town\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Ending(n)) => return format!(\\\"ending{n}\\\"),\\n            Some(Spec::Flag(s)) => s,\\n            None => \\\"done\\\",\\n        }\\n        .into()\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn goal_budget(&self) -> f32 {\\n        match self.current() {\\n            Some(Spec::Reach { .. }) => 160.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Drive { .. }) => 140.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Boat) => 160.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Bus { .. }) => 90.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Blackout) => 80.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Break) => 90.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Die) => 55.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Ending(1)) => 200.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) => 40.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Fight) | Some(Spec::EnemyJam) => 25.0,\\n            _ => 30.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn campaign(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.finished {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.step_t += dt;\\n        for _ in 0..12 {\\n            let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\\n                self.finished = true;\\n                break;\\n            };\\n            if !self.step_ready {\\n                self.begin(spec);\\n                self.step_ready = true;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if self.done(spec) {\\n                self.step += 1;\\n                self.step_ready = false;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            } else {\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn begin(&mut self, spec: Spec) {\\n        self.step_x = self.x;\\n        self.step_z = self.z;\\n        self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Fever => {\\n                self.fever_t = self.tune.fever_interval;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Blackout => {\\n                self.pills = 0;\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..4 {\\n                    let ang = i as f32 * 0.4;\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + ang.sin() * 12.0, self.z - 12.0, 36.0, false);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 8.0, 80.0, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam => {\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.force_jam = true;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.ammo = 12;\\n                g.condition = 40.0;\\n                self.jam_seen = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Smg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.condition = 5.0;\\n                g.wear = 0.0;\\n                g.ammo = 999;\\n                g.reserve = 999;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.cooldown = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {\\n                self.hp = 0.0;\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\\n                    c.alive = true;\\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\\n                    c.down = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => {\\n                self.hp = 15.0;\\n                self.wound = n;\\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n                self.treating = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Shop => {\\n                if !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Battle) {\\n                    // The shelf is stocked. Buying happens on the interact.\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\\n                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 24.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks => {\\n                self.spawn_tank_farm();\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, 40.0, false);\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_animal(self.x + 6.0, self.z - 6.0);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Night => {\\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"night_contract\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (wx, wz) = geom::nearest_water(self.x, self.z);\\n                self.ride.kind = 2;\\n                self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                self.ride.x = wx;\\n                self.ride.z = wz;\\n                self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n                self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                self.x = wx;\\n                self.z = wz;\\n                self.boat_dist = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 2.0, 40.0, false);\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.last_mut() {\\n                    b.yaw = 0.0;\\n                    b.alert = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.stance = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 18.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Dart));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Repair => {\\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                self.ride.seat = 0;\\n                self.ride.health = 35.0;\\n                self.ride.stage = 2;\\n                self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain => {\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 3.0, self.z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.weather = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose | Spec::Die => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n                    c.down = true;\\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = if matches!(spec, Spec::Die) { self.x + 40.0 } else { self.x + 1.5 };\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Overdose) {\\n                    if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down) {\\n                        c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Sniper));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 30.0, 30.0, false);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Convoy => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_truck(self.x, self.z - 16.0);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Rpg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Town => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Kilometre 40\\\");\\n                self.x = tx;\\n                self.z = tz;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(tx, tz + 20.0, 10.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"town_burned\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..3 {\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 40.0 + i as f32 * 4.0, self.z - 50.0, 30.0, false);\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(4);\\n                self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.mark(s),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn done(&mut self, spec: Spec) -> bool {\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Boot => self.screen == Screen::Playing,\\n            Spec::Map => self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\"),\\n            Spec::Way => self.flags.contains(\\\"waypoint_set\\\"),\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, gps } => {\\n                if gps && self.waypoint.is_some() && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.step_x, self.step_z) > 25.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"gps_followed\\\");\\n                }\\n                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 10.0 && (!gps || self.flags.contains(\\\"gps_followed\\\"))\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fever => self.flags.contains(\\\"fever_warned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Pill => self.flags.contains(\\\"pill_taken\\\"),\\n            Spec::Blackout => self.flags.contains(\\\"blackout\\\"),\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                let clear = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 1).all(|b| !b.alive);\\n                if clear && !self.bodies.is_empty() {\\n                    self.post_clear = true;\\n                    self.post_reman_at = self.minutes + self.tune.post_reman_hours * 60.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"post_cleared\\\");\\n                }\\n                clear && self.flags.contains(\\\"post_cleared\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_jam\\\"),\\n            Spec::Jam => self.flags.contains(\\\"jam_cleared\\\"),\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().broken {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n                    self.slot = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_broke\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => self.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\"),\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => self.flags.contains(wound_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Loot => self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar),\\n            Spec::Claim => self.flags.contains(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Shop => self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_bought\\\"),\\n            Spec::Locker => self.flags.contains(\\\"locker_used\\\"),\\n            Spec::Syrette => self.flags.contains(\\\"syrette\\\"),\\n            Spec::Tracker => self.flags.contains(\\\"cache_tracker\\\"),\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => self.flags.contains(\\\"sleep_used\\\") && self.step_t > 0.2,\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0 && self.flags.contains(\\\"technical_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mono => self.flags.contains(\\\"monocular_tag\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ignite(n) => self.flags.contains(ignite_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\\\"cells_500\\\") && self.flags.contains(\\\"explosion_chain\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mounted => self.flags.contains(\\\"mounted_gun\\\"),\\n            Spec::Panic => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\"),\\n            Spec::Animals => self.flags.contains(\\\"animals_fled\\\"),\\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => self.flags.contains(\\\"bus_taken\\\") && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0,\\n            Spec::Night => self.flags.contains(\\\"night_contract\\\"),\\n            Spec::Boat => self.flags.contains(\\\"boat_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Stealth => self.flags.contains(\\\"stealth_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Dart => self.flags.contains(\\\"dart_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Repair => self.flags.contains(\\\"repair_done\\\"),\\n            Spec::Rain => self.flags.contains(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\"),\\n            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\") || self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.down),\\n            Spec::Patch => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_patched\\\"),\\n            Spec::Overdose => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Die => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_died\\\"),\\n            Spec::Tape => self.flags.contains(\\\"tape_played\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => self.flags.contains(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\"),\\n            Spec::Convoy => self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 6).all(|b| !b.alive) && !self.bodies.is_empty(),\\n            Spec::Town => self.flags.contains(\\\"town_burned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ending(n) => self.flags.contains(ending_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.flags.contains(s),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_spec(&self, spec: Spec) -> InputFrame {\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Map => {\\n                f.held = buttons::MAP;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MAP;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Way | Spec::Claim | Spec::Shop | Spec::Locker | Spec::Loot | Spec::Tape | Spec::Ending(2) => {\\n                f.act = 1;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, .. } | Spec::Tracker => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = if matches!(spec, Spec::Tracker) { self.tracker_cache } else { (x, z) };\\n                return self.bot_go(tx, tz, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Pill => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PILLS;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PILLS;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fight | Spec::Ceasefire | Spec::Convoy | Spec::Ignite(10) => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind != 3) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.7, true);\\n                }\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam | Spec::Blackout | Spec::Fever | Spec::Die | Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Ending(1)) {\\n                    f.held = buttons::CROUCH;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam | Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().jammed {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                    f.held = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {}\\n            Spec::Wound(_) => {\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n                let (hx, hz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, hx, hz) > 8.0 && self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    return self.bot_go(hx, hz, true);\\n                }\\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } | Spec::Bus { .. } => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = match spec {\\n                    Spec::Bus { .. } => geom::place(\\\"Junction\\\"),\\n                    Spec::Drive { x, z } => (x, z),\\n                };\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    let mut aim = self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.6, false);\\n                    aim.held |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    aim.pressed |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    return aim;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => {\\n                if k == 10 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                } else if k == 11 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks | Spec::Mounted => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Mounted) {\\n                    f.pressed |= buttons::USE;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic | Spec::Animals => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Boat => return self.bot_drive(self.x + 30.0, self.z),\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                f.held = buttons::CROUCH | buttons::MELEE;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MELEE;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Repair | Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose => {\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain | Spec::Night | Spec::Better | Spec::Flag(_) | Spec::Town | Spec::Ending(0) => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n        let _ = shell::glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.xbox);\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_go(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, sprint: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.x, self.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.4, 1.4);\\n        if err.abs() < 0.4 {\\n            f.move_dir.y = 1.0;\\n            if sprint && self.stamina > 1.0 {\\n                f.held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_drive(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.axes.x = err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n        f.axes.y = 1.0;\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_aim(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, ty: f32, fire: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let dx = tx - self.x;\\n        let dz = tz - self.z;\\n        let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.2);\\n        let desired = dx.atan2(-dz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let perr = ((ty - self.eye) / dist).atan() - self.pitch;\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.5, 1.5);\\n        f.look.y = perr.clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n        if fire && err.abs() < 0.2 && perr.abs() < 0.2 {\\n            f.held |= buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            f.pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn start_playing(&mut self) {\\n        self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::place(\\\"Airstrip\\\");\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n        self.yaw = 0.0;\\n        self.eye = 1.58;\\n        self.idle = 0.0;\\n        self.pitch = 0.08;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn simulate(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        self.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.yaw + input.look.x);\\n        self.pitch = (self.pitch + input.look.y).clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.roll = (self.minutes * 2.0).sin() * 0.05 * self.tune.fever_severity;\\n        } else {\\n            self.roll *= 0.9;\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::CRAWL) {\\n            self.stance = 2;\\n        } else if input.down(buttons::CROUCH) {\\n            self.stance = 1;\\n        } else if !self.treating {\\n            self.stance = 0;\\n        }\\n        let target_eye = match self.stance {\\n            2 => 0.42,\\n            1 => 1.02,\\n            _ => 1.58,\\n        };\\n        let k = 1.0 - (-dt / 0.12).exp();\\n        self.eye += (target_eye - self.eye) * k;\\n\\n        if input.down(buttons::MAP) {\\n            self.map_t += dt;\\n            if self.map_t > 0.35 {\\n                self.mark(\\\"map_raised\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\") && (input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || input.act == 1) && self.waypoint.is_none() {\\n            self.waypoint = Some((0.0, 460.0));\\n            self.mark(\\\"waypoint_set\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::MONOCULAR) {\\n            self.mono_t += dt;\\n            if self.mono_t > 0.5 && self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < 80.0) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"monocular_tag\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n\\n        self.move_body(input, dt);\\n        self.use_vehicle(input, dt);\\n        self.handle_items(input, dt);\\n        self.handle_gun(input, dt);\\n        self.update_bodies(dt);\\n        self.update_fever(dt);\\n        self.update_rescue(dt);\\n        let rain = self.weather == 1;\\n        let wind = self.wind * self.tune.wind_strength;\\n        let out = self.fire.tick(dt, wind, self.tune.fire_spread, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes, rain, &mut self.rng);\\n        if out > 0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\");\\n            self.weather = 0;\\n        }\\n        if self.fire.burned >= 500 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cells_500\\\");\\n        }\\n        self.special_actions(input, dt);\\n        if self.hp > 20.0 && self.hp < 100.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 && !self.dev.god {\\n            self.hp = (self.hp + 8.0 * dt).min(100.0);\\n        }\\n        if self.dev.god {\\n            self.hp = 100.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn move_body(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.ride.seat != 0 || self.rescue_t > 0.0 || self.treating {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let fwd = Vec2::new(sy, -cy);\\n        let right = Vec2::new(cy, sy);\\n        let wish = right * input.move_dir.x + fwd * input.move_dir.y;\\n        let sprint = input.down(buttons::FOCUS) && self.stamina > 0.0 && self.stance == 0;\\n        let mut speed = if input.down(buttons::SECONDARY) { 3.0 } else { 4.6 };\\n        if sprint {\\n            speed = 7.0;\\n            self.stamina = (self.stamina - dt).max(0.0);\\n        } else if !input.down(buttons::FOCUS) {\\n            self.stamina = (self.stamina + dt * 2.0).min(12.0);\\n        }\\n        speed *= match self.stance {\\n            1 => 0.55,\\n            2 => 0.28,\\n            _ => 1.0,\\n        };\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            speed *= 0.75;\\n        }\\n        speed *= self.tune.player_speed;\\n        let diff = match self.difficulty {\\n            0 => 1.05,\\n            2 => 0.95,\\n            _ => 1.0,\\n        };\\n        speed *= diff;\\n        if wish.length_squared() > 1e-6 {\\n            let n = wish.normalize();\\n            self.x += n.x * speed * dt;\\n            self.z += n.y * speed * dt;\\n        }\\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.x, self.z);\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn use_vehicle(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if input.just(buttons::USE) && self.ride.kind != 0 {\\n            self.ride.seat = (self.ride.seat + 1) % 3;\\n            if self.ride.seat == 2 {\\n                // gunner\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n            if self.ride.kind != 0 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.ride.x, self.ride.z) < 5.0 && input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n                self.ride.repair += dt;\\n                if self.ride.repair >= 6.0 && self.ride.health < 70.0 {\\n                    self.ride.health = 70.0;\\n                    self.ride.stage = 1;\\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n                    self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"repair_done\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let steer = input.axes.x;\\n        self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + steer * dt * 1.6);\\n        let mut max_s = 16.0 * self.tune.vehicle_speed;\\n        if self.ride.stage == 2 {\\n            max_s *= 0.6;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage >= 3 {\\n            max_s *= 0.2;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && !geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            max_s = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        let throttle = input.axes.y;\\n        self.ride.speed += (throttle.clamp(-0.4, 1.0) * max_s - self.ride.speed) * (dt * 2.5).min(1.0);\\n        let (sy, cy) = self.ride.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let before = (self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x += sy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        self.ride.z += -cy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x = x;\\n        self.ride.z = z;\\n        self.ride.dist += geom::dist(before.0, before.1, self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h = geom::height(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h2 = geom::height(self.ride.x + sy * 2.0, self.ride.z - cy * 2.0);\\n        self.ride.pitch = (h2 - h).atan();\\n        if self.ride.roll.abs() > 0.02 {\\n            self.ride.roll *= (1.0 - dt * 3.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        }\\n        self.x = self.ride.x;\\n        self.z = self.ride.z;\\n        if self.ride.kind == 1 && self.ride.dist > 20.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"technical_driven\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && self.ride.dist > 15.0 && geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"boat_driven\\\");\\n            self.boat_dist = self.ride.dist;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.seat == 2 && input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"mounted_gun\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage == 3 {\\n            self.ride.fuse -= dt;\\n            if self.ride.fuse <= 0.0 {\\n                self.ride.stage = 4;\\n                self.ride.health = 0.0;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.npc {\\n            let points = [(0.0, 800.0), (0.0, 400.0), (0.0, 0.0), (0.0, -400.0)];\\n            let target = points[self.ride.npc_i % points.len()];\\n            if geom::dist(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1) < 8.0 {\\n                self.ride.npc_i += 1;\\n            }\\n            let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1);\\n            let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n            self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0) * dt * 2.0);\\n            self.ride.speed = 10.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn hurt_vehicle(&mut self, dmg: f32) {\\n        if self.ride.kind == 0 || self.ride.stage == 4 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.ride.health -= dmg / self.tune.vehicle_tough.max(0.2);\\n        if self.ride.health > 70.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 0;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 40.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 1;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 15.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 2;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 0.0 {\\n            if self.ride.stage < 3 {\\n                self.ride.fuse = 8.0;\\n            }\\n            self.ride.stage = 3;\\n        } else {\\n            self.ride.stage = 4;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn handle_items(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if input.just(buttons::HEAL) && self.hp >= 20.0 && self.hp < 100.0 && self.syrettes > 0 && self.syrette_t <= 0.0 {\\n            self.syrettes -= 1;\\n            self.syrette_t = 1.5;\\n        }\\n        if self.syrette_t > 0.0 {\\n            let step = dt.min(self.syrette_t);\\n            self.hp = (self.hp + self.tune.syrette_heal / 1.5 * step).min(100.0);\\n            self.syrette_t -= step;\\n            if self.syrette_t <= 0.0 {\\n                self.syrette_t = 0.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"syrette\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.hp < 20.0 && self.hp > 0.0 && input.down(buttons::HEAL) {\\n            self.treating = true;\\n            self.heal_t += dt;\\n            if self.heal_t >= 4.0 {\\n                self.hp = 40.0;\\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n                self.treating = false;\\n                self.mark(wound_flag(self.wound.max(1)));\\n                self.wound = 0;\\n            }\\n        } else if self.hp >= 20.0 {\\n            self.treating = false;\\n            self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if self.fever_state > 0 && input.down(buttons::PILLS) && self.pills > 0 {\\n            self.pill_t += dt;\\n            if self.pill_t >= 2.5 {\\n                self.pills -= 1;\\n                self.pill_t = 0.0;\\n                self.fever_state = 0;\\n                self.fever_t = 0.0;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"pill_taken\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.pill_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn handle_gun(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.guns.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        {\\n            let g = self.gun_mut();\\n            if input.just(buttons::RELOAD) {\\n                g.tap_reload();\\n            }\\n            g.tick_clear(dt);\\n            if self.dev.infinite {\\n                g.ammo = g.ammo.max(30);\\n            }\\n            if self.dev.no_jams {\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.force_jam = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.gun().jammed {\\n            self.jam_seen = true;\\n        } else if self.jam_seen {\\n            self.mark(\\\"jam_cleared\\\");\\n        }\\n        let holster = self.ceasefire && geom::in_town(self.x, self.z);\\n        let want = input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) && !self.treating && !holster && self.rescue_t <= 0.0;\\n        if !want {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let ads = input.down(buttons::SECONDARY);\\n        let pull = {\\n            let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\\n            let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\\n            let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\\n            let g = self.gun_mut();\\n            g.pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br)\\n        };\\n        if pull != Pull::Fired && pull != Pull::Broke {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.resolve_shot(ads);\\n        if pull == Pull::Broke {\\n            self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn resolve_shot(&mut self, ads: bool) {\\n        let st = gun::stats(self.gun().id);\\n        let spread = 0.02 * gun::spread_mul(self.gun().condition) * if ads { 0.25 } else { 1.0 };\\n        let jitter = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * spread;\\n        let yaw = self.yaw + jitter;\\n        let pitch = self.pitch + jitter * 0.5;\\n        let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n        let dir = (sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n        let origin = (self.x, self.eye, self.z);\\n        self.shots_tick(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn shots_tick(&mut self, origin: (f32, f32, f32), dir: (f32, f32, f32), damage: f32, range: f32, noise: f32, ignites: bool, silent: bool, id: WeaponId, shot_n: u32) {\\n        let mut best_t = range;\\n        let mut best_zone = 0u8;\\n        let mut best_i: Option<usize> = None;\\n        let mut blocked = false;\\n        for w in &self.walls {\\n            if let Some(t) = ray_aabb(origin, dir, w.min, w.max) {\\n                if t < best_t {\\n                    best_t = t;\\n                    blocked = true;\\n                    best_i = None;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if !blocked {\\n            for (i, b) in self.bodies.iter().enumerate() {\\n                if !b.alive {\\n                    continue;\\n                }\\n                let zones = [(1.70, 0.18, 3u8), (1.15, 0.28, 1u8), (0.45, 0.20, 2u8)];\\n                for (y, r, zone) in zones {\\n                    if let Some(t) = ray_sphere(origin, dir, (b.x, y, b.z), r) {\\n                        if t < best_t {\\n                            best_t = t;\\n                            best_zone = zone;\\n                            best_i = Some(i);\\n                            blocked = false;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let hit_x = origin.0 + dir.0 * best_t;\\n        let hit_z = origin.2 + dir.2 * best_t;\\n        if let Some(i) = best_i {\\n            let mul = match best_zone {\\n                3 => 3.0,\\n                2 => 0.6,\\n                _ => 1.0,\\n            };\\n            let dmg = damage * mul;\\n            let kind = self.bodies[i].kind;\\n            let in_town = geom::in_town(self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n            if self.ceasefire && in_town && kind == 2 {\\n                // Civilians are safe while the ceasefire holds.\\n            } else if id == WeaponId::Dart {\\n                self.bodies[i].poison = 3.0;\\n            } else {\\n                self.bodies[i].hp -= dmg;\\n                if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n                    if kind == 1 && self.stance == 1 && silent {\\n                        self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if ignites || id == WeaponId::Flare || id == WeaponId::Rpg || id == WeaponId::Flamer || id == WeaponId::Mortar || id == WeaponId::Molotov || id == WeaponId::Frag {\\n            let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n        }\\n        // Tracers: every third round, a quarter of them light dry grass.\\n        if shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 && self.rng.f32() < 0.25 {\\n            if self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_tracer\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if !silent {\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.alert == 0 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < noise {\\n                    b.alert = 1;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let _ = noise;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_bodies(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        let px = self.x;\\n        let pz = self.z;\\n        let stance = self.stance;\\n        let night = self.hour() < 5.0 || self.hour() > 20.0;\\n        let light = if night { 0.45 } else { 1.0 };\\n        let n = self.bodies.len();\\n        for i in 0..n {\\n            if !self.bodies[i].alive {\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].poison > 0.0 {\\n                self.bodies[i].poison -= dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].poison <= 0.0 && self.bodies[i].hp > 0.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].hp = 0.0;\\n                    self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"dart_kill\\\");\\n                    continue;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 3 {\\n                let d0 = geom::dist(px, pz, self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n                if d0 < 40.0 && self.guns.first().map(|g| g.shots > 0).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                    let dx = self.bodies[i].x - px;\\n                    let dz = self.bodies[i].z - pz;\\n                    let len = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.1);\\n                    self.bodies[i].x += dx / len * 6.0 * dt;\\n                    self.bodies[i].z += dz / len * 6.0 * dt;\\n                    self.bodies[i].flee += 6.0 * dt;\\n                    if self.bodies[i].flee > 8.0 {\\n                        self.mark(\\\"animals_fled\\\");\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 5 || self.bodies[i].kind == 6 {\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            let crouched = stance == 1;\\n            let grass = grass_factor(px, pz, crouched);\\n            let posture = match stance {\\n                2 => 0.3,\\n                1 => 0.6,\\n                _ => 1.0,\\n            };\\n            let motion = 0.5;\\n            let rate = exposure(posture, grass, light, motion) * self.tune.detection;\\n            let dist = geom::dist(px, pz, self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z).max(1.0);\\n            let falloff = (30.0 / dist).clamp(0.0, 1.5);\\n            if !self.dev.invisible && self.bodies[i].alert < 2 {\\n                self.bodies[i].see += rate * falloff * dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].see > 1.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].alert = 2;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            // Fire under an enemy makes them run.\\n            let (cx, cz) = (self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n            let cell = geom::cell_of(cx, cz);\\n            if self.fire.cells.get(&cell).map(|c| c.burning).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                self.bodies[i].alert = 4;\\n                self.bodies[i].x += 4.0 * dt;\\n                self.bodies[i].flee += 4.0 * dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].flee > 3.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 1 && self.bodies[i].alert >= 1 && !self.bodies[i].gun.jammed {\\n                let gpull = {\\n                    let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\\n                    let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\\n                    let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\\n                    self.bodies[i].gun.pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br)\\n                };\\n                if gpull == Pull::Jammed {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"enemy_jam\\\");\\n                }\\n                if gpull == Pull::Fired && self.rng.f32() < self.tune.enemy_accuracy * 0.15 {\\n                    let diff = match self.difficulty {\\n                        0 => 0.7,\\n                        2 => 1.3,\\n                        _ => 1.0,\\n                    };\\n                    if !self.dev.god && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n                        self.hp -= self.tune.enemy_damage * 0.15 * diff * dt.max(0.05) * 10.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            self.bodies[i].gun.tick_clear(dt);\\n            if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\\n                self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_fever(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.dev.no_fever {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.fever_state == 0 {\\n            self.fever_t += dt;\\n            if self.fever_t >= self.tune.fever_interval {\\n                self.fever_state = 1;\\n                self.fever_warn = 0.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"fever_warned\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else if self.fever_state == 1 {\\n            self.fever_warn += dt;\\n            if self.fever_warn >= 40.0 {\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        } else if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.fever_attack += dt;\\n            if self.fever_attack >= 60.0 && self.pills == 0 {\\n                self.blackout();\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blackout(&mut self) {\\n        let (sx, sz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n        self.x = sx;\\n        self.z = sz;\\n        self.hp = 50.0;\\n        self.diamonds = (self.diamonds as f32 * 0.8).floor() as u32;\\n        self.fever_state = 0;\\n        self.fever_t = 0.0;\\n        self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n        self.minutes += 6.0 * 60.0;\\n        self.mark(\\\"blackout\\\");\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_rescue(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.hp <= 0.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n            if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive && !c.rescue_spent && !c.down) {\\n                c.rescue_spent = true;\\n                self.rescue_t = 3.0;\\n                self.hp = 1.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.rescue_t > 0.0 {\\n            self.rescue_t -= dt;\\n            let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n            self.x -= sy * dt * 4.0;\\n            self.z -= -cy * dt * 4.0;\\n            if self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                self.hp = 50.0;\\n                self.slot = 0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"player_rescued\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn special_actions(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        let near_cache = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1);\\n        if near_cache < 4.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cache_tracker\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            self.hold_t += dt;\\n        } else {\\n            self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || (input.down(buttons::INTERACT) && self.hold_t > 0.4) {\\n            self.try_interact();\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::MELEE) {\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 1 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < 2.2 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n                    b.alive = false;\\n                    if self.stance == 1 {\\n                        self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        // Companion down timer.\\n        for c in &mut self.companions {\\n            if c.down && c.alive {\\n                c.down_t += dt;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && c.down_t > 45.0) {\\n            c.alive = false;\\n            c.down = false;\\n            self.mark(\\\"companion_died\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, c.x, c.z) < 3.0) {\\n                if self.hold_t > 3.0 && self.syrettes > 0 && !c.doomed_enough() {\\n                    // patched below after the borrow... \\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.patch_or_dose();\\n        // Scripted igniters that are not shots.\\n        if self.step_ready {\\n            if let Some(spec) = self.current() {\\n                self.script_ignite(spec, input);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn patch_or_dose(&mut self) {\\n        if self.hold_t < 3.0 || self.syrettes == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let doomed = matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Overdose));\\n        if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, c.x, c.z) < 4.0) {\\n            if doomed {\\n                c.alive = false;\\n                c.down = false;\\n                self.syrettes -= 1;\\n                self.mark(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\");\\n            } else {\\n                c.down = false;\\n                c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                self.syrettes -= 1;\\n                self.mark(\\\"companion_patched\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\\n        let x = self.x + 2.0;\\n        let z = self.z + 2.0;\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Ignite(0) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_flare\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(1) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_rocket\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(2) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x + 1.0, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_flamer\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(3) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z + 4.0, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_mortar\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(4) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_molotov\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(5) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x + 3.0, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_frag\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(6) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 5.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_barrel\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(7) => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\");\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 5.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(8) => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_person\\\");\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(9) => {\\n                self.weather = 2;\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x + 6.0, z - 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_lightning\\\");\\n                }\\n                self.weather = 0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(11) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_cigarette\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks => {\\n                self.blow_tanks();\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(0) => {\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"ending_burn\\\");\\n                self.finished = true;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                self.hold_t += 0.0;\\n                // hold_t is fed by interact. Use step_t instead.\\n                if self.step_t >= 180.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ending_read\\\");\\n                    self.finished = true;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(2) => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ending_chair\\\");\\n                self.finished = true;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => {\\n                let stop = geom::place(\\\"Junction\\\");\\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, stop.0, stop.1) < 14.0 && self.diamonds >= 1 {\\n                    self.diamonds -= 1;\\n                    self.x = x;\\n                    self.z = z;\\n                    self.ride.seat = 0;\\n                    self.minutes += 20.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"bus_taken\\\");\\n                    self.mark(\\\"diamonds_spent\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n        // Tracer step: spray the ground in front.\\n        if matches!(spec, Spec::Ignite(10)) {\\n            self.pitch = -0.25;\\n            for _ in 0..4 {\\n                if self.gun().ammo == 0 {\\n                    self.gun_mut().ammo = 30;\\n                }\\n                let pull = {\\n                    let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                    g.condition = 90.0;\\n                    g.pull(&mut self.rng, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\\n                };\\n                if pull == Pull::Fired || pull == Pull::Broke {\\n                    self.resolve_shot(true);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn try_interact(&mut self) {\\n        if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, 170.0, 470.0) < 16.0 || geom::dist(self.x, self.z, -260.0, -700.0) < 16.0 || geom::dist(self.x, self.z, 830.0, 255.0) < 16.0\\n        {\\n            if self.hold_t > 0.3 && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Claim)) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\");\\n                self.hp = 100.0;\\n            }\\n            if self.hold_t > 0.8 && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Sleep { .. })) {\\n                let hours = match self.current() {\\n                    Some(Spec::Sleep { hours }) => hours,\\n                    _ => 8.0,\\n                };\\n                self.minutes += hours * 60.0;\\n                self.hp = 100.0;\\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\\n                }\\n                self.yaw = std::f32::consts::PI;\\n                self.looking_at_post = false;\\n                self.mark(\\\"sleep_used\\\");\\n                if hours >= 24.0 && self.post_clear {\\n                    self.post_clear = false;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"post_remanned\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Shop)) {\\n            let price = 8u32;\\n            if self.diamonds >= price {\\n                self.diamonds -= price;\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Battle));\\n                self.mark(\\\"weapon_bought\\\");\\n                self.mark(\\\"diamonds_spent\\\");\\n                self.infamy += 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Locker)) && self.guns.len() > 1 {\\n            self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            self.mark(\\\"locker_used\\\");\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Loot)) && !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar) {\\n            let mut g = Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar);\\n            g.condition = 40.0;\\n            self.guns.push(g);\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Tape)) && self.hold_t > 1.5 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"tape_played\\\");\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ceasefire)) {\\n            self.ceasefire = false;\\n            self.mark(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn try_buy(&mut self) -> bool {\\n        if self.diamonds < 8 {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        self.diamonds -= 8;\\n        self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Battle));\\n        self.mark(\\\"weapon_bought\\\");\\n        self.mark(\\\"diamonds_spent\\\");\\n        true\\n    }\\n\\n    fn maybe_reman(&mut self) {\\n        if !self.post_clear {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let (px, pz) = geom::place(\\\"Kilo 38\\\");\\n        let to_x = px - self.x;\\n        let to_z = pz - self.z;\\n        let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let fwd = (sy, -cy);\\n        let len = (to_x * to_x + to_z * to_z).sqrt().max(0.1);\\n        let dot = (fwd.0 * to_x + fwd.1 * to_z) / len;\\n        let dist = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, px, pz);\\n        self.looking_at_post = dot > 0.4 && dist < 180.0;\\n        if self.minutes >= self.post_reman_at && !self.looking_at_post {\\n            self.post_clear = false;\\n            self.mark(\\\"post_remanned\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn clear_bodies(&mut self) {\\n        self.bodies.clear();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_soldier(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32, hp: f32, jammy: bool) {\\n        let mut g = Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar);\\n        if jammy {\\n            g.condition = 5.0;\\n            g.wear = 0.0;\\n            g.ammo = 400;\\n            g.reserve = 400;\\n        }\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 1,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: if jammy { 2 } else { 0 },\\n            gun: g,\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_animal(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 3,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp: 20.0,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: 0,\\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_truck(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 6,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp: 80.0,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: 0,\\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_tank_farm(&mut self) {\\n        self.clear_bodies();\\n        for i in 0..7 {\\n            for j in 0..7 {\\n                self.bodies.push(Body {\\n                    kind: 5,\\n                    x: self.x + i as f32 * 10.0,\\n                    z: self.z + j as f32 * 10.0 - 20.0,\\n                    yaw: 0.0,\\n                    hp: 20.0,\\n                    alive: true,\\n                    alert: 0,\\n                    gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n                    see: 0.0,\\n                    poison: 0.0,\\n                    burn: 0.0,\\n                    doomed: false,\\n                    flee: 0.0,\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blow_tanks(&mut self) {\\n        if self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.kind == 5 && b.alive) {\\n            let positions: Vec<(f32, f32)> = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 5).map(|b| (b.x, b.z)).collect();\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.kind == 5 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n                    b.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            for (x, z) in positions {\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            self.mark(\\\"explosion_chain\\\");\\n            self.mark(\\\"ignite_barrel\\\");\\n            if self.fire.burned >= 500 {\\n                self.mark(\\\"cells_500\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn hour(&self) -> f32 {\\n        (self.minutes / 60.0) % 24.0\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn tracker_rate(&self) -> f32 {\\n        let d = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1).max(1.0);\\n        if d > 60.0 { 0.0 } else { 8.0 / d }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn save_json(&self) -> String {\\n        serde_json::to_string(self).unwrap_or_else(|_| \\\"{}\\\".into())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn load_json(text: &str) -> Result<Self, String> {\\n        serde_json::from_str(text).map_err(|e| e.to_string())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn write_save(&mut self) {\\n        if self.hub {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.save_blob = String::new();\\n        let blob = self.save_json();\\n        self.save_blob = blob;\\n        self.has_save = true;\\n        self.saves_written += 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn fingerprint(&self) -> u64 {\\n        let s = serde_json::to_string(self).unwrap_or_default();\\n        let mut h = 0xcbf29ce484222325u64;\\n        for b in s.as_bytes() {\\n            h ^= *b as u64;\\n            h = h.wrapping_mul(0x100000001b3);\\n        }\\n        h\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn eye_pos(&self) -> (f32, f32, f32) {\\n        let h = geom::height(self.x, self.z);\\n        (self.x, h + self.eye, self.z)\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn status(&self) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let (ex, ey, ez) = self.eye_pos();\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"title\\\": \\\"Jam Cry\\\",\\n            \\\"screen\\\": format!(\\\"{:?}\\\", self.screen),\\n            \\\"goal\\\": self.goal_name(),\\n            \\\"x\\\": self.x,\\n            \\\"z\\\": self.z,\\n            \\\"yaw\\\": self.yaw,\\n            \\\"pitch\\\": self.pitch,\\n            \\\"roll\\\": self.roll,\\n            \\\"eye\\\": [ex, ey, ez],\\n            \\\"fov\\\": if self.mono_t > 0.0 { 15.0 } else if false { 55.0 } else { 75.0 },\\n            \\\"health\\\": self.hp,\\n            \\\"stance\\\": self.stance,\\n            \\\"diamonds\\\": self.diamonds,\\n            \\\"finished\\\": self.finished,\\n            \\\"coverage\\\": self.flags.iter().cloned().collect::<Vec<_>>(),\\n            \\\"audio\\\": { \\\"music\\\": self.music },\\n            \\\"dev\\\": { \\\"god\\\": self.dev.god, \\\"open\\\": self.screen == Screen::Dev },\\n            \\\"tune\\\": { \\\"fire_spread\\\": self.tune.fire_spread },\\n            \\\"wind\\\": self.wind.length(),\\n            \\\"hour\\\": self.hour(),\\n            \\\"vehicle\\\": { \\\"kind\\\": self.ride.kind, \\\"stage\\\": self.ride.stage, \\\"health\\\": self.ride.health, \\\"roll\\\": self.ride.roll, \\\"pitch\\\": self.ride.pitch },\\n            \\\"tracker\\\": self.tracker_rate(),\\n            \\\"attract\\\": self.attract_loops,\\n            \\\"saves\\\": self.saves_written,\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn ui_value(&self) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"screen\\\": format!(\\\"{:?}\\\", self.screen),\\n            \\\"rows\\\": self.rows(),\\n            \\\"focus\\\": self.focus,\\n            \\\"label\\\": self.rows().get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default(),\\n            \\\"notice\\\": self.notice(),\\n            \\\"touch_controls\\\": false,\\n            \\\"glyph\\\": shell::glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.xbox),\\n            \\\"xbox\\\": self.xbox,\\n            \\\"device\\\": format!(\\\"{:?}\\\", self.device),\\n            \\\"about\\\": about_pages(),\\n        })\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn wound_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match n {\\n        1 => \\\"wound_gunshot\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"wound_shrapnel\\\",\\n        3 => \\\"wound_burn\\\",\\n        4 => \\\"wound_fall\\\",\\n        5 => \\\"wound_tourniquet\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"wound_graze\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ignite_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match n {\\n        0 => \\\"ignite_flare\\\",\\n        1 => \\\"ignite_rocket\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"ignite_flamer\\\",\\n        3 => \\\"ignite_mortar\\\",\\n        4 => \\\"ignite_molotov\\\",\\n        5 => \\\"ignite_frag\\\",\\n        6 => \\\"ignite_barrel\\\",\\n        7 => \\\"ignite_vehicle\\\",\\n        8 => \\\"ignite_person\\\",\\n        9 => \\\"ignite_lightning\\\",\\n        10 => \\\"ignite_tracer\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"ignite_cigarette\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ending_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match n {\\n        1 => \\\"ending_read\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"ending_chair\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"ending_burn\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\ntrait Doomed {\\n    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool;\\n}\\nimpl Doomed for Companion {\\n    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool {\\n        false\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ray_sphere(o: (f32, f32, f32), d: (f32, f32, f32), c: (f32, f32, f32), r: f32) -> Option<f32> {\\n    let lx = c.0 - o.0;\\n    let ly = c.1 - o.1;\\n    let lz = c.2 - o.2;\\n    let b = lx * d.0 + ly * d.1 + lz * d.2;\\n    let cc = lx * lx + ly * ly + lz * lz - r * r;\\n    let disc = b * b - cc;\\n    if disc < 0.0 {\\n        return None;\\n    }\\n    let t = b - disc.sqrt();\\n    (t > 0.05).then_some(t)\\n}\\n\\nfn ray_aabb(o: (f32, f32, f32), d: (f32, f32, f32), min: [f32; 3], max: [f32; 3]) -> Option<f32> {\\n    let mut t0 = 0.0f32;\\n    let mut t1 = 1.0e6f32;\\n    let origins = [o.0, o.1, o.2];\\n    let dirs = [d.0, d.1, d.2];\\n    for i in 0..3 {\\n        if dirs[i].abs() < 1e-8 {\\n            if origins[i] < min[i] || origins[i] > max[i] {\\n                return None;\\n            }\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let inv = 1.0 / dirs[i];\\n        let mut ta = (min[i] - origins[i]) * inv;\\n        let mut tb = (max[i] - origins[i]) * inv;\\n        if ta > tb {\\n            std::mem::swap(&mut ta, &mut tb);\\n        }\\n        t0 = t0.max(ta);\\n        t1 = t1.min(tb);\\n        if t0 > t1 {\\n            return None;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (t0 > 0.05).then_some(t0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn about_pages() -> Vec<String> {\\n    vec![\\n        \\\"Jam Cry. Everything rusts. The grass burns anyway.\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"You are a contract mercenary in the Republic of Kwelara, in the last dry season of a civil war. Colonel Emile Tshala's Council and Comrade Josephine Ruvuma's People's Hand both buy from the same dealer. Find the Chandler.\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Source: Far Cry 2\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Date: 2026-11-05 01:35:03. Environment: Grok CLI (headless); Linux. Model: xAI grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh. Usage: added on import. Plan: PLAN.md.\\\".into(),\\n    ]\\n}\\n\\npub fn fiction_lines() -> Vec<String> {\\n    let mut lines = vec![\\n        \\\"Jam Cry\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Everything rusts. The grass burns anyway.\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Republic of Kwelara\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Ada Okoro\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Emile Tshala\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Josephine Ruvuma\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"The Chandler\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Thandiwe Moyo\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Papa Lazare\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Mr. Desai\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Sister Perpetua\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Bakker\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Kilometre 40\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"New contract\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Press any button\\\".into(),\\n    ];\\n    lines.extend(about_pages());\\n    for p in geom::PLACES {\\n        lines.push(p.name.into());\\n    }\\n    lines\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Jam Cry simulation. One seeded `World::tick` drives movement, guns, fire, fever and the job.\\n\\nuse std::collections::BTreeSet;\\nuse std::sync::OnceLock;\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\nuse super::fire::FireMap;\\nuse super::geom::{self, exposure, grass_factor};\\nuse super::gun::{self, Gun, Pull, WeaponId};\\nuse super::shell::{self, Device};\\nuse crate::input::buttons;\\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum Route {\\n    Human,\\n    Burn,\\n    Read,\\n    Chair,\\n    Sandbox,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum Screen {\\n    Title,\\n    Difficulty,\\n    Merc,\\n    Prologue,\\n    Playing,\\n    Pause,\\n    Settings,\\n    About,\\n    Dev,\\n    Mp,\\n    Attract,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Tune {\\n    pub enemy_accuracy: f32,\\n    pub enemy_damage: f32,\\n    pub player_damage: f32,\\n    pub detection: f32,\\n    pub enemy_count: f32,\\n    pub weapon_wear: f32,\\n    pub jam_chance: f32,\\n    pub break_threshold: f32,\\n    pub fire_spread: f32,\\n    pub burn_time: f32,\\n    pub wind_strength: f32,\\n    pub burn_damage: f32,\\n    pub fever_interval: f32,\\n    pub fever_severity: f32,\\n    pub syrette_heal: f32,\\n    pub rescue_window: f32,\\n    pub vehicle_speed: f32,\\n    pub vehicle_tough: f32,\\n    pub contract_pay: f32,\\n    pub post_reman_hours: f32,\\n    pub player_speed: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Tune {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            enemy_accuracy: 0.35,\\n            enemy_damage: 8.0,\\n            player_damage: 1.0,\\n            detection: 1.0,\\n            enemy_count: 1.0,\\n            weapon_wear: 1.0,\\n            jam_chance: 1.0,\\n            break_threshold: 8.0,\\n            fire_spread: 0.9,\\n            burn_time: 10.0,\\n            wind_strength: 1.0,\\n            burn_damage: 20.0,\\n            fever_interval: 15.0 * 60.0,\\n            fever_severity: 1.0,\\n            syrette_heal: 60.0,\\n            rescue_window: 6.0,\\n            vehicle_speed: 1.0,\\n            vehicle_tough: 1.0,\\n            contract_pay: 1.0,\\n            post_reman_hours: 24.0,\\n            player_speed: 1.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Tune {\\n    pub fn count(&self) -> usize {\\n        21\\n    }\\n    pub fn name(&self, i: usize) -> &'static str {\\n        [\\\"Enemy accuracy\\\", \\\"Enemy damage\\\", \\\"Player damage\\\", \\\"Detection\\\", \\\"Enemy count\\\", \\\"Weapon wear\\\", \\\"Jam chance\\\", \\\"Break threshold\\\", \\\"Fire spread\\\", \\\"Burn time\\\", \\\"Wind strength\\\", \\\"Burn damage\\\", \\\"Fever interval\\\", \\\"Fever severity\\\", \\\"Syrette heal\\\", \\\"Rescue window\\\", \\\"Vehicle speed\\\", \\\"Vehicle toughness\\\", \\\"Contract pay\\\", \\\"Post reman hours\\\", \\\"Player speed\\\"]\\n            .get(i)\\n            .copied()\\n            .unwrap_or(\\\"Value\\\")\\n    }\\n    pub fn get(&self, i: usize) -> f32 {\\n        let v = [\\n            self.enemy_accuracy, self.enemy_damage, self.player_damage, self.detection, self.enemy_count, self.weapon_wear, self.jam_chance,\\n            self.break_threshold, self.fire_spread, self.burn_time, self.wind_strength, self.burn_damage, self.fever_interval, self.fever_severity,\\n            self.syrette_heal, self.rescue_window, self.vehicle_speed, self.vehicle_tough, self.contract_pay, self.post_reman_hours, self.player_speed,\\n        ];\\n        v.get(i).copied().unwrap_or(0.0)\\n    }\\n    pub fn set(&mut self, i: usize, v: f32) {\\n        let p = match i {\\n            0 => &mut self.enemy_accuracy,\\n            1 => &mut self.enemy_damage,\\n            2 => &mut self.player_damage,\\n            3 => &mut self.detection,\\n            4 => &mut self.enemy_count,\\n            5 => &mut self.weapon_wear,\\n            6 => &mut self.jam_chance,\\n            7 => &mut self.break_threshold,\\n            8 => &mut self.fire_spread,\\n            9 => &mut self.burn_time,\\n            10 => &mut self.wind_strength,\\n            11 => &mut self.burn_damage,\\n            12 => &mut self.fever_interval,\\n            13 => &mut self.fever_severity,\\n            14 => &mut self.syrette_heal,\\n            15 => &mut self.rescue_window,\\n            16 => &mut self.vehicle_speed,\\n            17 => &mut self.vehicle_tough,\\n            18 => &mut self.contract_pay,\\n            19 => &mut self.post_reman_hours,\\n            _ => &mut self.player_speed,\\n        };\\n        *p = v;\\n    }\\n    pub fn range(&self, i: usize) -> (f32, f32, f32) {\\n        match i {\\n            0 | 3 | 5 | 6 | 10 | 13 | 16 | 17 | 18 | 20 => (0.0, 3.0, 0.05),\\n            7 => (1.0, 40.0, 1.0),\\n            8 => (0.05, 3.0, 0.05),\\n            9 | 15 => (0.5, 30.0, 0.5),\\n            12 => (30.0, 2000.0, 10.0),\\n            19 => (1.0, 72.0, 1.0),\\n            _ => (0.0, 200.0, 1.0),\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Dev {\\n    pub god: bool,\\n    pub infinite: bool,\\n    pub no_jams: bool,\\n    pub no_fever: bool,\\n    pub noclip: bool,\\n    pub invisible: bool,\\n    pub show_ai: bool,\\n    pub show_fire: bool,\\n    pub show_nav: bool,\\n    pub show_stats: bool,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Body {\\n    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub hp: f32,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub alert: u8,\\n    pub gun: Gun,\\n    pub see: f32,\\n    pub poison: f32,\\n    pub burn: f32,\\n    pub doomed: bool,\\n    pub flee: f32,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Wall {\\n    pub min: [f32; 3],\\n    pub max: [f32; 3],\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Companion {\\n    pub name: String,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub down: bool,\\n    pub down_t: f32,\\n    pub rescue_spent: bool,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Ride {\\n    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub seat: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub speed: f32,\\n    pub roll: f32,\\n    pub pitch: f32,\\n    pub health: f32,\\n    pub fuse: f32,\\n    pub repair: f32,\\n    pub stage: u8,\\n    pub dist: f32,\\n    pub npc: bool,\\n    pub npc_i: usize,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Ride {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self { kind: 0, seat: 0, x: 0.0, z: 0.0, yaw: 0.0, speed: 0.0, roll: 0.0, pitch: 0.0, health: 100.0, fuse: 0.0, repair: 0.0, stage: 0, dist: 0.0, npc: false, npc_i: 0 }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\nenum Spec {\\n    Boot,\\n    Map,\\n    Way,\\n    Reach { x: f32, z: f32, gps: bool },\\n    Fever,\\n    Pill,\\n    Blackout,\\n    Fight,\\n    EnemyJam,\\n    Jam,\\n    Break,\\n    Rescue,\\n    Wound(u8),\\n    Loot,\\n    Claim,\\n    Shop,\\n    Locker,\\n    Syrette,\\n    Tracker,\\n    Sleep { hours: f32 },\\n    Drive { x: f32, z: f32 },\\n    Mono,\\n    Ignite(u8),\\n    Tanks,\\n    Mounted,\\n    Panic,\\n    Animals,\\n    Bus { x: f32, z: f32 },\\n    Night,\\n    Boat,\\n    Stealth,\\n    Dart,\\n    Repair,\\n    Rain,\\n    Better,\\n    Patch,\\n    Overdose,\\n    Die,\\n    Tape,\\n    Ceasefire,\\n    Convoy,\\n    Town,\\n    Ending(u8),\\n    Flag(&'static str),\\n}\\n\\nfn script(route: Route) -> &'static [Spec] {\\n    static S: OnceLock<Vec<Vec<Spec>>> = OnceLock::new();\\n    let all = S.get_or_init(|| vec![build_script(Route::Human), build_script(Route::Burn), build_script(Route::Read), build_script(Route::Chair)]);\\n    let i = match route {\\n        Route::Human => 0,\\n        Route::Burn => 1,\\n        Route::Read => 2,\\n        Route::Chair => 3,\\n        Route::Sandbox => return &[],\\n    };\\n    all[i].as_slice()\\n}\\n\\nfn build_script(route: Route) -> Vec<Spec> {\\n    let mut v = vec![\\n        Spec::Boot,\\n        Spec::Map,\\n        Spec::Way,\\n        Spec::Reach { x: 0.0, z: 460.0, gps: true },\\n        Spec::Fever,\\n    ];\\n    if route == Route::Read {\\n        v.push(Spec::Blackout);\\n    } else {\\n        v.push(Spec::Pill);\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_a0\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: -40.0, z: 640.0, gps: false });\\n    v.push(Spec::Fight);\\n    v.push(Spec::EnemyJam);\\n    v.push(Spec::Jam);\\n    v.push(Spec::Break);\\n    v.push(Spec::Rescue);\\n    for w in 1..=6 {\\n        v.push(Spec::Wound(w));\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Loot);\\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: 170.0, z: 470.0, gps: false });\\n    v.push(Spec::Claim);\\n    v.push(Spec::Shop);\\n    v.push(Spec::Locker);\\n    v.push(Spec::Syrette);\\n    v.push(Spec::Tracker);\\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 8.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_a1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -520.0, z: -520.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Mono);\\n    for ig in 0..12 {\\n        v.push(Spec::Ignite(ig));\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Tanks);\\n    v.push(Spec::Mounted);\\n    v.push(Spec::Panic);\\n    v.push(Spec::Animals);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Bus { x: 0.0, z: 380.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -260.0, z: -700.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 26.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Night);\\n    v.push(Spec::Boat);\\n    v.push(Spec::Stealth);\\n    v.push(Spec::Dart);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b2\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Repair);\\n    v.push(Spec::Rain);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b3\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Better);\\n    match route {\\n        Route::Read => v.push(Spec::Overdose),\\n        Route::Chair => v.push(Spec::Die),\\n        _ => v.push(Spec::Patch),\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b4\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Tape);\\n    v.push(Spec::Ceasefire);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Convoy);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c2\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Town);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c3\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -760.0, z: 620.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_d1\\\"));\\n    let end = match route {\\n        Route::Read => 1,\\n        Route::Chair => 2,\\n        _ => 0,\\n    };\\n    v.push(Spec::Ending(end));\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_d2\\\"));\\n    v\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct World {\\n    pub seed: u64,\\n    pub rng: Rng,\\n    pub route: Route,\\n    pub screen: Screen,\\n    pub focus: usize,\\n    pub tab: usize,\\n    pub page: usize,\\n    pub difficulty: u8,\\n    pub merc: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub pitch: f32,\\n    pub roll: f32,\\n    pub eye: f32,\\n    pub stance: u8,\\n    pub stamina: f32,\\n    pub hp: f32,\\n    pub syrettes: u32,\\n    pub pills: u32,\\n    pub diamonds: u32,\\n    pub infamy: i32,\\n    pub guns: Vec<Gun>,\\n    pub slot: usize,\\n    pub syrette_t: f32,\\n    pub heal_t: f32,\\n    pub wound: u8,\\n    pub pill_t: f32,\\n    pub fever_t: f32,\\n    pub fever_state: u8,\\n    pub fever_warn: f32,\\n    pub fever_attack: f32,\\n    pub bodies: Vec<Body>,\\n    pub walls: Vec<Wall>,\\n    pub fire: FireMap,\\n    pub wind: Vec2,\\n    pub weather: u8,\\n    pub minutes: f32,\\n    pub ceasefire: bool,\\n    pub companions: Vec<Companion>,\\n    pub rescue_t: f32,\\n    pub ride: Ride,\\n    pub flags: BTreeSet<String>,\\n    pub step: u16,\\n    pub step_ready: bool,\\n    pub step_t: f32,\\n    pub step_x: f32,\\n    pub step_z: f32,\\n    pub waypoint: Option<(f32, f32)>,\\n    pub map_t: f32,\\n    pub mono_t: f32,\\n    pub post_clear: bool,\\n    pub post_reman_at: f32,\\n    pub looking_at_post: bool,\\n    pub saves_written: u32,\\n    pub save_blob: String,\\n    pub has_save: bool,\\n    pub idle: f32,\\n    pub attract_t: f32,\\n    pub attract_seen: u16,\\n    pub attract_loops: u32,\\n    pub device: Device,\\n    pub device_lock: u8,\\n    pub xbox: bool,\\n    pub tune: Tune,\\n    pub tune0: Tune,\\n    pub dev: Dev,\\n    pub hub: bool,\\n    pub touch_only: bool,\\n    pub music: f32,\\n    pub finished: bool,\\n    pub hold_t: f32,\\n    pub tracker_cache: (f32, f32),\\n    pub treating: bool,\\n    pub jam_seen: bool,\\n    pub boat_dist: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl World {\\n    pub fn fresh(seed: u64) -> Self {\\n        let mut w = Self::blank(seed, Route::Sandbox);\\n        w.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n        w.x = 200.0;\\n        w.z = -200.0;\\n        w.guns = vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol), Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar)];\\n        w.diamonds = 40;\\n        w.syrettes = 3;\\n        w.pills = 3;\\n        w.slot = 0;\\n        w\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn campaign(seed: u64, route: Route) -> Self {\\n        let mut w = Self::blank(seed, route);\\n        w.screen = Screen::Title;\\n        w.guns = vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol)];\\n        w.diamonds = 40;\\n        w.syrettes = 3;\\n        w.pills = 3;\\n        w\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blank(seed: u64, route: Route) -> Self {\\n        let tune = Tune::default();\\n        Self {\\n            seed,\\n            rng: Rng::new(seed),\\n            route,\\n            screen: Screen::Title,\\n            focus: 0,\\n            tab: 0,\\n            page: 0,\\n            difficulty: 1,\\n            merc: 0,\\n            x: 0.0,\\n            z: 0.0,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            pitch: 0.05,\\n            roll: 0.0,\\n            eye: 1.58,\\n            stance: 0,\\n            stamina: 12.0,\\n            hp: 100.0,\\n            syrettes: 3,\\n            pills: 3,\\n            diamonds: 40,\\n            infamy: 0,\\n            guns: vec![Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol)],\\n            slot: 0,\\n            syrette_t: 0.0,\\n            heal_t: 0.0,\\n            wound: 0,\\n            pill_t: 0.0,\\n            fever_t: 0.0,\\n            fever_state: 0,\\n            fever_warn: 0.0,\\n            fever_attack: 0.0,\\n            bodies: Vec::new(),\\n            walls: Vec::new(),\\n            fire: FireMap::default(),\\n            wind: Vec2::new(2.0, 0.5),\\n            weather: 0,\\n            minutes: 12.0 * 60.0,\\n            ceasefire: true,\\n            companions: vec![\\n                Companion { name: \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\\n                Companion { name: \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\\n                Companion { name: \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into(), alive: true, down: false, down_t: 0.0, rescue_spent: false, x: 0.0, z: 0.0 },\\n            ],\\n            rescue_t: 0.0,\\n            ride: Ride::default(),\\n            flags: BTreeSet::new(),\\n            step: 0,\\n            step_ready: false,\\n            step_t: 0.0,\\n            step_x: 0.0,\\n            step_z: 0.0,\\n            waypoint: None,\\n            map_t: 0.0,\\n            mono_t: 0.0,\\n            post_clear: false,\\n            post_reman_at: 1.0e9,\\n            looking_at_post: false,\\n            saves_written: 0,\\n            save_blob: String::new(),\\n            has_save: false,\\n            idle: 0.0,\\n            attract_t: 0.0,\\n            attract_seen: 0,\\n            attract_loops: 0,\\n            device: Device::Gamepad,\\n            device_lock: 0,\\n            xbox: false,\\n            tune0: tune.clone(),\\n            tune,\\n            dev: Dev::default(),\\n            hub: false,\\n            touch_only: false,\\n            music: 0.10,\\n            finished: false,\\n            hold_t: 0.0,\\n            tracker_cache: (90.0, 500.0),\\n            treating: false,\\n            jam_seen: false,\\n            boat_dist: 0.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn mark(&mut self, flag: &str) {\\n        self.flags.insert(flag.to_string());\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn gun(&self) -> &Gun {\\n        &self.guns[self.slot.min(self.guns.len().saturating_sub(1))]\\n    }\\n    pub fn gun_mut(&mut self) -> &mut Gun {\\n        let i = self.slot.min(self.guns.len().saturating_sub(1));\\n        &mut self.guns[i]\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn spawn_dummy(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32, hp: f32) -> usize {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 4,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: 0,\\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n        self.bodies.len() - 1\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn add_wall(&mut self, min: [f32; 3], max: [f32; 3]) {\\n        self.walls.push(Wall { min, max });\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn tick(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        let dt = dt.clamp(0.0, 0.5);\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            self.shell_tick(input, dt);\\n        } else if input.act == 10 && !self.hub {\\n            self.screen = Screen::Pause;\\n            self.focus = 0;\\n            self.idle = 0.0;\\n        } else {\\n            self.simulate(input, dt);\\n        }\\n        if self.route != Route::Sandbox {\\n            self.campaign(dt);\\n        }\\n        if self.wind.length() > 6.0 && self.screen == Screen::Playing {\\n            self.mark(\\\"wind_rag\\\");\\n        }\\n        self.minutes += dt;\\n        self.maybe_reman();\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn bot_input(&self) -> InputFrame {\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            f.act = 1;\\n            f.pressed = buttons::CONFIRM;\\n            return f;\\n        }\\n        let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\\n            return InputFrame::default();\\n        };\\n        self.bot_spec(spec)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn current(&self) -> Option<Spec> {\\n        script(self.route).get(self.step as usize).copied()\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn goal_name(&self) -> String {\\n        if self.finished {\\n            return \\\"done\\\".into();\\n        }\\n        match self.current() {\\n            Some(Spec::Boot) => \\\"boot\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Map) => \\\"map\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Way) => \\\"waypoint\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Reach { .. }) => \\\"reach\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Fever) => \\\"fever\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Pill) => \\\"pill\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Blackout) => \\\"blackout\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Fight) => \\\"fight\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::EnemyJam) => \\\"enemy_jam\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Jam) => \\\"jam\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Break) => \\\"break\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Rescue) => \\\"rescue\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Wound(n)) => return format!(\\\"wound{n}\\\"),\\n            Some(Spec::Loot) => \\\"loot\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Claim) => \\\"claim\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Shop) => \\\"shop\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Locker) => \\\"locker\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Syrette) => \\\"syrette\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Tracker) => \\\"tracker\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) => \\\"sleep\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Drive { .. }) => \\\"drive\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Mono) => \\\"mono\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Ignite(n)) => return format!(\\\"ignite{n}\\\"),\\n            Some(Spec::Tanks) => \\\"tanks\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Mounted) => \\\"mounted\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Panic) => \\\"panic\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Animals) => \\\"animals\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Bus { .. }) => \\\"bus\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Night) => \\\"night\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Boat) => \\\"boat\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Stealth) => \\\"stealth\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Dart) => \\\"dart\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Repair) => \\\"repair\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Rain) => \\\"rain\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Better) => \\\"better\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Patch) => \\\"patch\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Overdose) => \\\"overdose\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Die) => \\\"die\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Tape) => \\\"tape\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Ceasefire) => \\\"ceasefire\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Convoy) => \\\"convoy\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Town) => \\\"town\\\",\\n            Some(Spec::Ending(n)) => return format!(\\\"ending{n}\\\"),\\n            Some(Spec::Flag(s)) => s,\\n            None => \\\"done\\\",\\n        }\\n        .into()\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn goal_budget(&self) -> f32 {\\n        match self.current() {\\n            Some(Spec::Reach { .. }) => 160.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Drive { .. }) => 140.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Boat) => 160.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Bus { .. }) => 90.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Blackout) => 80.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Break) => 90.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Die) => 55.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Ending(1)) => 200.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) => 40.0,\\n            Some(Spec::Fight) | Some(Spec::EnemyJam) => 25.0,\\n            _ => 30.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn campaign(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.finished {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.step_t += dt;\\n        for _ in 0..12 {\\n            let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\\n                self.finished = true;\\n                break;\\n            };\\n            if !self.step_ready {\\n                self.begin(spec);\\n                self.step_ready = true;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if self.done(spec) {\\n                self.step += 1;\\n                self.step_ready = false;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            } else {\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn begin(&mut self, spec: Spec) {\\n        self.step_x = self.x;\\n        self.step_z = self.z;\\n        self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Fever => {\\n                self.fever_t = self.tune.fever_interval;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Blackout => {\\n                self.pills = 0;\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..4 {\\n                    let ang = i as f32 * 0.4;\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + ang.sin() * 12.0, self.z - 12.0, 36.0, false);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 8.0, 80.0, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam => {\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.force_jam = true;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.ammo = 12;\\n                g.condition = 40.0;\\n                self.jam_seen = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Smg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.condition = 5.0;\\n                g.wear = 0.0;\\n                g.ammo = 999;\\n                g.reserve = 999;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.cooldown = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {\\n                self.hp = 0.0;\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\\n                    c.alive = true;\\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\\n                    c.down = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => {\\n                self.hp = 15.0;\\n                self.wound = n;\\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n                self.treating = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Shop => {\\n                if !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Battle) {\\n                    // The shelf is stocked. Buying happens on the interact.\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\\n                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 24.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks => {\\n                self.spawn_tank_farm();\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, 40.0, false);\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_animal(self.x + 6.0, self.z - 6.0);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Night => {\\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"night_contract\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (wx, wz) = geom::nearest_water(self.x, self.z);\\n                self.ride.kind = 2;\\n                self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                self.ride.x = wx;\\n                self.ride.z = wz;\\n                self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n                self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                self.x = wx;\\n                self.z = wz;\\n                self.boat_dist = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 2.0, 40.0, false);\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.last_mut() {\\n                    b.yaw = 0.0;\\n                    b.alert = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.stance = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 18.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Dart));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Repair => {\\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                self.ride.seat = 0;\\n                self.ride.health = 35.0;\\n                self.ride.stage = 2;\\n                self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain => {\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 3.0, self.z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.weather = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose | Spec::Die => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n                    c.down = true;\\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = if matches!(spec, Spec::Die) { self.x + 40.0 } else { self.x + 1.5 };\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Overdose) {\\n                    if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down) {\\n                        c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Sniper));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 30.0, 30.0, false);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Convoy => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_truck(self.x, self.z - 16.0);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Rpg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Town => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Kilometre 40\\\");\\n                self.x = tx;\\n                self.z = tz;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(tx, tz + 20.0, 10.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"town_burned\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..3 {\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 40.0 + i as f32 * 4.0, self.z - 50.0, 30.0, false);\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(4);\\n                self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.mark(s),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn done(&mut self, spec: Spec) -> bool {\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Boot => self.screen == Screen::Playing,\\n            Spec::Map => self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\"),\\n            Spec::Way => self.flags.contains(\\\"waypoint_set\\\"),\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, gps } => {\\n                if gps && self.waypoint.is_some() && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.step_x, self.step_z) > 25.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"gps_followed\\\");\\n                }\\n                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 10.0 && (!gps || self.flags.contains(\\\"gps_followed\\\"))\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fever => self.flags.contains(\\\"fever_warned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Pill => self.flags.contains(\\\"pill_taken\\\"),\\n            Spec::Blackout => self.flags.contains(\\\"blackout\\\"),\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                let clear = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 1).all(|b| !b.alive);\\n                if clear && !self.bodies.is_empty() {\\n                    self.post_clear = true;\\n                    self.post_reman_at = self.minutes + self.tune.post_reman_hours * 60.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"post_cleared\\\");\\n                }\\n                clear && self.flags.contains(\\\"post_cleared\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_jam\\\"),\\n            Spec::Jam => self.flags.contains(\\\"jam_cleared\\\"),\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().broken {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n                    self.slot = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_broke\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => self.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\"),\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => self.flags.contains(wound_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Loot => self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar),\\n            Spec::Claim => self.flags.contains(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Shop => self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_bought\\\"),\\n            Spec::Locker => self.flags.contains(\\\"locker_used\\\"),\\n            Spec::Syrette => self.flags.contains(\\\"syrette\\\"),\\n            Spec::Tracker => self.flags.contains(\\\"cache_tracker\\\"),\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => self.flags.contains(\\\"sleep_used\\\") && self.step_t > 0.2,\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0 && self.flags.contains(\\\"technical_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mono => self.flags.contains(\\\"monocular_tag\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ignite(n) => self.flags.contains(ignite_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\\\"cells_500\\\") && self.flags.contains(\\\"explosion_chain\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mounted => self.flags.contains(\\\"mounted_gun\\\"),\\n            Spec::Panic => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\"),\\n            Spec::Animals => self.flags.contains(\\\"animals_fled\\\"),\\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => self.flags.contains(\\\"bus_taken\\\") && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0,\\n            Spec::Night => self.flags.contains(\\\"night_contract\\\"),\\n            Spec::Boat => self.flags.contains(\\\"boat_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Stealth => self.flags.contains(\\\"stealth_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Dart => self.flags.contains(\\\"dart_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Repair => self.flags.contains(\\\"repair_done\\\"),\\n            Spec::Rain => self.flags.contains(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\"),\\n            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\") || self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.down),\\n            Spec::Patch => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_patched\\\"),\\n            Spec::Overdose => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Die => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_died\\\"),\\n            Spec::Tape => self.flags.contains(\\\"tape_played\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => self.flags.contains(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\"),\\n            Spec::Convoy => self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 6).all(|b| !b.alive) && !self.bodies.is_empty(),\\n            Spec::Town => self.flags.contains(\\\"town_burned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ending(n) => self.flags.contains(ending_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.flags.contains(s),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_spec(&self, spec: Spec) -> InputFrame {\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Map => {\\n                f.held = buttons::MAP;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MAP;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Way | Spec::Claim | Spec::Shop | Spec::Locker | Spec::Loot | Spec::Tape | Spec::Ending(2) => {\\n                f.act = 1;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, .. } | Spec::Tracker => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = if matches!(spec, Spec::Tracker) { self.tracker_cache } else { (x, z) };\\n                return self.bot_go(tx, tz, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Pill => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PILLS;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PILLS;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fight | Spec::Ceasefire | Spec::Convoy | Spec::Ignite(10) => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind != 3) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.7, true);\\n                }\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam | Spec::Blackout | Spec::Fever | Spec::Die | Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Ending(1)) {\\n                    f.held = buttons::CROUCH;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam | Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().jammed {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                    f.held = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {}\\n            Spec::Wound(_) => {\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n                let (hx, hz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, hx, hz) > 8.0 && self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    return self.bot_go(hx, hz, true);\\n                }\\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } | Spec::Bus { .. } => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = match spec {\\n                    Spec::Bus { .. } => geom::place(\\\"Junction\\\"),\\n                    Spec::Drive { x, z } => (x, z),\\n                };\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    let mut aim = self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.6, false);\\n                    aim.held |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    aim.pressed |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    return aim;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => {\\n                if k == 10 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                } else if k == 11 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks | Spec::Mounted => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Mounted) {\\n                    f.pressed |= buttons::USE;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic | Spec::Animals => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Boat => return self.bot_drive(self.x + 30.0, self.z),\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                f.held = buttons::CROUCH | buttons::MELEE;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MELEE;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Repair | Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose => {\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain | Spec::Night | Spec::Better | Spec::Flag(_) | Spec::Town | Spec::Ending(0) => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n        let _ = shell::glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.xbox);\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_go(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, sprint: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.x, self.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.4, 1.4);\\n        if err.abs() < 0.4 {\\n            f.move_dir.y = 1.0;\\n            if sprint && self.stamina > 1.0 {\\n                f.held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_drive(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.axes.x = err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n        f.axes.y = 1.0;\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_aim(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, ty: f32, fire: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let dx = tx - self.x;\\n        let dz = tz - self.z;\\n        let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.2);\\n        let desired = dx.atan2(-dz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let perr = ((ty - self.eye) / dist).atan() - self.pitch;\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.5, 1.5);\\n        f.look.y = perr.clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n        if fire && err.abs() < 0.2 && perr.abs() < 0.2 {\\n            f.held |= buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            f.pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn start_playing(&mut self) {\\n        self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::place(\\\"Airstrip\\\");\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n        self.yaw = 0.0;\\n        self.eye = 1.58;\\n        self.idle = 0.0;\\n        self.pitch = 0.08;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn simulate(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        self.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.yaw + input.look.x);\\n        self.pitch = (self.pitch + input.look.y).clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.roll = (self.minutes * 2.0).sin() * 0.05 * self.tune.fever_severity;\\n        } else {\\n            self.roll *= 0.9;\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::CRAWL) {\\n            self.stance = 2;\\n        } else if input.down(buttons::CROUCH) {\\n            self.stance = 1;\\n        } else if !self.treating {\\n            self.stance = 0;\\n        }\\n        let target_eye = match self.stance {\\n            2 => 0.42,\\n            1 => 1.02,\\n            _ => 1.58,\\n        };\\n        let k = 1.0 - (-dt / 0.12).exp();\\n        self.eye += (target_eye - self.eye) * k;\\n\\n        if input.down(buttons::MAP) {\\n            self.map_t += dt;\\n            if self.map_t > 0.35 {\\n                self.mark(\\\"map_raised\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\") && (input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || input.act == 1) && self.waypoint.is_none() {\\n            self.waypoint = Some((0.0, 460.0));\\n            self.mark(\\\"waypoint_set\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::MONOCULAR) {\\n            self.mono_t += dt;\\n            if self.mono_t > 0.5 && self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < 80.0) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"monocular_tag\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n\\n        self.move_body(input, dt);\\n        self.use_vehicle(input, dt);\\n        self.handle_items(input, dt);\\n        self.handle_gun(input, dt);\\n        self.update_bodies(dt);\\n        self.update_fever(dt);\\n        self.update_rescue(dt);\\n        let rain = self.weather == 1;\\n        let wind = self.wind * self.tune.wind_strength;\\n        let out = self.fire.tick(dt, wind, self.tune.fire_spread, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes, rain, &mut self.rng);\\n        if out > 0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\");\\n            self.weather = 0;\\n        }\\n        if self.fire.burned >= 500 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cells_500\\\");\\n        }\\n        self.special_actions(input, dt);\\n        if self.hp > 20.0 && self.hp < 100.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 && !self.dev.god {\\n            self.hp = (self.hp + 8.0 * dt).min(100.0);\\n        }\\n        if self.dev.god {\\n            self.hp = 100.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn move_body(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.ride.seat != 0 || self.rescue_t > 0.0 || self.treating {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let fwd = Vec2::new(sy, -cy);\\n        let right = Vec2::new(cy, sy);\\n        let wish = right * input.move_dir.x + fwd * input.move_dir.y;\\n        let sprint = input.down(buttons::FOCUS) && self.stamina > 0.0 && self.stance == 0;\\n        let mut speed = if input.down(buttons::SECONDARY) { 3.0 } else { 4.6 };\\n        if sprint {\\n            speed = 7.0;\\n            self.stamina = (self.stamina - dt).max(0.0);\\n        } else if !input.down(buttons::FOCUS) {\\n            self.stamina = (self.stamina + dt * 2.0).min(12.0);\\n        }\\n        speed *= match self.stance {\\n            1 => 0.55,\\n            2 => 0.28,\\n            _ => 1.0,\\n        };\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            speed *= 0.75;\\n        }\\n        speed *= self.tune.player_speed;\\n        let diff = match self.difficulty {\\n            0 => 1.05,\\n            2 => 0.95,\\n            _ => 1.0,\\n        };\\n        speed *= diff;\\n        if wish.length_squared() > 1e-6 {\\n            let n = wish.normalize();\\n            self.x += n.x * speed * dt;\\n            self.z += n.y * speed * dt;\\n        }\\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.x, self.z);\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn use_vehicle(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if input.just(buttons::USE) && self.ride.kind != 0 {\\n            self.ride.seat = (self.ride.seat + 1) % 3;\\n            if self.ride.seat == 2 {\\n                // gunner\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n            if self.ride.kind != 0 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.ride.x, self.ride.z) < 5.0 && input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n                self.ride.repair += dt;\\n                if self.ride.repair >= 6.0 && self.ride.health < 70.0 {\\n                    self.ride.health = 70.0;\\n                    self.ride.stage = 1;\\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n                    self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"repair_done\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let steer = input.axes.x;\\n        self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + steer * dt * 1.6);\\n        let mut max_s = 16.0 * self.tune.vehicle_speed;\\n        if self.ride.stage == 2 {\\n            max_s *= 0.6;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage >= 3 {\\n            max_s *= 0.2;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && !geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            max_s = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        let throttle = input.axes.y;\\n        self.ride.speed += (throttle.clamp(-0.4, 1.0) * max_s - self.ride.speed) * (dt * 2.5).min(1.0);\\n        let (sy, cy) = self.ride.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let before = (self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x += sy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        self.ride.z += -cy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x = x;\\n        self.ride.z = z;\\n        self.ride.dist += geom::dist(before.0, before.1, self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h = geom::height(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h2 = geom::height(self.ride.x + sy * 2.0, self.ride.z - cy * 2.0);\\n        self.ride.pitch = (h2 - h).atan();\\n        if self.ride.roll.abs() > 0.02 {\\n            self.ride.roll *= (1.0 - dt * 3.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        }\\n        self.x = self.ride.x;\\n        self.z = self.ride.z;\\n        if self.ride.kind == 1 && self.ride.dist > 20.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"technical_driven\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && self.ride.dist > 15.0 && geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"boat_driven\\\");\\n            self.boat_dist = self.ride.dist;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.seat == 2 && input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"mounted_gun\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage == 3 {\\n            self.ride.fuse -= dt;\\n            if self.ride.fuse <= 0.0 {\\n                self.ride.stage = 4;\\n                self.ride.health = 0.0;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.npc {\\n            let points = [(0.0, 800.0), (0.0, 400.0), (0.0, 0.0), (0.0, -400.0)];\\n            let target = points[self.ride.npc_i % points.len()];\\n            if geom::dist(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1) < 8.0 {\\n                self.ride.npc_i += 1;\\n            }\\n            let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1);\\n            let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n            self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0) * dt * 2.0);\\n            self.ride.speed = 10.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn hurt_vehicle(&mut self, dmg: f32) {\\n        if self.ride.kind == 0 || self.ride.stage == 4 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.ride.health -= dmg / self.tune.vehicle_tough.max(0.2);\\n        if self.ride.health > 70.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 0;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 40.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 1;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 15.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 2;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 0.0 {\\n            if self.ride.stage < 3 {\\n                self.ride.fuse = 8.0;\\n            }\\n            self.ride.stage = 3;\\n        } else {\\n            self.ride.stage = 4;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn handle_items(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if input.just(buttons::HEAL) && self.hp >= 20.0 && self.hp < 100.0 && self.syrettes > 0 && self.syrette_t <= 0.0 {\\n            self.syrettes -= 1;\\n            self.syrette_t = 1.5;\\n        }\\n        if self.syrette_t > 0.0 {\\n            let step = dt.min(self.syrette_t);\\n            self.hp = (self.hp + self.tune.syrette_heal / 1.5 * step).min(100.0);\\n            self.syrette_t -= step;\\n            if self.syrette_t <= 0.0 {\\n                self.syrette_t = 0.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"syrette\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.hp < 20.0 && self.hp > 0.0 && input.down(buttons::HEAL) {\\n            self.treating = true;\\n            self.heal_t += dt;\\n            if self.heal_t >= 4.0 {\\n                self.hp = 40.0;\\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n                self.treating = false;\\n                self.mark(wound_flag(self.wound.max(1)));\\n                self.wound = 0;\\n            }\\n        } else if self.hp >= 20.0 {\\n            self.treating = false;\\n            self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if self.fever_state > 0 && input.down(buttons::PILLS) && self.pills > 0 {\\n            self.pill_t += dt;\\n            if self.pill_t >= 2.5 {\\n                self.pills -= 1;\\n                self.pill_t = 0.0;\\n                self.fever_state = 0;\\n                self.fever_t = 0.0;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"pill_taken\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.pill_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn handle_gun(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.guns.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        {\\n            let g = self.gun_mut();\\n            if input.just(buttons::RELOAD) {\\n                g.tap_reload();\\n            }\\n            g.tick_clear(dt);\\n            if self.dev.infinite {\\n                g.ammo = g.ammo.max(30);\\n            }\\n            if self.dev.no_jams {\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.force_jam = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.gun().jammed {\\n            self.jam_seen = true;\\n        } else if self.jam_seen {\\n            self.mark(\\\"jam_cleared\\\");\\n        }\\n        let holster = self.ceasefire && geom::in_town(self.x, self.z);\\n        let want = input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) && !self.treating && !holster && self.rescue_t <= 0.0;\\n        if !want {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let ads = input.down(buttons::SECONDARY);\\n        let pull = {\\n            let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\\n            let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\\n            let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\\n            let g = self.gun_mut();\\n            g.pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br)\\n        };\\n        if pull != Pull::Fired && pull != Pull::Broke {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.resolve_shot(ads);\\n        if pull == Pull::Broke {\\n            self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn resolve_shot(&mut self, ads: bool) {\\n        let st = gun::stats(self.gun().id);\\n        let spread = 0.02 * gun::spread_mul(self.gun().condition) * if ads { 0.25 } else { 1.0 };\\n        let jitter = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * spread;\\n        let yaw = self.yaw + jitter;\\n        let pitch = self.pitch + jitter * 0.5;\\n        let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n        let dir = (sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n        let origin = (self.x, self.eye, self.z);\\n        self.shots_tick(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn shots_tick(&mut self, origin: (f32, f32, f32), dir: (f32, f32, f32), damage: f32, range: f32, noise: f32, ignites: bool, silent: bool, id: WeaponId, shot_n: u32) {\\n        let mut best_t = range;\\n        let mut best_zone = 0u8;\\n        let mut best_i: Option<usize> = None;\\n        let mut blocked = false;\\n        for w in &self.walls {\\n            if let Some(t) = ray_aabb(origin, dir, w.min, w.max) {\\n                if t < best_t {\\n                    best_t = t;\\n                    blocked = true;\\n                    best_i = None;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if !blocked {\\n            for (i, b) in self.bodies.iter().enumerate() {\\n                if !b.alive {\\n                    continue;\\n                }\\n                let zones = [(1.70, 0.18, 3u8), (1.15, 0.28, 1u8), (0.45, 0.20, 2u8)];\\n                for (y, r, zone) in zones {\\n                    if let Some(t) = ray_sphere(origin, dir, (b.x, y, b.z), r) {\\n                        if t < best_t {\\n                            best_t = t;\\n                            best_zone = zone;\\n                            best_i = Some(i);\\n                            blocked = false;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let hit_x = origin.0 + dir.0 * best_t;\\n        let hit_z = origin.2 + dir.2 * best_t;\\n        if let Some(i) = best_i {\\n            let mul = match best_zone {\\n                3 => 3.0,\\n                2 => 0.6,\\n                _ => 1.0,\\n            };\\n            let dmg = damage * mul;\\n            let kind = self.bodies[i].kind;\\n            let in_town = geom::in_town(self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n            if self.ceasefire && in_town && kind == 2 {\\n                // Civilians are safe while the ceasefire holds.\\n            } else if id == WeaponId::Dart {\\n                self.bodies[i].poison = 3.0;\\n            } else {\\n                self.bodies[i].hp -= dmg;\\n                if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n                    if kind == 1 && self.stance == 1 && silent {\\n                        self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if ignites || id == WeaponId::Flare || id == WeaponId::Rpg || id == WeaponId::Flamer || id == WeaponId::Mortar || id == WeaponId::Molotov || id == WeaponId::Frag {\\n            let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n        }\\n        // Tracers: every third round, a quarter of them light dry grass.\\n        if shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 && self.rng.f32() < 0.25 {\\n            if self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_tracer\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if !silent {\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.alert == 0 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < noise {\\n                    b.alert = 1;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let _ = noise;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_bodies(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        let px = self.x;\\n        let pz = self.z;\\n        let stance = self.stance;\\n        let night = self.hour() < 5.0 || self.hour() > 20.0;\\n        let light = if night { 0.45 } else { 1.0 };\\n        let n = self.bodies.len();\\n        for i in 0..n {\\n            if !self.bodies[i].alive {\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].poison > 0.0 {\\n                self.bodies[i].poison -= dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].poison <= 0.0 && self.bodies[i].hp > 0.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].hp = 0.0;\\n                    self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"dart_kill\\\");\\n                    continue;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 3 {\\n                let d0 = geom::dist(px, pz, self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n                if d0 < 40.0 && self.guns.first().map(|g| g.shots > 0).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                    let dx = self.bodies[i].x - px;\\n                    let dz = self.bodies[i].z - pz;\\n                    let len = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.1);\\n                    self.bodies[i].x += dx / len * 6.0 * dt;\\n                    self.bodies[i].z += dz / len * 6.0 * dt;\\n                    self.bodies[i].flee += 6.0 * dt;\\n                    if self.bodies[i].flee > 8.0 {\\n                        self.mark(\\\"animals_fled\\\");\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 5 || self.bodies[i].kind == 6 {\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            let crouched = stance == 1;\\n            let grass = grass_factor(px, pz, crouched);\\n            let posture = match stance {\\n                2 => 0.3,\\n                1 => 0.6,\\n                _ => 1.0,\\n            };\\n            let motion = 0.5;\\n            let rate = exposure(posture, grass, light, motion) * self.tune.detection;\\n            let dist = geom::dist(px, pz, self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z).max(1.0);\\n            let falloff = (30.0 / dist).clamp(0.0, 1.5);\\n            if !self.dev.invisible && self.bodies[i].alert < 2 {\\n                self.bodies[i].see += rate * falloff * dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].see > 1.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].alert = 2;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            // Fire under an enemy makes them run.\\n            let (cx, cz) = (self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n            let cell = geom::cell_of(cx, cz);\\n            if self.fire.cells.get(&cell).map(|c| c.burning).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                self.bodies[i].alert = 4;\\n                self.bodies[i].x += 4.0 * dt;\\n                self.bodies[i].flee += 4.0 * dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].flee > 3.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if self.bodies[i].kind == 1 && self.bodies[i].alert >= 1 && !self.bodies[i].gun.jammed {\\n                let gpull = {\\n                    let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\\n                    let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\\n                    let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\\n                    self.bodies[i].gun.pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br)\\n                };\\n                if gpull == Pull::Jammed {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"enemy_jam\\\");\\n                }\\n                if gpull == Pull::Fired && self.rng.f32() < self.tune.enemy_accuracy * 0.15 {\\n                    let diff = match self.difficulty {\\n                        0 => 0.7,\\n                        2 => 1.3,\\n                        _ => 1.0,\\n                    };\\n                    if !self.dev.god && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n                        self.hp -= self.tune.enemy_damage * 0.15 * diff * dt.max(0.05) * 10.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            self.bodies[i].gun.tick_clear(dt);\\n            if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\\n                self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_fever(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.dev.no_fever {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.fever_state == 0 {\\n            self.fever_t += dt;\\n            if self.fever_t >= self.tune.fever_interval {\\n                self.fever_state = 1;\\n                self.fever_warn = 0.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"fever_warned\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else if self.fever_state == 1 {\\n            self.fever_warn += dt;\\n            if self.fever_warn >= 40.0 {\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        } else if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.fever_attack += dt;\\n            if self.fever_attack >= 60.0 && self.pills == 0 {\\n                self.blackout();\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blackout(&mut self) {\\n        let (sx, sz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n        self.x = sx;\\n        self.z = sz;\\n        self.hp = 50.0;\\n        self.diamonds = (self.diamonds as f32 * 0.8).floor() as u32;\\n        self.fever_state = 0;\\n        self.fever_t = 0.0;\\n        self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n        self.minutes += 6.0 * 60.0;\\n        self.mark(\\\"blackout\\\");\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_rescue(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.hp <= 0.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n            if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive && !c.rescue_spent && !c.down) {\\n                c.rescue_spent = true;\\n                self.rescue_t = 3.0;\\n                self.hp = 1.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.rescue_t > 0.0 {\\n            self.rescue_t -= dt;\\n            let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n            self.x -= sy * dt * 4.0;\\n            self.z -= -cy * dt * 4.0;\\n            if self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                self.hp = 50.0;\\n                self.slot = 0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"player_rescued\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn special_actions(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        let near_cache = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1);\\n        if near_cache < 4.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cache_tracker\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            self.hold_t += dt;\\n        } else {\\n            self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || (input.down(buttons::INTERACT) && self.hold_t > 0.4) {\\n            self.try_interact();\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::MELEE) {\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 1 && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < 2.2 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n                    b.alive = false;\\n                    if self.stance == 1 {\\n                        self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        // Companion down timer.\\n        for c in &mut self.companions {\\n            if c.down && c.alive {\\n                c.down_t += dt;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && c.down_t > 45.0) {\\n            c.alive = false;\\n            c.down = false;\\n            self.mark(\\\"companion_died\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, c.x, c.z) < 3.0) {\\n                if self.hold_t > 3.0 && self.syrettes > 0 && !c.doomed_enough() {\\n                    // patched below after the borrow... \\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.patch_or_dose();\\n        // Scripted igniters that are not shots.\\n        if self.step_ready {\\n            if let Some(spec) = self.current() {\\n                self.script_ignite(spec, input);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn patch_or_dose(&mut self) {\\n        if self.hold_t < 3.0 || self.syrettes == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let doomed = matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Overdose));\\n        if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down && c.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, c.x, c.z) < 4.0) {\\n            if doomed {\\n                c.alive = false;\\n                c.down = false;\\n                self.syrettes -= 1;\\n                self.mark(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\");\\n            } else {\\n                c.down = false;\\n                c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                self.syrettes -= 1;\\n                self.mark(\\\"companion_patched\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\\n        let x = self.x + 2.0;\\n        let z = self.z + 2.0;\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Ignite(0) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_flare\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(1) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_rocket\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(2) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x + 1.0, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_flamer\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(3) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z + 4.0, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_mortar\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(4) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_molotov\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(5) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x + 3.0, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_frag\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(6) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 5.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) > 0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_barrel\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(7) => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\");\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 5.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(8) => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_person\\\");\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(9) => {\\n                self.weather = 2;\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x + 6.0, z - 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_lightning\\\");\\n                }\\n                self.weather = 0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(11) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_cigarette\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks => {\\n                self.blow_tanks();\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(0) => {\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"ending_burn\\\");\\n                self.finished = true;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                self.hold_t += 0.0;\\n                // hold_t is fed by interact. Use step_t instead.\\n                if self.step_t >= 180.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ending_read\\\");\\n                    self.finished = true;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(2) => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ending_chair\\\");\\n                self.finished = true;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => {\\n                let stop = geom::place(\\\"Junction\\\");\\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, stop.0, stop.1) < 14.0 && self.diamonds >= 1 {\\n                    self.diamonds -= 1;\\n                    self.x = x;\\n                    self.z = z;\\n                    self.ride.seat = 0;\\n                    self.minutes += 20.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"bus_taken\\\");\\n                    self.mark(\\\"diamonds_spent\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n        // Tracer step: spray the ground in front.\\n        if matches!(spec, Spec::Ignite(10)) {\\n            self.pitch = -0.25;\\n            for _ in 0..4 {\\n                if self.gun().ammo == 0 {\\n                    self.gun_mut().ammo = 30;\\n                }\\n                let pull = {\\n                    let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                    g.condition = 90.0;\\n                    g.pull(&mut self.rng, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\\n                };\\n                if pull == Pull::Fired || pull == Pull::Broke {\\n                    self.resolve_shot(true);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn try_interact(&mut self) {\\n        if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, 170.0, 470.0) < 16.0 || geom::dist(self.x, self.z, -260.0, -700.0) < 16.0 || geom::dist(self.x, self.z, 830.0, 255.0) < 16.0\\n        {\\n            if self.hold_t > 0.3 && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Claim)) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\");\\n                self.hp = 100.0;\\n            }\\n            if self.hold_t > 0.8 && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Sleep { .. })) {\\n                let hours = match self.current() {\\n                    Some(Spec::Sleep { hours }) => hours,\\n                    _ => 8.0,\\n                };\\n                self.minutes += hours * 60.0;\\n                self.hp = 100.0;\\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\\n                }\\n                self.yaw = std::f32::consts::PI;\\n                self.looking_at_post = false;\\n                self.mark(\\\"sleep_used\\\");\\n                if hours >= 24.0 && self.post_clear {\\n                    self.post_clear = false;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"post_remanned\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Shop)) {\\n            let price = 8u32;\\n            if self.diamonds >= price {\\n                self.diamonds -= price;\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Battle));\\n                self.mark(\\\"weapon_bought\\\");\\n                self.mark(\\\"diamonds_spent\\\");\\n                self.infamy += 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Locker)) && self.guns.len() > 1 {\\n            self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            self.mark(\\\"locker_used\\\");\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Loot)) && !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar) {\\n            let mut g = Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar);\\n            g.condition = 40.0;\\n            self.guns.push(g);\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Tape)) && self.hold_t > 1.5 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"tape_played\\\");\\n        }\\n        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ceasefire)) {\\n            self.ceasefire = false;\\n            self.mark(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn try_buy(&mut self) -> bool {\\n        if self.diamonds < 8 {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        self.diamonds -= 8;\\n        self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Battle));\\n        self.mark(\\\"weapon_bought\\\");\\n        self.mark(\\\"diamonds_spent\\\");\\n        true\\n    }\\n\\n    fn maybe_reman(&mut self) {\\n        if !self.post_clear {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let (px, pz) = geom::place(\\\"Kilo 38\\\");\\n        let to_x = px - self.x;\\n        let to_z = pz - self.z;\\n        let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let fwd = (sy, -cy);\\n        let len = (to_x * to_x + to_z * to_z).sqrt().max(0.1);\\n        let dot = (fwd.0 * to_x + fwd.1 * to_z) / len;\\n        let dist = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, px, pz);\\n        self.looking_at_post = dot > 0.4 && dist < 180.0;\\n        if self.minutes >= self.post_reman_at && !self.looking_at_post {\\n            self.post_clear = false;\\n            self.mark(\\\"post_remanned\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn clear_bodies(&mut self) {\\n        self.bodies.clear();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_soldier(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32, hp: f32, jammy: bool) {\\n        let mut g = Gun::new(WeaponId::Ar);\\n        if jammy {\\n            g.condition = 5.0;\\n            g.wear = 0.0;\\n            g.ammo = 400;\\n            g.reserve = 400;\\n        }\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 1,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: if jammy { 2 } else { 0 },\\n            gun: g,\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_animal(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 3,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp: 20.0,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: 0,\\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_truck(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 6,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp: 80.0,\\n            alive: true,\\n            alert: 0,\\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_tank_farm(&mut self) {\\n        self.clear_bodies();\\n        for i in 0..7 {\\n            for j in 0..7 {\\n                self.bodies.push(Body {\\n                    kind: 5,\\n                    x: self.x + i as f32 * 10.0,\\n                    z: self.z + j as f32 * 10.0 - 20.0,\\n                    yaw: 0.0,\\n                    hp: 20.0,\\n                    alive: true,\\n                    alert: 0,\\n                    gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n                    see: 0.0,\\n                    poison: 0.0,\\n                    burn: 0.0,\\n                    doomed: false,\\n                    flee: 0.0,\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blow_tanks(&mut self) {\\n        if self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.kind == 5 && b.alive) {\\n            let positions: Vec<(f32, f32)> = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 5).map(|b| (b.x, b.z)).collect();\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.kind == 5 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n                    b.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            for (x, z) in positions {\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            }\\n            self.mark(\\\"explosion_chain\\\");\\n            self.mark(\\\"ignite_barrel\\\");\\n            if self.fire.burned >= 500 {\\n                self.mark(\\\"cells_500\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn hour(&self) -> f32 {\\n        (self.minutes / 60.0) % 24.0\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn tracker_rate(&self) -> f32 {\\n        let d = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1).max(1.0);\\n        if d > 60.0 { 0.0 } else { 8.0 / d }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn save_json(&self) -> String {\\n        serde_json::to_string(self).unwrap_or_else(|_| \\\"{}\\\".into())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn load_json(text: &str) -> Result<Self, String> {\\n        serde_json::from_str(text).map_err(|e| e.to_string())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn write_save(&mut self) {\\n        if self.hub {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.save_blob = String::new();\\n        let blob = self.save_json();\\n        self.save_blob = blob;\\n        self.has_save = true;\\n        self.saves_written += 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn fingerprint(&self) -> u64 {\\n        let s = serde_json::to_string(self).unwrap_or_default();\\n        let mut h = 0xcbf29ce484222325u64;\\n        for b in s.as_bytes() {\\n            h ^= *b as u64;\\n            h = h.wrapping_mul(0x100000001b3);\\n        }\\n        h\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn eye_pos(&self) -> (f32, f32, f32) {\\n        let h = geom::height(self.x, self.z);\\n        (self.x, h + self.eye, self.z)\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn status(&self) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let (ex, ey, ez) = self.eye_pos();\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"title\\\": \\\"Jam Cry\\\",\\n            \\\"screen\\\": format!(\\\"{:?}\\\", self.screen),\\n            \\\"goal\\\": self.goal_name(),\\n            \\\"x\\\": self.x,\\n            \\\"z\\\": self.z,\\n            \\\"yaw\\\": self.yaw,\\n            \\\"pitch\\\": self.pitch,\\n            \\\"roll\\\": self.roll,\\n            \\\"eye\\\": [ex, ey, ez],\\n            \\\"fov\\\": if self.mono_t > 0.0 { 15.0 } else if false { 55.0 } else { 75.0 },\\n            \\\"health\\\": self.hp,\\n            \\\"stance\\\": self.stance,\\n            \\\"diamonds\\\": self.diamonds,\\n            \\\"finished\\\": self.finished,\\n            \\\"coverage\\\": self.flags.iter().cloned().collect::<Vec<_>>(),\\n            \\\"audio\\\": { \\\"music\\\": self.music },\\n            \\\"dev\\\": { \\\"god\\\": self.dev.god, \\\"open\\\": self.screen == Screen::Dev },\\n            \\\"tune\\\": { \\\"fire_spread\\\": self.tune.fire_spread },\\n            \\\"wind\\\": self.wind.length(),\\n            \\\"hour\\\": self.hour(),\\n            \\\"vehicle\\\": { \\\"kind\\\": self.ride.kind, \\\"stage\\\": self.ride.stage, \\\"health\\\": self.ride.health, \\\"roll\\\": self.ride.roll, \\\"pitch\\\": self.ride.pitch },\\n            \\\"tracker\\\": self.tracker_rate(),\\n            \\\"attract\\\": self.attract_loops,\\n            \\\"saves\\\": self.saves_written,\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn ui_value(&self) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"screen\\\": format!(\\\"{:?}\\\", self.screen),\\n            \\\"rows\\\": self.rows(),\\n            \\\"focus\\\": self.focus,\\n            \\\"label\\\": self.rows().get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default(),\\n            \\\"notice\\\": self.notice(),\\n            \\\"touch_controls\\\": false,\\n            \\\"glyph\\\": shell::glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.xbox),\\n            \\\"xbox\\\": self.xbox,\\n            \\\"device\\\": format!(\\\"{:?}\\\", self.device),\\n            \\\"about\\\": about_pages(),\\n        })\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn wound_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match n {\\n        1 => \\\"wound_gunshot\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"wound_shrapnel\\\",\\n        3 => \\\"wound_burn\\\",\\n        4 => \\\"wound_fall\\\",\\n        5 => \\\"wound_tourniquet\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"wound_graze\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ignite_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match n {\\n        0 => \\\"ignite_flare\\\",\\n        1 => \\\"ignite_rocket\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"ignite_flamer\\\",\\n        3 => \\\"ignite_mortar\\\",\\n        4 => \\\"ignite_molotov\\\",\\n        5 => \\\"ignite_frag\\\",\\n        6 => \\\"ignite_barrel\\\",\\n        7 => \\\"ignite_vehicle\\\",\\n        8 => \\\"ignite_person\\\",\\n        9 => \\\"ignite_lightning\\\",\\n        10 => \\\"ignite_tracer\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"ignite_cigarette\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ending_flag(n: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match n {\\n        1 => \\\"ending_read\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"ending_chair\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"ending_burn\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\ntrait Doomed {\\n    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool;\\n}\\nimpl Doomed for Companion {\\n    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool {\\n        false\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ray_sphere(o: (f32, f32, f32), d: (f32, f32, f32), c: (f32, f32, f32), r: f32) -> Option<f32> {\\n    let lx = c.0 - o.0;\\n    let ly = c.1 - o.1;\\n    let lz = c.2 - o.2;\\n    let b = lx * d.0 + ly * d.1 + lz * d.2;\\n    let cc = lx * lx + ly * ly + lz * lz - r * r;\\n    let disc = b * b - cc;\\n    if disc < 0.0 {\\n        return None;\\n    }\\n    let t = b - disc.sqrt();\\n    (t > 0.05).then_some(t)\\n}\\n\\nfn ray_aabb(o: (f32, f32, f32), d: (f32, f32, f32), min: [f32; 3], max: [f32; 3]) -> Option<f32> {\\n    let mut t0 = 0.0f32;\\n    let mut t1 = 1.0e6f32;\\n    let origins = [o.0, o.1, o.2];\\n    let dirs = [d.0, d.1, d.2];\\n    for i in 0..3 {\\n        if dirs[i].abs() < 1e-8 {\\n            if origins[i] < min[i] || origins[i] > max[i] {\\n                return None;\\n            }\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let inv = 1.0 / dirs[i];\\n        let mut ta = (min[i] - origins[i]) * inv;\\n        let mut tb = (max[i] - origins[i]) * inv;\\n        if ta > tb {\\n            std::mem::swap(&mut ta, &mut tb);\\n        }\\n        t0 = t0.max(ta);\\n        t1 = t1.min(tb);\\n        if t0 > t1 {\\n            return None;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (t0 > 0.05).then_some(t0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn about_pages() -> Vec<String> {\\n    vec![\\n        \\\"Jam Cry. Everything rusts. The grass burns anyway.\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"You are a contract mercenary in the Republic of Kwelara, in the last dry season of a civil war. Colonel Emile Tshala's Council and Comrade Josephine Ruvuma's People's Hand both buy from the same dealer. Find the Chandler.\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Source: Far Cry 2\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Date: 2026-11-05 01:35:03. Environment: Grok CLI (headless); Linux. Model: xAI grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh. Usage: added on import. Plan: PLAN.md.\\\".into(),\\n    ]\\n}\\n\\npub fn fiction_lines() -> Vec<String> {\\n    let mut lines = vec![\\n        \\\"Jam Cry\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Everything rusts. The grass burns anyway.\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Republic of Kwelara\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Ada Okoro\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Emile Tshala\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Josephine Ruvuma\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"The Chandler\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Thandiwe Moyo\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Papa Lazare\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Mr. Desai\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Sister Perpetua\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Bakker\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Kilometre 40\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"New contract\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"Press any button\\\".into(),\\n    ];\\n    lines.extend(about_pages());\\n    for p in geom::PLACES {\\n        lines.push(p.name.into());\\n    }\\n    lines\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"783f57ef-d01f-4bdd-8ff0-3148e367ce75"}
