{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_79","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Resuming from where I left off.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The merc sim files are on disk but not wired into the crate yet. I'll add the game module, then compile and fix what the compiler reports."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-01f499ed-71bc-48a1-99cd-6c8cfbb70a6b-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"m0","content":"m0: Title notes, register merc, InputFrame, first compile","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"m1","content":"m1: First-person look, movement, hitscan, combat sim tests","status":"pending"},{"id":"m2","content":"m2: Country, fire, jams, fever, stealth, vehicles, world tests","status":"pending"},{"id":"m3","content":"m3: Companions, contracts, endings, saves, bot playthrough","status":"pending"},{"id":"m4","content":"m4: Audio, 10-foot shell, dev mode, attract, About","status":"pending"},{"id":"m5","content":"m5: Hub depot round and two-page multiplayer","status":"pending"},{"id":"m6","content":"m6: Pack HTML, exit-interview, PROGRESS, full tests and launch","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-01f499ed-71bc-48a1-99cd-6c8cfbb70a6b-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/long-running-background-tasks/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-01f499ed-71bc-48a1-99cd-6c8cfbb70a6b-2","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn build\\(|trait Game|struct Merc|history_seconds|fn pre\\(|fn post\\(|fn status\\(|fn bot\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src","glob":"**/*.{rs,toml}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-01f499ed-71bc-48a1-99cd-6c8cfbb70a6b-3","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-