{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_87","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing mod.rs now. Keeping visuals simple to avoid panics.\n\nChecking the Spawn API. Writing mod.rs with imports for world, fire, geom, gun, net, shell, and sim modules.\n\nDefining the Merc struct with a World and skipping serde fields for visuals and props. The build function loads merc.toml, parses it into a RoomDef, disables simulation history, builds the standalone room, and initializes the campaign world.\n\nFinishing the build function by storing the game in sim.state.play. Implementing the Game trait for Merc with a KEY constant and a pre method that ticks the world and returns an empty input map for the player.\n\nImplementing the `post` method. It calls `dress` to set up visuals. The player body is kept in the small room while the country simulation runs elsewhere. Checking gun shot counts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e1d3d89e-3032-49f5-a22c-dbc1fab31ce0-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/gun.rs","offset":89,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e1d3d89e-3032-49f5-a22c-dbc1fab31ce0-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct Spawn|fn visual|impl Spawn","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/entity.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e1d3d89e-3032-49f5-a22c-dbc1fab31ce0-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2050,"limit":250}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tok