{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_101","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The companion mark inside iter_mut will likely fail on the next compile.\n\nFixing companion death and patch_or_dose logic. Adding a companion_died mark. Adjusting melee loop to use iter_mut.\n\nAdding a stealth_kill mark for crouched melee kills. Rewriting handle_gun to use scoped mutability and track jam states with jam_cleared.\n\nAdding a tracer function that refills ammo and sets weapon condition. Renaming the campaign advance_script method and updating its call site. Splitting bot_spec and cloning shell data with string references.\n\nRemoving a `blocked = false` line. The `Spec::Jam` borrow ends when the local `g` variable is dropped, so setting `self.jam_seen` immediately after is valid. The compiler may have missed this borrow conflict among 14 reported errors.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The crate fails on a handful of borrow and match errors. I'll fix those and compile again."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cccd325f-65e0-4671-a743-8b53b1aa5d68-59","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        if self.route != Route::Sandbox {\n            self.campaign(dt);\n        }","new_string":"        if self.route != Route::Sandbox {\n            self.advance_script(dt);\n        }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cccd325f-65e0-4671-a743-8b53b1aa5d68-60","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"    fn campaign(&mut self, dt: f32) {","new_string":"    fn advance_script(&mut self, dt: f32) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call