{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_113","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The drive budget is 140 seconds. Traveling 1200 meters from the depot to SH1 at 16 m/s takes about 75 seconds.\n\nThe second drive to SH2 is roughly 1110 meters. The bus teleports the player to town and resets the seat, but the ride kind remains 1 from the first drive.\n\nPressing USE teleports the player to the vehicle at the junction. The distance to SH2 is roughly 400 meters.\n\nThe boat drive from SH2 to the nearest water is roughly 660 meters. The boat snaps the player to that water point, which is a teleport. After that, the bot drives an extra 30 meters in the x direction. The river runs mostly along negative x, so this extra offset might take the bot off the centerline.\n\nThe river centerline runs mostly east. The extra 30-meter x offset stays within the 7-meter deep-water channel.\n\nThe 30-meter eastward offset from the river centerline is roughly 7.3 meters laterally. That exceeds the 7-meter deep-water threshold, so the boat would lose speed before reaching the 15-meter exit distance. The fix is to make the boat bot drive along the river instead of adding x. I will update the Spec::Boat bot target in bot_spec.\n\nThe boat bot will use a new `water_ahead` helper in `geom.rs` to aim 40 meters along the nearest river segment. The mounted seat flicker is acceptable. The jammed reload logic will hold RELOAD every tick while jammed.\n\nThe jammed reload logic applies a 0.6 multiplier to the clear timer on the first tick after the jam, then locks it at roughly 1.2 seconds. The bot presses RELOAD every tick while jammed, but it may press before the jam actually triggers because the simulation tick runs before the campaign step.\n\nThe bot input is computed before the tick, so it pulls and jams the SMG on the first frame. The break condition is 5 and wear is zero, so it stays at 5. At 800 RPM the break cooldown is 0.075 seconds. With 3% per shot and a roughly 20% jam chance, the gun should last about 2 seconds between breaks. That fits within the 90-second budget.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-14b88d79-4c54-4fc6-ac7e-c40cd715fb2b-98","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":42,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-14b88d79-4c54-4fc6-ac7e-c40cd715fb2b-99","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1452,"limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1803,"output_tokens":1763,"cache_read_input_tokens":134016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"83c34e91-cbcb-4e99-88b3-6cba03fe5cfe"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-14b88d79-4c54-4fc6-ac7e-c40cd715fb2b-98","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"42→#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Tune {\\n    pub enemy_accuracy: f32,\\n    pub enemy_damage: f32,\\n    pub player_damage: f32,\\n    pub detection: f32,\\n    pub enemy_count: f32,\\n    pub weapon_wear: f32,\\n50→    pub jam_chance: f32,\\n    pub break_threshold: f32,\\n    pub fire_spread: f32,\\n    pub burn_time: f32,\\n    pub wind_strength: f32,\\n    pub burn_damage: f32,\\n    pub fever_interval: f32,\\n    pub fever_severity: f32,\\n    pub syrette_heal: f32,\\n    pub rescue_window: f32,\\n60→    pub vehicle_speed: f32,\\n    pub vehicle_tough: f32,\\n    pub contract_pay: f32,\\n    pub post_reman_hours: f32,\\n    pub player_speed: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Tune {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n70→            enemy_accuracy: 0.35,\\n            enemy_damage: 8.0,\\n            player_damage: 1.0,\\n            detection: 1.0,\\n            enemy_count: 1.0,\\n            weapon_wear: 1.0,\\n            jam_chance: 1.0,\\n            break_threshold: 8.0,\\n            fire_spread: 0.9,\\n            burn_time: 10.0,\\n80→            wind_strength: 1.0,\\n            burn_damage: 20.0,\\n            fever_interval: 15.0 * 60.0,\\n            fever_severity: 1.0,\\n            syrette_heal: 60.0,\\n            rescue_window: 6.0,\\n            vehicle_speed: 1.0,\\n            vehicle_tough: 1.0,\\n            contract_pay: 1.0,\\n            post_reman_hours: 24.0,\\n90→            player_speed: 1.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Tune {\\n    pub fn count(&self) -> usize {\\n        21\\n    }\\n    pub fn name(&self, i: usize) -> &'static str {\\n100→        [\\\"Enemy accuracy\\\", \\\"Enemy damage\\\", \\\"Player damage\\\", \\\"Detection\\\", \\\"Enemy count\\\", \\\"Weapon wear\\\", \\\"Jam chan