ck(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\\n    }\\n1470→\\n    fn shots_tick(&mut self, origin: (f32, f32, f32), dir: (f32, f32, f32), damage: f32, range: f32, noise: f32, ignites: bool, silent: bool, id: WeaponId, shot_n: u32) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"offset\":1452,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"        self.resolve_shot(ads);\\n        if pull == Pull::Broke {\\n            self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn resolve_shot(&mut self, ads: bool) {\\n        let st = gun::stats(self.gun().id);\\n        let spread = 0.02 * gun::spread_mul(self.gun().condition) * if ads { 0.25 } else { 1.0 };\\n        let jitter = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * spread;\\n        let yaw = self.yaw + jitter;\\n        let pitch = self.pitch + jitter * 0.5;\\n        let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n        let dir = (sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n        let origin = (self.x, self.eye, self.z);\\n        self.shots_tick(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn shots_tick(&mut self, origin: (f32, f32, f32), dir: (f32, f32, f32), damage: f32, range: f32, noise: f32, ignites: bool, silent: bool, id: WeaponId, shot_n: u32) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":2295}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"20ccde45-83a4-4060-852f-b0edd808bef0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_114","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Enemy damage per successful shot is 0.\n\nDamage per hit is 0.6 HP. Accuracy is 0.0525. The player should survive. Fever interval defaults to 900 seconds. The bot holds pills and needs active fever state.\n\nPill activation requires holding the button for 2.5 seconds. Blackout needs 60 seconds of attack after pills are spent and the fever state is set to 2. The script budget allows this. Syrette healing triggers when HP is between 20 and 100 with syrettes available. The bot's HP drops to 40 after wounds, then reaches 100 after sleep.\n\nSyrette is applied before sleep, so the bot can heal from 40 HP. Wound treatment takes 4 seconds. Rescue sets HP to zero and starts a 3-second drag. The shop budget is 32 diamonds, which is enough for the blackout floors.\n\nShop interaction triggers on the first tick of holding INTERACT, so the bot buys immediately. The tracker step is before sleep; the distance from SH1 to cache is about 85 meters, which fits within the 30-second walk budget. The 500-cell layout uses seven tanks spaced 10 meters apart with 6-meter ignition radius, overlapping by 2 meters.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fe675e6-b539-46d7-98a5-27a0663c847c-100","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs","offset":175,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fe675e6-b539-46d7-98a5-27a0663c847c-101","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2040,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3477,"output_tokens":1056,"cache_read_input_tokens":135808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"b820a2a2-7b7d-421e-ac33-26ac8b8e7117"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0fe675e6-b539-46d7-98a5-27a0663c847c-100","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"175→}\\n\\npub fn cell_of(x: f32, z: f32) -> (i32, i32) {\\n    (x.div_euclid(2.0) as i32, z.div_euclid(2.0) as i32)\\n}\\n180→\\npub fn cell_center(c: (i32, i32)) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    (c.0 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0, c.1 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn safe_houses() -> [(f32, f32); 3] {\\n    [place(\\\"Pump House\\\"), place(\\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\"), place(\\\"Boat Shed\\\")]\\n}\\n\\npub fn nearest_safe(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n190→    safe_houses().into_iter().min_by(|a, b| dist(x, z, a.0, a.1).total_cmp(&dist(x, z, b.0, b.1))).unwrap_or((170.0, 470.0))\\n}\\n\\n/// Detection multiplier from posture, grass, light and motion. Distance falloff is separate.\\n/// Crouched in tall grass at night, still: 0.6 * 0.35 * 0.45 * 0.5.\",\"content_concise\":\"175→}\\n\\npub fn cell_of(x: f32, z: f32) -> (i32, i32) {\\n    (x.div_euclid(2.0) as i32, z.div_euclid(2.0) as i32)\\n}\\n180→\\npub fn cell_center(c: (i32, i32)) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    (c.0 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0, c.1 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn safe_houses() -> [(f32, f32); 3] {\\n    [place(\\\"Pump House\\\"), place(\\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\"), place(\\\"Boat Shed\\\")]\\n}\\n\\npub fn nearest_safe(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n190→    safe_houses().into_iter().min_by(|a, b| dist(x, z, a.0, a.1).total_cmp(&dist(x, z, b.0, b.1))).unwrap_or((170.0, 470.0))\\n}\\n\\n/// Detection multiplier from posture, grass, light and motion. Distance falloff is separate.\\n/// Crouched in tall grass at night, still: 0.6 * 0.35 * 0.45 * 0.5.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs\",\"offset\":175,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"}\\n\\npub fn cell_of(x: f32, z: f32) -> (i32, i32) {\\n    (x.div_euclid(2.0) as i32, z.div_euclid(2.0) as i32)\\n}\\n\\npub fn cell_center(c: (i32, i32)) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    (c.0 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0, c.1 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn safe_houses() -> [(f32, f32); 3] {\\n    [place(\\\"Pump House\\\"), place(\\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\"), place(\\\"Boat Shed\\\")]\\n}\\n\\npub fn nearest_safe(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    safe_houses().into_iter().min_by(|a, b| dist(x, z, a.0, a.1).total_cmp(&dist(x, z, b.0, b.1))).unwrap_or((170.0, 470.0))\\n}\\n\\n/// Detection multiplier from posture, grass, light and motion. Distance falloff is separate.\\n/// Crouched in tall grass at night, still: 0.6 * 0.35 * 0.45 * 0.5.\\n\",\"total_lines\":219}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0fe675e6-b539-46d7-98a5-27a0663c847c-101","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"2040→\\n    fn spawn_tank_farm(&mut self) {\\n        self.clear_bodies();\\n        for i in 0..7 {\\n            for j in 0..7 {\\n                self.bodies.push(Body {\\n                    kind: 5,\\n                    x: self.x + i as f32 * 10.0,\\n                    z: self.z + j as f32 * 10.0 - 20.0,\\n                    yaw: 0.0,\\n2050→                    hp: 20.0,\\n                    alive: true,\\n                    alert: 0,\\n                    gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n                    see: 0.0,\\n                    poison: 0.0,\\n                    burn: 0.0,\\n                    doomed: false,\\n                    flee: 0.0,\\n                });\\n2060→            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blow_tanks(&mut self) {\\n        if self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.kind == 5 && b.alive) {\\n            let positions: Vec<(f32, f32)> = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 5).map(|b| (b.x, b.z)).collect();\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.kind == 5 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\",\"content_concise\":\"2040→\\n    fn spawn_tank_farm(&mut self) {\\n        self.clear_bodies();\\n        for i in 0..7 {\\n            for j in 0..7 {\\n                self.bodies.push(Body {\\n                    kind: 5,\\n                    x: self.x + i as f32 * 10.0,\\n                    z: self.z + j as f32 * 10.0 - 20.0,\\n                    yaw: 0.0,\\n2050→                    hp: 20.0,\\n                    alive: true,\\n                    alert: 0,\\n                    gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n                    see: 0.0,\\n                    poison: 0.0,\\n                    burn: 0.0,\\n                    doomed: false,\\n                    flee: 0.0,\\n                });\\n2060→            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blow_tanks(&mut self) {\\n        if self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.kind == 5 && b.alive) {\\n            let positions: Vec<(f32, f32)> = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 5).map(|b| (b.x, b.z)).collect();\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.kind == 5 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"offset\":2040,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"\\n    fn spawn_tank_farm(&mut self) {\\n        self.clear_bodies();\\n        for i in 0..7 {\\n            for j in 0..7 {\\n                self.bodies.push(Body {\\n                    kind: 5,\\n                    x: self.x + i as f32 * 10.0,\\n                    z: self.z + j as f32 * 10.0 - 20.0,\\n                    yaw: 0.0,\\n                    hp: 20.0,\\n                    alive: true,\\n                    alert: 0,\\n                    gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n                    see: 0.0,\\n                    poison: 0.0,\\n                    burn: 0.0,\\n                    doomed: false,\\n                    flee: 0.0,\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn blow_tanks(&mut self) {\\n        if self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.kind == 5 && b.alive) {\\n            let positions: Vec<(f32, f32)> = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 5).map(|b| (b.x, b.z)).collect();\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.kind == 5 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":2295}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"91d5b180-cfb4-40e5-8fd7-f3aef282485e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_115","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Calculating the total area of 49 tanks arranged in a 7x7 grid. Each disk has radius 6, giving an area of roughly 113 m² per tank.\n\nEstimating the farm's grid cells. A 72×72 meter bounding box yields roughly 1,296 cells. With 10-meter spacing and 6-meter radius, the 49 tanks likely cover about 735 unique cells, exceeding the 500-cell target. Road fuel will be zero, so depot areas must be grass.\n\nDepot and farm bounds are confirmed to avoid road overlap. The burned counter tracks cumulative ignitions, so earlier fires may already satisfy the 500-cell target. Twelve small disk ignitions will not reach that threshold; the tanks must do it.\n\nBurned cells only increment on new ignitions, not re-ignitions while a fire is still active. Wind rag is set correctly during play.\n\nBoat steering needs fixing before the long playthrough test to avoid wasting a three-route run.\n\nThe Ceasefire flag never triggers because the bot's Fight arm aims and fires rather than interacting, and script_ignite does not handle Ceasefire specs.\n\nThe Ceasefire flag will be cleared when a soldier dies during the ceasefire step, since the bot never presses INTERACT.\n\nThe Ceasefire flag will be cleared inside shots_tick when a soldier dies during that step. The bot's sniper deals 110 damage, so one hit should kill the target. A companion is placed 40 meters away on death, and down_t increases in special_actions.\n\nThe bot needs no action during the 45-second death countdown, so the 55-second budget is comfortable.\n\nOverdose and patch are handled correctly: the companion sits at 1.5 meters, the bot holds INTERACT long enough to trigger patch_or_dose while syrettes remain.\n\nIn the ending sequence, enemies spawn beyond 40 meters and must detect the player to start alerting. The bot will crouch instead of heal if health drops below 20. Even if rescue moves the player, step_t continues advancing in advance_script. The done condition requires step_t to reach 180 seconds and the flag set by script_ignite.\n\nThe full test run spans roughly 180,000 ticks across two seeds and three routes. The read-ending sequence is the longest segment, but total simulation time should finish in a few seconds to about thirty seconds.\n\nThe jam bot presses RELOAD once per frame. The mounted flag sets correctly on the first tick because the seat increments before primary input is held. In the panic step, begin() runs after simulate, so the fire tick executes before special actions. The exact tick ordering between update_bodies and fire.tick is being verified.\n\nThe panic step tick order is confirmed: simulate runs first, then advance_script calls begin() to ignite the fire. On the following tick, update_bodies detects the burning cell and starts the flee counter. The enemy flees at 4 m/s, so it clears the 3-meter threshold in about 0.75 seconds. The burn lasts 10 seconds.\n\nFor the animal step, the bot fires and the animal flees at 6 m/s. It needs to travel more than 8 meters, which takes roughly 1.3 seconds. The gun handler does not check whether the player is in a vehicle, so shots still increment.\n\nStealth requires the player to crouch within 2.2 meters of the soldier. The bot holds CROUCH, so stance stays at 1 and melee succeeds. Melee works even while mounted.\n\nFor the dart step, the bot aims at a soldier 18 meters away. Dart damage is zero, but the hit ID applies poison for three seconds before death. Spread is only 0.005 radians, so the shot must land.\n\nThe dart aim at 18 meters targets the torso, which has a radius of 0.28 meters, so the shot should land and apply poison.\n\nFor the tracer-ignite step, the bot fires forward from a low pitch while jammed; if the ground in front is already burned by earlier ignitions, ignite_at returns false and the flag never sets.\n\nThe tracer step can stall because the bot fires along its view, and if that ground is already burned it cannot be reignited for minutes. The fix is to aim at a fresh patch or an offset cell so the ignition succeeds.\n\nThe tracer step will use a fallback offset target 40 meters away from the depot fire. If the initial forward shot hits an already-burned cell, the bot will aim at that fresh patch instead. This avoids skipping the shot and keeps the script logic clean.\n\nThe tracer step fires every three shots with a 25% chance to ignite. The ray only hits bodies and walls, not the ground plane, so it cannot strike grass or fuel cells. If the depot area is already burned, the ignition never succeeds.\n\nThe tracer ray hits at maximum range along the view direction, not the ground plane. At 40 meters forward from the player, the target is likely fresh grass. Because the script fires four times per tick but the pistol cooldown blocks all except the first shot, only one bullet actually fires per tick. That yields roughly two and a half seconds to ignite the distant patch, which fits comfortably within the thirty-second budget.\n\nThe tracer step will aim east from the depot to avoid road and water. The bot will set yaw to π/2 so the forward ray strikes open grass instead of hitting fuel or obstacles.\n\nThe Ignite(10) script now sets pitch to -0.15 and yaw to π/2 so the tracer ray strikes open grass instead of road or water.\n\nA boat steering fix is needed in both geometry and bot code.\n\nThe Ceasefire flag will be cleared when a soldier dies during that step.\n\nThe companion dies at 40 meters away, so down_t increases every tick for 45 seconds.\n\nRoute blackout is confirmed: 60-second fever attack with zero pills.\n\nThe jam-clear bot test will use direct Gun calls rather than campaign ticks.\n\nA syrette unit test will set health to 40, hold heal for 1.5 seconds, and expect health to rise by 60.\n\nSmoke line-of-sight is not yet implemented, so tests will check exposure numbers without smoke unless the plan requires it. A Sim::new merc boot test will be added to games.rs. Fingerprint determinism and JSON roundtrip are required. Look.y is clamped to 1.15. Stick input maps yaw 0 with forward movement to decreasing z, and yaw π/2 with forward movement to increasing x.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-419a25a4-9648-4aea-adb7-003035386e18-102","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/lib.rs","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-419a25a4-9648-4aea-adb7-003035386e18-103","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub (struct|fn|use) Rng|pub mod rng","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1689,"output_tokens":3243,"cache_read_input_tokens":139264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"7a65aa4a-9648-40ae-a847-189b778a9397"}
