{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_119","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Next up are geometry fixes for water_ahead, world fixes, camera and audio tests, and mercenary tests.","signature":"FsPNhg6EJiYD6awMHN6MKI8wFb9r3ccFAZTx+bTdKYTZDCRB8Yw61BrjsQkYvAlUJ2Wp+qXNgyn1eaHxlEaNVnDyIcgGDmzRSs3H6TecnZ1qNWGf6/EgZ2bcAN1ZlisH+QEpnQoiK28AwaUB2aURMfVZqaHnJQ1g02B/u53EduH8OSDZpPq/b1ExpKErW5/htA"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-97207f23-a554-470e-9bf3-06416ff7f912-108","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs","old_string":"pub fn nearest_water(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {","new_string":"/// A point `metres` further along the channel from the closest point on the centre line.\npub fn water_ahead(x: f32, z: f32, metres: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\n    let mut best_i = 0usize;\n    let mut best_t = 0.0f32;\n    let mut best_d = f32::MAX;\n    for (i, w) in RIVER.windows(2).enumerate() {\n        let abx = w[1].0 - w[0].0;\n        let abz = w[1].1 - w[0].1;\n        let len2 = abx * abx + abz * abz;\n        let t = if len2 < 1e-4 { 0.0 } else { (((x - w[0].0) * abx + (z - w[0].1) * abz) / len2).clamp(0.0, 1.0) };\n        let px = w[0].0 + abx * t;\n        let pz = w[0].1 + abz * t;\n        let d = dist(x, z, px, pz);\n        if d < best_d {\n            best_d = d;\n            best_i = i;\n            best_t = t;\n        }\n    }\n    let mut i = best_i;\n    let mut t = best_t;\n    let mut left = metres.abs();\n    let forward = metres >= 0.0;\n    if !forward {\n        // Walk back toward the upstream end of the polyline.\n        while left > 0.0 {\n            let (ax, az) = RIVER[i];\n            let (bx, bz) = RIVER[i + 1];\n            let abx = bx - ax;\n            let abz = bz - az;\n            let len = (abx * abx + abz * abz).sqrt().max(0.001);\n            let back = t * len;\n            if left <= back {\n                let u = t - left / len;\n                return (ax + abx * u, az + abz * u);\n            }\n            left -= back;\n            if i == 0 {\n                return RIVER[0];\n            }\n            i -= 1;\n            t = 1.0;\n        }\n    }\n    while left > 0.0 && i + 1 < RIVER.len() {\n        let (ax, az) = RIVER[i];\n        let (bx, bz) = RIVER[i + 1];\n        let abx = bx - ax;\n        let abz = bz - az;\n        let len = (abx * abx + abz * abz).sqrt().max(0.001);\n        let remain = (1.0 - t) * len;\n        if left <= remain {\n            let u = t + left / len;\n            return (ax + abx * u, az + abz * u);\n        }\n        left -= remain;\n        i += 1;\n        t = 0.0;\n        if i + 1 >= RIVER.len() {\n            return RIVER[RIVER.len() - 1];\n        }\n    }\n    RIVER[best_i]\n}\n\npub fn nearest_water(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-97207f23-a554-470e-9bf3-06416ff7f912-109","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Boat => return self.bot_drive(self.x + 30.0, self.z),","new_string":"            Spec::Boat => {\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::water_ahead(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 50.0);\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-97207f23-a554-470e-9bf3-06416ff7f912-110","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"                self.bodies[i].hp -= dmg;\n                if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\n                   