{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_124","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"CameraData might be in another file.\n\nWriting unit tests for the camera. Checking that yaw-zero looks north and up points up. Verifying default near and far distances. Building a CameraRig with an FpCam.\n\nFixed the forward vector assertion in the camera test. Will write a thorough but non-duplicative test file covering audio and soldier helpers. Coverage flags will be checked against a constant list. Playthroughs will run two seeds across three routes to satisfy all contract requirements.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b4a2f6bf-60ac-4b81-9595-40bc83a10b56-120","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub use","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/lib.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b4a2f6bf-60ac-4b81-9595-40bc83a10b56-121","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_view/src/camera.rs","old_string":"    pub fn view_proj(&self, aspect: f32) -> Mat4 {\n        let d = self.data(aspect);\n        d.proj * d.view\n    }\n}","new_string":"    pub fn view_proj(&self, aspect: f32) -> Mat4 {\n        let d = self.data(aspect);\n        d.proj * d.view\n    }\n}\n\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn first_person_yaw_zero_faces_north() {\n        let (forward, _, _) = fp_basis(0.0, 0.0, 0.0);\n        assert!(forward.z < -0.9, \"{forward:?}\");\n        assert!(forward.x.abs() < 0.05 && forward.y.abs() < 0.05, \"{forward:?}\");\n        let (up_look, _, _) = fp_basis(0.0, 0.5, 0.0);\n        assert!(up_look.y > 0.4, \"{up_look:?}\");\n        let cam = FpCam::default();\n        assert!((cam.near - 0.08).abs() < 1e-5);\n        assert!((cam.far - 3000.0).abs() < 1.0);\n        let mut rig = CameraRig::default();\n        rig.fp = Some(cam);\n        assert!(rig.forward().z < -0.9);\n    }\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":239,"output_tokens":957,"cache_read_input_tokens":159616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"7c143909-1a53-4aa6-aada-d24a682de9f9"}
