{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_133","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Set the fever warning threshold to the interval minus zero.\n\nSetting the initial fever timer to the full interval plus one tick will trigger the warning.\n\nThe attract loop count is 2 instead of the expected 5. The timer should reach 800 seconds and yield 5 loops, so something may be resetting the attract state.\n\nThe simulation clamps dt to 0.5 seconds, so 800 ticks only advance 400 seconds and produce 2 attract loops instead of 5. The test should use dt=0.5 for menu timing.\n\nThe test will accumulate time in a loop until 800 seconds elapse, using small dt steps to respect the simulation clamp.\n\nThe attract test now uses 1600 ticks of 0.5 seconds to reach 800 seconds and five loops.\n\nFire speed 8 crossed the road at z=-420 despite no ember generation. The downwind vector points toward the road, so the fire should have stayed on the north side.\n\nThe fire crossed the road because the test assertion misinterprets the road's z-range. The road spans z from -424 to -416, so cells past the north edge are at z < -424. The current check uses z < -416, which incorrectly flags cells that have not actually crossed.\n\nThe fire crossed the road because the test assertion includes the ignition cell itself. The fire started at z=-440, which is north of the road band and satisfies z < -416, so the crossed flag becomes true immediately.\n\nThe fire test will be repositioned to start south of the road at z = -400. Wind will blow north toward the road, and the assertion will check that no cell crosses into the north band.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-def753bd-b23d-4172-84bf-39f3c57e898e-134","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","old_string":"    w.fever_t = w.tune.fever_interval - 0.05;\n    w.tick(&InputFrame::default(), DT);","new_string":"    w.fever_t = w.tune.fever_interval;\n    w.tick(&InputFrame::default(), DT);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-def753bd-b23d-4172-84bf-39f3c57e898e-135","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","old_string":"    let mut blocked = FireMap::default();\n    let south = (200.0f32, -440.0f32);\n    assert!(!geom::on_road(south.0, south.1));\n    blocked.ignite_at(south.0, south.1, 20.0, 0.0);\n    let mut rng = Rng::new(4);\n    for _ in 0..30 {\n        blocked.tick(1.0, pav_core::glam::Vec2::new(0.0, -8.0), 0.9, 20.0, 0.0, false, &mut rng);\n    }\n    let crossed = blocked.cells.keys().any(|c| {\n        let (x, z) = geom::cell_center(*c);\n        z < -416.0 && (z + 420.0).abs() > 4.0 && x > 180.0 && x < 220.0\n    });\n    assert!(!crossed, \"speed 8 does not jump the road\");\n\n    let mut ember = FireMap::default();\n    ember.ignite_at(south.0, south.1, 20.0, 0.0);\n    let mut rng = Rng::new(5);\n    for _ in 0..20 {\n        ember.tick(1.0, pav_core::glam::Vec2::new(0.0, -12.0), 0.9, 20.0, 0.0, false, &mut rng);\n    }\n    let hopped = ember.cells.keys().any(|c| geom::cell_center(*c).1 < -410.0);\n    assert!(hopped, \"wind above 8 can throw an ember across the road\");","new_string":"    let mut blocked = FireMap::default();\n    // South of the flats road. Wind blows north, into the road, at exactly 8 m/s.\n    let south = (200.0f32, -400.0f32);\n    assert!(!geom::on_road(south.0, south.1));\n    blocked.ignite_at(south.0, south.1, 20.0, 0.0);\n    let mut rng = Rng::new(4);\n    for _ in 0..30 {\n        blocked.tick(1.0, pav_core::glam::Vec2::new(0.0, -8.0), 0.9, 20.0, 0.0, false, &mut rng);\n    }\n    let crossed = blocked.cells.keys().any(|c| {\n        let (x, z) = geom::cell_center(*c);\n        z < -424.5 && x > 180.0 && x < 220.0\n    });\n    assert!(!crossed, \"speed 8 does not jump the road\");\n\n    let mut ember = FireMap::default();\n    ember.ignite_at(south.0, south.1, 20.0, 0.0);\n    let mut rng = Rng::new(5);\n    for _ in 0..20 {\n        ember.tick(1.0, pav_core::glam::Vec2::new(0.0, -12.0), 0.9, 20.0, 0.0, false, &mut rng);\n    }\n    let hopped = ember.cells.keys().any(|c| {\n        let (x, z) = geom::cell_center(*c);\n        z < -424.5 && x > 180.0 && x < 220.0\n    });\n    assert!(hopped, \"wind above 8 can throw an ember across the road\");"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-def753bd-b23d-4172-84bf-39f3c57e898e-136","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","old_string":"    w.ride.health = 100.0;\n    w.ride.stage = 0;\n    w.hurt_vehicle(50.0);\n    assert!(w.ride.stage >= 1, \"stage {}\", w.ride.stage);\n    w.hurt_vehicle(80.0);\n    assert_eq!(w.ride.stage, 3);\n    run(&mut w, &drive, 9.0);\n    assert!(w.flags.contains(\"ignite_vehicle\") || w.ride.stage == 4);","new_string":"    w.ride.health = 100.0;\n    w.ride.stage = 0;\n    w.hurt_vehicle(50.0);\n    assert!(w.ride.stage >= 1, \"stage {}\", w.ride.stage);\n    w.hurt_vehicle(40.0);\n    assert_eq!(w.ride.stage, 3, \"health {}\", w.ride.health);\n    run(&mut w, &drive, 9.0);\n    assert!(w.flags.contains(\"ignite_vehicle\") || w.ride.stage == 4);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-def753bd-b23d-4172-84bf-39f3c57e898e-137","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","old_string":"    let saves = w.saves_written;\n    for _ in 0..800 {\n        w.tick(&InputFrame::default(), 1.0);\n    }","new_string":"    let saves 