s:\\n\\nfailures:\\n    bot_plays_all_three_endings\\n\\ntest result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 15 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\\n\\nerror: test failed, to rerun pass `-p pav_core --test merc`\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91%2Fwork/01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558/terminal/call-489f8071-954d-4ef6-a961-86eb4fac800e-148.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":12878}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"983cf033-c6d0-4498-b6b4-9cfeae68dfb9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_145","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The playthrough reached the syrette quickly. The zero time value is due to a small t when the goal changes.\n\nThe stuck message printed after 30 seconds, but the eprintln only fires when the goal changes. The code shows the transition at t=0 and then panics on syrette, so the stuck timer likely accumulated while the goal remained unchanged.\n\nOnly one transition line appears before the panic. The goal likely changed from boot to map at t=0, but no further changes were logged. This suggests stdout buffering or a rapid sequence may have suppressed the remaining output.\n\nThe `goal != before` guard explains the single logged transition. After boot completes and sets goal to map, every subsequent tick updates goal to match `before`, so the condition is false and no further eprintln fires.\n\nThe eprintln guard is inverted. It should print whenever `now != before`, not only when `goal != before`. The stuck state at syrette is genuine: the robot is roughly 10 meters away from the target, but the task does not require position.\n\nThe Syrette task requires holding HEAL while HP is between 20 and 100. The bot holds HEAL continuously. After wounds the HP drops to 40 and syrettes remain at three. The heal logic should trigger. The suspicion is that HP may have already reached 100 before the wound was applied.\n\nThe position at 162, 476 is near SH1. The robot has already reached the shop and completed Claim, Shop, Locker, and is now stuck on Syrette.\n\nThe likely cause of the stuck state is that Claim sets HP to 100. If HP is already 100 when the wound lands, the heal logic sees no need to trigger because the target is already full.\n\nThe fix is to set HP to 40 at the start of the Syrette step if it is already full. This mirrors the Wound step and ensures the heal animation triggers.\n\nThe Syrette step now explicitly drops HP to 40 if it is above 80, and ensures at least one syrette is available. I am also auditing the remaining steps for similar done-condition bugs before re-running the full test.\n\nAll prior steps passed successfully. Combat resolved quickly.\n\nThe Syrette fix is confirmed. The Tracker step requires walking roughly 85 meters from the shop to cache 90 and 500. At sprint speed this fits within the 30-second budget. The Sleep step follows Claim.\n\nThe return walk from the cache to the safe house is roughly 85 meters and fits within the 40-second sleep budget. The depot drive covers about 1207 meters at speed 16, taking approximately 75 seconds plus turning, which is acceptable. The remaining steps are Ignite fuel, Tracer yaw, Tanks to 500 disks, Mounted seat cycle with primary, and Panic with animals.\n\nThe Bus step covers 540 meters to the junction in 34 seconds, well within its 90-second budget. Driving to SH2 is roughly 400 meters and takes about 25 seconds, fitting the 140-second budget. Sleep at SH2 requires cycling the seat to zero and interacting. The Night step is instant. Boat travel snaps to water and drives along the channel for 160 seconds. Stealth and dart follow. Repair begins with the boat at kind 2, seat 0, and 35 health, requiring an interaction if the player is within five meters.\n\nRepair is confirmed to work at boat position without requiring kind 1. Rain ignition and weather 1 are set in the same begin tick, but the extinguish flag is only checked on the next fire tick, so the done condition works correctly. The remaining steps—Better, Patch/Overdose/Die, Tape hold 1.5s, and Ceasefire with kill marking—are also verified as correct.\n\nConvoy RPG damage is sufficient to kill the truck in one hit. The Town step is instant. The cement drive from SH2 to -760, 620 covers roughly 1411 meters and takes about 88 seconds, which fits within the 140-second budget.\n\nThe tracker budget will be raised to 50 seconds to avoid a flaky stall. Every goal change will be printed so the log is useful. The bot will not panic until the actual issue is seen.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37ba990e-d8ce-4166-9e0a-579c20687271-150","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Shop => {","new_string":"            Spec::Syrette => {\n                if self.hp > 70.0 {\n                    self.hp = 45.0;\n                }\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(1);\n            }\n            Spec::Shop => {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37ba990e-d8ce-4166-9e0a-579c20687271-151","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) => 40.0,","new_string":"            Some(Spec::Sleep { .. }) | Some(Spec::Tracker) => 50.0,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37ba990e-d8ce-4166-9e0a-579c20687271-152","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","old_string":"        if now != before {\n            if goal != before {\n                eprintln!(\"{route:?} seed {seed}: {before} -> {now} at ({:.0},{:.0}) t={t:.0}\", w.x, w.z);\n            }\n            goal = now;\n            stuck = 0.0;\n        } else {","new_string":"        if now != before {\n            eprintln!(\"{route:?} seed {seed}: {before} -> {now} at ({:.0},{:.0}) t={t:.0}\", w.x, w.z);\n            goal = now;\n            stuck = 0.0;\n        } else {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4856,"output_tokens":3164