{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_147","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Drafting a Rust script for ignite2 flamer.\n\nIgnite2 fails because the target cell is already burning from the rocket disk. Ignite0 and ignite1 succeeded at different coordinates.\n\nThe fix is to offset each ignite index by 20 meters in x so every weapon lights fresh ground. The player and depot are far from the road, so these offsets avoid overlap and stay on valid terrain.\n\nThe 14-meter spacing is too tight because a rocket disk radius of 6 covers 12 meters. The tracer weapon uses shots rather than the offset logic, so it falls through to the pull loop and can miss if its impact point was already burned by earlier ignites.\n\nScripted ignites will be placed to the west of the player, and tracers will shoot east. This keeps the two paths away from each other. The westward offset lands on grass in the depot area, not on the road. Mortar disk radii of 8 meters leave a 2-meter gap between centers spaced 18 meters apart, so they will not overlap.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5bb02e25-01db-4047-a170-fee4a694a460-154","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\n        let x = self.x + 2.0;\n        let z = self.z + 2.0;","new_string":"    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\n        // Each source lights a fresh patch west of the player. East stays clear for tracers.\n        let n = match spec {\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => k as f32,\n            _ => 0.0,\n        };\n        let x = self.x - 24.0 - n * 18.0;\n        let z = self.z - 16.0;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1530,"output_tokens":1067,"cache_read_input_tokens":202496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"fa94e851-58f6-4cd5-832c-2e8903ffc79c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5bb02e25-01db-4047-a170-fee4a694a460-154","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\\n        let x = self.x + 2.0;\\n        let z = self.z + 2.0;\",\"new_string\":\"    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\\n        // Each source lights a fresh patch west of the player. East stays clear for tracers.\\n        let n = match spec {\\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => k as f32,\\n            _ => 0.0,\\n        };\\n        let x = self.x - 24.0 - n * 18.0;\\n        let z = self.z - 16.0;\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\\n        let x = self.x + 2.0;\\n        let z = self.z + 2.0;\",\"old_line\":1811,\"new_string\":\"    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\\n        // Each source lights a fresh patch west of the player. East stays clear for tracers.\\n        let n = match spec {\\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => k as f32,\\n            _ => 0.0,\\n        };\\n        let x = self.x - 24.0 - n * 18.0;\\n        let z = self.z - 16.0;\",\"new_line\":1811,\"context_before\":\"        }\\n    }\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"        match spec {\\n            Spec::Ignite(0) => {\\n                if self.fire.ignite_at(x, z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"32779eab-64d3-4b6b-b337-8a72a1ac9e05"}
