{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_153","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Running the test now. The tracer might fail because the script overwrites yaw after handle_gun.\n\nTracer yaw overwrite is confirmed. The bot ignores input and forces east. A surviving soldier might block the tracer. The gun ID or shot_n condition could also cause failure.\n\nThe tracer fires roughly 7,200 shots over 30 seconds. Only about 8% of them attempt to ignite. The pitch and range will determine whether the hit lands on already-burned ground from a prior Ignite(7). I am checking weapon ranges before launching.\n\nThe full campaign should finish in about one to ten seconds. The fire spread loop will iterate roughly four million cells across the campaign, which is acceptable.\n\nThe fire spread probability with wind speed 9 could reach roughly 2.2 per tick, far above the 1.0 cap. This might burn the entire map. The campaign could then fill one million cells and become extremely slow.\n\nThe BTreeMap of one million cells could become very slow if fire spreads across the entire map. Burned cells remain tracked for 2,880 minutes even after flames die, which risks memory exhaustion. I will start the test with a 180-second timeout and tee output to play2.log.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Other cargo jobs are in sibling folders, so this test can use this engine’s target directory. Running the three-ending playthrough next."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bf68d548-3ad1-46a8-bba6-b2a0ae03eaba-12","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine\" && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=12 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/target\" cargo test -p pav_core --test merc --offline bot_plays_all_three_endings -- --nocapture --test-threads=1 > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/play2.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/play2.log\"","description":"Re-run three-ending bot playthrough","block_until_ms":180000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":56691,"output_tokens":1380,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"72431ed1-71a9-4933-9b75-a1e75a147bc4"}
