{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_157","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tick order is: update_bodies, fire, then special_actions and script_ignite.\n\nadvance_script runs after simulate. The soldier spawns and ignites on the next tick. The soldier is outside the vehicle's 5-meter ignition radius, so ignite_at likely failed due to zero fuel or an already-burnt cell.\n\nThe soldier is far enough from the tank to have a fresh grass cell, so ignite_at should succeed. The flee threshold of 3 requires only about 0.75 seconds at 1/60 dt, so the test budget of 30 seconds should easily allow it. The panic likely fails because the soldier dies or moves off the burning cell before the flee timer accumulates.\n\nThe soldier runs off the burning cell in 0.5 seconds. Flee accumulates only while on that cell, so it reaches 2.0 and never exceeds 3. The fix is to ignite a disk or strip under the soldier so they remain inside the fire longer.\n\nThe soldier at +4, -4 likely sits outside the tank farm's existing fires, which start at z-20. Igniting a patch of fire directly under or ahead of the soldier would let them run through it for several seconds and accumulate enough flee to trigger the panic flag.\n\nThe soldier at (+4, -4) is only 5.66 meters from the tank at (player.x, player.z). That distance falls inside the tank's 6-meter fire radius. The soldier likely sits on an already-burned cell. Ignite_at therefore fails because the cell is not fresh grass.\n\nThe soldier might already be inside the tank fire. If so, the panic flag should trigger once flee exceeds 3. The suspicion now shifts to two other causes: fire damage killing the soldier before the timer finishes, or a `morale_broken` check running before the fire check and causing a separate flee behavior.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d616c864-d8f7-4cdf-8fea-439e646ac9a5-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn clear_bodies","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","-A":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d616c864-d8f7-4cdf-8fea-439e646ac9a5-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"enemy_panicked|flee","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2447,"output_tokens":1407,"cache_read_input_tokens":69888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"a98d1c96-a551-4e1e-b319-cc0f4dff7fe9"}
