{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_158","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The clear_bodies function empties the vector, leaving only one soldier.\n\nMorale is not broken. The soldier flees only while standing on a burning cell, but the flee value never exceeds 3. The cell might not be burning at all. The fire timer should last long enough, so the cause is likely either a failed ignite_at or the soldier being killed by the player's bot.\n\nThe panic bot fires every tick. The soldier dies before reaching flee 3. The fix is to stop the bot from shooting and instead ignite a wide strip of fire so the soldier can survive and flee.\n\nThe fix is to spawn the soldier and light a strip of fire downwind in begin(Panic). Eight 3-meter disks will keep the runner burning while it flees.\n\nThe panic bot should be silenced entirely. The animals bot should keep shooting so the animal flees from gunshots.\n\nAnimals spawn at +6,-6 and flee when distance is under 40 meters and their first gun has shots. Earlier campaign data may already give them shots, so they could flee immediately. At 6 m/s they travel about 16 meters in roughly 1.33 seconds, still inside the 40-meter range.\n\nThe player bot may kill the animal before it can flee. In update_bodies, the dead check runs before the animal flee logic, so a shot that kills the animal prevents it from ever escaping. The animal's health and the exact timing of the shot need to be checked.\n\nThe animal bot should also stop shooting. Its first gun already has shots from earlier campaign data, so the animal flees without a fresh kill. I will check spawn_animal to confirm the animal can survive the existing fire and the scripted panic fire.\n\nMounted passed. I will fix only the panic bot now and rerun to find the next real failure, since the test is fast and compilation is cheap. I may also patch other mechanics if they fail in the same way.\n\nThe soldier spawns at +4,-4, which may already be inside a tank fire disk. The scripted corridor of fire keeps the runner burning long enough for flee to exceed 3.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-485472aa-08bc-4575-a394-69059b3a0dee-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"burn","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-485472aa-08bc-4575-a394-69059b3a0dee-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn spawn_animal|kind == 3|mounted_gun|boat_dist|dart","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1898,"output_tokens":1533,"cache_read_input_tokens":72320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"c43571c9-e7ba-48cb-a0dc-fcb955f40ba2"}
