{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_159","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The fire check only accumulates flee while standing on a burning cell.\n\nThe soldier moves at 4 m/s and flees after 3 meters. I'll light a fire strip along +x to keep the runner in flames for about 3 seconds. The panic bot's automatic shooting will be disabled so it doesn't kill the soldier first.\n\nFire does not damage bodies. Only gunshots kill them. The soldier runs into tank fire to the east, so the existing fire may already keep them in flames.\n\nThe soldier starts at player.x+4, player.z-4 and moves only along +x. The tank fire disk at that z-level barely covers the soldier's starting position. They exit after about 0.5 meters of burning. Flee accumulates to roughly 2.0. That is not enough to trigger flee.\n\nThe fire strip will run from player.x+4 to player.x+20 along z = player.z-4. The panic bot fires before bodies update, so the soldier dies on tick one and flee never accumulates. Disabling the bot's shooting is the correct fix; raising soldier health is unnecessary.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f36ec704-22c5-414c-8ffd-9c1db17b61f7-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1288,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f36ec704-22c5-414c-8ffd-9c1db17b61f7-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2035,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f36ec704-22c5-414c-8ffd-9c1db17b61f7-24","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"WeaponId::","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/gun.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3260,"output_tokens":1199,"cache_read_input_tokens":74112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"e4825155-5301-41c8-a71d-e2dc20a1d2c0"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f36ec704-22c5-414c-8ffd-9c1db17b61f7-22","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1288→                    self.ride.stage = 1;\\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n1290→                    self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"repair_done\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let steer = input.axes.x;\\n        self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + steer * dt * 1.6);\\n        let mut max_s = 16.0 * self.tune.vehicle_speed;\\n        if self.ride.stage == 2 {\\n1300→            max_s *= 0.6;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage >= 3 {\\n            max_s *= 0.2;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && !geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            max_s = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        let throttle = input.axes.y;\\n        self.ride.speed += (throttle.clamp(-0.4, 1.0) * max_s - self.ride.speed) * (dt * 2.5).min(1.0);\\n1310→        let (sy, cy) = self.ride.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let before = (self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x += sy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        self.ride.z += -cy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x = x;\\n        self.ride.z = z;\\n        self.ride.dist += geom::dist(before.0, before.1, self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h = geom::height(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h2 = geom::height(self.ride.x + sy * 2.0, self.ride.z - cy * 2.0);\\n1320→        self.ride.pitch = (h2 - h).atan();\\n        if self.ride.roll.abs() > 0.02 {\\n            self.ride.roll *= (1.0 - dt * 3.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        }\\n        self.x = self.ride.x;\\n        self.z = self.ride.z;\\n        if self.ride.kind == 1 && self.ride.dist > 20.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"technical_driven\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && self.ride.dist > 15.0 && geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n1330→            self.mark(\\\"boat_driven\\\");\\n            self.boat_dist = self.ride.dist;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.seat == 2 && input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"mounted_gun\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage == 3 {\\n            self.ride.fuse -= dt;\\n            if self.ride.fuse <= 0.0 {\\n                self.ride.stage = 4;\\n1340→                self.ride.health = 0.0;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.npc {\\n            let points = [(0.0, 800.0), (0.0, 400.0), (0.0, 0.0), (0.0, -400.0)];\\n            let target = points[self.ride.npc_i % points.len()];\\n            if geom::dist(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1) < 8.0 {\\n                self.ride.npc_i += 1;\\n1350→            }\\n            let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1);\\n            let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n            self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0) * dt * 2.0);\\n            self.ride.speed = 10.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn hurt_vehicle(&mut self, dmg: f32) {\\n        if self.ride.kind == 0 || self.ride.stage == 4 {\\n1360→            return;\\n        }\\n        self.ride.health -= dmg / self.tune.vehicle_tough.max(0.2);\\n        if self.ride.health > 70.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 0;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 40.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 1;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 15.0 {\",\"content_concise\":\"1288→                    self.ride.stage = 1;\\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n1290→                    self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"repair_done\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let steer = input.axes.x;\\n        self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + steer * dt * 1.6);\\n        let mut max_s = 16.0 * self.tune.vehicle_speed;\\n        if self.ride.stage == 2 {\\n1300→            max_s *= 0.6;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage >= 3 {\\n            max_s *= 0.2;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && !geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            max_s = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        let throttle = input.axes.y;\\n        self.ride.speed += (throttle.clamp(-0.4, 1.0) * max_s - self.ride.speed) * (dt * 2.5).min(1.0);\\n1310→        let (sy, cy) = self.ride.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let before = (self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x += sy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        self.ride.z += -cy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x = x;\\n        self.ride.z = z;\\n        self.ride.dist += geom::dist(before.0, before.1, self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h = geom::height(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h2 = geom::height(self.ride.x + sy * 2.0, self.ride.z - cy * 2.0);\\n1320→        self.ride.pitch = (h2 - h).atan();\\n        if self.ride.roll.abs() > 0.02 {\\n            self.ride.roll *= (1.0 - dt * 3.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        }\\n        self.x = self.ride.x;\\n        self.z = self.ride.z;\\n        if self.ride.kind == 1 && self.ride.dist > 20.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"technical_driven\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && self.ride.dist > 15.0 && geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n1330→            self.mark(\\\"boat_driven\\\");\\n            self.boat_dist = self.ride.dist;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.seat == 2 && input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"mounted_gun\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage == 3 {\\n            self.ride.fuse -= dt;\\n            if self.ride.fuse <= 0.0 {\\n                self.ride.stage = 4;\\n1340→                self.ride.health = 0.0;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.npc {\\n            let points = [(0.0, 800.0), (0.0, 400.0), (0.0, 0.0), (0.0, -400.0)];\\n            let target = points[self.ride.npc_i % points.len()];\\n            if geom::dist(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1) < 8.0 {\\n                self.ride.npc_i += 1;\\n1350→            }\\n            let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1);\\n            let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n            self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0) * dt * 2.0);\\n            self.ride.speed = 10.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn hurt_vehicle(&mut self, dmg: f32) {\\n        if self.ride.kind == 0 || self.ride.stage == 4 {\\n1360→            return;\\n        }\\n        self.ride.health -= dmg / self.tune.vehicle_tough.max(0.2);\\n        if self.ride.health > 70.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 0;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 40.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 1;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 15.0 {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"offset\":1288,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"                    self.ride.stage = 1;\\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n                    self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"repair_done\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let steer = input.axes.x;\\n        self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + steer * dt * 1.6);\\n        let mut max_s = 16.0 * self.tune.vehicle_speed;\\n        if self.ride.stage == 2 {\\n            max_s *= 0.6;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage >= 3 {\\n            max_s *= 0.2;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && !geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            max_s = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        let throttle = input.axes.y;\\n        self.ride.speed += (throttle.clamp(-0.4, 1.0) * max_s - self.ride.speed) * (dt * 2.5).min(1.0);\\n        let (sy, cy) = self.ride.yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let before = (self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x += sy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        self.ride.z += -cy * self.ride.speed * dt;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::clamp_map(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        self.ride.x = x;\\n        self.ride.z = z;\\n        self.ride.dist += geom::dist(before.0, before.1, self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h = geom::height(self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n        let h2 = geom::height(self.ride.x + sy * 2.0, self.ride.z - cy * 2.0);\\n        self.ride.pitch = (h2 - h).atan();\\n        if self.ride.roll.abs() > 0.02 {\\n            self.ride.roll *= (1.0 - dt * 3.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        }\\n        self.x = self.ride.x;\\n        self.z = self.ride.z;\\n        if self.ride.kind == 1 && self.ride.dist > 20.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"technical_driven\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.kind == 2 && self.ride.dist > 15.0 && geom::deep_water(self.ride.x, self.ride.z) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"boat_driven\\\");\\n            self.boat_dist = self.ride.dist;\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.seat == 2 && input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) {\\n            self.mark(\\\"mounted_gun\\\");\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.stage == 3 {\\n            self.ride.fuse -= dt;\\n            if self.ride.fuse <= 0.0 {\\n                self.ride.stage = 4;\\n                self.ride.health = 0.0;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.ride.npc {\\n            let points = [(0.0, 800.0), (0.0, 400.0), (0.0, 0.0), (0.0, -400.0)];\\n            let target = points[self.ride.npc_i % points.len()];\\n            if geom::dist(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1) < 8.0 {\\n                self.ride.npc_i += 1;\\n            }\\n            let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, target.0, target.1);\\n            let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n            self.ride.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.ride.yaw + err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0) * dt * 2.0);\\n            self.ride.speed = 10.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn hurt_vehicle(&mut self, dmg: f32) {\\n        if self.ride.kind == 0 || self.ride.stage == 4 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.ride.health -= dmg / self.tune.vehicle_tough.max(0.2);\\n        if self.ride.health > 70.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 0;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 40.0 {\\n            self.ride.stage = 1;\\n        } else if self.ride.health > 15.0 {\\n\",\"total_lines\":2332}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f36ec704-22c5-414c-8ffd-9c1db17b61f7-23","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"2035→            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n2040→    }\\n\\n    fn spawn_animal(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {\\n            kind: 3,\\n            x,\\n            z,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            hp: 20.0,\\n            alive: true,\\n2050→            alert: 0,\\n            gun: Gun::new(WeaponId::Pistol),\\n            see: 0.0,\\n            poison: 0.0,\\n            burn: 0.0,\\n            doomed: false,\\n            flee: 0.0,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n2060→    fn spawn_truck(&mut self, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n        self.bodies.push(Body {