{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_161","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Applying the panic fix. Checking melee stealth distance requirements in special_actions.\n\nSoldier spawn distance is correct. Removing panic bot shooting to prevent friendly fire. Checking water_ahead and boat risks. Fire strip burn duration and flee threshold look good.\n\nRealized the tank fire likely overlaps the soldier's fire strip. The tank's burn radius reaches the strip's starting position. This explains why flee never accumulated.\n\nThe panic bot kills the soldier before flee can accumulate. The soldier spawns after simulation, so no update runs that tick. On the next tick, the bot fires primary and kills the soldier instantly. The equipped weapon slot is unchanged by the mounted action.\n\nThe panic bot's equipped weapon slot is still uncertain. It may be the original pistol, an SMG, or a battle rifle depending on prior actions. The soldier has 40 HP and the bot fires roughly every 0.4 seconds. That is faster than the 0.75 second flee window. A headshot multiplier could kill the soldier in one shot.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Ignites, tanks, and the mounted gun all completed. The panic step fails because the soldier sprints off a single burning cell, and the bot shoots them before the sprint counts. I’ll light a strip along their run and stop the bot from killing them."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6fcc7e9a-29d9-4db6-9a62-8ddd13215b7e-26","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Panic => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, 40.0, false);\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 4.0, self.z - 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n            }","new_string":"            Spec::Panic => {\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                let sx = self.x + 4.0;\n                let sz = self.z - 4.0;\n                self.spawn_soldier(sx, sz, 40.0, false);\n                // Runners sprint +x. One 2 m cell ends before flee passes 3.\n                for i in 0..6 {\n                    let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(sx + i as f32 * 4.0, sz, 3.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                }\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6fcc7e9a-29d9-4db6-9a62-8ddd13215b7e-27","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Panic | Spec::Animals => {\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\n            }","new_string":"            Spec::Animals => {\n                // A shot already happened. Firing again drops the herd before it clears the grass.\n                f.held = buttons::SECONDARY;\n            }\n            Spec::Panic => {}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2732,"output_tokens":1335,"cache_read_input_tokens":80000,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"bc3fef62-3a24-44a1-aba6-4e614b5b8a32"}
