{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_162","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Animals flee only if the first gun has shots remaining.\n\nAnimals flee at 6 m/s until distance exceeds 8 m. The initial distance is roughly 8.5 m, so after about 1.33 s the animal should still be within range. The check requires shots on the first gun; since the pistol remains in that slot and was fired earlier, it should have ammunition.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f34cc615-6c5d-4aac-b3b3-91e7d21267aa-28","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine\" && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=12 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/target\" cargo test -p pav_core --test merc --offline bot_plays_all_three_endings -- --nocapture --test-threads=1 > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/play3.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/play3.log\"","description":"Re-run playthrough after panic fix","block_until_ms":180000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1568,"output_tokens":545,"cache_read_input_tokens":82688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"1d5ad023-1389-46cf-b22d-cca360dd3ce7"}
