{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_164","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All requested tasks passed instantly.\n\nThe rain task is stuck. The weather flag is set too late in the simulation cycle, so the fire never ignites.\n\nThe rain task should pass on the next tick once the weather flag is set. The 30-second failure likely means ignite_at failed or the cell was not burning when rain struck.\n\nThe log shows the bot arrived at the lodge (-251, -692) and then immediately took a boat to (-200, -40). This suggests the boat is not at the nearest water. The fire may be igniting in the wrong location.\n\nThe boat task teleports the bot to the nearest water point. The lodge is at (-260, -700), but the boat starts at (-200, -40). This suggests the nearest water calculation is returning an incorrect location.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2aed8b5a-44bc-455b-a37d-255689a7be3c-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn nearest_water|fn on_water|fn deep_water|fn water_ahead|RIVER|polyline","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1543,"output_tokens":931,"cache_read_input_tokens":84736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"18c316d6-0067-41ea-89b6-770a17a00291"}
