{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_168","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`doomed_enough` always returns false.\n\nOverdose and patch both route through patch_or_dose. The dead-code comment checking doomed_enough is harmless because that function always returns false. The real path is patch_or_dose. Rain fixes are applied. Ceasefire try_interact is left unchanged. Newly ignited cells remain burning on the next tick.\n\nChecking whether a cell at r=14 could be blocked from re-igniting by an old burnt_until timestamp. Depot fires are far away, so this is unlikely. Road coordinates near x=0 are fine. Spec::Rain and Spec::Better will be updated. Better may stall immediately after rain plus flag because the flag steps auto-complete in begin and done checks the flag in the same advance loop.\n\nBetter will be fixed to down companions immediately in its begin method. This prevents the same-tick stall that blocks Patch. Patch also downs companions, so the overlap is safe.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe05a187-59c2-4a5f-ab73-c36963cfde25-35","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Rain => {\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + 3.0, self.z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                self.weather = 1;\n            }","new_string":"            Spec::Rain => {\n                // The boat step leaves you on the channel. Rain has to quench grass, not water.\n                let mut lit = false;\n                for r in [16.0, 22.0, 30.0, 40.0] {\n                    for (dx, dz) in [(r, 0.0), (-r, 0.0), (0.0, r), (0.0, -r)] {\n                        if self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + dx, self.z + dz, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                            lit = true;\n                            break;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if lit {\n                        break;\n                    }\n                }\n                self.weather = 1;\n            }\n            Spec::Better => {\n                self.mark(\"better_way\");\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\n                    c.down = true;\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\n                    c.x = self.x + 1.5;\n                    c.z = self.z;\n                }\n            }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1081,"output_tokens":958,"cache_read_input_tokens":93184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"a27b4621-97d3-4676-bad7-4cf5fc9c03e3"}
