{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-48297fb3-2c22-4205-83eb-ea3f83356182-37","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1758→\\n    fn special_actions(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n1760→        let near_cache = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1);\\n        if near_cache < 4.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cache_tracker\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            self.hold_t += dt;\\n        } else {\\n            self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || (input.down(buttons::INTERACT) && self.hold_t > 0.4) {\\n1770→            self.try_interact();\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::MELEE) {\\n            let crouched = self.stance == 1;\\n            let px = self.x;\\n            let pz = self.z;\\n            let mut stealth = false;\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 1 && geom::dist(px, pz, b.x, b.z) < 2.2 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n1780→                    b.alive = false;\\n                    if crouched {\\n                        stealth = true;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if stealth {\\n                self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n1790→        // Companion down timer.\\n        for c in &mut self.companions {\\n            if c.down && c.alive {\\n                c.down_t += dt;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(i) = self.companions.iter().position(|c| c.down && c.alive && c.down_t > 45.0) {\\n            self.companions[i].alive = false;\",\"content_concise\":\"1758→\\n    fn special_actions(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n1760→        let near_cache = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1);\\n        if near_cache < 4.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cache_tracker\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            self.hold_t += dt;\\n        } else {\\n            self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || (input.down(buttons::INTERACT) && self.hold_t > 0.4) {\\n1770→            self.try_interact();\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::MELEE) {\\n            let crouched = self.stance == 1;\\n            let px = self.x;\\n            let pz = self.z;\\n            let mut stealth = false;\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 1 && geom::dist(px, pz, b.x, b.z) < 2.2 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n1780→                    b.alive = false;\\n                    if crouched {\\n                        stealth = true;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if stealth {\\n                self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n1790→        // Companion down timer.\\n        for c in &mut self.companions {\\n            if c.down && c.alive {\\n                c.down_t += dt;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(i) = self.companions.iter().position(|c| c.down && c.alive && c.down_t > 45.0) {\\n            self.companions[i].alive = false;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"offset\":1758,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"\\n    fn special_actions(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        let near_cache = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1);\\n        if near_cache < 4.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cache_tracker\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            self.hold_t += dt;\\n        } else {\\n            self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || (input.down(buttons::INTERACT) && self.hold_t > 0.4) {\\n            self.try_interact();\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::MELEE) {\\n            let crouched = self.stance == 1;\\n            let px = self.x;\\n            let pz = self.z;\\n            let mut stealth = false;\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 1 && geom::dist(px, pz, b.x, b.z) < 2.2 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n                    b.alive = false;\\n                    if crouched {\\n                        stealth = true;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if stealth {\\n                self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n        // Companion down timer.\\n        for c in &mut self.companions {\\n            if c.down && c.alive {\\n                c.down_t += dt;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(i) = self.companions.iter().position(|c| c.down && c.alive && c.down_t > 45.0) {\\n            self.companions[i].alive = false;\\n\",\"total_lines\":2359}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"172bb830-f176-4277-bf50-140df1779f16"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_171","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The ceasefire bot aims and fires without pressing interact.\n\nRepair leaves the boat kind as 2. The player ends up on foot next to the boat.\n\nDrive does not convert the boat into a technical vehicle. The bot will be stranded on land. The log shows boat_driven was already true from the earlier deep water ride.\n\nDrive will now spawn a technical vehicle when the current ride is not a technical. This fixes the boat-to-land problem.\n\nThe Drive begin fix preserves the existing boat_driven flag. It only spawns a technical when kind is 2, replacing the boat for the inland leg. The first Drive step already succeeded by converting kind 0 to 1.\n\nBus and the first Drive step are already complete. The cement drive is the only remaining one that needs the fix. After repair sets seat to 0, Drive begin will spawn a technical vehicle and set seat to 1 so the bot can drive directly. If the seat were left at 0, the bot would press USE to cycle through seats until it enters.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b44d042-bbbe-423b-9cd6-92309e1a4808-38","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\n                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\n                }\n            }","new_string":"            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\n                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\n                // Inland legs need the technical. A boat left on the channel cannot climb the bank.\n                if self.ride.kind != 1 {\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\n                }\n            }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":539,"output_tokens":1281,"cache_read_input_tokens":96128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"8d201fa9-a890-401c-a39d-f232b63b8b18"}
