m = Sim::new(Merc::KEY, seed).unwrap();\"},{\"line_number\":77,\"content\":\"fn same_seed_matches_across_a_save() {\"},{\"line_number\":84,\"content\":\"        a.tick(&f, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":85,\"content\":\"        b.tick(&f, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":90,\"content\":\"    a.tick(&f, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"    loaded.tick(&f, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":110,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&look, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":113,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&look, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":132,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&f, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":139,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&f, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":147,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&f, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":196,\"content\":\"    for _ in 0..(90.0 / DT) as i32 {\"},{\"line_number\":198,\"content\":\"            w.tick(&press(buttons::RELOAD), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":200,\"content\":\"            w.tick(&fire, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":219,\"content\":\"    for _ in 0..(20.0 / DT) as i32 {\"},{\"line_number\":220,\"content\":\"        w.tick(&InputFrame::default(), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":331,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&press(buttons::PRIMARY), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":372,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&InputFrame::default(), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":375,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&InputFrame::default(), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":383,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&InputFrame::default(), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":405,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&press(buttons::HEAL), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":449,\"content\":\"    w.tick(&drive, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":504,\"content\":\"    wet.tick(&press(buttons::USE), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":507,\"content\":\"    wet.tick(&hold(buttons::PRIMARY), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":590,\"content\":\"        w.tick(&press(bit), DT);\"},{\"line_number\":687,\"content\":\"fn play_route(route: Route, seed: u64) -> BTreeSet<String> {\"},{\"line_number\":688,\"content\":\"    let mut w = World::campaign(seed, route);\"},{\"line_number\":696,\"content\":\"        w.tick(&input, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":697,\"content\":\"        t += DT;\"},{\"line_number\":700,\"content\":\"            eprintln!(\\\"{route:?} seed {seed}: {before} -> {now} at ({:.0},{:.0}) t={t:.0}\\\", w.x, w.z);\"},{\"line_number\":704,\"content\":\"            stuck += DT;\"},{\"line_number\":708,\"content\":\"                    \\\"{route:?} seed {seed} stuck on {now} for {stuck:.0}s (budget {budget:.0}) at ({:.1},{:.1}) step {} flags {}\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":714,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.finished, \\\"{route:?} seed {seed} did not finish by {t:.0}s goal {} at ({:.0},{:.0})\\\", w.goal_name(), w.x, w.z);\"},{\"line_number\":727,\"content\":\"    for seed in [1u64, 2] {\"},{\"line_number\":728,\"content\":\"        let mut prefix_a = World::campaign(seed, Route::Human);\"},{\"line_number\":729,\"content\":\"        let mut prefix_b = World::campaign(seed, Route::Human);\"},{\"line_number\":733,\"content\":\"            prefix_a.tick(&a, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":734,\"content\":\"            prefix_b.tick(&b, DT);\"},{\"line_number\":738,\"content\":\"            union.extend(play_route(route, seed));\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"1e49c6c1-7e15-4372-9249-92b3ecb2670b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_175","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The enemy jam soldier requires an alert level of at least 1 to shoot.\n\nThe soldier spawns 8 meters from the player and should be visible. Seed 2 fails because the alert level never reaches 1. Smoke, grass, or night may be blocking vision.\n\nThe soldier's gun might break before jamming. A 3% chance per shot causes breakage, which leaves the weapon permanently dry and prevents jamming.\n\nThe math confirms the issue. About 11% of seeds produce a broken gun before jamming, leaving the soldier permanently dry. This explains why seed 2 fails while seed 1 succeeds.\n\nThree fixes are under consideration. Force the soldier's gun to jam immediately. Remove the break threshold so the weapon cannot break first. Or treat a broken gun during the jam step as a jam.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-389b977b-8ca6-4c3b-9a22-00bbfa75680e-44","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2035,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-389b977b-8ca6-4c3b-9a22-00bbfa75680e-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"jammy|enemy_jam|force_jam","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4712,"output_tokens":958,"cache_read_input_tokens":99072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"8c94fa3a-dc94-4468-bb92-509d2ba21987"}
