{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_177","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The unit test builds its own soldier instead of using spawn_soldier jammy.\n\nThe unit test will remain unchanged because it passed with seed 9. The campaign jammy guns will use force_jam so the scripted set-piece always jams on the first pull. After jamming, tick_clear clears the jam and firing resumes.\n\nThe jam-clear delay is about 2.4 seconds, so the one-second freeze check holds. force_jam does not affect the unit test. The campaign's forced jam on the first pull is deterministic and safe. Break probability is negligible at seed 2, and tracer ignition is a fixed 25% chance.\n\nThe tracer ignition budget is ample, so seed 2 should pass unless the ray misses grass. Dart poison is deterministic on hit. The sniper's single shot has minimal spread jitter, but it will only hit if the player is actually aiming down sight.\n\nThe ending script counts steps even if the player dies, so death does not block the scripted set-piece. Seed 2 reached the enemy jam step, confirming the fight itself is deterministic. The fix is to force jam on enemy guns.\n\nThe jammy gun code sets condition to 5.0, zero wear, full ammo, and force_jam to true. A lone soldier will pull the weapon immediately on the first tick and jam it. This avoids any cooldown or alert delay. Seed 1 already passed all endings, so this should be the last simulation flake unless seed 2 fails later.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ead80d55-8046-4a78-9524-c7a9ad2c4397-47","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        if jammy {\n            g.condition = 5.0;\n            g.wear = 0.0;\n            g.ammo = 400;\n            g.reserve = 400;\n        }","new_string":"        if jammy {\n            g.condition = 5.0;\n            g.wear = 0.0;\n            g.ammo = 400;\n            g.reserve = 400;\n            // A break roll can win before the jam roll. This set piece is a known bad gun.\n            g.force_jam = true;\n        }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1099,"output_tokens":1107,"cache_read_input_tokens":105600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"887e737e-d91e-4d08-a825-5b0c002a002a"}
