{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_182","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to check the blank() function to find the right place for a new field.\n\nI'll avoid adding a new serde field. Instead, I'll clear the sleep_used flag when Sleep begins so done() requires it to be set again during that step.\n\nThe Sleep arm will remove the sleep_used flag. The bot is within 12 blocks of the lodge, so it should interact to sleep.\n\nThe bot will walk within 8 blocks of the lodge before holding interact. Sleep triggers after 0.8 seconds of holding. The 26-hour sleep marks reman, but post_clear may already be false if maybe_reman fired during the wait.\n\nThe campaign spans only 248 in-game minutes, so the natural reman timer has not expired. post_clear remains true until the sleep interact fires and marks reman. The sleep interact also sets yaw to south and looking_at_post to false.\n\nThe explicit reman mark in the sleep interact is reliable, independent of the maybe_reman timer. The flag sequence works correctly across both sleeps: it starts unset, gets set during the first sleep, then cleared and set again during the second sleep, leaving both flags in the end state. For the second sleep, the bot exits the vehicle, which is within 12 blocks of the lodge, then walks closer if needed before interacting.\n\nThe USE button cycles the seat between 0, 1, and 2. The bot presses it while sitting in a non-zero seat.\n\ncontract_d2 ending arms must not set finished to true.\n\nThe Night step marks night_contract in begin and done checks it, so that step completes immediately.\n\nThe sleep_used flag is already covered and not missing. I will implement both fixes.\n\nI checked the Ending(0) flow. It still marks ending_burn correctly. The flag step begins and sets finished in the same advance_script after simulate marks it. The flag step has not started when simulate runs.\n\nI traced the tick-by-tick flow for the Ending step. On the first tick after arrival, the step begins but the ending flag is not yet set, so the script stops. The next tick's simulate marks ending_burn without setting finished.\n\nThe Ending(1) script waits 180 ticks before marking the flag, so finished stays false during that window. The chair ending marks immediately. I also need to verify the sleep bot won't get stuck if nearest_safe from the arrival point is not the lodge.\n\nThe pump house and boat shed are far from the arrival point, so the nearest safe spot is correctly the lodge. The 26-hour sleep adds 1560 minutes, which may exceed the 1440-minute post_reman_at threshold. Since simulate runs before advance_script, the sleep interact marks reman before maybe_reman can fire.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4d31be76-ad2c-49e9-a53d-4e829cd5caab-53","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Ending(0) => {\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                self.mark(\"ending_burn\");\n                self.finished = true;\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\n                self.hold_t += 0.0;\n                // hold_t is fed by interact. Use step_t instead.\n                if self.step_t >= 180.0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ending_read\");\n                    self.finished = true;\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(2) => {\n                self.mark(\"ending_chair\");\n                self.finished = true;\n            }","new_string":"            Spec::Ending(0) => {\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(self.x, self.z, 8.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n                self.mark(\"ending_burn\");\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\n                // The ledger is read under fire. step_t is real time on this step.\n                if self.step_t >= 180.0 {\n                    self.mark(\"ending_read\");\n                }\n            }\n            Spec::Ending(2) => {\n                self.mark(\"ending_chair\");\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4d31be76-ad2c-49e9-a53d-4e829cd5caab-54","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Spec::Night => {\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\n                self.mark(\"night_contract\");\n            }","new_string":"            Spec::Night => {\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\n                self.mark(\"night_contract\");\n            }\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\n                // The short rest already set this. The long rest has to happen on its own.\n                self.flags.remove(\"sleep_used\");\n            }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3511,"output_tokens":2240,"cache_read_input_tokens":110080,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"e6d1faa0-b6c7-4a0e-9cc9-a476390b1d62"}
