{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_190","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Examining input gathering and simulation passing. Checking the clock advance cap.\n\nPlanning the Merc scene integration. The app frame will hide pavilion UI and sync the first-person camera from world status. Tick caps will rise during menus or nodraw states. __game data will publish to WASM. JavaScript will handle session logic, DOM shell mirroring, pointer lock, hub protocol, and Web Audio music. Shell logic remains in Rust.\n\nKeyboard input will flow from JavaScript into Rust via WASM. Rust maps keys to InputFrame buttons and act codes, feeds them to Merc::pre each tick, and publishes the resulting UI state to window.__game. The DOM shell can then render menus directly from that published state. Existing winit keyboard handling on web should still receive test-generated key events.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-711e4fd0-b1ce-4d50-8e4e-b358600386db-72","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn input|buttons::|keyboard|MouseMotion|pointer","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-711e4fd0-b1ce-4d50-8e4e-b358600386db-73","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/simhost.rs","offset":230,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-711e4fd0-b1ce-4d50-8e4e-b358600386db-74","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct FpCam|fn fp_basis|pub fp","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_view/src/camera.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_toke