{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_200","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will implement merc_web.rs in pav_app. It will be called from simhost on wasm before each step. I will also set the camera in app.rs when the scene is merc.\n\nI will skip graphics drawing when nodraw=1 and cap ticks at 120. I will also suppress egui menus and Escape pause for the merc scene so the canvas stays clear. I am now editing simhost.rs to handle wasm merc input before each step.\n\nThe wasm merc input will be applied after the frame is built but before sim.step. The tick cap will be 120 when nodraw or test mode is active, otherwise 8.\n\nThe fast-tick condition now checks for the Merc component and nodraw or non-Playing screen. Nodraw is read from a OnceLock on first call. I need to import Merc and the Game trait. The JavaScript publish loop will write JSON strings into window.__game every 15 ticks. Tests will parse those strings.\n\nI am defining the command schema for `window.gameTest.queue`. It will use numeric action codes for confirm, back, pause, god mode, slider increment, xbox toggle, save, and continue. It will also use objects for look, move, hover, click, and reload button presses.\n\nThe command queue will also accept simple strings like \"confirm\", \"pause\", and \"god\" in addition to objects. Keyboard input must work without the queue, either through a page listener or winit. The Playwright test will dispatch Enter and Space events that the page listener converts into simulation commands.\n\nI will use a JavaScript keydown listener to buffer input into `window.gameInput.pending`, and Rust will drain that buffer each tick. Winit keys are a fallback. Pointer lock will accumulate mouse movement for look commands, and losing the lock during play will pause the game. I will also stub gamepad detection for the official controller ID.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e109343d-1334-426f-9fd7-99638abb07d3-100","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs","offset":208,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e109343d-1334-426f-9fd7-99638abb07d3-101","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn step\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e109343d-1334-426f-9fd7-99638abb07d3-102","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/scripts/build-web.sh","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1239,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":162560,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"86c85690-a2fe-4412-b01a-4942d3ffb0e4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e109343d-1334-426f-9fd7-99638abb07d3-100","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"208→    fn activate(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        match self.screen {\\n210→            Screen::Title => match label {\\n                \\\"Continue\\\" => {\\n                    if self.has_save {\\n                        if let Ok(w) = World::load_json(&self.save_blob) {\\n                            let saves = self.saves_written;\\n                            let blob = self.save_blob.clone();\\n                            *self = w;\\n                            self.saves_written = saves;\\n                            self.save_blob = blob;\\n                            self.has_save = true;\\n220→                            self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                \\\"New contract\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Difficulty;\\n                    self.focus = 1;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Multiplayer\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Mp;\\n230→                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"About\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::About;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n240→                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Difficulty => {\\n                self.difficulty = match label {\\n                    \\\"Easy\\\" => 0,\\n                    \\\"Hard\\\" => 2,\\n                    _ => 1,\\n                };\\n250→                self.screen = Screen::Merc;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Merc => {\\n                self.merc = match label {\\n                    \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\" => 1,\\n                    \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\" => 2,\\n                    \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\" => 3,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n260→                self.screen = Screen::Prologue;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Prologue => {\\n                if label == \\\"Begin\\\" {\\n                    self.start_playing();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Pause => match label {\\n                \\\"Resume\\\" => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n270→                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Controls\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Dev mode\\\" if !self.hub => {\\n280→                    self.screen = Screen::Dev;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Quit to title\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n290→            },\\n            Screen::Settings => {\\n                if label == \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = true;\\n                } else if label == \\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = false;\\n                } else if label.starts_with(\\\"Page\\\") {\\n                    self.tab = (self.tab + 1) % 4;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n300→            }\\n            Screen::Dev => {\\n                if self.tab == 0 {\\n                    self.tab = match label {\\n                        \\\"Cheats\\\" => 1,\\n                        \\\"Teleport\\\" => 2,\\n                        \\\"Spawn\\\" => 3,\\n                        \\\"World\\\" => 4,\\n                        \\\"Balance\\\" => 5,\\n                        _ => 0,\\n310→                    };\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Reset to defaults\\\" {\\n                    self.tune = self.tune0.clone();\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Next page\\\" {\\n320→                    self.page += 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if self.tab == 1 {\\n                    self.toggle_cheat(label);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::About => {\\n                if label == \\\"Next\\\" {\\n330→                    self.page += 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" && self.page > 0 {\\n                    self.page -= 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Mp => {\\n                if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n340→                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn toggle_cheat(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        let d = &mut self.dev;\\n        match label {\\n350→            \\\"God mode\\\" => d.god = !d.god,\\n            \\\"Infinite ammo\\\" => d.infinite = !d.infinite,\\n            \\\"No jams\\\" => d.no_jams = !d.no_jams,\\n            \\\"No fever\\\" => d.no_fever = !d.no_fever,\\n            \\\"Noclip\\\" => d.noclip = !d.noclip,\\n            \\\"Invisible\\\" => d.invisible = !d.invisible,\\n            \\\"Show AI\\\" => d.show_ai = !d.show_ai,\\n            \\\"Show fire\\\" => d.show_fire = !d.show_fire,\\n            \\\"Show nav\\\" => d.show_nav = !d.show_nav,\\n            \\\"Show stats\\\" => d.show_stats = !d.show_stats,\\n360→            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let all: Vec<String> = match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => {\\n                let mut r = Vec::new();\\n                if self.has_save {\\n                    r.push(\\\"Continue\\\".into());\\n370→                }\\n                r.extend([\\\"New contract\\\".into(), \\\"Multiplayer\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"About\\\".into()]);\\n                r\\n            }\\n            Screen::Difficulty => vec![\\\"Easy\\\".into(), \\\"Normal\\\".into(), \\\"Hard\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Merc => vec![\\\"Ada Okoro\\\".into(), \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(), \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(), \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Prologue => vec![\\\"Begin\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Pause => vec![\\\"Resume\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"Controls\\\".into(), \\\"Dev mode\\\".into(), \\\"Quit to title\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Settings => self.settings_rows(),\\n            Screen::About => vec![\\\"Next\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n380→            Screen::Dev => self.dev_rows(),\\n            Screen::Mp => vec![\\\"This computer\\\".into(), \\\"Invite code\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Attract => vec![\\\"Press any button\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Playing => vec![],\\n        };\\n        all.into_iter().take(7).collect()\\n    }\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"208→    fn activate(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        match self.screen {\\n210→            Screen::Title => match label {\\n                \\\"Continue\\\" => {\\n                    if self.has_save {\\n                        if let Ok(w) = World::load_json(&self.save_blob) {\\n                            let sa