{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e01ed2b-890c-4e77-8e7b-98bbb3b869e1-133","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"612→    }\\n    let root = Path::new(env!(\\\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\\\")).join(\\\"src/games/merc\\\");\\n    for entry in std::fs::read_dir(&root).unwrap() {\\n        let path = entry.unwrap().path();\\n        let text = std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap_or_default().to_lowercase();\\n        for word in banned {\\n            assert!(!text.contains(word), \\\"{word} in {}\\\", path.display());\\n        }\\n620→    }\\n    let engine = Path::new(env!(\\\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\\\")).join(\\\"../..\\\");\\n    let mut audio = Vec::new();\\n    walk_audio(&engine, &mut audio);\\n    assert!(audio.is_empty(), \\\"shipped audio files: {audio:?}\\\");\\n}\\n\\nfn walk_audio(dir: &Path, out: &mut Vec<String>) {\\n    let Ok(rd) = std::fs::read_dir(dir) else { return };\\n    for entry in rd.flatten() {\\n630→        let path = entry.path();\\n        if path.file_name().and_then(|s| s.to_str()) == Some(\\\"target\\\") {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if path.is_dir() {\\n            walk_audio(&path, out);\\n        } else if let Some(ext) = path.extension().and_then(|s| s.to_str()) {\\n            if matches!(ext, \\\"wav\\\" | \\\"mp3\\\" | \\\"ogg\\\") {\\n                out.push(path.display().to_string());\\n            }\\n640→        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[test]\\nfn net_loopback_shares_one_fire_cell() {\\n    let mut host = World::fresh(1);\\n    let mut client = World::fresh(2);\\n    assert!(host.fire.ignite_at(200.0, -200.0, 10.0, host.minutes));\\n    let mut link = Link::new(7, 0.15, 0.0, 0.0);\\n650→    host_publish(&host, &mut link, false);\\n    assert!(link.max_bytes < 1200);\",\"content_concise\":\"612→    }\\n    let root = Path::new(env!(\\\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\\\")).join(\\\"src/games/merc\\\");\\n    for entry in std::fs::read_dir(&root).unwrap() {\\n        let path = entry.unwrap().path();\\n        let text = std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap_or_default().to_lowercase();\\n        for word in banned {\\n            assert!(!text.contains(word), \\\"{word} in {}\\\", path.display());\\n        }\\n620→    }\\n    let engine = Path::new(env!(\\\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\\\")).join(\\\"../..\\\");\\n    let mut audio = Vec::new();\\n    walk_audio(&engine, &mut audio);\\n    assert!(audio.is_empty(), \\\"shipped audio files: {audio:?}\\\");\\n}\\n\\nfn walk_audio(dir: &Path, out: &mut Vec<String>) {\\n    let Ok(rd) = std::fs::read_dir(dir) else { return };\\n    for entry in rd.flatten() {\\n630→        let path = entry.path();\\n        if path.file_name().and_then(|s| s.to_str()) == Some(\\\"target\\\") {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if path.is_dir() {\\n            walk_audio(&path, out);\\n        } else if let Some(ext) = path.extension().and_then(|s| s.to_str()) {\\n            if matches!(ext, \\\"wav\\\" | \\\"mp3\\\" | \\\"ogg\\\") {\\n                out.push(path.display().to_string());\\n            }\\n640→        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[test]\\nfn net_loopback_shares_one_fire_cell() {\\n    let mut host = World::fresh(1);\\n    let mut client = World::fresh(2);\\n    assert!(host.fire.ignite_at(200.0, -200.0, 10.0, host.minutes));\\n    let mut link = Link::new(7, 0.15, 0.0, 0.0);\\n650→    host_publish(&host, &mut link, false);\\n    assert!(link.max_bytes < 1200);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs\",\"offset\":612,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    }\\n    let root = Path::new(env!(\\\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\\\")).join(\\\"src/games/merc\\\");\\n    for entry in std::fs::read_dir(&root).unwrap() {\\n        let path = entry.unwrap().path();\\n        let text = std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap_or_default().to_lowercase();\\n        for word in banned {\\n            assert!(!text.contains(word), \\\"{word} in {}\\\", path.display());\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let engine = Path::new(env!(\\\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\\\")).join(\\\"../..\\\");\\n    let mut audio = Vec::new();\\n    walk_audio(&engine, &mut audio);\\n    assert!(audio.is_empty(), \\\"shipped audio files: {audio:?}\\\");\\n}\\n\\nfn walk_audio(dir: &Path, out: &mut Vec<String>) {\\n    let Ok(rd) = std::fs::read_dir(dir) else { return };\\n    for entry in rd.flatten() {\\n        let path = entry.path();\\n        if path.file_name().and_then(|s| s.to_str()) == Some(\\\"target\\\") {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if path.is_dir() {\\n            walk_audio(&path, out);\\n        } else if let Some(ext) = path.extension().and_then(|s| s.to_str()) {\\n            if matches!(ext, \\\"wav\\\" | \\\"mp3\\\" | \\\"ogg\\\") {\\n                out.push(path.display().to_string());\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[test]\\nfn net_loopback_shares_one_fire_cell() {\\n    let mut host = World::fresh(1);\\n    let mut client = World::fresh(2);\\n    assert!(host.fire.ignite_at(200.0, -200.0, 10.0, host.minutes));\\n    let mut link = Link::new(7, 0.15, 0.0, 0.0);\\n    host_publish(&host, &mut link, false);\\n    assert!(link.max_bytes < 1200);\\n\",\"total_lines\":743}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"6c7c0f95-8e12-42c8-b526-f39b75062e7f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_219","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The file scan lowercases the entire file, so any substring match fails.\n\nAvoiding banned substrings like \"todo\" in comments. The file scan does not special-case \"far cry 2\" or \"Source:\".\n\nAbout pages will be written carefully. Pointer fields are being added. The app's move_dir input and escape match need small edits. UI skip logic will guard boot, stats, guide, hint, and pause scenes. The first-person camera will be set before rig.update. The show_stats variable is confirmed to be a copy.\n\nApp::new will disable boot, stats, and guide when the initial scene is merc. Menu guards will remain as a fallback. The canvas must exist from the first frame even if nodraw skips drawing.\n\nThe canvas is created during graphics initialization, not on the first draw call, so skipping draw leaves it blank without issue. The draw submission will be guarded by `merc_web::skip_draw()`, which returns false on native. The view sky also needs to be set in `App::new`.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b014b95d-ebe5-4e61-8fd3-ee7d9f35ec45-134","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"wasm-bindgen --version; rustup target list --installed | rg wasm32 || true","description":"Check wasm-bindgen CLI and wasm target"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":681,"output_tokens":780,"cache_read_input_tokens":203008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"050b322d-4694-46c8-8706-de8d35c4a0eb"}
