{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_248","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I am extracting assertion messages from unit and play logs to count distinct issues caught by testing.\n\nI found 14 distinct compile errors in check1. The unit1 failure was a scope issue with Merc::KEY.\n\nI found 4 distinct post-compile test failures in unit2. unit3 appears to have a new issue after its fix. Only three units exist, so unit4 is absent. I am also cataloging 5 distinct playthrough bugs: ignite stall, panic stall, rain stall, and enemy jam.\n\nplay5 uncovered two missing coverage cases: post_remanned and contract_d2.\n\nBetter was fixed in the same batch as play4 without a separate log.\n\nThe unit1 scope failure is distinct from the 14 compile errors and counts as another issue caught by testing.\n\nThe four unit2 failures are a fever threshold bug, attract loops caused by dt clamp and shop_tracker, fire road, and vehicle stage.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c752d19c-229d-4c4b-9a27-c14004fcb554-73","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer\necho \"CHECK1 error[ count: $(rg -c 'error\\[' $SCR/check1.log)\"\necho \"---- unit1 panic/error ----\"\nrg -n \"error\\[|panicked|assert\" $SCR/unit1.log | head -20\necho \"---- unit2 assert lines ----\"\nrg -n \"panicked|assertion|left:|right:\" $SCR/unit2.log | head -30\necho \"---- unit3 assert ----\"\nrg -n -A2 \"panicked\" $SCR/unit3.log | head -20\necho \"---- play messages ----\"\nrg -n \"stuck|missing|panicked\" $SCR/play1.log $SCR/play2.log $SCR/play3.log $SCR/play4.log $SCR/play5.log | head -40\n","description":"Extract distinct failure messages from scratch logs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4524,"output_tokens":841,"cache_read_input_tokens":144512,"cache_creation_input_tokens