e_number\":149,\"content\":\"   * No hub after all: play on, with Math.random the page's own again. The\"},{\"line_number\":155,\"content\":\"    if (seededRandom && Math.random === seededRandom) Math.random = realRandom;\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"01023654-34b5-4ad4-8108-b15bc5c892f6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_274","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"session.js replaces Math.\n\nsession.js restores Math.random when no hub is present. The test should verify the shared-world path never calls it in solo mode. I need to read session.js lines 110-160 to confirm this behavior. Keyboard confirmation sets the device to Keyboard during shell_tick when act is non-zero and device_lock is zero.\n\nWorld::tick runs apply_console before the screen branch. This means shell_tick sees act != 0 and sets the device to Keyboard, so the Enter glyph appears for confirmation.\n\nThe gamepad stub locks the device when its pad ID matches. Rust sets Device::Gamepad with device_lock=1, preventing any subsequent keyboard input from overriding it.\n\nThe test sequence confirms the lock works correctly. Pressing a key first sets the device to Keyboard. Installing the pad stub then sets gamepad with lock true. shell_tick sees device_lock=1 and cannot flip back to Keyboard, so the glyph stays Cross. An Xbox button press queues act:14 while the device is already gamepad.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce21a3e0-e784-4696-b0a3-c9afe4e66a90-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"act == 10|Screen::Pause|buttons::PAUSE|fn tick\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce21a3e0-e784-4696-b0a3-c9afe4e66a90-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/hub/session.js","offset":100,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce21a3e0-e784-4696-b0a3-c9afe4e66a90-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn pre\\(|look\\.|self\\.yaw \\+|input\\.look","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/g