on().search().ok()).unwrap_or_default();\"},{\"line_number\":68,\"content\":\"                s.scene = format!(\\\"world/{r}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":70,\"content\":\"            if let Some(r) = p.get(\\\"scene\\\").filter(|r| !r.is_empty()) {\"},{\"line_number\":71,\"content\":\"                s.scene = r;\"},{\"line_number\":83,\"content\":\"        if (s.animation_studio || s.asset_studio || s.creature_studio) && s.scene.is_empty() {\"},{\"line_number\":84,\"content\":\"            s.scene = \\\"empty\\\".into();\"},{\"line_number\":86,\"content\":\"        if s.scene.is_empty() {\"},{\"line_number\":87,\"content\":\"            // Shardfall's town; the engine's pavilion is the `world` scene (pause menu).\"},{\"line_number\":88,\"content\":\"            s.scene = \\\"town\\\".into();\"},{\"line_number\":150,\"content\":\"                \\\"--scene\\\" => s.scene = it.next().cloned().unwrap_or(s.scene),\"},{\"line_number\":151,\"content\":\"                \\\"--room\\\" => s.scene = it.next().map(|r| format!(\\\"world/{r}\\\")).unwrap_or(s.scene),\"},{\"line_number\":165,\"content\":\"            if s.scene.is_empty() {\"},{\"line_number\":166,\"content\":\"                s.scene = \\\"empty\\\".into();\"},{\"line_number\":172,\"content\":\"        if s.scene.is_empty() {\"},{\"line_number\":173,\"content\":\"            // Shardfall's town; the engine's pavilion is the `world` scene (pause menu).\"},{\"line_number\":174,\"content\":\"            s.scene = \\\"town\\\".into();\"},{\"line_number\":194,\"content\":\"            \\\"start_room\\\" if !v.is_empty() => s.scene = format!(\\\"world/{v}\\\"),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"69051cc5-5420-4705-bb79-c8ef004db0bc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_300","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A fallback will be added in settings.rs for the WASM path. If the scene is empty, it will check a JS global.\n\nThe page script will set `window.__jamScene = 'merc'` at startup. The WASM settings code will read this global if the query string lacks a scene.\n\nThe query string takes precedence over the global fallback. The edit to settings.rs may be missed if cargo already started compiling pav_app with the old version. Pav_core will recompile first, then pav_app.\n\nI am editing settings.rs now while pav_core is still compiling. I am working out the correct wasm_bindgen syntax to read the optional `window.__jamScene` global.\n\nI will use `js_sys::Reflect::get` to read the `__jamScene` global. This avoids adding js-sys as a direct dependency, since it is already available transitively through wasm_bindgen and web_sys.\n\nI must not add js-sys as a direct dependency. The build uses --locked, so any new entry in Cargo.lock would fail.\n\nI will not add js-sys as a direct dependency. I am considering a wasm_bindgen extern declaration instead, or placing the fallback in main before settings.rs parses the query string. Inline JavaScript is ruled out because the packer rejects script tags in glue.\n\nThe classic page script will call `history.replaceState` early to inject `?scene=merc` into the URL before the WASM module loads. This covers cases where the packer fails or the template is served without it. Inline JavaScript remains off limits.\n\nThe fallback script will run at the very start of the classic page, before the WASM loader. It checks whether the query string already contains `scene` or `room`. If not, it injects `?scene=merc` via `history.replaceState` and preserves any existing hash. This ensures the loader sees the scene parameter before it runs.\n\nI am testing a wasm_bindgen extern declaration to read the `__jamScene` global directly from Rust without adding js-sys. If replaceState fails, I will fall back to Rust code that avoids new dependencies.\n\nThe `wasm_bindgen` extern declaration for `window.__jamScene` is confirmed safe. It returns an undefined `JsValue` when the property is missing, and `as_string()` handles that gracefully without throwing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87a1a7ee-67b1-4739-bea3-ea47aebb0087-85","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/settings.rs","offset":55,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3288,"output_tokens":1637,"cache_read_input_tokens":146816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"d7881e7e-88fb-4301-a773-92c4c72e72ca"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-87a1a7ee-67b1-4739-bea3-ea47aebb0087-85","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"55→}\\n\\n#[cfg(not(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\"))]\\nconst HEADER: &str = \\\"# Shardfall startup settings. Delete this file to restore defaults.\\\\n# backend = \\\\\\\"vulkan\\\\\\\" or \\\\\\\"dx12\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\";\\n\\n60→impl Settings {\\n    /// In the browser: defaults, plus `?room=NAME&seed=N` from the page address.\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    pub fn load(_args: &[String]) -> (Self, String) {\\n        let mut s = Settings::default();\\n        let query = web_sys::window().and_then(|w| w.location().search().ok()).unwrap_or_default();\\n        if let Ok(p) = web_sys::UrlSearchParams::new_with_str(&query) {\\n            if let Some(r) = p.get(\\\"room\\\").filter(|r| !r.is_empty()) {\\n                s.scene = format!(\\\"world/{r}\\\");\\n            }\\n70→            if let Some(r) = p.get(\\\"scene\\\").filter(|r| !r.is_empty()) {\\n                s.scene = r;\\n            }\\n            if let Some(v) = p.get(\\\"seed\\\").and_then(|v| v.parse().ok()) {\\n                s.seed = v;\\n            }\\n            s.animation_studio = p.get(\\\"animation_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.animation_clip = p.get(\\\"clip\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n            s.asset_studio = p.get(\\\"asset_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.asset_name = p.get(\\\"asset\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n80→            s.creature_studio = p.get(\\\"creature_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.creature_name = p.get(\\\"creature\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n        }\\n        if (s.animation_studio || s.asset_studio || s.creature_studio) && s.scene.is_empty() {\\n            s.scene = \\\"empty\\\".into();\\n        }\\n        if s.scene.is_empty() {\\n            // Shardfall's town; the engine's pavilion is the `world` scene (pause menu).\\n            s.scene = \\\"town\\\".into();\\n        }\\n90→        (s, \\\"page address (?room=NAME&seed=N)\\\".into())\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Loads settings (creating the file with defaults on first run), then applies CLI flags.\\n    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\"))]\",\"content_concise\":\"55→}\\n\\n#[cfg(not(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\"))]\\nconst HEADER: &str = \\\"# Shardfall startup settings. Delete this file to restore defaults.\\\\n# backend = \\\\\\\"vulkan\\\\\\\" or \\\\\\\"dx12\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\";\\n\\n60→impl Settings {\\n    /// In the browser: defaults, plus `?room=NAME&seed=N` from the page address.\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    pub fn load(_args: &[String]) -> (Self, String) {\\n        let mut s = Settings::default();\\n        let query = web_sys::window().and_then(|w| w.location().search().ok()).unwrap_or_default();\\n        if let Ok(p) = web_sys::UrlSearchParams::new_with_str(&query) {\\n            if let Some(r) = p.get(\\\"room\\\").filter(|r| !r.is_empty()) {\\n                s.scene = format!(\\\"world/{r}\\\");\\n            }\\n70→            if let Some(r) = p.get(\\\"scene\\\").filter(|r| !r.is_empty()) {\\n                s.scene = r;\\n            }\\n            if let Some(v) = p.get(\\\"seed\\\").and_then(|v| v.parse().ok()) {\\n                s.seed = v;\\n            }\\n            s.animation_studio = p.get(\\\"animation_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.animation_clip = p.get(\\\"clip\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n            s.asset_studio = p.get(\\\"asset_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.asset_name = p.get(\\\"asset\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n80→            s.creature_studio = p.get(\\\"creature_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.creature_name = p.get(\\\"creature\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n        }\\n        if (s.animation_studio || s.asset_studio || s.creature_studio) && s.scene.is_empty() {\\n            s.scene = \\\"empty\\\".into();\\n        }\\n        if s.scene.is_empty() {\\n            // Shardfall's town; the engine's pavilion is the `world` scene (pause menu).\\n            s.scene = \\\"town\\\".into();\\n        }\\n90→        (s, \\\"page address (?room=NAME&seed=N)\\\".into())\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Loads settings (creating the file with defaults on first run), then applies CLI flags.\\n    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\"))]\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/settings.rs\",\"offset\":55,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"}\\n\\n#[cfg(not(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\"))]\\nconst HEADER: &str = \\\"# Shardfall startup settings. Delete this file to restore defaults.\\\\n# backend = \\\\\\\"vulkan\\\\\\\" or \\\\\\\"dx12\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\";\\n\\nimpl Settings {\\n    /// In the browser: defaults, plus `?room=NAME&seed=N` from the page address.\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    pub fn load(_args: &[String]) -> (Self, String) {\\n        let mut s = Settings::default();\\n        let query = web_sys::window().and_then(|w| w.location().search().ok()).unwrap_or_default();\\n        if let Ok(p) = web_sys::UrlSearchParams::new_with_str(&query) {\\n            if let Some(r) = p.get(\\\"room\\\").filter(|r| !r.is_empty()) {\\n                s.scene = format!(\\\"world/{r}\\\");\\n            }\\n            if let Some(r) = p.get(\\\"scene\\\").filter(|r| !r.is_empty()) {\\n                s.scene = r;\\n            }\\n            if let Some(v) = p.get(\\\"seed\\\").and_then(|v| v.parse().ok()) {\\n                s.seed = v;\\n            }\\n            s.animation_studio = p.get(\\\"animation_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.animation_clip = p.get(\\\"clip\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n            s.asset_studio = p.get(\\\"asset_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.asset_name = p.get(\\\"asset\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n            s.creature_studio = p.get(\\\"creature_studio\\\").is_some_and(|v| v != \\\"false\\\");\\n            s.creature_name = p.get(\\\"creature\\\").unwrap_or_default();\\n        }\\n        if (s.animation_studio || s.asset_studio || s.creature_studio) && s.scene.is_empty() {\\n            s.scene = \\\"empty\\\".into();\\n        }\\n        if s.scene.is_empty() {\\n            // Shardfall's town; the engine's pavilion is the `world` scene (pause menu).\\n            s.scene = \\\"town\\\".into();\\n        }\\n        (s, \\\"page address (?room=NAME&seed=N)\\\".into())\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Loads settings (creating the file with defaults on first run), then applies CLI flags.\\n    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\"))]\\n\",\"total_lines\":209}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"ecdc8383-48cc-4d4b-88fd-ee25d2742c0e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_301","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding a fallback to read window.__jamScene via wasm_bindgen when the scene is empty, placed before the town default.\n\nThe extern declaration is placed inside a `#[cfg(target_arch = \"wasm32\")]` block. It reads `window.__jamScene` as a static `JsValue`, which safely returns `None` if the property is undefined.\n\nThe fallback code converts the JsValue to a string and assigns it to the scene field only if it is non-empty. The classic index.html script sets `window.__jamScene` to 'merc' and injects a default scene query parameter when both scene and room are absent. Settings still checks the URL query first, so __jamScene only serves as a fallback.\n\nThe classic script runs before WASM initialization, so the fallback static reads the current value rather than a stale snapshot. Both the query parameter and the fallback property default to 'merc', and explicit scene parameters are not overridden.\n\nThe static `JsValue` fallback is safe because WASM initialization happens after the classic script runs. A function-style getter was considered but rejected; the correct approach is a static property.\n\nThe Rust fallback is being dropped as too messy and risky. The page script's replaceState will be tried first. The Rust fallback will only be added if the launch test shows the wrong scene.\n\nA town scene would leave the visible title as Jam Cry and the canvas showing town. The keyboard test changes published UI, but if merc is not running the shell paint never executes so dataset.screen stays Title. Enter might not advance the screen either. The test will fail in that case.\n\nReconsidering the Rust fallback. The `thread_local_v2` wasm-bindgen attribute will be used to read `window.__jamScene` as a static `JsValue`, with the value extracted via `.with(|v| v.as_string().unwrap_or_default())`. If compilation fails, the build log will reveal the error and the code can be fixed. The build is already running.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f769d1ac-b4b4-4fc7-9172-ccfc7b641b8e-86","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/settings.rs","old_string":"        if (s.animation_studio || s.asset_studio || s.creature_studio) && s.scene.is_empty() {\n            s.scene = \"empty\".into();\n        }\n        if s.scene.is_empty() {\n            // Shardfall's town; the engine's pavilion is the `world` scene (pause menu).\n            s.scene = \"town\".into();\n        }\n        (s, \"page address (?room=NAME&seed=N)\".into())","new_string":"        if (s.animation_studio || s.asset_studio || s.creature_studio) && s.scene.is_empty() {\n            s.scene = \"empty\".into();\n        }\n        if s.scene.is_empty() {\n            let baked = jam_scene_name();\n            if !baked.is_empty() {\n                s.scene = baked;\n            }\n        }\n        if s.scene.is_empty() {\n            // Shardfall's town; the engine's pavilion is the `world` scene (pause menu).\n            s.scene = \"town\".into();\n        }\n        (s, \"page address (?room=NAME&seed=N)\".into())"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f769d1ac-b4b4-4fc7-9172-ccfc7b641b8e-87","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/settings.rs","limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2306,"output_tokens":1570,"cache_read_input_tokens":150016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"523451ea-368c-4bcb-bb56-fe2567297d00"}
