{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_324","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The guide panel is skipped for merc.\n\n`panel.ui` at line 1451 runs unconditionally before the merc check. It likely draws the controls window. `guide_ui::pad_note` also executes for mercs. The visible panel is probably the F1 tuning panel.\n\nThe scene might not be named \"merc\" at draw time. The overlook visuals and dress() suggest it is merc, but the skip check uses the raw scene name. If the name differs, the guide panel would still render.\n\nThe scene name theory seems unlikely. The dark panel may actually be the egui guide overlay, while the shell text is large and semi-transparent, causing visual overlap with the menu items.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff7c6012-e87d-463e-9fda-a6c7ad49b797-124","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"input::guide|crate::input::guide|\\.guide\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2346,"output_tokens":699,"cache_read_input_tokens":185216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"8f283dfd-ae3a-4005-ac3b-d9489ec1712a"}
