{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_335","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The controls guide is confirmed to be on screen.\n\nThe guide text renders correctly. The missing X button suggests the skip logic is not active. Either merc_scene is false or the WASM build lacks the skip fix.\n\nThe running WASM binary might be outdated. The `scene_name` clone at line 1397 could also be causing the skip condition to fail.\n\nThe WASM binary contains the guide skip fix. The scene name is exactly \"merc\" in both the query and JS loader, so the skip condition should be active. The reason the guide still appears remains unclear.\n\nThe guide is visible because the scene was not \"merc\" when the app initialized. If it had been merc, both the `show_guide` flag and the `merc_scene` check would have suppressed it. The 3D world is clearly the merc overlook, so the scene name must have changed between initialization and UI rendering.\n\nThe scene name is confirmed to be \"merc\" because the visible 3D composition matches the merc dress() output. The guide should be hidden, so the running WASM binary is likely stale. The pack script uses target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/dist/shardfall.wasm, which matches the dist profile build path.\n\nThe previous session's build failed on scene_name before it could finish, so it never produced a new WASM binary. The running file must be an older build from before the guide skip was added.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d87fab3d-b4a6-4890-8f41-fce6ca008a4b-140","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"guide\\(device\\)|guide_panel|show_guide","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":832,"output_tokens":1095,"cache_read_input_tokens":197760,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"cebc9740-ca9e-4ebb-af00-3e6028e6812f"}
