ools\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/docs/ASSET_SYSTEM_PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":693,\"content\":\"- Every phase: `cargo build -p pav_app`, `cargo test -p pav_app`, and `cargo clippy -p pav_app --target wasm32-unknown-unknown`.\"},{\"line_number\":1404,\"content\":\"| TOOLS-10 | UI adapter for format 2 | props `V1Part`; `asset_ui.rs` | `cargo build/test -p pav_app`; wasm clippy |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/docs/REFERENCE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"              scale, dynamic resolution). Builds natively and for wasm32 (WebGPU).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/docs/MAKE_A_GAME.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"cargo build -p pav_tools --bin pav                     # first build: a few minutes\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/docs/CREATURE_STUDIO.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":66,\"content\":\"cargo build --locked -p pav_app -p pav_tools\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/AGENTS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":110,\"content\":\"  pavilion's egui UI; native and wasm32.\"},{\"line_number\":133,\"content\":\"cargo build                        # everything (Linux)\"},{\"line_number\":147,\"content\":\"Browser build: `cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")` code lives in `pav_app` (no threads, async GPU\"},{\"line_number\":149,\"content\":\"backend. Check it with `cargo clippy -p pav_app --target wasm32-unknown-unknown`. Headless\"},{\"line_number\":268,\"content\":\"- makes threads, blocking calls or file access reachable on `wasm32`.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/scripts/build-windows.sh\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\"cargo build --profile dist --target x86_64-pc-windows-gnu -p pav_app -p pav_tools\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/pavilion-lite/AGENTS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"cargo build                                  # first build: 1-3 minutes\"},{\"line_number\":380,\"content\":\"a running server also stops `cargo build` from replacing `pav.exe`. `record` warns if tools\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/pavilion-lite/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\"cargo build\"},{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\"For agents that use MCP (Claude Code reads `.mcp.json`), run `cargo build` in the folder\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/scripts/check-handoff.sh\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"cargo build --locked -q -p pav_tools --bin pav\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/scripts/build-web.sh\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"# Needs: rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown\"},{\"line_number\":32,\"content\":\"cargo build --locked --profile dist --target wasm32-unknown-unknown -p pav_app\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"wasm=${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/wasm32-unknown-unknown/dist/shardfall.wasm\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/docs/HISTORY.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\"- **Environment:** as on 2026-10-18 (Rust 1.98.1, the Windows-gnu and wasm32 targets,\"},{\"line_number\":98,\"content\":\"  built `pav`. `cargo build` and `cargo test --workspace` (462 pass, 2 ignored) are clean, and so\"},{\"line_number\":204,\"content\":\"- **Environment:** Rust 1.98.1 with the Linux, Windows-gnu and wasm32 targets; lavapipe Vulkan\"},{\"line_number\":417,\"content\":\"  `cargo clippy -p pav_app --target wasm32-unknown-unknown` warns about `drop` on a lock in\"},{\"line_number\":723,\"content\":\"- **Fixed on the way:** 437 embedded clips, not 423; `wasm32` code isn't only in `pav_app` (other\"},{\"line_number\":1050,\"content\":\"Checked in the same session: lavapipe captures, the pinned toolchains (wasm32 and Windows\"},{\"line_number\":1126,\"content\":\"    wasm32-unknown-unknown` pass.\"},{\"line_number\":1309,\"content\":\"  touches; `cargo check -p pav_app --target wasm32-unknown-unknown` passes. No shader change, so\"},{\"line_number\":3124,\"content\":\"  with plain `cargo build` on Rust 1.89+ and needs no system packages for headless use.\"},{\"line_number\":3584,\"content\":\"  pavilion_bg.wasm ~13 MB). Same `pav_app` crate with `cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")`: the sim is\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"7e0f0647-ee33-4dbf-92fa-ec176ae8018d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_342","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"An early return is in place. Checking for a running cargo process before starting the WASM build.\n\nChecking that the early return inside the closure compiles correctly. In Rust, `return` exits the closure itself, not the outer function. The return type should be `()` since `run_ui` expects a closure returning `()`.\n\nThe WASM build will run with block_until_ms 0 and be monitored. A full rebuild of the app crate in the dist profile may take several minutes.\n\nThe build will block for up to three minutes. It may be backgrounded if it exceeds that. The dist profile does not use incremental compilation, so the rebuild should take roughly the same time as before.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-78863526-2ab3-486a-b75b-a9262e5158e5-6","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/tests/pack.sh"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-78863526-2ab3-486a-b75b-a9262e5158e5-7","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"pgrep -af 'cargo|rustc' | head -40; echo '---'; ls -la \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/dist/shardfall.wasm\" 2>/dev/null | awk '{print $5,$6,$7,$8,$9}'","description":"Check cargo lock and existing wasm artifact"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4906,"output_tokens":752,"cache_read_input_tokens":37248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"6cf071a9-114d-48bd-b958-ac845483f50b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-78863526-2ab3-486a-b75b-a9262e5158e5-6","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# Inject unmodified session.js, bindgen the existing wasm, pack one HTML, restore the template.\\nset -euo pipefail\\nDEV=\\\"$(cd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/..\\\" && pwd)\\\"\\nENGINE=\\\"$DEV/engine\\\"\\nWORK=\\\"$(cd \\\"$DEV/..\\\" && pwd)\\\"\\nNAME=\\\"Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503\\\"\\nHTML=\\\"$WORK/$NAME.html\\\"\\nPAGE=\\\"$ENGINE/web/index.html\\\"\\n10→SESSION=\\\"$DEV/hub/session.js\\\"\\nWASM=\\\"$ENGINE/target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/dist/shardfall.wasm\\\"\\n[[ -f \\\"$WASM\\\" ]] || { echo \\\"FAIL: wasm missing: $WASM\\\" >&2; exit 1; }\\ncp \\\"$PAGE\\\" \\\"$PAGE.template\\\"\\nrestore() { mv -f \\\"$PAGE.template\\\" \\\"$PAGE\\\"; }\\ntrap restore EXIT\\npython3 - \\\"$PAGE\\\" \\\"$SESSION\\\" <<'PY'\\nimport pathlib, sys\\npage, session = map(pathlib.Path, sys.argv[1:])\\ntext = page.read_text()\\n20→js = session.read_bytes()\\nmarker = b\\\"/*__SESSION_JS__*/\\\"\\nraw = text.encode()\\nif raw.count(marker) != 1:\\n    raise SystemExit(\\\"marker missing\\\")\\nif b\\\"</script\\\" in js.lower() or b\\\"<!--\\\" in js or b\\\"<script\\\" in js.lower():\\n    raise SystemExit(\\\"session.js cannot sit in a script element\\\")\\npage.write_bytes(raw.replace(marker, js, 1))\\nPY\\nBINDGEN=\\\"$(mktemp -d)\\\"\\n30→wasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript --out-dir \\\"$BINDGEN\\\" --out-name shardfall \\\"$WASM\\\"\\n(\\n  cd \\\"$ENGINE\\\"\\n  python3 -I scripts/pack_single_html.py \\\"$BINDGEN\\\" \\\\\\n    --title \\\"Jam Cry\\\" \\\\\\n    --description \\\"A first-person contract in the last dry season. Keep the rifle working, burn a path, and choose how the ledger ends.\\\" \\\\\\n    --theme-color \\\"#2a2420\\\" \\\\\\n    --scene merc \\\\\\n    --out \\\"$HTML\\\"\\n)\\n40→rm -rf \\\"$BINDGEN\\