{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_357","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The title \"Jam Cry\" is visible and unobstructed.\n\nThe tagline is visible. The orange contract bar and the Multiplayer, Settings, and About buttons are all present. The 3D overlook shows trees, a character, a mound, laterite, and a warm sky. No room card or duplicate Settings appear.\n\nThe player mesh is acceptable since the plan only requires the dressed overlook. The dotted ground texture near the character is a shadow or decal. Launch2 at 1280x720 comes first, followed by hub and run.sh. Screenshots will be copied to scratch only after both launch images are verified.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ff4f261-98cd-490d-a5b3-721ebe16fab1-30","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"DEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503\"\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer\"\ncd \"$DEV\"\npython3 tests/browser.py launch2 > \"$SCRATCH/launch2.log\" 2>&1\necho LAUNCH2:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/launch2.log\"\ncat \"$SCRATCH/launch2.log\"","description":"Launch packed page at 1280x720 and screenshot","block_until_ms":200000}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ff4f261-98cd-490d-a5b3-721ebe16fab1-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^## |^\\[ \\]|Verification|Deviations|launch","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91%2Fwork/01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558/goal/plan.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":844,"output_tokens":793,"cache_read_input_tokens":69504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"506024d3-9764-4809-828f-c77581e7e8d2"}
