pitch >= -1.15 - 1e-3);\"},{\"line_number\":118,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.stance == 1 && (w.eye - 1.02).abs() < 0.08, \\\"eye {}\\\", w.eye);\"},{\"line_number\":121,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.stance == 2 && w.eye < 0.6, \\\"eye {}\\\", w.eye);\"},{\"line_number\":124,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":125,\"content\":\"fn hits_use_zones_and_walls_block() {\"},{\"line_number\":134,\"content\":\"    assert!(hp < 100.0 - 50.0, \\\"headshot damage, hp {hp}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":141,\"content\":\"    assert!(limb > 80.0 && limb < 90.0, \\\"limb damage, hp {limb}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":148,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.bodies[0].hp, 100.0, \\\"wall blocks the ray\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":151,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":152,\"content\":\"fn jams_match_the_curve_and_a_slap_shortens_the_clear() {\"},{\"line_number\":168,\"content\":\"    assert!(jams > 5000 / 30 && jams < 5000 / 12, \\\"jams {jams}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":174,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(stuck.pull(&mut rng, 1.0, 1.0, 8.0), pav_core::games::merc::gun::Pull::Jammed);\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(stuck.ammo, before, \\\"a jam spends no round\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":181,\"content\":\"    assert!((clear - expect).abs() < 0.01 && clear >= 1.2 && clear <= 2.5, \\\"{clear}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":183,\"content\":\"    assert!((stuck.clear_left - clear * 0.6).abs() < 0.02, \\\"{}\\\", stuck.clear_left);\"},{\"line_number\":186,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":187,\"content\":\"fn a_worn_gun_breaks_and_a_jammed_soldier_stops() {\"},{\"line_number\":207,\"content\":\"    assert!(broke, \\\"condition 5 should break inside 90s\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":227,\"content\":\"    assert!(saw_jam, \\\"soldier should jam\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":229,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.bodies[0].gun.shots, shots_at_jam, \\\"a jammed soldier stops firing\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":232,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":233,\"content\":\"fn fire_runs_downwind_and_respects_breaks() {\"},{\"line_number\":236,\"content\":\"    assert!(map.ignite_at(origin.0, origin.1, 30.0, 0.0));\"},{\"line_number\":243,\"content\":\"    assert!(up > 0.0, \\\"upwind reach {up}, down {down}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":244,\"content\":\"    assert!(down >= up * 3.0, \\\"down {down} up {up}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":265,\"content\":\"    assert!(aspect < 2.5, \\\"calm scar aspect {aspect} dx {dx} dz {dz}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":270,\"content\":\"    assert!(!geom::on_road(south.0, south.1));\"},{\"line_number\":280,\"content\":\"    assert!(!crossed, \\\"speed 8 does not jump the road\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":292,\"content\":\"    assert!(hopped, \\\"wind above 8 can throw an ember across the road\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":298,\"content\":\"    assert!(!ash.ignite_at(origin.0, origin.1, 5.0, 10.0), \\\"burnt ground refuses a new fire\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":299,\"content\":\"    assert!(ash.ignite_at(origin.0, origin.1, 5.0, 10.0 + 2880.0));\"},{\"line_number\":304,\"content\":\"    assert!(n > 0 && wet.burning_count() == 0);\"},{\"line_number\":308,\"content\":\"    assert!(lit > 8, \\\"barrel disk lit {lit}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":311,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":312,\"content\":\"fn exposure_smoke_and_noise() {\"},{\"line_number\":315,\"content\":\"    assert!((night - 0.04725).abs() < 1e-5);\"},{\"line_number\":316,\"content\":\"    assert!((noon - 0.5).abs() < 1e-5);\"},{\"line_number\":317,\"content\":\"    assert!(noon / night > 10.0);\"},{\"line_number\":323,\"content\":\"    assert!(quiet.fire.ignite_at(mid.0, mid.1, 30.0, quiet.minutes));\"},{\"line_number\":326,\"content\":\"    assert!(loud.bodies[0].see > quiet.bodies[0].see + 0.05, \\\"smoke {} open {}\\\", quiet.bodies[0].see, loud.bodies[0].see);\"},{\"line_number\":332,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.bodies[0].alert, 1, \\\"a loud shot makes them suspicious\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":335,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":336,\"content\":\"fn squad_caps_shooters_and_breaks() {\"},{\"line_number\":344,\"content\":\"    assert!(firing <= 4, \\\"shooters {firing}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":345,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.bodies[5].x > x5 + 1.0, \\\"the extra soldier flanks\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":359,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.bodies[3].x > x + 2.0, \\\"morale sends the last soldier away\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":360,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.bodies[3].gun.shots, shots);\"},{\"line_number\":363,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":364,\"content\":\"fn post_remans_only_when_nobody_is_looking() {\"},{\"line_number\":373,\"content\":\"    assert!(!w.flags.contains(\\\"post_remanned\\\"), \\\"looking at the post holds it\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":376,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"post_remanned\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":379,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":380,\"content\":\"fn fever_pills_blackout_and_healing() {\"},{\"line_number\":384,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"fever_warned\\\") && w.fever_state == 1);\"},{\"line_number\":386,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"pill_taken\\\") && w.fever_state == 0);\"},{\"line_number\":387,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.pills, 2);\"},{\"line_number\":397,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"blackout\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":398,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.hp >= 50.0 && w.hp < 70.0, \\\"woke at 50 and started to recover, hp {}\\\", w.hp);\"},{\"line_number\":399,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.diamonds, 32);\"},{\"line_number\":401,\"content\":\"    assert!(geom::dist(w.x, w.z, safe.0, safe.1) < 1.0);\"},{\"line_number\":407,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"syrette\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":408,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.hp > 90.0, \\\"hp {}\\\", w.hp);\"},{\"line_number\":414,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"wound_gunshot\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":415,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.hp >= 40.0 && w.hp < 50.0, \\\"treated to 40 then recovered, hp {}\\\", w.hp);\"},{\"line_number\":420,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\") && w.hp >= 50.0);\"},{\"line_number\":421,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.companions.iter().any(|c| c.rescue_spent));\"},{\"line_number\":425,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.hp < 5.0, \\\"a second rescue waits until sleep, hp {}\\\", w.hp);\"},{\"line_number\":427,\"content\":\"    assert!(loaded.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":428,\"content\":\"    assert!(loaded.companions.iter().any(|c| c.rescue_spent));\"},{\"line_number\":431,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":432,\"content\":\"fn vehicles_climb_break_and_float() {\"},{\"line_number\":446,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.ride.pitch > 0.01, \\\"pitch {}\\\", w.ride.pitch);\"},{\"line_number\":447,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"technical_driven\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":450,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.ride.roll < 0.3);\"},{\"line_number\":455,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.ride.stage >= 1, \\\"stage {}\\\", w.ride.stage);\"},{\"line_number\":457,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.ride.stage, 3, \\\"health {}\\\", w.ride.health);\"},{\"line_number\":459,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"ignite_vehicle\\\") || w.ride.stage == 4);\"},{\"line_number\":469,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(\\\"repair_done\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":470,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.ride.health >= 70.0);\"},{\"line_number\":479,\"content\":\"    assert!(!geom::deep_water(200.0, -200.0));\"},{\"line_number\":483,\"content\":\"    assert!(dry.ride.speed.abs() < 0.2, \\\"boat on grass {}\\\", dry.ride.speed);\"},{\"line_number\":496,\"content\":\"    assert!(wet.flags.contains(\\\"boat_driven\\\"), \\\"dist {} deep {}\\\", wet.ride.dist, geom::deep_water(wet.ride.x, wet.ride.z));\"},{\"line_number\":501,\"content\":\"    assert!((wet.ride.x - wx).abs() > 0.5 || (wet.ride.z - z0).abs() > 0.5);\"},{\"line_number\":508,\"content\":\"    assert!(wet.flags.contains(\\\"mounted_gun\\\"));\"},{\"line_number\":511,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":512,\"content\":\"fn shop_tracker_and_shell() {\"},{\"line_number\":516,\"content\":\"    assert!(!w.try_buy());\"},{\"line_number\":517,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.guns.len(), guns);\"},{\"line_number\":518,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.diamonds, 0);\"},{\"line_number\":524,\"content\":\"    assert!(near > far && far > 0.0, \\\"{near} vs {far}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":527,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.rows().len() <= 7);\"},{\"line_number\":538,\"content\":\"                assert!(w.rows().len() <= 7, \\\"{screen:?} tab {tab} page {page} {:?}\\\", w.rows());\"},{\"line_number\":545,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.focus, 2);\"},{\"line_number\":547,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.screen, Screen::Title);\"},{\"line_number\":551,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.focus, 1);\"},{\"line_number\":553,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.screen, Screen::Difficulty);\"},{\"line_number\":555,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", Device::Gamepad, false), \\\"Cross\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":556,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", Device::Gamepad, true), \\\"A\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":557,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(glyph(\\\"fire\\\", Device::Keyboard, false), \\\"LMB\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":558,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(glyph(\\\"reload\\\", Device::Gamepad, false), \\\"Square\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":566,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.tune.fire_spread > before, \\\"{} -> {}\\\", before, w.tune.fire_spread);\"},{\"line_number\":570,\"content\":\"    assert!((w.tune.fire_spread - w.tune0.fire_spread).abs() < 1e-4);\"},{\"line_number\":576,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.screen, Screen::Attract);\"},{\"line_number\":583,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.attract_loops >= 5, \\\"loops {}\\\", w.attract_loops);\"},{\"line_number\":584,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.attract_seen, (1u16 << 10) - 1, \\\"seen {:b}\\\", w.attract_seen);\"},{\"line_number\":585,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.saves_written, saves);\"},{\"line_number\":593,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(w.screen, Screen::Playing, \\\"{seen:?}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":594,\"content\":\"    assert!(seen.windows(2).all(|p| p[0] != p[1]), \\\"{seen:?}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":597,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":598,\"content\":\"fn fiction_has_no_source_names_and_no_audio_files() {\"},{\"line_number\":602,\"content\":\"        \\\"todo\\\", \\\"tbd\\\", \\\"placeholder\\\", \\\"lorem\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":607,\"content\":\"            assert!(line.contains(\\\"Source:\\\"), \\\"{line}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":610,\"content\":\"            assert!(!low.contains(word), \\\"{word} in {line}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":618,\"content\":\"            assert!(!text.contains(word), \\\"{word} in {}\\\", path.display());\"},{\"line_number\":624,\"content\":\"    assert!(audio.is_empty(), \\\"shipped audio files: {audio:?}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":627,\"content\":\"fn walk_audio(dir: &Path, out: &mut Vec<String>) {\"},{\"line_number\":644,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":645,\"content\":\"fn net_loopback_shares_one_fire_cell() {\"},{\"line_number\":648,\"content\":\"    assert!(host.fire.ignite_at(200.0, -200.0, 10.0, host.minutes));\"},{\"line_number\":651,\"content\":\"    assert!(link.max_bytes < 1200);\"},{\"line_number\":656,\"content\":\"    assert!(bodies.iter().any(|b| b.contains(\\\"\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fire\\\\\\\"\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":659,\"content\":\"    assert!(shared, \\\"host and client should share a burning cell within 1s\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":661,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(link.finishes, 1);\"},{\"line_number\":663,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(link.finishes, 1);\"},{\"line_number\":668,\"content\":\"    assert!(lossy.poll().is_empty());\"},{\"line_number\":671,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(lossy.poll().len(), 1);\"},{\"line_number\":687,\"content\":\"fn play_route(route: Route, seed: u64) -> BTreeSet<String> {\"},{\"line_number\":714,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.finished, \\\"{route:?} seed {seed} did not finish by {t:.0}s goal {} at ({:.0},{:.0})\\\", w.goal_name(), w.x, w.z);\"},{\"line_number\":720,\"content\":\"    assert!(w.flags.contains(end), \\\"{route:?} missing {end}\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":724,\"content\":\"#[test]\"},{\"line_number\":725,\"content\":\"fn bot_plays_all_three_endings() {\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-df0cdadf-94d5-43bd-9e5a-d74f076b8ac3-14","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→warning: variable `goal` is assigned to, but never used\\n   --> crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs:689:9\\n    |\\n689 |     let mut goal = String::new();\\n    |         ^^^^^^^^\\n    |\\n    = note: consider using `_goal` instead\\n    = note: `#[warn(unused_variables)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\\n\\n10→warning: value assigned to `goal` is never read\\n   --> crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs:701:13\\n    |\\n701 |             goal = now;\\n    |             ^^^^\\n    |\\n    = help: maybe it is overwritten before being read?\\n    = note: `#[warn(unused_assignments)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\\n\\nwarning: `pav_core` (test \\\"merc\\\") generated 2 warnings\\n20→    Finished `test` profile [optimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.09s\\n     Running tests/merc.rs (target/debug/deps/merc-b2f028caa874fecd)\\n\\nrunning 1 test\\ntest bot_plays_all_three_endings ... ok\\n\\ntest result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 15 filtered out; finished in 0.69s\\n\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→warning: variable `goal` is assigned to, but never used\\n   --> crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs:689:9\\n    |\\n689 |     let mut goal = String::new();\\n    |         ^^^^^^^^\\n    |\\n    = note: consider using `_goal` instead\\n    = note: `#[warn(unused_variables)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\\n\\n10→warning: value assigned to `goal` is never read\\n   --> crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs:701:13\\n    |\\n701 |             goal = now;\\n    |  