       Spec::Blackout => {\"},{\"line_number\":781,\"content\":\"            Spec::Fight => {\"},{\"line_number\":788,\"content\":\"            Spec::EnemyJam => {\"},{\"line_number\":792,\"content\":\"            Spec::Jam => {\"},{\"line_number\":801,\"content\":\"            Spec::Break => {\"},{\"line_number\":813,\"content\":\"            Spec::Rescue => {\"},{\"line_number\":822,\"content\":\"            Spec::Wound(n) => {\"},{\"line_number\":828,\"content\":\"            Spec::Syrette => {\"},{\"line_number\":834,\"content\":\"            Spec::Shop => {\"},{\"line_number\":839,\"content\":\"            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\"},{\"line_number\":853,\"content\":\"            Spec::Mono => {\"},{\"line_number\":858,\"content\":\"            Spec::Tanks => {\"},{\"line_number\":861,\"content\":\"            Spec::Panic => {\"},{\"line_number\":871,\"content\":\"            Spec::Animals => {\"},{\"line_number\":875,\"content\":\"            Spec::Night => {\"},{\"line_number\":879,\"content\":\"            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\"},{\"line_number\":883,\"content\":\"            Spec::Boat => {\"},{\"line_number\":895,\"content\":\"            Spec::Stealth => {\"},{\"line_number\":904,\"content\":\"            Spec::Dart => {\"},{\"line_number\":910,\"content\":\"            Spec::Repair => {\"},{\"line_number\":921,\"content\":\"            Spec::Rain => {\"},{\"line_number\":937,\"content\":\"            Spec::Better => {\"},{\"line_number\":946,\"content\":\"            Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose | Spec::Die => {\"},{\"line_number\":951,\"content\":\"                    c.x = if matches!(spec, Spec::Die) { self.x + 40.0 } else { self.x + 1.5 };\"},{\"line_number\":954,\"content\":\"                if matches!(spec, Spec::Overdose) {\"},{\"line_number\":960,\"content\":\"            Spec::Ceasefire => {\"},{\"line_number\":965,\"content\":\"            Spec::Convoy => {\"},{\"line_number\":971,\"content\":\"            Spec::Town => {\"},{\"line_number\":978,\"content\":\"            Spec::Ending(1) => {\"},{\"line_number\":986,\"content\":\"            Spec::Flag(s) => self.mark(s),\"},{\"line_number\":993,\"content\":\"            Spec::Boot => self.screen == Screen::Playing,\"},{\"line_number\":994,\"content\":\"            Spec::Map => self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":995,\"content\":\"            Spec::Way => self.flags.contains(\\\"waypoint_set\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":996,\"content\":\"            Spec::Reach { x, z, gps } => {\"},{\"line_number\":1002,\"content\":\"            Spec::Fever => self.flags.contains(\\\"fever_warned\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1003,\"content\":\"            Spec::Pill => self.flags.contains(\\\"pill_taken\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1004,\"content\":\"            Spec::Blackout => self.flags.contains(\\\"blackout\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1005,\"content\":\"            Spec::Fight => {\"},{\"line_number\":1014,\"content\":\"            Spec::EnemyJam => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_jam\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1015,\"content\":\"            Spec::Jam => self.flags.contains(\\\"jam_cleared\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1016,\"content\":\"            Spec::Break => {\"},{\"line_number\":1023,\"content\":\"            Spec::Rescue => self.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1024,\"content\":\"            Spec::Wound(n) => self.flags.contains(wound_flag(n)),\"},{\"line_number\":1025,\"content\":\"            Spec::Loot => self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar),\"},{\"line_number\":1026,\"content\":\"            Spec::Claim => self.flags.contains(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1027,\"content\":\"            Spec::Shop => self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_bought\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1028,\"content\":\"            Spec::Locker => self.flags.contains(\\\"locker_used\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1029,\"content\":\"            Spec::Syrette => self.flags.contains(\\\"syrette\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1030,\"content\":\"            Spec::Tracker => self.flags.contains(\\\"cache_tracker\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1031,\"content\":\"            Spec::Sleep { .. } => self.flags.contains(\\\"sleep_used\\\") && self.step_t > 0.2,\"},{\"line_number\":1032,\"content\":\"            Spec::Drive { x, z } => geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0 && self.flags.contains(\\\"technical_driven\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1033,\"content\":\"            Spec::Mono => self.flags.contains(\\\"monocular_tag\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1034,\"content\":\"            Spec::Ignite(n) => self.flags.contains(ignite_flag(n)),\"},{\"line_number\":1035,\"content\":\"            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\\\"cells_500\\\") && self.flags.contains(\\\"explosion_chain\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1036,\"content\":\"            Spec::Mounted => self.flags.contains(\\\"mounted_gun\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1037,\"content\":\"            Spec::Panic => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1038,\"content\":\"            Spec::Animals => self.flags.contains(\\\"animals_fled\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1039,\"content\":\"            Spec::Bus { x, z } => self.flags.contains(\\\"bus_taken\\\") && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0,\"},{\"line_number\":1040,\"content\":\"            Spec::Night => self.flags.contains(\\\"night_contract\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1041,\"content\":\"            Spec::Boat => self.flags.contains(\\\"boat_driven\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1042,\"content\":\"            Spec::Stealth => self.flags.contains(\\\"stealth_kill\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1043,\"content\":\"            Spec::Dart => self.flags.contains(\\\"dart_kill\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1044,\"content\":\"            Spec::Repair => self.flags.contains(\\\"repair_done\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1045,\"content\":\"            Spec::Rain => self.flags.contains(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1046,\"content\":\"            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\") || self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.down),\"},{\"line_number\":1047,\"content\":\"            Spec::Patch => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_patched\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1048,\"content\":\"            Spec::Overdose => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1049,\"content\":\"            Spec::Die => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_died\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1050,\"content\":\"            Spec::Tape => self.flags.contains(\\\"tape_played\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1051,\"content\":\"            Spec::Ceasefire => self.flags.contains(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1052,\"content\":\"            Spec::Convoy => self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 6).all(|b| !b.alive) && !self.bodies.is_empty(),\"},{\"line_number\":1053,\"content\":\"            Spec::Town => self.flags.contains(\\\"town_burned\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1054,\"content\":\"            Spec::Ending(n) => self.flags.contains(ending_flag(n)),\"},{\"line_number\":1055,\"content\":\"            Spec::Flag(s) => self.flags.contains(s),\"},{\"line_number\":1059,\"content\":\"    fn bot_spec(&self, spec: Spec) -> InputFrame {\"},{\"line_number\":1062,\"content\":\"            Spec::Map => {\"},{\"line_number\":1066,\"content\":\"            Spec::Way | Spec::Claim | Spec::Shop | Spec::Locker | Spec::Loot | Spec::Tape | Spec::Ending(2) => {\"},{\"line_number\":1071,\"content\":\"            Spec::Reach { x, z, .. } => return self.bot_go(x, z, true),\"},{\"line_number\":1072,\"content\":\"            Spec::Tracker => {\"},{\"line_number\":1076,\"content\":\"            Spec::Pill => {\"},{\"line_number\":1080,\"content\":\"            Spec::Fight | Spec::Ceasefire | Spec::Convoy | Spec::Ignite(10) => {\"},{\"line_number\":1086,\"content\":\"            Spec::EnemyJam | Spec::Blackout | Spec::Fever | Spec::Die | Spec::Ending(1) => {\"},{\"line_number\":1087,\"content\":\"                if matches!(spec, Spec::Ending(1)) {\"},{\"line_number\":1091,\"content\":\"            Spec::Jam | Spec::Break => {\"},{\"line_number\":1100,\"content\":\"            Spec::Rescue => {}\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"3dde925b-500c-417e-8d11-0f863d557efe"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_404","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9547bcd0-47e6-42a0-92f9-62d5cc930746-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":743,"limit":520}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3580,"output_tokens":158,"cache_read_input_tokens":86912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"d88e6c9b-be39-4660-8f2b-74a6c34df0f7"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9547bcd0-47e6-42a0-92f9-62d5cc930746-36","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"743→    fn advance_script(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.finished {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.step_t += dt;\\n        for _ in 0..12 {\\n            let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\\n750→                self.finished = true;\\n                break;\\n            };\\n            if !self.step_ready {\\n                self.begin(spec);\\n                self.step_ready = true;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if self.done(spec) {\\n                self.step += 1;\\n760→                self.step_ready = false;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            } else {\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn begin(&mut self, spec: Spec) {\\n        self.step_x = self.x;\\n770→        self.step_z = self.z;\\n        self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Fever => {\\n                self.fever_t = self.tune.fever_interval;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Blackout => {\\n                self.pills = 0;\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n780→            }\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..4 {\\n                    let ang = i as f32 * 0.4;\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + ang.sin() * 12.0, self.z - 12.0, 36.0, false);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n790→                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 8.0, 80.0, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam => {\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.force_jam = true;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.ammo = 12;\\n                g.condition = 40.0;\\n                self.jam_seen = false;\\n800→            }\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Smg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.condition = 5.0;\\n                g.wear = 0.0;\\n                g.ammo = 999;\\n                g.reserve = 999;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n810→                g.broken = false;\\n                g.cooldown = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {\\n                self.hp = 0.0;\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\\n                    c.alive = true;\\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\\n                    c.down = false;\\n820→                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => {\\n                self.hp = 15.0;\\n                self.wound = n;\\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n                self.treating = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                if self.hp > 70.0 {\\n830→                    self.hp = 45.0;\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(1);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Shop => {\\n                if !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Battle) {\\n                    // The shelf is stocked. Buying happens on the interact.\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\\n840→                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\\n                // Inland legs need the technical. A boat left on the channel cannot climb the bank.\\n                if self.ride.kind != 1 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n850→                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 24.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks => {\\n                self.spawn_tank_farm();\\n860→            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                let sx = self.x + 4.0;\\n                let sz = self.z - 4.0;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(sx, sz, 40.0, false);\\n                // Runners sprint +x. One 2 m cell ends before flee passes 3.\\n                for i in 0..6 {\\n                    let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(sx + i as f32 * 4.0, sz, 3.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                }\\n870→            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_animal(self.x + 6.0, self.z - 6.0);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Night => {\\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"night_contract\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n880→                // The short rest already set this. The long rest has to happen on its own.\\n                self.flags.remove(\\\"sleep_used\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (wx, wz) = geom::nearest_water(self.x, self.z);\\n                self.ride.kind = 2;\\n                self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                self.ride.x = wx;\\n                self.ride.z = wz;\\n                self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n890→                self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                self.x = wx;\\n                self.z = wz;\\n                self.boat_dist = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 2.0, 40.0, false);\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.last_mut() {\\n                    b.yaw = 0.0;\\n900→                    b.alert = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.stance = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 18.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Dart));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n910→            Spec::Repair => {\\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                self.ride.seat = 0;\\n                self.ride.health = 35.0;\\n                self.ride.stage = 2;\\n                self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n920→            }\\n            Spec::Rain => {\\n                // The boat step leaves you on the channel. Rain has to quench grass, not water.\\n                let mut lit = false;\\n                for r in [16.0, 22.0, 30.0, 40.0] {\\n                    for (dx, dz) in [(r, 0.0), (-r, 0.0), (0.0, r), (0.0, -r)] {\\n                        if self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + dx, self.z + dz, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                            lit = true;\\n                            break;\\n                        }\\n930→                    }\\n                    if lit {\\n                        break;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                self.weather = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Better => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n940→                    c.down = true;\\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = self.x + 1.5;\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose | Spec::Die => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n                    c.down = true;\\n950→                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = if matches!(spec, Spec::Die) { self.x + 40.0 } else { self.x + 1.5 };\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Overdose) {\\n                    if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down) {\\n                        c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n960→            Spec::Ceasefire => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Sniper));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 30.0, 30.0, false);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Convoy => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_truck(self.x, self.z - 16.0);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Rpg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n970→            }\\n            Spec::Town => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Kilometre 40\\\");\\n                self.x = tx;\\n                self.z = tz;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(tx, tz + 20.0, 10.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"town_burned\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n980→                for i in 0..3 {\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 40.0 + i as f32 * 4.0, self.z - 50.0, 30.0, false);\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(4);\\n                self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.mark(s),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n990→\\n    fn done(&mut self, spec: Spec) -> bool {\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Boot => self.screen == Screen::Playing,\\n            Spec::Map => self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\"),\\n            Spec::Way => self.flags.contains(\\\"waypoint_set\\\"),\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, gps } => {\\n                if gps && self.waypoint.is_some() && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.step_x, self.step_z) > 25.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"gps_followed\\\");\\n                }\\n1000→                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 10.0 && (!gps || self.flags.contains(\\\"gps_followed\\\"))\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fever => self.flags.contains(\\\"fever_warned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Pill => self.flags.contains(\\\"pill_taken\\\"),\\n            Spec::Blackout => self.flags.contains(\\\"blackout\\\"),\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                let clear = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 1).all(|b| !b.alive);\\n                if clear && !self.bodies.is_empty() {\\n                    self.post_clear = true;\\n                    self.post_reman_at = self.minutes + self.tune.post_reman_hours * 60.0;\\n1010→                    self.mark(\\\"post_cleared\\\");\\n                }\\n                clear && self.flags.contains(\\\"post_cleared\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_jam\\\"),\\n            Spec::Jam => self.flags.contains(\\\"jam_cleared\\\"),\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().broken {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n                    self.slot = 0;\\n1020→                }\\n                self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_broke\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => self.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\"),\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => self.flags.contains(wound_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Loot => self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar),\\n            Spec::Claim => self.flags.contains(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Shop => self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_bought\\\"),\\n            Spec::Locker => self.flags.contains(\\\"locker_used\\\"),\\n            Spec::Syrette => self.flags.contains(\\\"syrette\\\"),\\n1030→            Spec::Tracker => self.flags.contains(\\\"cache_tracker\\\"),\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => self.flags.contains(\\\"sleep_used\\\") && self.step_t > 0.2,\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0 && self.flags.contains(\\\"technical_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mono => self.flags.contains(\\\"monocular_tag\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ignite(n) => self.flags.contains(ignite_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\\\"cells_500\\\") && self.flags.contains(\\\"explosion_chain\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mounted => self.flags.contains(\\\"mounted_gun\\\"),\\n            Spec::Panic => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\"),\\n            Spec::Animals => self.flags.contains(\\\"animals_fled\\\"),\\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => self.flags.contains(\\\"bus_taken\\\") && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0,\\n1040→            Spec::Night => self.flags.contains(\\\"night_contract\\\"),\\n            Spec::Boat => self.flags.contains(\\\"boat_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Stealth => self.flags.contains(\\\"stealth_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Dart => self.flags.contains(\\\"dart_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Repair => self.flags.contains(\\\"repair_done\\\"),\\n            Spec::Rain => self.flags.contains(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\"),\\n            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\") || self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.down),\\n            Spec::Patch => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_patched\\\"),\\n            Spec::Overdose => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Die => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_died\\\"),\\n1050→            Spec::Tape => self.flags.contains(\\\"tape_played\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => self.flags.contains(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\"),\\n            Spec::Convoy => self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 6).all(|b| !b.alive) && !self.bodies.is_empty(),\\n            Spec::Town => self.flags.contains(\\\"town_burned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ending(n) => self.flags.contains(ending_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.flags.contains(s),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_spec(&self, spec: Spec) -> InputFrame {\\n1060→        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Map => {\\n                f.held = buttons::MAP;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MAP;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Way | Spec::Claim | Spec::Shop | Spec::Locker | Spec::Loot | Spec::Tape | Spec::Ending(2) => {\\n                f.act = 1;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n1070→            }\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, .. } => return self.bot_go(x, z, true),\\n            Spec::Tracker => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = self.tracker_cache;\\n                return self.bot_go(tx, tz, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Pill => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PILLS;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PILLS;\\n            }\\n1080→            Spec::Fight | Spec::Ceasefire | Spec::Convoy | Spec::Ignite(10) => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind != 3) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.7, true);\\n                }\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam | Spec::Blackout | Spec::Fever | Spec::Die | Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Ending(1)) {\\n                    f.held = buttons::CROUCH;\\n                }\\n1090→            }\\n            Spec::Jam | Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().jammed {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                    f.held = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n1100→            Spec::Rescue => {}\\n            Spec::Wound(_) => {\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n1110→                let (hx, hz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, hx, hz) > 8.0 && self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    return self.bot_go(hx, hz, true);\\n                }\\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                }\\n1120→            }\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = (x, z);\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Bus { .. } => {\\n1130→                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Junction\\\");\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    let mut aim = self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.6, false);\\n1140→                    aim.held |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    aim.pressed |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    return aim;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => {\\n                if k == 10 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                } else if k == 11 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n1150→                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks | Spec::Mounted => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Mounted) {\\n1160→                    f.pressed |= buttons::USE;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                // A shot already happened. Firing again drops the herd before it clears the grass.\\n                f.held = buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {}\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::water_ahead(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 50.0);\\n1170→                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                f.held = buttons::CROUCH | buttons::MELEE;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MELEE;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\\n                }\\n1180→            }\\n            Spec::Repair | Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose => {\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain | Spec::Night | Spec::Better | Spec::Flag(_) | Spec::Town | Spec::Ending(0) => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n1190→        let _ = shell::glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.xbox);\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_go(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, sprint: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.x, self.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.4, 1.4);\\n        if err.abs() < 0.4 {\\n1200→            f.move_dir.y = 1.0;\\n            if sprint && self.stamina > 1.0 {\\n                f.held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_drive(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, tx, tz);\\n1210→        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.axes.x = err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n        f.axes.y = 1.0;\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_aim(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, ty: f32, fire: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let dx = tx - self.x;\\n        let dz = tz - self.z;\\n1220→        let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.2);\\n        let desired = dx.atan2(-dz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let perr = ((ty - self.eye) / dist).atan() - self.pitch;\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.5, 1.5);\\n        f.look.y = perr.clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n        if fire && err.abs() < 0.2 && perr.abs() < 0.2 {\\n            f.held |= buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            f.pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n1230→        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn start_playing(&mut self) {\\n        self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::place(\\\"Airstrip\\\");\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n        self.yaw = 0.0;\\n1240→        self.eye = 1.58;\\n        self.idle = 0.0;\\n        self.pitch = 0.08;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn simulate(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        self.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.yaw + input.look.x);\\n        self.pitch = (self.pitch + input.look.y).clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.roll = (self.minutes * 2.0).sin() * 0.05 * self.tune.fever_severity;\\n1250→        } else {\\n            self.roll *= 0.9;\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::CRAWL) {\\n            self.stance = 2;\\n        } else if input.down(buttons::CROUCH) {\\n            self.stance = 1;\\n        } else if !self.treating {\\n            self.stance = 0;\\n        }\\n1260→        let target_eye = match self.stance {\\n            2 => 0.42,\\n            1 => 1.02,\",\"content_concise\":\"743→    fn advance_script(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.finished {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.step_t += dt;\\n        for _ in 0..12 {\\n            let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\\n750→                self.finished = true;\\n                break;\\n            };\\n            if !self.step_ready {\\n                self.begin(spec);\\n                self.step_ready = true;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if self.done(spec) {\\n                self.step += 1;\\n760→                self.step_ready = false;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            } else {\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn begin(&mut self, spec: Spec) {\\n        self.step_x = self.x;\\n770→        self.step_z = self.z;\\n        self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Fever => {\\n                self.fever_t = self.tune.fever_interval;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Blackout => {\\n                self.pills = 0;\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n780→            }\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..4 {\\n                    let ang = i as f32 * 0.4;\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + ang.sin() * 12.0, self.z - 12.0, 36.0, false);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n790→                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 8.0, 80.0, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam => {\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.force_jam = true;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.ammo = 12;\\n                g.condition = 40.0;\\n                self.jam_seen = false;\\n800→            }\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Smg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.condition = 5.0;\\n                g.wear = 0.0;\\n                g.ammo = 999;\\n                g.reserve = 999;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n810→                g.broken = false;\\n                g.cooldown = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {\\n                self.hp = 0.0;\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\\n                    c.alive = true;\\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\\n                    c.down = false;\\n820→                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => {\\n                self.hp = 15.0;\\n                self.wound = n;\\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n                self.treating = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                if self.hp > 70.0 {\\n830→                    self.hp = 45.0;\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(1);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Shop => {\\n                if !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Battle) {\\n                    // The shelf is stocked. Buying happens on the interact.\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\\n840→                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\\n                // Inland legs need the technical. A boat left on the channel cannot climb the bank.\\n                if self.ride.kind != 1 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n850→                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 24.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks => {\\n                self.spawn_tank_farm();\\n860→            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                let sx = self.x + 4.0;\\n                let sz = self.z - 4.0;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(sx, sz, 40.0, false);\\n                // Runners sprint +x. One 2 m cell ends before flee passes 3.\\n                for i in 0..6 {\\n                    let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(sx + i as f32 * 4.0, sz, 3.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                }\\n870→            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_animal(self.x + 6.0, self.z - 6.0);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Night => {\\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"night_contract\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n880→                // The short rest already set this. The long rest has to happen on its own.\\n                self.flags.remove(\\\"sleep_used\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (wx, wz) = geom::nearest_water(self.x, self.z);\\n                self.ride.kind = 2;\\n                self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                self.ride.x = wx;\\n                self.ride.z = wz;\\n                self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n890→                self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                self.x = wx;\\n                self.z = wz;\\n                self.boat_dist = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 2.0, 40.0, false);\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.last_mut() {\\n                    b.yaw = 0.0;\\n900→                    b.alert = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.stance = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 18.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Dart));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n910→            Spec::Repair => {\\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                self.ride.seat = 0;\\n                self.ride.health = 35.0;\\n                self.ride.stage = 2;\\n                self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n920→            }\\n            Spec::Rain => {\\n                // The boat step leaves you on the channel. Rain has to quench grass, not water.\\n                let mut lit = false;\\n                for r in [16.0, 22.0, 30.0, 40.0] {\\n                    for (dx, dz) in [(r, 0.0), (-r, 0.0), (0.0, r), (0.0, -r)] {\\n                        if self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + dx, self.z + dz, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                            lit = true;\\n                            break;\\n                        }\\n930→                    }\\n                    if lit {\\n                        break;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                self.weather = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Better => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n940→                    c.down = true;\\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = self.x + 1.5;\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose | Spec::Die => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n                    c.down = true;\\n950→                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = if matches!(spec, Spec::Die) { self.x + 40.0 } else { self.x + 1.5 };\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Overdose) {\\n                    if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down) {\\n                        c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n960→            Spec::Ceasefire => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Sniper));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 30.0, 30.0, false);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Convoy => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_truck(self.x, self.z - 16.0);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Rpg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n970→            }\\n            Spec::Town => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Kilometre 40\\\");\\n                self.x = tx;\\n                self.z = tz;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(tx, tz + 20.0, 10.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"town_burned\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n980→                for i in 0..3 {\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 40.0 + i as f32 * 4.0, self.z - 50.0, 30.0, false);\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(4);\\n                self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.mark(s),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n990→\\n    fn done(&mut self, spec: Spec) -> bool {\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Boot => self.screen == Screen::Playing,\\n            Spec::Map => self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\"),\\n            Spec::Way => self.flags.contains(\\\"waypoint_set\\\"),\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, gps } => {\\n                if gps && self.waypoint.is_some() && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.step_x, self.step_z) > 25.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"gps_followed\\\");\\n                }\\n1000→                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 10.0 && (!gps || self.flags.contains(\\\"gps_followed\\\"))\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fever => self.flags.contains(\\\"fever_warned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Pill => self.flags.contains(\\\"pill_taken\\\"),\\n            Spec::Blackout => self.flags.contains(\\\"blackout\\\"),\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                let clear = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 1).all(|b| !b.alive);\\n                if clear && !self.bodies.is_empty() {\\n                    self.post_clear = true;\\n                    self.post_reman_at = self.minutes + self.tune.post_reman_hours * 60.0;\\n1010→                    self.mark(\\\"post_cleared\\\");\\n                }\\n                clear && self.flags.contains(\\\"post_cleared\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_jam\\\"),\\n            Spec::Jam => self.flags.contains(\\\"jam_cleared\\\"),\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().broken {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n                    self.slot = 0;\\n1020→                }\\n                self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_broke\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => self.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\"),\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => self.flags.contains(wound_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Loot => self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar),\\n            Spec::Claim => self.flags.contains(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Shop => self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_bought\\\"),\\n            Spec::Locker => self.flags.contains(\\\"locker_used\\\"),\\n            Spec::Syrette => self.flags.contains(\\\"syrette\\\"),\\n1030→            Spec::Tracker => self.flags.contains(\\\"cache_tracker\\\"),\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => self.flags.contains(\\\"sleep_used\\\") && self.step_t > 0.2,\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0 && self.flags.contains(\\\"technical_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mono => self.flags.contains(\\\"monocular_tag\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ignite(n) => self.flags.contains(ignite_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\\\"cells_500\\\") && self.flags.contains(\\\"explosion_chain\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mounted => self.flags.contains(\\\"mounted_gun\\\"),\\n            Spec::Panic => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\"),\\n            Spec::Animals => self.flags.contains(\\\"animals_fled\\\"),\\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => self.flags.contains(\\\"bus_taken\\\") && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0,\\n1040→            Spec::Night => self.flags.contains(\\\"night_contract\\\"),\\n            Spec::Boat => self.flags.contains(\\\"boat_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Stealth => self.flags.contains(\\\"stealth_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Dart => self.flags.contains(\\\"dart_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Repair => self.flags.contains(\\\"repair_done\\\"),\\n            Spec::Rain => self.flags.contains(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\"),\\n            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\") || self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.down),\\n            Spec::Patch => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_patched\\\"),\\n            Spec::Overdose => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Die => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_died\\\"),\\n1050→            Spec::Tape => self.flags.contains(\\\"tape_played\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => self.flags.contains(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\"),\\n            Spec::Convoy => self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 6).all(|b| !b.alive) && !self.bodies.is_empty(),\\n            Spec::Town => self.flags.contains(\\\"town_burned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ending(n) => self.flags.contains(ending_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.flags.contains(s),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_spec(&self, spec: Spec) -> InputFrame {\\n1060→        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Map => {\\n                f.held = buttons::MAP;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MAP;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Way | Spec::Claim | Spec::Shop | Spec::Locker | Spec::Loot | Spec::Tape | Spec::Ending(2) => {\\n                f.act = 1;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n1070→            }\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, .. } => return self.bot_go(x, z, true),\\n            Spec::Tracker => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = self.tracker_cache;\\n                return self.bot_go(tx, tz, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Pill => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PILLS;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PILLS;\\n            }\\n1080→            Spec::Fight | Spec::Ceasefire | Spec::Convoy | Spec::Ignite(10) => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind != 3) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.7, true);\\n                }\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam | Spec::Blackout | Spec::Fever | Spec::Die | Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Ending(1)) {\\n                    f.held = buttons::CROUCH;\\n                }\\n1090→            }\\n            Spec::Jam | Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().jammed {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                    f.held = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n1100→            Spec::Rescue => {}\\n            Spec::Wound(_) => {\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n1110→                let (hx, hz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, hx, hz) > 8.0 && self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    return self.bot_go(hx, hz, true);\\n                }\\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                }\\n1120→            }\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = (x, z);\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Bus { .. } => {\\n1130→                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Junction\\\");\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    let mut aim = self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.6, false);\\n1140→                    aim.held |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    aim.pressed |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    return aim;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => {\\n                if k == 10 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                } else if k == 11 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n1150→                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks | Spec::Mounted => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Mounted) {\\n1160→                    f.pressed |= buttons::USE;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                // A shot already happened. Firing again drops the herd before it clears the grass.\\n                f.held = buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {}\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::water_ahead(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 50.0);\\n1170→                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                f.held = buttons::CROUCH | buttons::MELEE;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MELEE;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\\n                }\\n1180→            }\\n            Spec::Repair | Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose => {\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain | Spec::Night | Spec::Better | Spec::Flag(_) | Spec::Town | Spec::Ending(0) => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n1190→        let _ = shell::glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.xbox);\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_go(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, sprint: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.x, self.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.4, 1.4);\\n        if err.abs() < 0.4 {\\n1200→            f.move_dir.y = 1.0;\\n            if sprint && self.stamina > 1.0 {\\n                f.held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_drive(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, tx, tz);\\n1210→        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.axes.x = err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n        f.axes.y = 1.0;\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_aim(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, ty: f32, fire: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let dx = tx - self.x;\\n        let dz = tz - self.z;\\n1220→        let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.2);\\n        let desired = dx.atan2(-dz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let perr = ((ty - self.eye) / dist).atan() - self.pitch;\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.5, 1.5);\\n        f.look.y = perr.clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n        if fire && err.abs() < 0.2 && perr.abs() < 0.2 {\\n            f.held |= buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            f.pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n1230→        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn start_playing(&mut self) {\\n        self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::place(\\\"Airstrip\\\");\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n        self.yaw = 0.0;\\n1240→        self.eye = 1.58;\\n        self.idle = 0.0;\\n        self.pitch = 0.08;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn simulate(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        self.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.yaw + input.look.x);\\n        self.pitch = (self.pitch + input.look.y).clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.roll = (self.minutes * 2.0).sin() * 0.05 * self.tune.fever_severity;\\n1250→        } else {\\n            self.roll *= 0.9;\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::CRAWL) {\\n            self.stance = 2;\\n        } else if input.down(buttons::CROUCH) {\\n            self.stance = 1;\\n        } else if !self.treating {\\n            self.stance = 0;\\n        }\\n1260→        let target_eye = match self.stance {\\n            2 => 0.42,\\n            1 => 1.02,\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"offset\":743,\"limit\":520,\"raw_output\":\"    fn advance_script(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.finished {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.step_t += dt;\\n        for _ in 0..12 {\\n            let Some(spec) = self.current() else {\\n                self.finished = true;\\n                break;\\n            };\\n            if !self.step_ready {\\n                self.begin(spec);\\n                self.step_ready = true;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if self.done(spec) {\\n                self.step += 1;\\n                self.step_ready = false;\\n                self.step_t = 0.0;\\n            } else {\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn begin(&mut self, spec: Spec) {\\n        self.step_x = self.x;\\n        self.step_z = self.z;\\n        self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Fever => {\\n                self.fever_t = self.tune.fever_interval;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Blackout => {\\n                self.pills = 0;\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..4 {\\n                    let ang = i as f32 * 0.4;\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + ang.sin() * 12.0, self.z - 12.0, 36.0, false);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 8.0, 80.0, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam => {\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.force_jam = true;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.ammo = 12;\\n                g.condition = 40.0;\\n                self.jam_seen = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Smg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                let g = self.gun_mut();\\n                g.condition = 5.0;\\n                g.wear = 0.0;\\n                g.ammo = 999;\\n                g.reserve = 999;\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.broken = false;\\n                g.cooldown = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {\\n                self.hp = 0.0;\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                for c in &mut self.companions {\\n                    c.alive = true;\\n                    c.rescue_spent = false;\\n                    c.down = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => {\\n                self.hp = 15.0;\\n                self.wound = n;\\n                self.heal_t = 0.0;\\n                self.treating = false;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                if self.hp > 70.0 {\\n                    self.hp = 45.0;\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(1);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Shop => {\\n                if !self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Battle) {\\n                    // The shelf is stocked. Buying happens on the interact.\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { .. } => {\\n                self.wind = Vec2::new(9.0, 0.0);\\n                // Inland legs need the technical. A boat left on the channel cannot climb the bank.\\n                if self.ride.kind != 1 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                    self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                    self.ride.stage = 0;\\n                    self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n                    self.ride.fuse = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 24.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks => {\\n                self.spawn_tank_farm();\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                let sx = self.x + 4.0;\\n                let sz = self.z - 4.0;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(sx, sz, 40.0, false);\\n                // Runners sprint +x. One 2 m cell ends before flee passes 3.\\n                for i in 0..6 {\\n                    let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(sx + i as f32 * 4.0, sz, 3.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_animal(self.x + 6.0, self.z - 6.0);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Night => {\\n                self.minutes = 22.0 * 60.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"night_contract\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n                // The short rest already set this. The long rest has to happen on its own.\\n                self.flags.remove(\\\"sleep_used\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (wx, wz) = geom::nearest_water(self.x, self.z);\\n                self.ride.kind = 2;\\n                self.ride.seat = 1;\\n                self.ride.x = wx;\\n                self.ride.z = wz;\\n                self.ride.speed = 0.0;\\n                self.ride.health = 100.0;\\n                self.x = wx;\\n                self.z = wz;\\n                self.boat_dist = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 2.0, 40.0, false);\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.last_mut() {\\n                    b.yaw = 0.0;\\n                    b.alert = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.stance = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 18.0, 40.0, false);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Dart));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Repair => {\\n                if self.ride.kind == 0 {\\n                    self.ride.kind = 1;\\n                    self.ride.x = self.x;\\n                    self.ride.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                self.ride.seat = 0;\\n                self.ride.health = 35.0;\\n                self.ride.stage = 2;\\n                self.ride.repair = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain => {\\n                // The boat step leaves you on the channel. Rain has to quench grass, not water.\\n                let mut lit = false;\\n                for r in [16.0, 22.0, 30.0, 40.0] {\\n                    for (dx, dz) in [(r, 0.0), (-r, 0.0), (0.0, r), (0.0, -r)] {\\n                        if self.fire.ignite_at(self.x + dx, self.z + dz, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                            lit = true;\\n                            break;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                    if lit {\\n                        break;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n                self.weather = 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Better => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n                    c.down = true;\\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = self.x + 1.5;\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose | Spec::Die => {\\n                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\\n                if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive) {\\n                    c.down = true;\\n                    c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    c.x = if matches!(spec, Spec::Die) { self.x + 40.0 } else { self.x + 1.5 };\\n                    c.z = self.z;\\n                }\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Overdose) {\\n                    if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.down) {\\n                        c.down_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => {\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Sniper));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x, self.z - 30.0, 30.0, false);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Convoy => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                self.spawn_truck(self.x, self.z - 16.0);\\n                self.guns.push(Gun::new(WeaponId::Rpg));\\n                self.slot = self.guns.len() - 1;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Town => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Kilometre 40\\\");\\n                self.x = tx;\\n                self.z = tz;\\n                let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(tx, tz + 20.0, 10.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n                self.mark(\\\"town_burned\\\");\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                self.clear_bodies();\\n                for i in 0..3 {\\n                    self.spawn_soldier(self.x + 40.0 + i as f32 * 4.0, self.z - 50.0, 30.0, false);\\n                }\\n                self.syrettes = self.syrettes.max(4);\\n                self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.mark(s),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn done(&mut self, spec: Spec) -> bool {\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Boot => self.screen == Screen::Playing,\\n            Spec::Map => self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\"),\\n            Spec::Way => self.flags.contains(\\\"waypoint_set\\\"),\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, gps } => {\\n                if gps && self.waypoint.is_some() && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.step_x, self.step_z) > 25.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"gps_followed\\\");\\n                }\\n                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 10.0 && (!gps || self.flags.contains(\\\"gps_followed\\\"))\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fever => self.flags.contains(\\\"fever_warned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Pill => self.flags.contains(\\\"pill_taken\\\"),\\n            Spec::Blackout => self.flags.contains(\\\"blackout\\\"),\\n            Spec::Fight => {\\n                let clear = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 1).all(|b| !b.alive);\\n                if clear && !self.bodies.is_empty() {\\n                    self.post_clear = true;\\n                    self.post_reman_at = self.minutes + self.tune.post_reman_hours * 60.0;\\n                    self.mark(\\\"post_cleared\\\");\\n                }\\n                clear && self.flags.contains(\\\"post_cleared\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_jam\\\"),\\n            Spec::Jam => self.flags.contains(\\\"jam_cleared\\\"),\\n            Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().broken {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n                    self.slot = 0;\\n                }\\n                self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_broke\\\")\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => self.flags.contains(\\\"player_rescued\\\"),\\n            Spec::Wound(n) => self.flags.contains(wound_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Loot => self.guns.iter().any(|g| g.id == WeaponId::Ar),\\n            Spec::Claim => self.flags.contains(\\\"safe_house_claimed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Shop => self.flags.contains(\\\"weapon_bought\\\"),\\n            Spec::Locker => self.flags.contains(\\\"locker_used\\\"),\\n            Spec::Syrette => self.flags.contains(\\\"syrette\\\"),\\n            Spec::Tracker => self.flags.contains(\\\"cache_tracker\\\"),\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => self.flags.contains(\\\"sleep_used\\\") && self.step_t > 0.2,\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0 && self.flags.contains(\\\"technical_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mono => self.flags.contains(\\\"monocular_tag\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ignite(n) => self.flags.contains(ignite_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\\\"cells_500\\\") && self.flags.contains(\\\"explosion_chain\\\"),\\n            Spec::Mounted => self.flags.contains(\\\"mounted_gun\\\"),\\n            Spec::Panic => self.flags.contains(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\"),\\n            Spec::Animals => self.flags.contains(\\\"animals_fled\\\"),\\n            Spec::Bus { x, z } => self.flags.contains(\\\"bus_taken\\\") && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, x, z) < 12.0,\\n            Spec::Night => self.flags.contains(\\\"night_contract\\\"),\\n            Spec::Boat => self.flags.contains(\\\"boat_driven\\\"),\\n            Spec::Stealth => self.flags.contains(\\\"stealth_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Dart => self.flags.contains(\\\"dart_kill\\\"),\\n            Spec::Repair => self.flags.contains(\\\"repair_done\\\"),\\n            Spec::Rain => self.flags.contains(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\"),\\n            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\") || self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.down),\\n            Spec::Patch => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_patched\\\"),\\n            Spec::Overdose => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_overdosed\\\"),\\n            Spec::Die => self.flags.contains(\\\"companion_died\\\"),\\n            Spec::Tape => self.flags.contains(\\\"tape_played\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ceasefire => self.flags.contains(\\\"ceasefire_ended\\\"),\\n            Spec::Convoy => self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.kind == 6).all(|b| !b.alive) && !self.bodies.is_empty(),\\n            Spec::Town => self.flags.contains(\\\"town_burned\\\"),\\n            Spec::Ending(n) => self.flags.contains(ending_flag(n)),\\n            Spec::Flag(s) => self.flags.contains(s),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_spec(&self, spec: Spec) -> InputFrame {\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        match spec {\\n            Spec::Map => {\\n                f.held = buttons::MAP;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MAP;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Way | Spec::Claim | Spec::Shop | Spec::Locker | Spec::Loot | Spec::Tape | Spec::Ending(2) => {\\n                f.act = 1;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Reach { x, z, .. } => return self.bot_go(x, z, true),\\n            Spec::Tracker => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = self.tracker_cache;\\n                return self.bot_go(tx, tz, true);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Pill => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PILLS;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PILLS;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Fight | Spec::Ceasefire | Spec::Convoy | Spec::Ignite(10) => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind != 3) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.7, true);\\n                }\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::EnemyJam | Spec::Blackout | Spec::Fever | Spec::Die | Spec::Ending(1) => {\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Ending(1)) {\\n                    f.held = buttons::CROUCH;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Jam | Spec::Break => {\\n                if self.gun().jammed {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                    f.held = buttons::RELOAD;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rescue => {}\\n            Spec::Wound(_) => {\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Syrette => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::HEAL;\\n                f.held = buttons::HEAL;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Sleep { .. } => {\\n                let (hx, hz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n                if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, hx, hz) > 8.0 && self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    return self.bot_go(hx, hz, true);\\n                }\\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Drive { x, z } => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = (x, z);\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Bus { .. } => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::place(\\\"Junction\\\");\\n                if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Mono => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    let mut aim = self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.6, false);\\n                    aim.held |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    aim.pressed |= buttons::MONOCULAR;\\n                    return aim;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Ignite(k) => {\\n                if k == 10 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                } else if k == 11 {\\n                    f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                } else {\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                    f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Tanks | Spec::Mounted => {\\n                f.held = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                if matches!(spec, Spec::Mounted) {\\n                    f.pressed |= buttons::USE;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Animals => {\\n                // A shot already happened. Firing again drops the herd before it clears the grass.\\n                f.held = buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Panic => {}\\n            Spec::Boat => {\\n                let (tx, tz) = geom::water_ahead(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 50.0);\\n                return self.bot_drive(tx, tz);\\n            }\\n            Spec::Stealth => {\\n                f.held = buttons::CROUCH | buttons::MELEE;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::MELEE;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Dart => {\\n                if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive) {\\n                    return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Spec::Repair | Spec::Patch | Spec::Overdose => {\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            Spec::Rain | Spec::Night | Spec::Better | Spec::Flag(_) | Spec::Town | Spec::Ending(0) => {\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n        let _ = shell::glyph(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.xbox);\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_go(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, sprint: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.x, self.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.4, 1.4);\\n        if err.abs() < 0.4 {\\n            f.move_dir.y = 1.0;\\n            if sprint && self.stamina > 1.0 {\\n                f.held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_drive(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32) -> InputFrame {\\n        let desired = geom::yaw_toward(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, tx, tz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.ride.yaw);\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.axes.x = err.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n        f.axes.y = 1.0;\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_aim(&self, tx: f32, tz: f32, ty: f32, fire: bool) -> InputFrame {\\n        let dx = tx - self.x;\\n        let dz = tz - self.z;\\n        let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt().max(0.2);\\n        let desired = dx.atan2(-dz);\\n        let err = geom::wrap_angle(desired - self.yaw);\\n        let perr = ((ty - self.eye) / dist).atan() - self.pitch;\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.look.x = err.clamp(-1.5, 1.5);\\n        f.look.y = perr.clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n        if fire && err.abs() < 0.2 && perr.abs() < 0.2 {\\n            f.held |= buttons::PRIMARY | buttons::SECONDARY;\\n            f.pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn start_playing(&mut self) {\\n        self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n        let (x, z) = geom::place(\\\"Airstrip\\\");\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n        self.yaw = 0.0;\\n        self.eye = 1.58;\\n        self.idle = 0.0;\\n        self.pitch = 0.08;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn simulate(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        self.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.yaw + input.look.x);\\n        self.pitch = (self.pitch + input.look.y).clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.roll = (self.minutes * 2.0).sin() * 0.05 * self.tune.fever_severity;\\n        } else {\\n            self.roll *= 0.9;\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::CRAWL) {\\n            self.stance = 2;\\n        } else if input.down(buttons::CROUCH) {\\n            self.stance = 1;\\n        } else if !self.treating {\\n            self.stance = 0;\\n        }\\n        let target_eye = match self.stance {\\n            2 => 0.42,\\n            1 => 1.02,\\n\",\"total_lines\":2449}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"948c90e5-2cf6-4910-8fe9-746ce47c4d43"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_405","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bot script's `begin()` function relies on heavy shortcuts.\n\nSpecific shortcuts include instant town teleportation with immediate burn marking, direct boat placement on water, forced night contracts and better-way flags, instant ammo and condition fills, forced jamming, direct fever state, instant rescue with zero health, and weapons pushed directly into inventory.\n\nThe criterion forbids teleport and cheating. The `begin()` function warps state directly rather than using normal inputs. This likely violates the rules, though some setup like spawning enemies may be legitimate.\n\nThe plan explicitly requires the bot to play through each ending using only normal inputs and actions. The Town and Boat steps teleport the player, and the Night step auto-marks a flag without player action.\n\nThe test `bot_plays_all_three_endings` is itself dishonest. It drives a bot that teleports and force-sets flags, then asserts those flags. This makes the test a form of theater.\n\nThe bot is the actual shipped campaign path. The game initializes with Route::Human, so advance_script runs for any non-sandbox route including the human path. This means the test is not faked or mocked; it exercises real code.\n\nThe human campaign path is identical to the bot script. The director forces fever timers, spawns fights, jams the gun, fills ammo, warps the player to town and marks it burned, auto-marks contract flags, spawns the boat, and marks night contracts immediately. The player follows a rigid scripted sequence rather than freely exploring an open world. Only some steps require actual inputs.\n\nMajor story beats are stamped by the director rather than earned. This contradicts PLAN.md, which describes contracts as a state machine driven by player triggers. The linear script that auto-completes flags is a significant shortcut, though it may still qualify as a vertical slice if the player can walk, shoot, and drive between scripted beats.\n\nA visual problem remains: the camera does not track world position. When a human presses WASD, the simulation updates x and z, but the 3D view stays fixed on the overlook. The player cannot see where they are going and cannot visually play the game.\n\nThe `aim_overlook` function only adjusts yaw and pitch. The camera eye remains fixed at [0.15, 1.55, 4.2]. The pavilion body is pinned to its spawn point. Walking does not shift the view. This confirms a decisive defect for first-person foot movement. The simulation tracks world state correctly. The shipped page does not display or follow it. Criterion 2 passes only in native simulation tests.\n\nThe code-correctness floor treats a no-op visual branch as a decisive refute. Movement inputs alter simulation coordinates, yet the rendered scene never shifts. This leaves the first-person country traversal visually unconnected to any effect. I am now checking whether a 2D HUD or map might allow abstract play.\n\nThe project documentation explicitly describes a first-person 3D game with terrain and viewmodels, so a text-adventure overlay is not a valid fallback. The captured runtime run shows only the title screen. There is no evidence that movement shifts the camera or that gameplay is visible.\n\nI need to read browser.py to verify what the launch test actually asserts. I will also look for real correctness bugs the simulation tests might miss. The next checks cover whether human play can complete without script cheating, whether the HTML shell shows first-person gameplay, and the honesty of the music RMS and hub tests.\n\nCoverage flags must be checked against §15. Day-night visual effects need verification. The file:// page should be checked for an unmodified session.js first. The companion name \"Rafael Quintero\" may violate the forbidden list, which excludes Far Cry 2 buddies and playable mercs.\n\nRafael Quintero is not on the forbidden list. The static Mutex OVERLOOK is process-global, which is a bug for tests but acceptable for a single page; native tests avoid it entirely.\n\nI need to inspect the HTML shell structure to see if a separate JavaScript file drives the game and whether playing produces any visible output. I also want to verify whether weapons.toml and contracts.toml exist as external data files or are fully hardcoded, since PLAN specifies numbers in data files but that is an implementation detail rather than a behavioral criterion.\n\nThe launch screenshot description confirms the 3D scene fills the entire canvas. Criterion 6 is satisfied. I am now searching for concrete bugs to demonstrate.\n\nFire spread is tip-only rather than neighbor-flood. The test still asserts a three-to-one downwind reach ratio, which conflicts with the criterion requiring deterministic wind-driven behavior.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87b0dbbf-4b98-4631-aac7-52975066d6c9-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn ignite_flag|ignite_flag|cells_500|fn shoot|mark\\(\\\"","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87b0dbbf-4b98-4631-aac7-52975066d6c9-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","offset":640,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87b0dbbf-4b98-4631-aac7-52975066d6c9-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/tests/browser.py","limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5949,"output_tokens":2405,"cache_read_input_tokens":90368,"cache_creation