{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_409","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The player cannot choose among three endings during play.\n\nThe game hardcodes Route::Human at World construction, which always triggers the burn ending. The shell lacks an ending choice screen, so players only see that single outcome.\n\nThe playthrough test constructs the ending by passing a Route value directly to World::campaign, which is not a player choice. The merc pick screen and pause menu also lack any ending selection option.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2effdbb9-52dc-446a-a00b-f9b4208954c8-50","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs","offset":379,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2effdbb9-52dc-446a-a00b-f9b4208954c8-51","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"dev\\.|Teleport|spawn_|noclip|show_fire","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2effdbb9-52dc-446a-a00b-f9b4208954c8-52","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2188,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6355,"output_tokens":639,"cache_read_input_tokens":117120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"b255bceb-2b6c-40e1-b5f2-4e4ff297007f"}
