{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_410","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Dev mode Teleport tab lists place names via page_of_owned, but Screen::Dev's activate() only handles a limited set of cases.\n\nSelecting a place name on the Teleport tab does nothing. The Spawn and World tabs fall through to generic reset or page controls, omitting their own controls entirely. This violates Criterion 5, which requires teleport, spawn, world controls, and balance sliders in Dev mode.\n\nCheats are partially wired. God, infinite ammo, no jams, and no fever are active in simulate. Noclip and invisible are set but never read, so they do nothing. Balance sliders on tab 5 exist and can be nudged.\n\nThe `shop_tracker_and_shell` test confirms that nudge_slider works in the shell. Teleport, spawn, and world controls are explicit no-ops. Criterion 5 names them specifically. Incomplete cheat coverage is acceptable if the category exists. Missing named controls is not.\n\nThe human route is hardcoded in build(). The page offers no UI to choose burn, read, or chair endings. Criterion 4 requires player choice among three endings. The test injects Route::Read and Route::Chair, but the real player path never presents those options.\n\nCriterion 2 is unmet. Look yaw and pitch update the overlook camera, but movement does not shift the eye. Stance eye is not applied to the camera. Map, GPS, and monocular are not physical props.\n\nBot characters teleport to Town and Boat. This violates the no-teleport rule.\n\nscript_ignite stamps ignite_* achievements without using those weapons. Coverage \"set by real play\" is therefore broken.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92cab50b-137f-4e9e-bc36-dd49cc42ded4-53","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.hour\\(\\)|noclip|world\\.yaw|overlook\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92cab50b-137f-4e9e-bc36-dd49cc42ded4-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PLAN.md","offset":620,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92cab50b-137f-4e9e-bc36-dd49cc42ded4-55","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"session\\.js|__SESSION_JS__|first script","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/hub/session.js","head_limit":5}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92cab50b-137f-4e9e-bc36-dd49cc42ded4-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/hub/session.js","limit":8}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2777,"output_tokens":1151,"cache_read_input_tokens":123392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"c7b4e081-dc86-471f-a77c-83bc7d879665"}
