{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_421","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have a solid plan and will implement the changes systematically.\n\nAdding Screen::Ledger for the ending choice. Checking that ui_value includes screen names for browser tests. Verified the three ending labels are clear. For dev mode, teleporting will move the player while the menu is open so they can resume.\n\nSpawn tab will add real spawns for soldiers, animals, barrels, companions, and vehicles. World tab will add weather and fire controls. Noclip mode is currently unused; it will be wired to skip the ceasefire holster, stance speed penalty, water and height constraints, and pass through walls.\n\nNoclip will be wired into move_body so it actually changes movement. It will override ride locks, stance penalties, and treating or rescue states.\n\nNoclip will let the player walk away from a mounted vehicle while keeping the seat occupied. Teleport will clear the ride seat and return to Playing. The Spawn tab rows are Soldier, Animal, and Truck.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2b9ef271-0440-4bc9-a7da-0ad5c7541b56-118","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Dev mode|Teleport|Noclip|dev_rows|Show AI|fire_spread","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2b9ef271-0440-4bc9-a7da-0ad5c7541b56-119","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2048,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2b9ef271-0440-4bc9-a7da-0ad5c7541b56-120","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-g