{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_427","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing from the previous conversation.\n\nFixing four outstanding bugs: first-person view wiring, in-play ending choices, campaign director cheats, and dev mode controls. Reading the relevant code sections now.\n\nReading merc/mod.rs, world.rs, shell.rs, and tests in parallel. The camera is the pavilion FpCam, not Three.js.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The four skeptic bugs are still open. I’ll wire the first-person eye, the in-play ending choice, honest campaign actions, and the dev controls, then prove them against the shipped sim."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a38b8ca0-fd65-4a3b-880e-5951ba26eaf8-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"fp","content":"fp: Drive the rendered eye from world position and stance, and show first-person props","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"endings","content":"endings: Add an in-play burn/read/chair choice reached with normal inputs","status":"pending"},{"id":"bot","content":"bot: Remove campaign warps and flag stamps; bot uses player actions","status":"pending"},{"id":"dev","content":"dev: Wire dev teleport, spawn, world controls, and noclip","status":"pending"},{"id":"verify","content":"verify: Re-run sim, playthrough, and the plan verification checks","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a38b8ca0-fd65-4a3b-880e-5951ba26eaf8-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/threejs-frame-conventions/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a38b8ca0-fd65-4a3b-880e-5951ba26eaf8-2","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn aim_overlook|fn dress|fn post|fn pre|struct Merc|overlook|fn eye_pos|struct Overlook","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use"