{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_436","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to check how tests access entity positions through sim.state.\n\nI need to check entity position and name access. I also need to review fire.cells for town burning checks and examine play_route tests around lines 500-750. Jam probability at condition 100 is zero, so fresh guns will not jam during ignite steps. Country tiles cover an 88m window.\n\nCountry tiles contain roughly 165 entities. Trees spawn on about 18% of cells. The country patch sits at (-120, 900), away from the room origin, so the title camera stays clear. On quit to title, the country and props despawn and the eye restores.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e4726cca-f849-4f3a-8d74-66eca012e69f-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub fn get\\(|pub name|struct EntityMap|pub map","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/entity.rs","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e4726cca-f849-4f3a-8d74-66eca012e69f-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/fire.rs","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e4726cca-f849-4f3a-8d74-66eca012e69f-25","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","offset":480,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e4726cca-f849-4f3a-8d74-66eca012e69f-26","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn jam_probability","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/