{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_438","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Merc needs a Default implementation for serde skip fields.\n\nAdding `country`, `country_anchor`, and `props` to Merc with `#[serde(skip)]` is safe because Vec and (i32, i32) implement Default. The app.rs roll copy for Overlook also needs updating so the fever roll displays.\n\nFpCam will use `o.roll` for the title overlook roll. The pitch offset will be removed during gameplay so the camera matches the shot direction. Country tile Y will be set to the surface height.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5240d078-13de-4ec8-8ee7-229f2d0a5987-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn forward|fn eye|struct FpCam","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_view/src/camera.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5240d078-13de-4ec8-8ee7-229f2d0a5987-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","offset":63,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3038,"output_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":107136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"246c0427-2c3c-48da-b980-d6083bceccd2"}
