{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_442","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"play() returns an immutable reference to GameBox.\n\nThe test only needs to read after the step, and `get::<Merc>()` works on `&GameBox`. `Entities.map` is public. The title dress spawns a rifle at fixed coordinates; the first-person version should be named \"fp-rifle\" so tests can find it. First-person props should only appear during gameplay.\n\nWind rag movement can be tested by checking that the rag stays near the eye rather than at the static dress position. The map prop should appear when holding MAP.\n\nThe new `World` field needs a serde `Default` implementation. The `Ledger` screen rows must match the expected layout; compilation will catch mismatches. Returning from `Ledger` should resume `Playing`. The phrase \"Burn the ledger\" is acceptable because \"ledger\" does not contain banned words. The hotel name \"Hotel Splendide\" already exists. New comments should avoid \"apr\" since the fiction scanner scans all files under `src/games/merc` and may flag it.\n\nThe word \"approach\" does not contain the banned substring \"apr\". The scanner only flags exact consecutive letter sequences.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17879a66-77ba-4fde-a196-66f61b2d9ccc-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/gun.rs","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17879a66-77ba-4fde-a196-66f61b2d9ccc-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct Entities|pub map","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/entity.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1050,"output_tokens":901,"cache_read_in