{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_456","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The present ending teleports to the cement works.\n\nThe present_ending teleport is test-only. Shell updates are in progress. Night fire logic now handles bot movement. The shell will skip its idle attract when the ledger is open.\n\nThe shell must not idle away from the Ledger screen. If it did, the player would return to Title and get stuck while the finale step waits for the Ledger.\n\nBack navigation from the Ledger screen is now disabled so the player must make a choice. The activate action for the Ledger screen maps its two options to values 1 and 2.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3547eada-abb1-41db-bb76-6edb1195b89d-83","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs","old_string":"            } else if !self.hub {\n                self.idle += dt;\n            }","new_string":"            } else if !self.hub && self.screen != Screen::Ledger {\n                self.idle += dt;\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3547eada-abb1-41db-bb76-6edb1195b89d-84","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs","old_string":"            Screen::Pause => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\n            _ => {}","new_string":"            Screen::Pause => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\n            Screen::Ledger => {}\n            _ => {}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3547eada-abb1-41db-bb76-6edb1195b89d-85","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-