{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_458","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The World tab contains 7 rows, and the rows() method takes 7.\n\nShell syntax checks out. I will compile to verify Quat::from_rotation_arc exists. geom::on_rock is public. I need to add tests to merc.rs and scan for \"apr\" in merc files after edits. The bot ledger for Human confirms focus 0 immediately and proceeds to choose_finale.\n\nThe confirm tick sets the screen to Playing via shell_tick, so simulate is skipped that tick. The finale flag is not yet set, and advance_script runs instead. The next tick simulates the shot.\n\nBot route: focus 0 becomes 1 on the first tick, then confirms on the second. Chair route: two downs then confirm.\n\nThe present_ending test opens the ledger on the first tick with empty input.\n\nThe burn ending test will use bot_input after the menu to trigger the ground-shot flag. The shipped bot actions should satisfy the skeptic's requirement for normal inputs.\n\nThe burn ending test will manually construct look and fire input frames instead of using bot_input. It confirms the ledger opens, the player selects row 0, and the screen returns to Playing before advancing time.\n\nThe burn ending test loops bot_input ticks until the ending_burn flag is set or eight seconds pass. The chair ending test manually presses act 4 twice, confirms, and interacts without using the bot.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33bdf7ba-5536-4584-9365-a1006e08ea17-93","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub state","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33bdf7ba-5536-4584-9365-a1006e08ea17-94","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn from_rotation_arc","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-F