-516,-515) t=287\\n\\nthread 'bot_plays_all_three_endings' (765313) panicked at crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs:884:17:\\nHuman seed 1 stuck on ignite7 for 30s (budget 30) at (-516.7,-515.3) step 37 flags 36\\n\\n\\nfailures:\\n    bot_plays_all_three_endings\\n    dev_menu_teleports_spawns_and_noclip_flies\\n\\ntest result: FAILED. 17 passed; 2 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.05s\\n\\nerror: test failed, to rerun pass `-p pav_core --test merc`\\n\",\"exit_code\":101,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine\\\" && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=12 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/target\\\" cargo test -p pav_core --test merc --offline -- --test-threads=8 2>&1\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Re-run the full merc sim suite\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91%2Fwork/01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558/terminal/call-f67a462e-a957-4381-973a-2a29696d9b94-105.log\",\"total_bytes\":4476}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"0ee79cec-ea79-41d4-80b5-c6c0d2545eac"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_468","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Two failures were found. The first is that noclip did not move x.\n\nThe forward vector at yaw 0 is negative Z, so z should change rather than x. The assertion failed because both x and z remained nearly unchanged. The noclip movement code appears correct, so the cause of the stuck position is unclear.\n\nNoclip should be active during ticks. The stuck position may be caused by use_vehicle copying the ride position back when seat equals 1.\n\nConfirmed: use_vehicle overwrites the player's position with the vehicle's after noclip moves it. The fix is to skip use_vehicle when noclip is active.\n\nThe first fix is confirmed: returning early from use_vehicle when noclip is active correctly detaches the player from the vehicle.\n\nThe second failure is ignite7, where the truck remains stuck for 30 seconds despite shots landing within 10 meters. The bot's aim and near-check logic appear correct, so the cause of the missing damage is unclear.\n\nThe bot's yaw convergence was examined. A 3.14 rad error turns in about three ticks, so firing should occur within a second. The clamp of 1.2 per tick prevents overshoot, so the aim logic appears sound.\n\nThe bot's aim logic is sound. It converges on yaw and pitch within seconds, and the 0.2-second cooldown allows many shots over 30 seconds. The vehicle kind is likely 1, so hurt_vehicle should not return early. The missing stage 3 suggests the hits may not actually be registering within the 16-meter range.\n\nThe bot is holding PRIMARY and pulling fires. Three shots should deal enough damage. The missing stage 3 may be caused by resolve_shot hitting a body instead of the vehicle. Dead bodies are skipped, so a dead barrel or soldier could intercept the shot. Walls blocking the path seems unlikely at Ombe.\n\nThe near check is valid. The vehicle and player yaw are independent, so the bot's shots use its own yaw. A bug was spotted.\n\nThe bot's aim logic for Ignite 7 is correct. The missing damage may instead be caused by the pistol running out of ammo. The arm() function only refills the magazine when it is empty, so prior firing throughout the campaign could have depleted the 12-round magazine.\n\nThe bot's holster and firing conditions were ruled out. The real issue is that the simulation lacks ground colliders, so the bot's shallow-pitch shots never hit anything and deal no damage.\n\nThe bot's shallow-pitch shots travel the full 40-meter pistol range without hitting anything. The horizontal distance is roughly 39.5 meters, which exceeds the 16-meter near threshold. The vehicle therefore never receives damage.\n\nThe fix for Ignite(7) is to drop the near check when the current stage is Ignite(7). Any shot fired while seated in the vehicle should damage it. The ray originates at the vehicle, so the closest approach distance is zero.\n\nThe fix for Ignite(7) is being implemented. Instead of checking the hit point, the code now computes the closest point on the shot ray to the vehicle and clamps that distance to zero so the ray origin counts as passing near.\n\nThe 4-meter threshold ensures the truck is always damaged when the bot is inside it, while stray shots fired away from the vehicle are ignored. Other ignites remain unaffected because their blast radius is large enough to hit fresh ground at 40 meters.\n\nAll other ignites are confirmed safe. Flamer, molotov, frag, mortar, RPG, and flare ranges all exceed their near thresholds. Town molotovs land roughly 20 meters ahead of the player at yaw 0, still inside the town radius and off road.\n\nThe town molotov hit must land in grass inside the town radius. Standing at (18, 420) with yaw 0 places the hit at (18, 400), which is still inside the town and off road. The bot currently stops at (18, 400) while holding its current yaw.\n\nThe bot_town target will be moved to (18, 424) and the town shot yaw set to 0. This places the 24-meter molotov hit at roughly (18, 410), inside the town radius and off road. The ending flare is also being checked: its 60-meter range with a shallow pitch covers about 58 meters of horizontal travel.\n\nThe ending burn test passed, confirming the flare ignite works at cement. The earlier ignites succeeded because they lit fuel directly, but Ignite 7 failed because the near check blocked vehicle damage. The dev test assertion will be updated to verify z movement rather than x.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The truck never took the round because the hit was scored at the end of the ray, and noclip was snapped back onto the vehicle. I’ll score the shot along the ray and let noclip leave the seat."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3fd1934-333d-43a3-9637-7efc19189e6e-106","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"    fn use_vehicle(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        if input.just(buttons::USE) && self.ride.kind != 0 {","new_string":"    fn use_vehicle(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\n        if self.dev.noclip {\n            return;\n        }\n        if input.just(buttons::USE) && self.ride.kind != 0 {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3fd1934-333d-43a3-9637-7efc19189e6e-107","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(7))) && self.ride.kind != 0 {\n            let near = geom::dist(hit_x, hit_z, self.ride.x, self.ride.z) < 16.0;\n            if near {\n                self.hurt_vehicle(damage.max(40.0));","new_string":"        if matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(7))) && self.ride.kind != 0 {\n            // The round starts at the eye. Score the closest point on that ray, not the far hit.\n            let rel_x = self.ride.x - origin.0;\n            let rel_z = self.ride.z - origin.2;\n            let along = rel_x * dir.0 + rel_z * dir.2;\n            let t = along.clamp(0.0, best_t);\n            let cx = origin.0 + dir.0 * t;\n            let cz = origin.2 + dir.2 * t;\n            if geom::dist(cx, cz, self.ride.x, self.ride.z) < 4.0 {\n                self.hurt_vehicle(damage.max(40.0));"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3fd1934-333d-43a3-9637-7efc19189e6e-108","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        let (tx, tz) = (18.0, 400.0);","new_string":"        let (tx, tz) = (18.0, 424.0);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3fd1934-333d-43a3-9637-7efc19189e6e-109","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            Some(Spec::Town) => (self.yaw, -0.55),","new_string":"            Some(Spec::Town) => (0.0, -0.55),"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3fd1934-333d-43a3-9637-7efc19189e6e-110","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","old_string":"    let x0 = w.x;\n    let eye0 = w.eye;\n    let mut fly = InputFrame::default();\n    fly.move_dir.y = 1.0;\n    fly.look.y = 1.0;\n    run(&mut w, &fly, 0.5);\n    assert!((w.x - x0).abs() + (w.z - w.ride.z).abs() > 2.0 || (w.x - x0).abs() > 2.0, \"noclip x {} from {x0}\", w.x);\n    assert!(w.eye > eye0 + 2.0, \"eye {} from {eye0}\", w.eye);","new_string":"    let x0 = w.x;\n    let z0 = w.z;\n    let eye0 = w.eye;\n    let mut fly = InputFrame::default();\n    fly.move_dir.y = 1.0;\n    fly.look.y = 1.0;\n    run(&mut w, &fly, 0.5);\n    let moved = ((w.x - x0).powi(2) + (w.z - z0).powi(2)).sqrt();\n    assert!(moved > 2.0, \"noclip moved {moved:.2} from ({x0:.1},{z0:.1}) to ({:.1},{:.1})\", w.x, w.z);\n    assert!(w.eye > eye0 + 2.0, \"eye {} from {eye0}\", w.eye);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2147,"output_tokens":4673,"cache_read_input_tokens":188032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"b0a3cb93-43a7-48a4-b51d-fc34e8aeb9fa"}
