{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_471","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ignite 7 passed. Ignite 8 is stuck.\n\nInvestigating why Ignite 8 is stuck. The flamer should reach the soldier at ~6m. Possible causes include aim convergence failure, ignite_person not being triggered, the soldier being killed by something else, or a jam.\n\nThe soldier is not behind a wall or seated. The mark condition requires the ray to hit the body, so a miss would explain the 30-second stall. The bot's aim calculation is being examined.\n\nThe aim math checks out for a 6m target. The spawn position is being verified against the ray sphere intersection logic.\n\nThe spawn position is roughly 5.4 meters away, well inside flamer range.\n\nA new theory is that `bot_aim` selects the first alive soldier it finds. If a mono soldier spawned earlier is still alive and listed first, the bot would aim at a target 24 meters away with a 14-meter flamer. That would explain the stall.\n\nThe fix is to make bot_ignite for k==8 aim at the nearest alive soldier instead of the first one. The ignite-8 soldier should also be spawned closer, and bodies cleared at that stage since panic begin already clears them.\n\nClearing bodies before spawning the ignite-8 soldier will prevent the mono soldier from blocking the flamer shot. The barrel target is safe because no other kind 5 bodies exist yet.\n\nAmmo exhaustion during later ignites was considered but dismissed; 12 rounds is enough for the required shots.\n\nAmmo refill logic is being tightened. The bot will now top up the magazine to at least its full capacity whenever it arms a scripted weapon, preventing later ignites from running dry.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ca6972c-0e9b-474f-af48-0c0b584f9dd0-113","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        let g = self.gun_mut();\n        g.jammed = false;\n        g.broken = false;\n        g.force_jam = false;\n        g.cooldown = 0.0;\n        g.condition = 100.0;\n        if g.ammo == 0 {\n            g.ammo = gun::stats(id).mag.max(1);\n        }\n    }","new_string":"        let g = self.gun_mut();\n        g.jammed = false;\n        g.broken = false;\n        g.force_jam = false;\n        g.cooldown = 0.0;\n        g.condition = 100.0;\n        let mag = gun::stats(id).mag.max(1);\n        if g.ammo < mag {\n            g.ammo = mag;\n        }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ca6972c-0e9b-474f-af48-0c0b584f9dd0-114","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"            8 => {\n                self.arm(WeaponId::Flamer);\n                let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x + sy * 6.0 + 1.0, self.z - cy * 6.0, 40.0, false);\n            }","new_string":"            8 => {\n                self.arm(WeaponId::Flamer);\n                self.clear_bodies();\n                let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\n                self.spawn_soldier(self.x + sy * 6.0 + 1.0, self.z - cy * 6.0, 40.0, false);\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ca6972c-0e9b-474f-af48-0c0b584f9dd0-115","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        if k == 8 {\n            if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind == 1) {\n                return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\n            }\n        }","new_string":"        if k == 8 {\n            let nearest = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.alive && b.kind == 1).min_by(|a, b| {\n                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, a.x, a.z).total_cmp(&geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z))\n            });\n            if let Some(b) = nearest {\n                return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\n            }\n        }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1771,"output_tokens":2495,"cache_read_input_tokens":196096,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"765845eb-b3e5-4541-955c-638dbeb8a571"}
