ings\\n\\ntest result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 18 filtered out; finished in 0.01s\\n\\nerror: test failed, to rerun pass `-p pav_core --test merc`\\n\",\"exit_code\":101,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine\\\" && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=12 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/target\\\" cargo test -p pav_core --test merc --offline -- --test-threads=8 bot_plays_all_three_endings --nocapture 2>&1\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Re-run the three-ending playthrough\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91%2Fwork/01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558/terminal/call-d3cf28a3-b881-420f-8ee7-9fa7f376dc94-116.log\",\"total_bytes\":3574}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"9fba748a-b2fb-4372-938e-9133d65b8360"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_473","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ignite8 and ignite9 passed. The process jumped from ignite9 to ignite11 and skipped ignite10.\n\nThe transition log only prints when the goal name changes. Ignite10 likely finished in the same tick it started, so the loop advanced multiple steps before the next print could fire.\n\nThe ambient 25% tracer rule likely set ignite_tracer before Ignite(10) began. The step finished instantly because the flag was already true.\n\nThe ambient 25% tracer rule likely fired during earlier shots and set the flag before Ignite(10) began. The fix is to restrict ignite_tracer to the Ignite(10) step alone, so the step must prove it through its own shots.\n\nThe fix is to restrict `ignite_tracer` to the `tracer_step` condition. Ambient 25% tracers will still light grass, but they will no longer set the flag. During Ignite(10), every third shot will attempt to mark the flag. This prevents the flag from being set early by prior ambient shots.\n\nIgnite11 is stuck. The player is at (-516.7, -515.3) and fuel should be positive. The `ignite_cigarette` flag only marks when `ignite_at` succeeds, which fails if fuel is zero or the cell is already burning. The player has been firing from a distance, so their own cell may have caught fire from downwind spread.\n\nIgnite7's vehicle explosion likely ignited the cell directly beneath the player. That fire spread would prevent ignite_at from lighting their own feet, which explains why the cigarette step fails.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5fdf3ad6-1221-4512-9150-39d1aea73589-117","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        if k == 11 {\n            if geom::fuel(self.x, self.z) <= 0.0 {\n                return self.bot_go(self.x + 14.0, self.z + 6.0, false);\n            }","new_string":"        if k == 11 {\n            let fresh = geom::fuel(self.x, self.z) > 0.0 && !self.cell_burning(self.x, self.z);\n            if !fresh || self.ride.seat != 0 {\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\n                    let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\n                    return f;\n                }\n                return self.bot_go(self.step_x + 16.0, self.step_z + 12.0, false);\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5fdf3ad6-1221-4512-9150-39d1aea73589-118","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"        // Tracers: every third round. The tracer step always tries; other play stays at one in four.\n        let tracer_step = matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(10)));\n        if shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 && (tracer_step || self.rng.f32() < 0.25) {\n            if self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x + 1.5, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                self.mark(\"ignite_tracer\");\n            }\n        }","new_string":"        // Tracers: every third round. The coverage flag is earned on the tracer step.\n        // Other play still lights grass one time in four, without stamping that flag early.\n        let tracer_step = matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(10)));\n        if tracer_step && shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 {\n            let ox = hit_x + shot_n as f32;\n            if self.fire.ignite_at(ox, hit_z + 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\n                self.mark(\"ignite_tracer\");\n            }\n        } else if shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 && self.rng.f32() < 0.25 {\n            let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\n        }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5fdf3ad6-1221-4512-9150-39d1aea73589-119","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","old_string":"    fn town_burning(&self) -> bool {","new_string":"    fn cell_burning(&self, x: f32, z: f32) -> bool {\n        self.fire.cells.get(&geom::cell_of(x, z)).is_some_and(|c| c.burning)\n    }\n\n    fn town_burning(&self) -> bool {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1751,"output_tokens":2496,"cache_read_input_tokens":200576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"e6a6e2df-3b19-4ff6-829c-f8ac77f6ef58"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5fdf3ad6-1221-4512-9150-39d1aea73589-117","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"        if k == 11 {\\n            if geom::fuel(self.x, self.z) <= 0.0 {\\n                return self.bot_go(self.x + 14.0, self.z + 6.0, false);\\n            }\",\"new_string\":\"        if k == 11 {\\n            let fresh = geom::fuel(self.x, self.z) > 0.0 && !self.cell_burning(self.x, self.z);\\n            if !fresh || self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                    let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_go(self.step_x + 16.0, self.step_z + 12.0, false);\\n            }\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"        if k == 11 {\\n            if geom::fuel(self.x, self.z) <= 0.0 {\\n                return self.bot_go(self.x + 14.0, self.z + 6.0, false);\\n            }\",\"old_line\":1310,\"new_string\":\"        if k == 11 {\\n            let fresh = geom::fuel(self.x, self.z) > 0.0 && !self.cell_burning(self.x, self.z);\\n            if !fresh || self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                    let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                    return f;\\n                }\\n                return self.bot_go(self.step_x + 16.0, self.step_z + 12.0, false);\\n            }\",\"new_line\":1310,\"context_before\":\"    }\\n\\n    fn bot_ignite(&self, k: u8) -> InputFrame {\\n\",\"context_after\":\"            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n            f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5fdf3ad6-1221-4512-9150-39d1aea73589-118","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"        // Tracers: every third round. The tracer step always tries; other play stays at one in four.\\n        let tracer_step = matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(10)));\\n        if shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 && (tracer_step || self.rng.f32() < 0.25) {\\n            if self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x + 1.5, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_tracer\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\",\"new_string\":\"        // Tracers: every third round. The coverage flag is earned on the tracer step.\\n        // Other play still lights grass one time in four, without stamping that flag early.\\n        let tracer_step = matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(10)));\\n        if tracer_step && shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 {\\n            let ox = hit_x + shot_n as f32;\\n            if self.fire.ignite_at(ox, hit_z + 4.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"ignite_tracer\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else if shot_n > 0 && shot_n % 3 == 0 && self.rng.f32() < 0.25 {\\n            let _ = self.fire.ignite_at(hit_x, hit_z, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n        }\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__2026110