{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_476","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the cigarette logic.\n\nThe seat != 0 branch always presses USE to exit the vehicle. Once the seat is zero, it walks to step_x+16, step_z+12 if the cell is not fresh.\n\nThe walk target is a fixed offset. If that cell is burning or empty, the bot loops forever at the same spot and never interacts. I will search for a fresh cell instead.\n\nPassing through a fresh cell during the walk triggers interaction early, which is acceptable. The real problem is when the path avoids fresh cells entirely, or when the arrival cell itself is burned. The surrounding area is grass with fuel, so a 20-meter walk should normally find a fresh spot unless something blocks it.\n\nThe bot is on grass, not road. Previous ignites covered a wide radius: flares reached roughly 59 meters, RPGs about 148 meters, mortars about 197 meters, and molotovs about 24 meters. These large blast zones likely burned the surrounding area, leaving no fresh fuel cells within reach.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17c87f4b-fa39-44c3-8ebb-7a0d191e25d0-6","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn ignite_at|fn spread|burning","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/fire.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17c87f4b-fa39-44c3-8ebb-7a0d191e25d0-7","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn try_interact|cigarette|INTERACT","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17c87f4b-fa39-44c3-8ebb-7a0d191e25d0-8","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn use_vehicle|seat","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3965,"output_tokens":1090,"cache_read_input_tokens":43776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"65be2e67-3503-4396-b8ec-6accfbbff38b"}
