{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_479","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`just` is a pressed-bit signal, not an edge.\n\nSeating cycles every tick. Walking to step_x+16, step_z+12. Checking bot_go speed with sprint disabled. Fresh cell interactions should ignite correctly. There is a risk of walking through burned targets if prior long-range shots hit the target cell. Ignite yaw uses k*0.55.\n\nThe walk target is roughly 20 meters southeast of the step position. Prior long-range shots mostly land in other directions, so the player should not collide with a previously burned cell.\n\nThe 20-meter walk should clear the 5-meter burn disk. I need to check bot_go's arrival threshold, since a large one could stop the player inside the burn. The target cell is 8 cells away, so it cannot be the same as the start. `fresh` is checked at the current position.\n\nIf the target cell is already burning, the bot arrives but cannot interact because `fresh` is false. It stays idle for 30 seconds. A 20-meter walk takes roughly 4 seconds at stance speed, so the task should finish in time if the cell is fresh.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e8bbef9b-bedd-467b-a50d-e2cd108c25af-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1650,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e8bbef9b-bedd-467b-a50d-e2cd108c25af-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn bot_go","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":875,"output_tokens":1113,"cache_read_input_tokens":55424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"3b68090c-42c4-49a0-bf94-81bbd89068e5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e8bbef9b-bedd-467b-a50d-e2cd108c25af-14","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1650→    }\\n\\n    fn handle_gun(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.guns.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::NEXT) {\\n            self.slot = (self.slot + 1) % self.guns.len();\\n        }\\n        let infinite = self.dev.infinite;\\n1660→        let no_jams = self.dev.no_jams;\\n        let i = self.slot.min(self.guns.len() - 1);\\n        {\\n            let g = &mut self.guns[i];\\n            if input.just(buttons::RELOAD) {\\n                g.tap_reload();\\n            }\\n            g.tick_clear(dt);\\n            if infinite {\\n                g.ammo = g.ammo.max(30);\\n1670→            }\\n            if no_jams {\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.force_jam = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.guns[i].jammed {\\n            self.jam_seen = true;\\n        } else if self.jam_seen {\\n            self.mark(\\\"jam_cleared\\\");\\n1680→        }\\n        let holster = self.ceasefire && geom::in_town(self.x, self.z);\\n        let want = input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) && !self.treating && !holster && self.rescue_t <= 0.0;\\n        if !want {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let ads = input.down(buttons::SECONDARY);\\n        let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\\n        let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\\n        let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\\n1690→        let pull = self.guns[i].pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br);\\n        if pull != Pull::Fired && pull != Pull::Broke {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.resolve_shot(ads);\\n        if pull == Pull::Broke {\\n            self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n1700→    pub fn resolve_shot(&mut self, ads: bool) {\\n        let st = gun::stats(self.gun().id);\\n        let spread = 0.02 * gun::spread_mul(self.gun().condition) * if ads { 0.25 } else { 1.0 };\\n        let jitter = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * spread;\\n        let yaw = self.yaw + jitter;\\n        let pitch = self.pitch + jitter * 0.5;\\n        let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n        let dir = (sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n        let origin = (self.x, self.eye, self.z);\\n1710→        self.shots_tick(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn shots_tick(&mut self, origin: (f32, f32, f32), dir: (f32, f32, f32), damage: f32, range: f32, noise: f32, ignites: bool, silent: bool, id: WeaponId, shot_n: u32) {\\n        let mut best_t = range;\\n        let mut best_zone = 0u8;\\n        let mut best_i: Option<usize> = None;\\n        let mut blocked = false;\\n        for w in &self.walls {\\n            if let Some(t) = ray_aabb(origin, dir, w.min, w.max) {\\n1720→                if t < best_t {\\n                    best_t = t;\\n                    blocked = true;\\n                    best_i = None;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if !blocked {\\n            for (i, b) in self.bodies.iter().enumerate() {\\n                if !b.alive {\\n1730→                    continue;\\n                }\\n                let zones = [(1.70, 0.18, 3u8), (1.15, 0.28, 1u8), (0.45, 0.20, 2u8)];\\n                for (y, r, zone) in zones {\\n                    if let Some(t) = ray_sphere(origin, dir, (b.x, y, b.z), r) {\\n                        if t < best_t {\\n                            best_t = t;\\n                            best_zone = zone;\\n                            best_i = Some(i);\\n                        }\\n1740→                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let hit_x = origin.0 + dir.0 * best_t;\\n        let hit_z = origin.2 + dir.2 * best_t;\\n        if let Some(i) = best_i {\\n            let mul = match best_zone {\\n                3 => 3.0,\\n                2 => 0.6,\\n1750→                _ => 1.0,\\n            };\\n            let dmg = damage * mul;\\n            let kind = self.bodies[i].kind;\\n            let in_town = geom::in_town(self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n            if self.ceasefire && in_town && kind == 2 {\\n                // Civilians are safe while the ceasefire holds.\\n            } else if id == WeaponId::Dart {\\n                self.bodies[i].poison = 3.0;\\n            } else {\\n1760→                self.bodies[i].hp -= dmg;\\n                if ignites && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(8))) && kind == 1 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"ignite_person\\\");\\n                }\\n                if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n                    if kind == 1 && self.stance == 1 && silent {\\n                        self.mark(\\\"stealth_kill\\\");\\n                    }\\n                    if kind == 5 && matches!(self.current(), Some(Spec::Ignite(6))) {\",\"content_concise\":\"1650→    }\\n\\n    fn handle_gun(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.guns.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::NEXT) {\\n            self.slot = (self.slot + 1) % self.guns.len();\\n        }\\n        let infinite = self.dev.infinite;\\n1660→        let no_jams = self.dev.no_jams;\\n        let i = self.slot.min(self.guns.len() - 1);\\n        {\\n            let g = &mut self.guns[i];\\n            if input.just(buttons::RELOAD) {\\n                g.tap_reload();\\n            }\\n            g.tick_clear(dt);\\n            if infinite {\\n                g.ammo = g.ammo.max(30);\\n1670→            }\\n            if no_jams {\\n                g.jammed = false;\\n                g.force_jam = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.guns[i].jammed {\\n            self.jam_seen = true;\\n        } else if self.jam_seen {\\n            self.mark(\\\"jam_cleared\\\");\\n1680→        }\\n        let holster = self.ceasefire && geom::in_town(self.x, self.z);\\n        let want = input.down(buttons::PRIMARY) && !self.treating && !holster && self.rescue_t <= 0.0;\\n        if !want {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let ads = input.down(buttons::SECONDARY);\\n        let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\\n        let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\\n        let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\\n1690→        let pull = self.guns[i].pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br);\\n        if pull != Pull::Fired && pull != Pull::Broke {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.resolve_shot(ads);\\n        if pull == Pull::Broke {\\n            self.mark(\\\"weapon_broke\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n1700→    pub fn resolve_shot(&mut self, ads: bool) {\\n        let st = gun::stats(self.gun().id);\\n        let spread = 0.02 * gun::spread_mul(self.gun().condition) * if ads { 0.25 } else { 1.0 };\\n        let jitter = (self.rng.f32() - 0.5) * spread;\\n        let yaw = self.yaw + jitter;\\n        let pitch = self.pitch + jitter * 0.5;\\n        let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n        let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n        let dir = (sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n        let origin = (self.x, self.eye, self.z);\\n1710→        self.shots_tick(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn shots_tick(&mut self, origin: (f32, f32, f32), dir: (f32, f32, f32), damage: f32, range: f32, noise: f32, ignites: bool, silent: bool, id: WeaponId, shot_n: u32) {\\n        let mut best_t = range;\\n        let mut best_zone = 0u8;\\n        let mut best_i: Option<usize> = None;\\n        let mut blocked = false;\\n        for w in &self.walls {\\n            if let Some(t) = ray_aabb(origin, dir, w.min, w.max) {\\n1720→          