{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_486","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Walking works on water without a block.\n\nFixing cigarette behavior: find the nearest fresh fuel cell and walk there, or USE if already seated. For mounted units, walk to the vehicle if not in the gunner seat, then USE to reach seat 2 before firing. Buses will walk to the vehicle when seat 0 is far away. Also checking whether blow_tanks needs player presence and whether cells_500 is partially filled from prior ignites.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8b301735-6ef6-4990-ab37-c7acfd43e776-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"wind_rag|fn blow_tanks|fn spawn_tank","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8b301735-6ef6-4990-ab37-c7acfd43e776-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs","offset":140,"limit":100}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5234,"output_tokens":452,"cache_read_input_tokens":75776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"01b687fe-7c35-4478-a33b-e7682de24c70"}
