{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_491","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pgrep command returned no results.\n\nNo Rust processes were found. The cell_burning replacement is complete with no remaining callers. I will run the test in the background and log output to a scratch file to avoid excessive wakeups from 300 progress lines. Cargo will be started with block_until 0.\n\nThe monitor will poll every 30 seconds and print only to the terminal. Capturing the cargo PID is tricky because backgrounded commands return a task ID rather than the actual process ID. A shell script that runs cargo, tees output to a log, and prints a single DONE or FAILED line at the end seems like the simplest path.\n\nCargo will run in the background so I can do other work while it compiles and runs. I will read the PLAN verification section, check the fiction scanner against new comments, review pack.sh for the wasm command, and confirm the first_person and ledger tests still match the code.\n\nI will not edit world.rs while cargo compiles. I am calculating whether the blow_tanks 7x7 radius-6 scenario reaches 500 cells, noting that ignite_disk uses a ceiling radius of 7.\n\nThe 7×7 grid of radius-6 disks contains roughly 28 cells each. Without overlap, forty-nine disks would total about 1372 cells. At ten-meter spacing, two adjacent circles intersect by approximately 42 square meters, so overlap is substantial.\n\nThe overlap estimate is too messy. A 36-by-36 bounding box covers 1296 cells. Diagonal pairs are excluded because their spacing exceeds the radius.\n\nThe corner cutouts are negligible, so the total cell count easily exceeds 500. I am now checking whether Ombe sits on road or water cells that would prevent ignition.\n\nOmbe sits on grass, so the 500-cell target is easily reached. The new comment avoids banned words. I will start cargo with a high block_until and continue preparing verification materials in parallel.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-af6084fb-8e07-4f01-b332-b0fe6cd298fd-41","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"mkdir -p \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer\" && cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine\" && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=12 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/target\" cargo test -p pav_core --test merc --offline -- --test-threads=8 bot_plays_all_three_endings --nocapture > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/playthrough-try.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/playthrough-try.log\"","description":"Re-run three-ending playthrough after bot fixes","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1154,"output_tokens":1713,"cache_read_input_tokens":93184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"f8f41eb1-0eb7-47f2-98a2-f68bc8f651c0"}
