{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e3143465-a387-49a1-85e3-3b9beb32302d-56","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Map queries for the Republic of Kwelara. Coordinates: x east, z south, origin at the map centre.\\n//! The playable square is 2048 m on a side.\\n\\nuse crate::rng::hash_f32;\\n\\npub const MAP: f32 = 1024.0;\\n\\npub struct Place {\\n    pub name: &'static str,\\n10→    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\npub const PLACES: &[Place] = &[\\n    Place { name: \\\"Airstrip\\\", x: -120.0, z: 900.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Kilo 38\\\", x: -40.0, z: 640.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Kilometre 40\\\", x: 0.0, z: 380.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Pump House\\\", x: 170.0, z: 470.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Bridge\\\", x: 40.0, z: 40.0 },\\n20→    Place { name: \\\"North Post\\\", x: 40.0, z: 110.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"South Post\\\", x: 40.0, z: -30.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ste-Odile\\\", x: 720.0, z: 420.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ferry\\\", x: 640.0, z: 170.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Boat Shed\\\", x: 830.0, z: 255.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Pump Station\\\", x: -420.0, z: -30.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ombe Flats\\\", x: -520.0, z: -520.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Junction\\\", x: 20.0, z: -420.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Flats Post\\\", x: 60.0, z: -460.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\", x: -260.0, z: -700.0 },\\n30→    Place { name: \\\"Ridge Post\\\", x: 360.0, z: -520.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Hotel Splendide\\\", x: 620.0, z: -640.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Quarry Post\\\", x: -420.0, z: 480.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Cement Works\\\", x: -760.0, z: 620.0 },\\n];\\n\\nconst RIVER: &[(f32, f32)] = &[\\n    (1024.0, 120.0),\\n    (760.0, 260.0),\\n    (420.0, 90.0),\\n40→    (120.0, 40.0),\\n    (-200.0, -40.0),\\n    (-560.0, 60.0),\\n    (-820.0, 220.0),\\n    (-1024.0, 180.0),\\n];\\n\\npub fn place(name: &str) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    PLACES.iter().find(|p| p.name == name).map(|p| (p.x, p.z)).unwrap_or((0.0, 380.0))\\n}\\n50→\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Map queries for the Republic of Kwelara. Coordinates: x east, z south, origin at the map centre.\\n//! The playable square is 2048 m on a side.\\n\\nuse crate::rng::hash_f32;\\n\\npub const MAP: f32 = 1024.0;\\n\\npub struct Place {\\n    pub name: &'static str,\\n10→    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\npub const PLACES: &[Place] = &[\\n    Place { name: \\\"Airstrip\\\", x: -120.0, z: 900.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Kilo 38\\\", x: -40.0, z: 640.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Kilometre 40\\\", x: 0.0, z: 380.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Pump House\\\", x: 170.0, z: 470.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Bridge\\\", x: 40.0, z: 40.0 },\\n20→    Place { name: \\\"North Post\\\", x: 40.0, z: 110.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"South Post\\\", x: 40.0, z: -30.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ste-Odile\\\", x: 720.0, z: 420.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ferry\\\", x: 640.0, z: 170.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Boat Shed\\\", x: 830.0, z: 255.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Pump Station\\\", x: -420.0, z: -30.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ombe Flats\\\", x: -520.0, z: -520.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Junction\\\", x: 20.0, z: -420.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Flats Post\\\", x: 60.0, z: -460.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\", x: -260.0, z: -700.0 },\\n30→    Place { name: \\\"Ridge Post\\\", x: 360.0, z: -520.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Hotel Splendide\\\", x: 620.0, z: -640.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Quarry Post\\\", x: -420.0, z: 480.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Cement Works\\\", x: -760.0, z: 620.0 },\\n];\\n\\nconst RIVER: &[(f32, f32)] = &[\\n    (1024.0, 120.0),\\n    (760.0, 260.0),\\n    (420.0, 90.0),\\n40→    (120.0, 40.0),\\n    (-200.0, -40.0),\\n    (-560.0, 60.0),\\n    (-820.0, 220.0),\\n    (-1024.0, 180.0),\\n];\\n\\npub fn place(name: &str) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    PLACES.iter().find(|p| p.name == name).map(|p| (p.x, p.z)).unwrap_or((0.0, 380.0))\\n}\\n50→\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"//! Map queries for the Republic of Kwelara. Coordinates: x east, z south, origin at the map centre.\\n//! The playable square is 2048 m on a side.\\n\\nuse crate::rng::hash_f32;\\n\\npub const MAP: f32 = 1024.0;\\n\\npub struct Place {\\n    pub name: &'static str,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\npub const PLACES: &[Place] = &[\\n    Place { name: \\\"Airstrip\\\", x: -120.0, z: 900.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Kilo 38\\\", x: -40.0, z: 640.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Kilometre 40\\\", x: 0.0, z: 380.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Pump House\\\", x: 170.0, z: 470.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Bridge\\\", x: 40.0, z: 40.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"North Post\\\", x: 40.0, z: 110.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"South Post\\\", x: 40.0, z: -30.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ste-Odile\\\", x: 720.0, z: 420.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ferry\\\", x: 640.0, z: 170.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Boat Shed\\\", x: 830.0, z: 255.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Pump Station\\\", x: -420.0, z: -30.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ombe Flats\\\", x: -520.0, z: -520.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Junction\\\", x: 20.0, z: -420.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Flats Post\\\", x: 60.0, z: -460.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\", x: -260.0, z: -700.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Ridge Post\\\", x: 360.0, z: -520.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Hotel Splendide\\\", x: 620.0, z: -640.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Quarry Post\\\", x: -420.0, z: 480.0 },\\n    Place { name: \\\"Cement Works\\\", x: -760.0, z: 620.0 },\\n];\\n\\nconst RIVER: &[(f32, f32)] = &[\\n    (1024.0, 120.0),\\n    (760.0, 260.0),\\n    (420.0, 90.0),\\n    (120.0, 40.0),\\n    (-200.0, -40.0),\\n    (-560.0, 60.0),\\n    (-820.0, 220.0),\\n    (-1024.0, 180.0),\\n];\\n\\npub fn place(name: &str) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    PLACES.iter().find(|p| p.name == name).map(|p| (p.x, p.z)).unwrap_or((0.0, 380.0))\\n}\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":284}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"b3cb8e84-b532-4973-9868-832cb2159d7b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_500","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The lodge is at (-260, -700). River points span z from -40 to 260 and x from -1024 to 1024.\n\nThe nearest river segment is roughly 663 meters away. The walk will take about 100 seconds and cost 240. After boating 40 meters along the river, the player will be near z=-40 to 60.\n\nThe nearest river point is (-200, -40). The town target at (18, 424) is about 512 meters away. Walking there takes roughly 75 seconds and costs 220.\n\nThe drive to the cement at (-760, 620) is about 802 meters. At 16 m/s it takes roughly 50 seconds and costs 140.\n\nThe ending lasts 180 seconds within a 200-second budget. Soldiers are only 40–48 meters away and will shoot. The player must survive the entire combat. If the player dies, rescue adds a few seconds but might not be enough to finish in time.\n\nstep_t is the step timer, not survival time. The ending triggers when step_t reaches 180 and the finale flag is set. Even if the player dies and gets rescued, step_t continues counting. The concern is whether the ledger screen pauses step_t advancement.\n\nThe ledger screen does not freeze step_t. The bot selects a row and returns to playing, so menu time counts toward the 200-second budget. The 180-second crouch should finish within that window.\n\nInteractions with the chair and burn are fast. The longest segments are the walks.\n\nEach route takes roughly 750 seconds of game time. With six routes and two seeds, total simulation time is about 4500 seconds, or 270,000 ticks.\n\nFire spread runs every 15 ticks after the initial burn. Burned cells could number in the thousands, making that phase CPU-heavy.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The cell-search loop needed an `i32`. The three-ending playthrough is compiling again, and I’ll take the next stall from that log."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":888