{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_508","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking new comments for banned words.\n\nNo banned words found in the latest comments. Rerunning tests now. The panic flag removal might stall soldiers who don't panic within 30 seconds. Starting a new cargo and monitor. Town travel from the boat is roughly 500 meters, which should fit within the 220 budget if the soldier exits first.\n\nBoat-driven marks end the step while the soldier may still be seated. The town bot exits via USE before walking. Repair occurs after stealth and dart while the soldier is likely still in the boat, setting seat 0 and health to 35. Rain requires grass within 40 meters of the river; a 16-meter offset should reach it. Town travel takes about 74 seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-40450cc2-6676-4c71-87d7-a0dfcf39bca9-68","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine\" && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=12 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/target\" cargo test -p pav_core --test merc --offline -- --test-threads=8 bot_plays_all_three_endings --nocapture > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/playthrough-try3.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/playthrough-try3.log\"","description":"Re-run playthrough after boat steering fix","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-40450cc2-6676-4c71-87d7-a0dfcf39bca9-69","name":"monitor","input":{"command":"LOG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok