{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_520","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The test invokes Sim::step, which runs Game::pre, physics, and Game::post in sequence.\n\nThe screen is correctly set to Playing, but the camera remains at the title overlook instead of updating via aim_overlook. I will examine Merc::post in mod.rs to find why the camera is not being updated.\n\nThe overlook is a process-global static Mutex. Parallel tests overwrite it between this test's step and the read. Other tests call World::tick directly instead of Merc::post.\n\nI am checking which tests actually invoke Merc::post. The scene_boots test probably runs Sim::new, so it may call post before the screen becomes Playing and reset the overlook to the title camera. I will read that test and Merc::post to confirm.\n\nThe test passed in isolation but fails under parallel execution. This confirms a static mutex race condition. The overlook is global because the renderer reads it directly, so the test itself must be made thread-safe.\n\nThe test suite runs with --test-threads=8, so parallel execution is guaranteed. The overlook is written by Merc::post during Sim::step. To fix the race, I am weighing three options: making the test independent of the global state, using a thread-local instead of a static, or locking a mutex for the duration of any test that modifies the overlook.\n\nOnly Merc::post writes the overlook, not World::tick. The scene_boots test likely calls post during Sim construction while the screen is still title, overwriting the first_person camera. I will serialize these tests with a shared mutex or `#[serial]` to prevent the race.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8cf99ade-73ff-4f52-8459-59946fe6d97b-84","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"overlook|aim_overlook|static","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8cf99ade-73ff-4f52-8459-59946fe6d97b-85","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"overlook|Sim::new","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core","glob":"**/*.{rs}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1729,"output_tokens":1128,"cache_read_input_tokens":141568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"710c5bc7-3bdd-424b-bcfa-1db85b550955"}
