ore\":\"- [x] Pack `{GameTitle}-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503.html` into the work root, write `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md`, run the full test command and the file:// launch twice, and store the captured logs.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n## Risks / Contradictions\\n- Software WebGPU on this host is slow, and the wrong Chromium flags (`--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader`) leave a blank canvas that still reports frames. Use the flags in verification step 6. A blank screenshot from a successful readback is an app failure. If the browser process cannot start, step 6's written fallback applies. earlyoom kills the largest browser under memory pressure; keep a single browser and stop it by PID.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-526bde9c-0ae7-4e46-b0c8-80babf92edb3-123","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- The `merc` scene is a headless country sim behind a first-person overlook. Look, hits, jams, fever, wind-driven fire, vehicles, companions, the contract list, and three endings are covered by `cargo test -p pav_core --test merc`. The seeded bot sets every coverage flag.\",\"new_string\":\"- The `merc` scene is a headless country sim. While a contract is playing, the rendered eye follows the body and the stance, and the rifle, rag, map, GPS, and glass are props in that view. Look, hits, jams, fever, wind-driven fire, vehicles, companions, the contract list, and three endings are covered by `cargo test -p pav_core --test merc` (19 tests). The seeded bot walks, shoots, and drives, and the union of those runs sets every coverage flag. The ledger is the burn, read, or chair choice. Dev teleport, spawn, world, and noclip change the world.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- The `merc` scene is a headless country sim behind a first-person overlook. Look, hits, jams, fever, wind-driven fire, vehicles, companions, the contract list, and three endings are covered by `cargo test -p pav_core --test merc`. The seeded bot sets every coverage flag.\",\"old_line\":6,\"new_string\":\"- The `merc` scene is a headless country sim. While a contract is playing, the rendered eye follows the body and the stance, and the rifle, rag, map, GPS, and glass are props in that view. Look, hits, jams, fever, wind-driven fire, vehicles, companions, the contract list, and three endings are covered by `cargo test -p pav_core --test merc` (19 tests). The seeded bot walks, shoots, and drives, and the union of those runs sets every coverage flag. The ledger is the burn, read, or chair choice. Dev teleport, spawn, world, and noclip change the world.\",\"new_line\":6,\"context_before\":\"Original first-person contract shooter on the shardfall engine. The playable page is `Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503.html` in this folder. The dev folder of the same name holds the engine, the hub client, and `tests/run.sh`.\\n\\n- Title chosen from 50 riffs plus a real RNG. Notes are in the dev folder `notes/title.md`. Feedback notes are in `notes/feedback.md`.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- Menus are a 10-foot shell on the page. Music and voices are synthesized. The hub depot round uses the unmodified session client as the first script.\\n- `tests/run.sh all` runs the sim, audio, browser, and hub checks and prints one failure count. The finished run printed `PASS 48 FAIL 0`.\\n\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-526bde9c-0ae7-4e46-b0c8-80babf