{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_554","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to read the following files: script_ignite, prep_ignite, bot_ignite, bot_boat, bot_town, bot_ending, choose_finale, dev_teleport, dev_spawn, dev_world, noclip movement, and eye_pos.\n\nNight now sets the clock to 22:00 in begin instead of stamping the flag immediately. The night_contract flag is only set after the player moves more than 1.5 meters at night. This is a scripted time-of-day effect similar to sleeping, but it requires actual movement to register.\n\nTown only arms the molotov in begin. The town_burning flag is set when the bot actually throws it, so bot_town must walk and throw rather than teleport. Boat spawns on water but unboarded; bot_boat must make the player walk to board. Ignite still uses script_ignite with _input.\n\nNeed to verify whether script_ignite still stamps flags directly.\n\nSpec::Ending sets the screen to Ledger and clears the finale. The done condition requires both a finale and a flag. bot_ending selects based on route, so Read and Chair still predetermine choices. A human on Route::Human might freely choose any ending if choose_finale does not lock to route. Need to read choose_finale.\n\nRoute::Human allows a human to freely pick any ending from the ledger. The bot uses different routes to select different menu items, which is a reasonable way to test all three endings through the same UI. If choose_finale uses the label rather than the route, the test ledger_confirm is a genuine choice.\n\nRoute::Chair also changes companion outcomes and blackout versus pill. These are route variants for coverage union, which the plan allows. The ending itself should remain a choice. If bot_ending always matches the route to a predetermined end, a human player can still freely select other endings through the UI.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0245268-a735-4e12-87dd-3554696f2b7c-70","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1270,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0245268-a735-4e12-87dd-3554696f2b7c-71","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1680,"limit":220}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0245268-a735-4e12-87dd-3554696f2b7c-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2050,"limit":450}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9567,"output_tokens":1013,"cache_read_input_tokens":155008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"63e69a68-c050-4b2d-a8cf-35307548c769"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a0245268-a735-4e12-87dd-3554696f2b7c-70","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1270→    }\\n\\n    fn bot_ledger(&self) -> InputFrame {\\n        let want = match self.route {\\n            Route::Read => 1usize,\\n            Route::Chair => 2,\\n            _ => 0,\\n        };\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        if self.focus != want {\\n1280→            f.act = if self.focus < want { 4 } else { 3 };\\n        } else {\\n            f.act = 1;\\n            f.pressed = buttons::CONFIRM;\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_boat(&self) -> InputFrame {\\n        if self.ride.seat == 0 {\\n1290→            let d = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.ride.x, self.ride.z);\\n            if d > 5.0 {\\n                return self.bot_go(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, true);\\n            }\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n            return f;\\n        }\\n        let (tx, tz) = geom::water_ahead(self.ride.x, self.ride.z, 40.0);\\n        self.bot_drive(tx, tz)\\n1300→    }\\n\\n    fn bot_town(&self) -> InputFrame {\\n        if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n            return f;\\n        }\\n        let (tx, tz) = (18.0, 424.0);\\n        if geom::dist(self.x, self.z, tx, tz) > 2.5 {\\n1310→            return self.bot_go(tx, tz, true);\\n        }\\n        self.bot_ground_shot()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_ending(&self) -> InputFrame {\\n        match self.finale {\\n            Some(1) => {\\n                let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n                f.held = buttons::CROUCH;\\n1320→                f\\n            }\\n            Some(2) => {\\n                let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f\\n            }\\n            _ => self.bot_ground_shot(),\\n        }\\n1330→    }\\n\\n    fn bot_ignite(&self, k: u8) -> InputFrame {\\n        if k == 11 {\\n            if self.ride.seat != 0 {\\n                let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n                f.pressed = buttons::USE;\\n                return f;\\n            }\\n            if self.cell_open(self.x, self.z) {\\n1340→                let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n                f.held = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                f.pressed = buttons::INTERACT;\\n                return f;\\n            }\\n            if let Some((px, pz)) = self.nearest_open_cell(self.x, self.z) {\\n                return self.bot_go(px, pz, true);\\n            }\\n            return self.bot_go(self.step_x + 16.0, self.step_z + 12.0, true);\\n        }\\n1350→        if k == 6 {\\n            if let Some(b) = self.bodies.iter().find(|b| b.alive && b.kind == 5) {\\n                return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.15, true);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if k == 8 {\\n            let nearest = self.bodies.iter().filter(|b| b.alive && b.kind == 1).min_by(|a, b| {\\n                geom::dist(self.x, self.z, a.x, a.z).total_cmp(&geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z))\\n            });\\n            if let Some(b) = nearest {\\n1360→                return self.bot_aim(b.x, b.z, 1.2, true);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.bot_ground_shot()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot_ground_shot(&self) -> InputFrame {\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        let (want_yaw, want_pitch) = match self.current() {\\n            Some(Spec::Ignite(k)) => (k as f32 * 0.55, -0.16),\\n1370→            Some(Spec::Town) => (0.0, -0.55),\\n            _ => (self.yaw, -0.22),\\n        };\\n        let yerr = geom::wrap_angle(want_yaw - self.yaw);\\n        let perr = want_pitch - self.pitch;\\n        f.look.x = yerr.clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n        f.look.y = perr.clamp(-0.4, 0.4);\\n        if yerr.abs() < 0.12 && perr.abs() < 0.08 {\\n            if self.guns.is_empty() || self.gun().ammo == 0 {\\n                f.pressed |= buttons::RELOAD;\\n1380→            } else {\\n                f.held |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n                f.pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        f\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn start_playing(&mut self) {\\n        self.screen = Screen::Playing;\\n1390→        let (x, z) = geom::place(\\\"Airstrip\\\");\\n        self.x = x;\\n        self.z = z;\\n        self.yaw = 0.0;\\n        self.eye = 1.58;\\n        self.idle = 0.0;\\n        self.pitch = 0.08;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn simulate(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n1400→        self.yaw = geom::wrap_angle(self.yaw + input.look.x);\\n        self.pitch = (self.pitch + input.look.y).clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.roll = (self.minutes * 2.0).sin() * 0.05 * self.tune.fever_severity;\\n        } else {\\n            self.roll *= 0.9;\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::CRAWL) {\\n            self.stance = 2;\\n        } else if input.down(buttons::CROUCH) {\\n1410→            self.stance = 1;\\n        } else if !self.treating {\\n            self.stance = 0;\\n        }\\n        let target_eye = match self.stance {\\n            2 => 0.42,\\n            1 => 1.02,\\n            _ => 1.58,\\n        };\\n        let k = 1.0 - (-dt / 0.12).exp();\\n1420→        if !self.dev.noclip {\\n            self.eye += (target_eye - self.eye) * k;\\n        }\\n\\n        if input.down(buttons::MAP) {\\n            self.map_t += dt;\\n            if self.map_t > 0.35 {\\n                self.mark(\\\"map_raised\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n1430→            self.map_t = (self.map_t - dt * 2.0).max(0.0);\\n        }\\n        if self.flags.contains(\\\"map_raised\\\") && (input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || input.act == 1) && self.waypoint.is_none() {\\n            self.waypoint = Some((0.0, 460.0));\\n            self.mark(\\\"waypoint_set\\\");\\n        }\\n        if input.down(buttons::MONOCULAR) {\\n            self.mono_t += dt;\\n            if self.mono_t > 0.5 && self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.alive && geom::dist(self.x, self.z, b.x, b.z) < 80.0) {\\n                self.mark(\\\"monocular_tag\\\");\\n1440→            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.mono_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n\\n        self.move_body(input, dt);\\n        self.use_vehicle(input, dt);\\n        self.handle_items(input, dt);\\n        self.handle_gun(input, dt);\\n        self.update_bodies(dt);\\n1450→        self.update_fever(dt);\\n        self.update_rescue(dt);\\n        let rain = self.weather == 1;\\n        let wind = self.wind * self.tune.wind_strength;\\n        let out = self.fire.tick(dt, wind, self.tune.fire_spread, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes, rain, &mut self.rng);\\n        if out > 0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"rain_extinguished\\\");\\n            self.weather = 0;\\n        }\\n        if self.fire.burned >= 500 {\\n1460→            self.mark(\\\"cells_500\\\");\\n        }\\n        self.special_actions(input, dt);\\n        if self.hp > 20.0 && self.hp < 100.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 && !self.dev.god {\\n            self.hp = (self.hp + 8.0 * dt).min(100.0);\\n        }\\n        if self.dev.god {\\n            self.hp = 100.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n1470→\\n    fn move_body(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.dev.noclip {\\n            let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n            let fwd = Vec2::new(sy, -cy);\\n            let right = Vec2::new(cy, sy);\\n            let wish = right * input.move_dir.x + fwd * input.move_dir.y;\\n            if wish.length_squared() > 1e-6 {\\n                let n = wish.normalize();\\n                self.x += n.x * 24.0 * dt;\\n1480→                self.z += n.y * 24.0 * dt;\\n            }\\n            self.eye = (self.eye + input.look.y * 24.0 * dt).clamp(0.2, 80.0);\\n          