{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_558","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the menu_of mapping for acts 1, 3, and 4.\n\nConfirmed the Ending sequence logic. The ledger screen blocks simulate but advance_script still increments step_t. The read mark requires finale to be set first. Choosing a finale sets finale=0 and arms the flare. Bot_ending fires when the flare ignites.\n\nConfirmed the Ledger screen stays active during advance_script until step_ready is set. The menu_of mapping was verified against passing tests. Country tiles and room geometry are positioned at world coordinates.\n\nThe airstrip camera looks at country tiles while the pavilion character is placed nearby. The old room dressing remains at the origin, but the static room is 1km away and out of view. Camera near distance is 0.08; 8m country tiles fill the ground, and the eye sits at height+1.58 so the ground should be visible. Title screen screenshots remain valid since that view uses a fixed overlook.\n\nChecking whether the engine's post() hook runs before the camera samples each frame. The browser uses the same Game implementation, and app.rs copies the overlook every frame. If post executes after input but before the camera read, the eye will follow the player. The original bug was a static overlook; now post writes the eye position.\n\nConfirmed the render thread reads the eye after post updates it. The web path follows the same sequence: simhost ticks the simulation, then the app loop reads the updated overlook. A static mutex ensures the eye position is published even if the simulation runs on a background thread.\n\nThe title camera resets to [0.15, 1.55, 4.2] when not playing. The diorama remains visible in the title screen.\n\nThe packed HTML bundle may not have been rebuilt after the Rust changes. If the HTML was not repacked, the shipped page still contains the old camera code. I should verify the HTML timestamp or search the packed wasm for a unique new string to confirm it was updated.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1c2cc990-84b2-454f-9217-39fd25241b95-83","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Burn the ledger|fp-rifle|Take the chair","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503.html","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1c2cc990-84b2-454f-9217-39fd25241b95-84","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn menu_of|act ==","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1c2cc990-84b2-454f-9217-39fd25241b95-85","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/test-logs/playthrough.log","limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1c2cc990-84b2-454f-9217-39fd25241b95-86","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/test-logs/launch-a.log","limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4703,"output_tokens":1223,"cache_read_input_tokens":181632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"0a0e4331-a3ec-436b-ac20-06feec4f8a23"}
