{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_568","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to act as an adversarial verifier.I will act as an adversarial verifier.\n\nChecking if prior gaps are fixed. The first-person camera \n\nI am re-verifying still lacks WASD movementthe objective. I will and stance changes. The eye height and  check that PRIOR_GAPSbody position remain are genuinely fixed pinned to spawn. Map, and that PLAN.md and GPS, monocular, rifle, and wind rag are static flags rather than interactive props.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll audit the four prior gaps"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" TASK.md requirements","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":" against the current code, tests"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" are met.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":", and captured run output before judging the plan."},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nFirst-person camera logic is broken. The view only copies yaw and pitch, while the","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c65375f0-4036-4acb-aba5-9fff6e4759ae-0","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91%2Fwork/01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558/goal/plan.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c65375f0-4036-4acb-aba5-9fff6e4759ae-1","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c65375f0-4036-4acb-aba5-9fff6e4759ae-2","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^## |^### |acceptance|gating|criterion","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":22529,"output_tokens":691,"cache_read_input_tokens":1792,"cache_creation_input_t