wd * 0.30 + up * -0.04 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\"},{\"line_number\":244,\"content\":\"    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, _dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\"},{\"line_number\":258,\"content\":\"            let (x, y, z) = self.world.eye_pos();\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":159,\"content\":\"    pub noclip: bool,\"},{\"line_number\":276,\"content\":\"    let all = S.get_or_init(|| vec![build_script(Route::Human), build_script(Route::Burn), build_script(Route::Read), build_script(Route::Chair)]);\"},{\"line_number\":278,\"content\":\"        Route::Human => 0,\"},{\"line_number\":279,\"content\":\"        Route::Burn => 1,\"},{\"line_number\":280,\"content\":\"        Route::Read => 2,\"},{\"line_number\":281,\"content\":\"        Route::Chair => 3,\"},{\"line_number\":282,\"content\":\"        Route::Sandbox => return &[],\"},{\"line_number\":295,\"content\":\"    if route == Route::Read {\"},{\"line_number\":342,\"content\":\"        Route::Read => v.push(Spec::Overdose),\"},{\"line_number\":343,\"content\":\"        Route::Chair => v.push(Spec::Die),\"},{\"line_number\":357,\"content\":\"        Route::Read => 1,\"},{\"line_number\":358,\"content\":\"        Route::Chair => 2,\"},{\"line_number\":382,\"content\":\"    pub eye: f32,\"},{\"line_number\":456,\"content\":\"        let mut w = Self::blank(seed, Route::Sandbox);\"},{\"line_number\":495,\"content\":\"            eye: 1.58,\"},{\"line_number\":615,\"content\":\"        if self.route != Route::Sandbox {\"},{\"line_number\":1261,\"content\":\"        let perr = ((ty - self.eye) / dist).atan() - self.pitch;\"},{\"line_number\":1274,\"content\":\"            Route::Read => 1usize,\"},{\"line_number\":1275,\"content\":\"            Route::Chair => 2,\"},{\"line_number\":1394,\"content\":\"        self.eye = 1.58;\"},{\"line_number\":1414,\"content\":\"        let target_eye = match self.stance {\"},{\"line_number\":1420,\"content\":\"        if !self.dev.noclip {\"},{\"line_number\":1421,\"content\":\"            self.eye += (target_eye - self.eye) * k;\"},{\"line_number\":1472,\"content\":\"        if self.dev.noclip {\"},{\"line_number\":1482,\"content\":\"            self.eye = (self.eye + input.look.y * 24.0 * dt).clamp(0.2, 80.0);\"},{\"line_number\":1526,\"content\":\"        if self.dev.noclip {\"},{\"line_number\":1734,\"content\":\"        let origin = (self.x, self.eye, self.z);\"},{\"line_number\":1812,\"content\":\"                self.mark(\\\"ending_burn\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":1819,\"content\":\"            // The round starts at the eye. Score the closest point on that ray, not the far hit.\"},{\"line_number\":2088,\"content\":\"                self.script_ignite(spec, input);\"},{\"line_number\":2114,\"content\":\"    fn script_ignite(&mut self, spec: Spec, _input: &InputFrame) {\"},{\"line_number\":2420,\"content\":\"        if self.route == Route::Sandbox {\"},{\"line_number\":2421,\"content\":\"            self.route = Route::Human;\"},{\"line_number\":2589,\"content\":\"    pub fn eye_pos(&self) -> (f32, f32, f32) {\"},{\"line_number\":2591,\"content\":\"        (self.x, h + self.eye, self.z)\"},{\"line_number\":2595,\"content\":\"        let (ex, ey, ez) = self.eye_pos();\"},{\"line_number\":2605,\"content\":\"            \\\"eye\\\": [ex, ey, ez],\"},{\"line_number\":2684,\"content\":\"        _ => \\\"ending_burn\\\",\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"79e26316-590e-4682-ba32-9fda5e15f6d5"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_573","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to read mod.rs, world.rs, and shell.rs carefully.","signature":"BM4lLG/Su2lD9ijUBm2bDdnryYI807hucKIR/mBqJp0c8vuo3EZgrXSLvxcFjmnort7WqtNLMNUXKWVWDVPxrMlH8436WJ2CjHslVNa5Wg42QFJDPuN0nqpYWweGb346y9LWO7drbg2k89sNppKcCwFSmo/lWkFyXbaa/G+Yuyt+beltmrtCvRrUDM45PQ"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c85718d-3c1b-4d59-a062-9cc91e756398-5","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/mod.rs","offset":1,"limit":350}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c85718d-3c1b-4d59-a062-9cc91e756398-6","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs","offset":150,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c85718d-3c1b-4d59-a062-9cc91e756398-7","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":850,"limit":400}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2387,"output_tokens":325,"cache_read_input_tokens":30848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"a0308f4f-aa41-4090-8bb7-c582cc91ca0b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3c85718d-3c1b-4d59-a062-9cc91e756398-5","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Jam Cry. The country is [`world::World`]; the pavilion room is a dusk overlook the body stands in.\\n\\npub mod fire;\\npub mod geom;\\npub mod gun;\\npub mod net;\\npub mod shell;\\npub mod world;\\n\\n10→use std::collections::BTreeMap;\\n\\nuse anyhow::{Result, anyhow};\\nuse glam::{Quat, Vec3};\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::{Game, GameBox, level_text};\\nuse crate::color::Color;\\nuse crate::entity::{EntityId, Spawn};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\n20→use crate::input::InputFrame;\\nuse crate::room::RoomDef;\\nuse crate::shape::{Shape, Visual};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub use fire::FireMap;\\npub use geom::exposure;\\npub use gun::{Gun, WeaponId, clear_seconds, jam_probability, spread_mul};\\npub use net::{Link, client_apply, host_publish};\\npub use shell::{Device, MenuInput, glyph};\\n30→pub use world::{Route, Screen, Tune, World, about_pages, fiction_lines};\\n\\nconst LEVEL: &str = include_str!(\\\"../merc.toml\\\");\\n\\n/// Where the window looks. Menus keep the dusk overlook. Play copies the body.\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct Overlook {\\n    pub eye: [f32; 3],\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub pitch: f32,\\n40→    pub roll: f32,\\n}\\n\\nstatic OVERLOOK: std::sync::Mutex<Overlook> = std::sync::Mutex::new(Overlook {\\n    eye: [0.15, 1.55, 4.2],\\n    yaw: 0.0,\\n    pitch: -0.42,\\n    roll: 0.0,\\n});\\n\\n50→pub fn overlook() -> Overlook {\\n    *OVERLOOK.lock().unwrap()\\n}\\n\\nfn aim_overlook(eye: [f32; 3], yaw: f32, pitch: f32, roll: f32) {\\n    let mut slot = OVERLOOK.lock().unwrap();\\n    slot.eye = eye;\\n    slot.yaw = yaw;\\n    slot.pitch = pitch;\\n    slot.roll = roll;\\n60→}\\n\\n/// Same basis as `pav_view::camera::fp_basis`. Yaw 0, pitch 0, roll 0 → forward (0, 0, −1), right (1, 0, 0).\\nfn view_basis(yaw: f32, pitch: f32, roll: f32) -> (Vec3, Vec3, Vec3) {\\n    let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n    let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n    let mut forward = Vec3::new(sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n    if forward.length_squared() < 1e-8 {\\n        forward = Vec3::NEG_Z;\\n    }\\n70→    forward = forward.normalize();\\n    let mut right = forward.cross(Vec3::Y);\\n    if right.length_squared() < 1e-6 {\\n        right = Vec3::new(cy, 0.0, sy);\\n    }\\n    right = right.normalize();\\n    let up = right.cross(forward).normalize();\\n    let (sr, cr) = roll.sin_cos();\\n    let rolled_right = (right * cr + up * sr).normalize();\\n    let rolled_up = (up * cr - right * sr).normalize();\\n80→    (forward, rolled_right, rolled_up)\\n}\\n\\n/// Rules state. Visual entity ids are not part of the save: they are rebuilt in `post`.\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Merc {\\n    pub world: World,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    dressed: bool,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n90→    country: Vec<EntityId>,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    country_anchor: (i32, i32),\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    props: Vec<EntityId>,\\n}\\n\\n/// Builds the overlook and starts a human-route contract. History stays off: the save is the world.\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, _rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&level_text(Merc::KEY, LEVEL)).map_err(|e| anyhow!(\\\"merc.toml: {e}\\\"))?;\\n100→    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, Merc::KEY, def);\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    let game = Merc {\\n        world: World::campaign(sim.state.seed, Route::Human),\\n        dressed: false,\\n        country: Vec::new(),\\n        country_anchor: (i32::MIN, i32::MIN),\\n        props: Vec::new(),\\n    };\\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(game));\\n110→    Ok(())\\n}\\n\\nimpl Merc {\\n    fn dress(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.dressed {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.dressed = true;\\n        let ground = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(48.0, 0.2, 48.0) }, Color::hex(\\\"#c9a24b\\\"));\\n120→        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"ground\\\", Vec3::new(0.0, -0.2, 0.0)).visual(ground));\\n        let road = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(3.2, 0.08, 40.0) }, Color::hex(\\\"#8a5a32\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"road\\\", Vec3::new(-1.2, 0.02, -6.0)).visual(road));\\n        let greens = [\\\"#3d5a32\\\", \\\"#2f4a28\\\", \\\"#4a6a38\\\", \\\"#243820\\\", \\\"#6a5030\\\"];\\n        for i in 0..28 {\\n            let col = (i % 7) as f32 - 3.0;\\n            let row = (i / 7) as f32;\\n            let h = 1.4 + (i % 5) as f32 * 0.55;\\n            let at = Vec3::new(col * 1.7, h, 1.2 - row * 2.4);\\n            let trunk = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.22, h, 0.22) }, Color::hex(greens[i % 5]));\\n130→            sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"tree\\\", at).visual(trunk));\\n            let crown = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.7, 0.45, 0.7) }, Color::hex(greens[(i + 2) % 5]));\\n            sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"crown\\\", at + Vec3::new(0.0, h * 0.65, 0.0)).visual(crown));\\n        }\\n        let mound = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(1.4, 0.7, 1.1) }, Color::hex(\\\"#a86838\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"mound\\\", Vec3::new(2.4, 0.7, -1.5)).visual(mound));\\n        let rifle = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.05, 0.05, 0.42) }, Color::hex(\\\"#2a2420\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"rifle\\\", Vec3::new(0.42, 1.18, 3.15)).visual(rifle));\\n        let rag = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.08, 0.16, 0.02) }, Color::hex(\\\"#9a2a22\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"rag\\\", Vec3::new(0.62, 1.42, 2.6)).visual(rag));\\n140→    }\\n\\n    fn sync_country(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.world.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let anchor = ((self.world.x / 8.0).div_euclid(1.0) as i32, (self.world.z / 8.0).div_euclid(1.0) as i32);\\n        if anchor == self.country_anchor && !self.country.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n150→        for id in self.country.drain(..) {\\n            sim.despawn(id);\\n        }\\n        self.country_anchor = anchor;\\n        for dz in -5..=5 {\\n            for dx in -5..=5 {\\n                let x = (anchor.0 + dx) as f32 * 8.0 + 4.0;\\n                let z = (anchor.1 + dz) as f32 * 8.0 + 4.0;\\n                let h = geom::height(x, z);\\n                let color = if geom::on_water(x, z) {\\n160→                    \\\"#2c6e78\\\"\\n                } else if geom::on_road(x, z) {\\n                    \\\"#8a5a32\\\"\\n                } else if geom::on_rock(x, z) {\\n                    \\\"#7a7368\\\"\\n                } else {\\n                    \\\"#b9924a\\\"\\n                };\\n                let tile = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(3.9, 0.12, 3.9) }, Color::hex(color));\\n                let id = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country\\\", Vec3::new(x, h - 0.12, z)).visual(tile));\\n170→                self.country.push(id);\\n                if geom::tree_at(x, z) {\\n                    let trunk = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.22, 1.3, 0.22) }, Color::hex(\\\"#6a5030\\\"));\\n                    let tid = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country-tree\\\", Vec3::new(x, h + 1.3, z)).visual(trunk));\\n                    self.country.push(tid);\\n                    let crown = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(1.1, 0.7, 1.1) }, Color::hex(\\\"#2f4a28\\\"));\\n                    let cid = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country-crown\\\", Vec3::new(x, h + 2.6, z)).visual(crown));\\n                    self.country.push(cid);\\n                }\\n            }\\n180→        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sync_props(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.world.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.props.is_empty() {\\n            let hide = Vec3::new(0.0, -40.0, 0.0);\\n            let specs = [\\n190→                (\\\"fp-rifle\\\", Vec3::new(0.04, 0.04, 0.28), \\\"#2a2420\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-rag\\\", Vec3::new(0.02, 0.14, 0.08), \\\"#9a2a22\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-map\\\", Vec3::new(0.16, 0.01, 0.12), \\\"#d7c4a2\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-gps\\\", Vec3::new(0.05, 0.04, 0.02), \\\"#1c3a2a\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-glass\\\", Vec3::new(0.04, 0.04, 0.14), \\\"#1a1c1e\\\"),\\n            ];\\n            for (name, half, color) in specs {\\n                let visual = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half }, Color::hex(color));\\n                self.props.push(sim.spawn(Spawn::new(name, hide).visual(visual)));\\n            }\\n200→        }\\n        let (ex, ey, ez) = self.world.eye_pos();\\n        let eye = Vec3::new(ex, ey, ez);\\n        let pitch = self.world.pitch.clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        let (fwd, right, up) = view_basis(self.world.yaw, pitch, self.world.roll);\\n        let flutter = Vec3::new(self.world.wind.x, (self.world.minutes * 3.0).sin() * 1.4, self.world.wind.y) * 0.04;\\n        let rifle = eye + fwd * 0.46 + right * 0.18 + up * -0.20;\\n        let rag = eye + fwd * 0.72 + right * 0.34 + up * -0.02 + flutter;\\n        let show_map = self.world.map_t > 0.05;\\n        let map = if show_map { eye + fwd * 0.40 + right * -0.16 + up * -0.10 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n210→        let show_gps = self.world.waypoint.is_some();\\n        let gps = if show_gps { eye + fwd * 0.52 + up * -0.30 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n        let show_glass = self.world.mono_t > 0.0;\\n        let glass = if show_glass { eye + fwd * 0.30 + up * -0.04 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n        let spots = [rifle, rag, map, gps, glass];\\n        let rot = Quat::from_rotation_arc(Vec3::Z, fwd);\\n        for (id, pos) in self.props.iter().copied().zip(spots) {\\n            sim.set_position(id, pos);\\n            if let Some(e) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id) {\\n                e.rot = rot;\\n220→            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Game for Merc {\\n    const KEY: &'static str = \\\"merc\\\";\\n\\n    fn pre(\\n        &mut self,\\n230→        sim: &mut Sim,\\n        input: &InputFrame,\\n        dt: f32,\\n        _events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>,\\n    ) -> BTreeMap<EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        self.world.tick(input, dt);\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            // The country moves inside `World`. The room body stays put so the controller does not fight it.\\n            out.insert(id, InputFrame::default());\\n240→        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, _dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.dress(sim);\\n        let playing = self.world.screen == Screen::Playing;\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            if playing {\\n                let h = geom::height(self.world.x, self.world.z);\\n250→                sim.set_position(id, Vec3::new(self.world.x, h, self.world.z));\\n            } else {\\n                sim.set_position(id, sim.state.spawn);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if playing {\\n            self.sync_country(sim);\\n            self.sync_props(sim);\\n            let (x, y, z) = self.world.eye_pos();\\n            let pitch = self.world.pitch.clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n260→            aim_overlook([x, y, z], self.world.yaw, pitch, self.world.roll);\\n        } else {\\n            aim_overlook([0.15, 1.55, 4.2], 0.0, -0.42, 0.0);\\n        }\\n        if self.world.guns.first().is_some_and(|g| g.shots > 0) {\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Impact { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 1.2, -1.0), strength: 0.4 });\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n270→        vec![format!(\\\"HP {:.0}\\\", self.world.hp), self.world.goal_name()]\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        self.world.status()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\\n        self.world.bot_input()\\n    }\\n280→}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Jam Cry. The country is [`world::World`]; the pavilion room is a dusk overlook the body stands in.\\n\\npub mod fire;\\npub mod geom;\\npub mod gun;\\npub mod net;\\npub mod shell;\\npub mod world;\\n\\n10→use std::collections::BTreeMap;\\n\\nuse anyhow::{Result, anyhow};\\nuse glam::{Quat, Vec3};\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::{Game, GameBox, level_text};\\nuse crate::color::Color;\\nuse crate::entity::{EntityId, Spawn};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\n20→use crate::input::InputFrame;\\nuse crate::room::RoomDef;\\nuse crate::shape::{Shape, Visual};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub use fire::FireMap;\\npub use geom::exposure;\\npub use gun::{Gun, WeaponId, clear_seconds, jam_probability, spread_mul};\\npub use net::{Link, client_apply, host_publish};\\npub use shell::{Device, MenuInput, glyph};\\n30→pub use world::{Route, Screen, Tune, World, about_pages, fiction_lines};\\n\\nconst LEVEL: &str = include_str!(\\\"../merc.toml\\\");\\n\\n/// Where the window looks. Menus keep the dusk overlook. Play copies the body.\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct Overlook {\\n    pub eye: [f32; 3],\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub pitch: f32,\\n40→    pub roll: f32,\\n}\\n\\nstatic OVERLOOK: std::sync::Mutex<Overlook> = std::sync::Mutex::new(Overlook {\\n    eye: [0.15, 1.55, 4.2],\\n    yaw: 0.0,\\n    pitch: -0.42,\\n    roll: 0.0,\\n});\\n\\n50→pub fn overlook() -> Overlook {\\n    *OVERLOOK.lock().unwrap()\\n}\\n\\nfn aim_overlook(eye: [f32; 3], yaw: f32, pitch: f32, roll: f32) {\\n    let mut slot = OVERLOOK.lock().unwrap();\\n    slot.eye = eye;\\n    slot.yaw = yaw;\\n    slot.pitch = pitch;\\n    slot.roll = roll;\\n60→}\\n\\n/// Same basis as `pav_view::camera::fp_basis`. Yaw 0, pitch 0, roll 0 → forward (0, 0, −1), right (1, 0, 0).\\nfn view_basis(yaw: f32, pitch: f32, roll: f32) -> (Vec3, Vec3, Vec3) {\\n    let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n    let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n    let mut forward = Vec3::new(sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n    if forward.length_squared() < 1e-8 {\\n        forward = Vec3::NEG_Z;\\n    }\\n70→    forward = forward.normalize();\\n    let mut right = forward.cross(Vec3::Y);\\n    if right.length_squared() < 1e-6 {\\n        right = Vec3::new(cy, 0.0, sy);\\n    }\\n    right = right.normalize();\\n    let up = right.cross(forward).normalize();\\n    let (sr, cr) = roll.sin_cos();\\n    let rolled_right = (right * cr + up * sr).normalize();\\n    let rolled_up = (up * cr - right * sr).normalize();\\n80→    (forward, rolled_right, rolled_up)\\n}\\n\\n/// Rules state. Visual entity ids are not part of the save: they are rebuilt in `post`.\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Merc {\\n    pub world: World,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    dressed: bool,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n90→    country: Vec<EntityId>,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    country_anchor: (i32, i32),\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    props: Vec<EntityId>,\\n}\\n\\n/// Builds the overlook and starts a human-route contract. History stays off: the save is the world.\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, _rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&level_text(Merc::KEY, LEVEL)).map_err(|e| anyhow!(\\\"merc.toml: {e}\\\"))?;\\n100→    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, Merc::KEY, def);\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    let game = Merc {\\n        world: World::campaign(sim.state.seed, Route::Human),\\n        dressed: false,\\n        country: Vec::new(),\\n        country_anchor: (i32::MIN, i32::MIN),\\n        props: Vec::new(),\\n    };\\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(game));\\n110→    Ok(())\\n}\\n\\nimpl Merc {\\n    fn dress(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.dressed {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.dressed = true;\\n        let ground = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(48.0, 0.2, 48.0) }, Color::hex(\\\"#c9a24b\\\"));\\n120→        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"ground\\\", Vec3::new(0.0, -0.2, 0.0)).visual(ground));\\n        let road = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(3.2, 0.08, 40.0) }, Color::hex(\\\"#8a5a32\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"road\\\", Vec3::new(-1.2, 0.02, -6.0)).visual(road));\\n        let greens = [\\\"#3d5a32\\\", \\\"#2f4a28\\\", \\\"#4a6a38\\\", \\\"#243820\\\", \\\"#6a5030\\\"];\\n        for i in 0..28 {\\n            let col = (i % 7) as f32 - 3.0;\\n            let row = (i / 7) as f32;\\n            let h = 1.4 + (i % 5) as f32 * 0.55;\\n            let at = Vec3::new(col * 1.7, h, 1.2 - row * 2.4);\\n            let trunk = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.22, h, 0.22) }, Color::hex(greens[i % 5]));\\n130→            sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"tree\\\", at).visual(trunk));\\n            let crown = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.7, 0.45, 0.7) }, Color::hex(greens[(i + 2) % 5]));\\n            sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"crown\\\", at + Vec3::new(0.0, h * 0.65, 0.0)).visual(crown));\\n        }\\n        let mound = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(1.4, 0.7, 1.1) }, Color::hex(\\\"#a86838\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"mound\\\", Vec3::new(2.4, 0.7, -1.5)).visual(mound));\\n        let rifle = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.05, 0.05, 0.42) }, Color::hex(\\\"#2a2420\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"rifle\\\", Vec3::new(0.42, 1.18, 3.15)).visual(rifle));\\n        let rag = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.08, 0.16, 0.02) }, Color::hex(\\\"#9a2a22\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"rag\\\", Vec3::new(0.62, 1.42, 2.6)).visual(rag));\\n140→    }\\n\\n    fn sync_country(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.world.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let anchor = ((self.world.x / 8.0).div_euclid(1.0) as i32, (self.world.z / 8.0).div_euclid(1.0) as i32);\\n        if anchor == self.country_anchor && !self.country.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n150→        for id in self.country.drain(..) {\\n            sim.despawn(id);\\n        }\\n        self.country_anchor = anchor;\\n        for dz in -5..=5 {\\n            for dx in -5..=5 {\\n                let x = (anchor.0 + dx) as f32 * 8.0 + 4.0;\\n                let z = (anchor.1 + dz) as f32 * 8.0 + 4.0;\\n                let h = geom::height(x, z);\\n                let color = if geom::on_water(x, z) {\\n160→                    \\\"#2c6e78\\\"\\n                } else if geom::on_road(x, z) {\\n                    \\\"#8a5a32\\\"\\n                } else if geom::on_rock(x, z) {\\n                    \\\"#7a7368\\\"\\n                } else {\\n                    \\\"#b9924a\\\"\\n                };\\n                let tile = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(3.9, 0.12, 3.9) }, Color::hex(color));\\n                let id = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country\\\", Vec3::new(x, h - 0.12, z)).visual(tile));\\n170→                self.country.push(id);\\n                if geom::tree_at(x, z) {\\n                    let trunk = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.22, 1.3, 0.22) }, Color::hex(\\\"#6a5030\\\"));\\n                    let tid = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country-tree\\\", Vec3::new(x, h + 1.3, z)).visual(trunk));\\n                    self.country.push(tid);\\n                    let crown = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(1.1, 0.7, 1.1) }, Color::hex(\\\"#2f4a28\\\"));\\n                    let cid = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country-crown\\\", Vec3::new(x, h + 2.6, z)).visual(crown));\\n                    self.country.push(cid);\\n                }\\n            }\\n180→        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sync_props(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.world.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.props.is_empty() {\\n            let hide = Vec3::new(0.0, -40.0, 0.0);\\n            let specs = [\\n190→                (\\\"fp-rifle\\\", Vec3::new(0.04, 0.04, 0.28), \\\"#2a2420\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-rag\\\", Vec3::new(0.02, 0.14, 0.08), \\\"#9a2a22\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-map\\\", Vec3::new(0.16, 0.01, 0.12), \\\"#d7c4a2\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-gps\\\", Vec3::new(0.05, 0.04, 0.02), \\\"#1c3a2a\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-glass\\\", Vec3::new(0.04, 0.04, 0.14), \\\"#1a1c1e\\\"),\\n            ];\\n            for (name, half, color) in specs {\\n                let visual = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half }, Color::hex(color));\\n                self.props.push(sim.spawn(Spawn::new(name, hide).visual(visual)));\\n            }\\n200→        }\\n        let (ex, ey, ez) = self.world.eye_pos();\\n        let eye = Vec3::new(ex, ey, ez);\\n        let pitch = self.world.pitch.clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        let (fwd, right, up) = view_basis(self.world.yaw, pitch, self.world.roll);\\n        let flutter = Vec3::new(self.world.wind.x, (self.world.minutes * 3.0).sin() * 1.4, self.world.wind.y) * 0.04;\\n        let rifle = eye + fwd * 0.46 + right * 0.18 + up * -0.20;\\n        let rag = eye + fwd * 0.72 + right * 0.34 + up * -0.02 + flutter;\\n        let show_map = self.world.map_t > 0.05;\\n        let map = if show_map { eye + fwd * 0.40 + right * -0.16 + up * -0.10 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n210→        let show_gps = self.world.waypoint.is_some();\\n        let gps = if show_gps { eye + fwd * 0.52 + up * -0.30 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n        let show_glass = self.world.mono_t > 0.0;\\n        let glass = if show_glass { eye + fwd * 0.30 + up * -0.04 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n        let spots = [rifle, rag, map, gps, glass];\\n        let rot = Quat::from_rotation_arc(Vec3::Z, fwd);\\n        for (id, pos) in self.props.iter().copied().zip(spots) {\\n            sim.set_position(id, pos);\\n            if let Some(e) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id) {\\n                e.rot = rot;\\n220→            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Game for Merc {\\n    const KEY: &'static str = \\\"merc\\\";\\n\\n    fn pre(\\n        &mut self,\\n230→        sim: &mut Sim,\\n        input: &InputFrame,\\n        dt: f32,\\n        _events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>,\\n    ) -> BTreeMap<EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        self.world.tick(input, dt);\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            // The country moves inside `World`. The room body stays put so the controller does not fight it.\\n            out.insert(id, InputFrame::default());\\n240→        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, _dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.dress(sim);\\n        let playing = self.world.screen == Screen::Playing;\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            if playing {\\n                let h = geom::height(self.world.x, self.world.z);\\n250→                sim.set_position(id, Vec3::new(self.world.x, h, self.world.z));\\n            } else {\\n                sim.set_position(id, sim.state.spawn);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if playing {\\n            self.sync_country(sim);\\n            self.sync_props(sim);\\n            let (x, y, z) = self.world.eye_pos();\\n            let pitch = self.world.pitch.clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n260→            aim_overlook([x, y, z], self.world.yaw, pitch, self.world.roll);\\n        } else {\\n            aim_overlook([0.15, 1.55, 4.2], 0.0, -0.42, 0.0);\\n        }\\n        if self.world.guns.first().is_some_and(|g| g.shots > 0) {\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Impact { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 1.2, -1.0), strength: 0.4 });\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n270→        vec![format!(\\\"HP {:.0}\\\", self.world.hp), self.world.goal_name()]\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        self.world.status()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\\n        self.world.bot_input()\\n    }\\n280→}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/mod.rs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":350,\"raw_output\":\"//! Jam Cry. The country is [`world::World`]; the pavilion room is a dusk overlook the body stands in.\\n\\npub mod fire;\\npub mod geom;\\npub mod gun;\\npub mod net;\\npub mod shell;\\npub mod world;\\n\\nuse std::collections::BTreeMap;\\n\\nuse anyhow::{Result, anyhow};\\nuse glam::{Quat, Vec3};\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::{Game, GameBox, level_text};\\nuse crate::color::Color;\\nuse crate::entity::{EntityId, Spawn};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\\nuse crate::room::RoomDef;\\nuse crate::shape::{Shape, Visual};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub use fire::FireMap;\\npub use geom::exposure;\\npub use gun::{Gun, WeaponId, clear_seconds, jam_probability, spread_mul};\\npub use net::{Link, client_apply, host_publish};\\npub use shell::{Device, MenuInput, glyph};\\npub use world::{Route, Screen, Tune, World, about_pages, fiction_lines};\\n\\nconst LEVEL: &str = include_str!(\\\"../merc.toml\\\");\\n\\n/// Where the window looks. Menus keep the dusk overlook. Play copies the body.\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct Overlook {\\n    pub eye: [f32; 3],\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub pitch: f32,\\n    pub roll: f32,\\n}\\n\\nstatic OVERLOOK: std::sync::Mutex<Overlook> = std::sync::Mutex::new(Overlook {\\n    eye: [0.15, 1.55, 4.2],\\n    yaw: 0.0,\\n    pitch: -0.42,\\n    roll: 0.0,\\n});\\n\\npub fn overlook() -> Overlook {\\n    *OVERLOOK.lock().unwrap()\\n}\\n\\nfn aim_overlook(eye: [f32; 3], yaw: f32, pitch: f32, roll: f32) {\\n    let mut slot = OVERLOOK.lock().unwrap();\\n    slot.eye = eye;\\n    slot.yaw = yaw;\\n    slot.pitch = pitch;\\n    slot.roll = roll;\\n}\\n\\n/// Same basis as `pav_view::camera::fp_basis`. Yaw 0, pitch 0, roll 0 → forward (0, 0, −1), right (1, 0, 0).\\nfn view_basis(yaw: f32, pitch: f32, roll: f32) -> (Vec3, Vec3, Vec3) {\\n    let (sy, cy) = yaw.sin_cos();\\n    let (sp, cp) = pitch.sin_cos();\\n    let mut forward = Vec3::new(sy * cp, sp, -cy * cp);\\n    if forward.length_squared() < 1e-8 {\\n        forward = Vec3::NEG_Z;\\n    }\\n    forward = forward.normalize();\\n    let mut right = forward.cross(Vec3::Y);\\n    if right.length_squared() < 1e-6 {\\n        right = Vec3::new(cy, 0.0, sy);\\n    }\\n    right = right.normalize();\\n    let up = right.cross(forward).normalize();\\n    let (sr, cr) = roll.sin_cos();\\n    let rolled_right = (right * cr + up * sr).normalize();\\n    let rolled_up = (up * cr - right * sr).normalize();\\n    (forward, rolled_right, rolled_up)\\n}\\n\\n/// Rules state. Visual entity ids are not part of the save: they are rebuilt in `post`.\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Merc {\\n    pub world: World,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    dressed: bool,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    country: Vec<EntityId>,\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    country_anchor: (i32, i32),\\n    #[serde(skip)]\\n    props: Vec<EntityId>,\\n}\\n\\n/// Builds the overlook and starts a human-route contract. History stays off: the save is the world.\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, _rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&level_text(Merc::KEY, LEVEL)).map_err(|e| anyhow!(\\\"merc.toml: {e}\\\"))?;\\n    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, Merc::KEY, def);\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    let game = Merc {\\n        world: World::campaign(sim.state.seed, Route::Human),\\n        dressed: false,\\n        country: Vec::new(),\\n        country_anchor: (i32::MIN, i32::MIN),\\n        props: Vec::new(),\\n    };\\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(game));\\n    Ok(())\\n}\\n\\nimpl Merc {\\n    fn dress(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.dressed {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.dressed = true;\\n        let ground = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(48.0, 0.2, 48.0) }, Color::hex(\\\"#c9a24b\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"ground\\\", Vec3::new(0.0, -0.2, 0.0)).visual(ground));\\n        let road = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(3.2, 0.08, 40.0) }, Color::hex(\\\"#8a5a32\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"road\\\", Vec3::new(-1.2, 0.02, -6.0)).visual(road));\\n        let greens = [\\\"#3d5a32\\\", \\\"#2f4a28\\\", \\\"#4a6a38\\\", \\\"#243820\\\", \\\"#6a5030\\\"];\\n        for i in 0..28 {\\n            let col = (i % 7) as f32 - 3.0;\\n            let row = (i / 7) as f32;\\n            let h = 1.4 + (i % 5) as f32 * 0.55;\\n            let at = Vec3::new(col * 1.7, h, 1.2 - row * 2.4);\\n            let trunk = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.22, h, 0.22) }, Color::hex(greens[i % 5]));\\n            sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"tree\\\", at).visual(trunk));\\n            let crown = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.7, 0.45, 0.7) }, Color::hex(greens[(i + 2) % 5]));\\n            sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"crown\\\", at + Vec3::new(0.0, h * 0.65, 0.0)).visual(crown));\\n        }\\n        let mound = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(1.4, 0.7, 1.1) }, Color::hex(\\\"#a86838\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"mound\\\", Vec3::new(2.4, 0.7, -1.5)).visual(mound));\\n        let rifle = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.05, 0.05, 0.42) }, Color::hex(\\\"#2a2420\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"rifle\\\", Vec3::new(0.42, 1.18, 3.15)).visual(rifle));\\n        let rag = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.08, 0.16, 0.02) }, Color::hex(\\\"#9a2a22\\\"));\\n        sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"rag\\\", Vec3::new(0.62, 1.42, 2.6)).visual(rag));\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sync_country(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.world.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let anchor = ((self.world.x / 8.0).div_euclid(1.0) as i32, (self.world.z / 8.0).div_euclid(1.0) as i32);\\n        if anchor == self.country_anchor && !self.country.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        for id in self.country.drain(..) {\\n            sim.despawn(id);\\n        }\\n        self.country_anchor = anchor;\\n        for dz in -5..=5 {\\n            for dx in -5..=5 {\\n                let x = (anchor.0 + dx) as f32 * 8.0 + 4.0;\\n                let z = (anchor.1 + dz) as f32 * 8.0 + 4.0;\\n                let h = geom::height(x, z);\\n                let color = if geom::on_water(x, z) {\\n                    \\\"#2c6e78\\\"\\n                } else if geom::on_road(x, z) {\\n                    \\\"#8a5a32\\\"\\n                } else if geom::on_rock(x, z) {\\n                    \\\"#7a7368\\\"\\n                } else {\\n                    \\\"#b9924a\\\"\\n                };\\n                let tile = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(3.9, 0.12, 3.9) }, Color::hex(color));\\n                let id = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country\\\", Vec3::new(x, h - 0.12, z)).visual(tile));\\n                self.country.push(id);\\n                if geom::tree_at(x, z) {\\n                    let trunk = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(0.22, 1.3, 0.22) }, Color::hex(\\\"#6a5030\\\"));\\n                    let tid = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country-tree\\\", Vec3::new(x, h + 1.3, z)).visual(trunk));\\n                    self.country.push(tid);\\n                    let crown = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half: Vec3::new(1.1, 0.7, 1.1) }, Color::hex(\\\"#2f4a28\\\"));\\n                    let cid = sim.spawn(Spawn::new(\\\"country-crown\\\", Vec3::new(x, h + 2.6, z)).visual(crown));\\n                    self.country.push(cid);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sync_props(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if self.world.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.props.is_empty() {\\n            let hide = Vec3::new(0.0, -40.0, 0.0);\\n            let specs = [\\n                (\\\"fp-rifle\\\", Vec3::new(0.04, 0.04, 0.28), \\\"#2a2420\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-rag\\\", Vec3::new(0.02, 0.14, 0.08), \\\"#9a2a22\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-map\\\", Vec3::new(0.16, 0.01, 0.12), \\\"#d7c4a2\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-gps\\\", Vec3::new(0.05, 0.04, 0.02), \\\"#1c3a2a\\\"),\\n                (\\\"fp-glass\\\", Vec3::new(0.04, 0.04, 0.14), \\\"#1a1c1e\\\"),\\n            ];\\n            for (name, half, color) in specs {\\n                let visual = Visual::new(Shape::Box { half }, Color::hex(color));\\n                self.props.push(sim.spawn(Spawn::new(name, hide).visual(visual)));\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let (ex, ey, ez) = self.world.eye_pos();\\n        let eye = Vec3::new(ex, ey, ez);\\n        let pitch = self.world.pitch.clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n        let (fwd, right, up) = view_basis(self.world.yaw, pitch, self.world.roll);\\n        let flutter = Vec3::new(self.world.wind.x, (self.world.minutes * 3.0).sin() * 1.4, self.world.wind.y) * 0.04;\\n        let rifle = eye + fwd * 0.46 + right * 0.18 + up * -0.20;\\n        let rag = eye + fwd * 0.72 + right * 0.34 + up * -0.02 + flutter;\\n        let show_map = self.world.map_t > 0.05;\\n        let map = if show_map { eye + fwd * 0.40 + right * -0.16 + up * -0.10 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n        let show_gps = self.world.waypoint.is_some();\\n        let gps = if show_gps { eye + fwd * 0.52 + up * -0.30 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n        let show_glass = self.world.mono_t > 0.0;\\n        let glass = if show_glass { eye + fwd * 0.30 + up * -0.04 } else { Vec3::new(ex, -40.0, ez) };\\n        let spots = [rifle, rag, map, gps, glass];\\n        let rot = Quat::from_rotation_arc(Vec3::Z, fwd);\\n        for (id, pos) in self.props.iter().copied().zip(spots) {\\n            sim.set_position(id, pos);\\n            if let Some(e) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id) {\\n                e.rot = rot;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Game for Merc {\\n    const KEY: &'static str = \\\"merc\\\";\\n\\n    fn pre(\\n        &mut self,\\n        sim: &mut Sim,\\n        input: &InputFrame,\\n        dt: f32,\\n        _events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>,\\n    ) -> BTreeMap<EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        self.world.tick(input, dt);\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            // The country moves inside `World`. The room body stays put so the controller does not fight it.\\n            out.insert(id, InputFrame::default());\\n        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, _dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.dress(sim);\\n        let playing = self.world.screen == Screen::Playing;\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            if playing {\\n                let h = geom::height(self.world.x, self.world.z);\\n                sim.set_position(id, Vec3::new(self.world.x, h, self.world.z));\\n            } else {\\n                sim.set_position(id, sim.state.spawn);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if playing {\\n            self.sync_country(sim);\\n            self.sync_props(sim);\\n            let (x, y, z) = self.world.eye_pos();\\n            let pitch = self.world.pitch.clamp(-1.15, 1.15);\\n            aim_overlook([x, y, z], self.world.yaw, pitch, self.world.roll);\\n        } else {\\n            aim_overlook([0.15, 1.55, 4.2], 0.0, -0.42, 0.0);\\n        }\\n        if self.world.guns.first().is_some_and(|g| g.shots > 0) {\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Impact { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 1.2, -1.0), strength: 0.4 });\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        vec![format!(\\\"HP {:.0}\\\", self.world.hp), self.world.goal_name()]\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        self.world.status()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\\n        self.world.bot_input()\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":280}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3c85718d-3c1b-4d59-a062-9cc91e756398-6","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"150→        }\\n        if m.down {\\n            self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\\n        }\\n        self.focus = self.focus.min(n - 1);\\n        let activate = m.confirm || m.click;\\n        if m.left || m.right {\\n            self.nudge_slider(if m.right { 1.0 } else { -1.0 });\\n        }\\n        if m.back {\\n160→            self.go_back();\\n        }\\n        if activate {\\n            let rows = self.rows();\\n            let label = rows.get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default();\\n            self.activate(&label);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\\n170→        self.focus = 0;\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Difficulty | Screen::Settings | Screen::About | Screen::Mp => self.screen = Screen::Title,\\n            Screen::Merc => self.screen = Screen::Difficulty,\\n            Screen::Prologue => self.screen = Screen::Merc,\\n            Screen::Dev if self.tab != 0 => self.tab = 0,\\n            Screen::Dev => self.screen = Screen::Pause,\\n            Screen::Pause => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n            Screen::Ledger => {}\\n            _ => {}\\n180→        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn nudge_slider(&mut self, dir: f32) {\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Dev || self.tab != 5 {\\n            if self.screen == Screen::Settings && self.tab == 0 && self.focus == 1 {\\n                self.music = (self.music + dir * 0.05).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n190→        let count = self.tune.count();\\n        let page_size = 6;\\n        let index = self.page * page_size + self.focus;\\n        if self.focus == 6 || index >= count {\\n            if dir < 0.0 && self.page > 0 {\\n                self.page -= 1;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n200→        let (lo, hi, step) = self.tune.range(index);\\n        let v = (self.tune.get(index) + dir * step).clamp(lo, hi);\\n        self.tune.set(index, v);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => match label {\\n                \\\"Continue\\\" => self.continue_save(),\\n                \\\"New contract\\\" => {\\n210→                    self.screen = Screen::Difficulty;\\n                    self.focus = 1;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Multiplayer\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Mp;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n220→                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"About\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::About;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Difficulty => {\\n230→                self.difficulty = match label {\\n                    \\\"Easy\\\" => 0,\\n                    \\\"Hard\\\" => 2,\\n                    _ => 1,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Merc;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Merc => {\\n                self.merc = match label {\\n240→                    \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\" => 1,\\n                    \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\" => 2,\\n                    \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\" => 3,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Prologue;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Prologue => {\\n                if label == \\\"Begin\\\" {\\n250→                    self.start_playing();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Pause => match label {\\n                \\\"Resume\\\" => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Controls\\\" => {\\n260→                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Dev mode\\\" if !self.hub => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Dev;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n270→                \\\"Quit to title\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Settings => {\\n                if label == \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = true;\\n                } else if label == \\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\" {\\n280→                    self.xbox = false;\\n                } else if label.starts_with(\\\"Page\\\") {\\n                    self.tab = (self.tab + 1) % 4;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Dev => {\\n                if self.tab == 0 {\\n                    self.tab = match label {\\n                        \\\"Cheats\\\" => 1,\\n290→                        \\\"Teleport\\\" => 2,\\n                        \\\"Spawn\\\" => 3,\\n                        \\\"World\\\" => 4,\\n                        \\\"Balance\\\" => 5,\\n                        _ => 0,\\n                    };\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n300→                if label == \\\"Reset to defaults\\\" {\\n                    self.tune = self.tune0.clone();\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Next page\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if self.tab == 1 {\\n310→                    self.toggle_cheat(label);\\n                } else if self.tab == 2 {\\n                    self.dev_teleport(label);\\n                } else if self.tab == 3 {\\n                    self.dev_spawn(label);\\n                } else if self.tab == 4 {\\n                    self.dev_world(label);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Ledger => {\\n320→                let n = match label {\\n                    \\\"Read the names\\\" => 1,\\n                    \\\"Take the chair\\\" => 2,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                self.choose_finale(n);\\n            }\\n            Screen::About => {\\n                if label == \\\"Next\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n330→                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" && self.page > 0 {\\n                    self.page -= 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Mp => {\\n                if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n340→                }\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn toggle_cheat(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        let d = &mut self.dev;\\n        match label {\\n            \\\"God mode\\\" => d.god = !d.god,\\n350→            \\\"Infinite ammo\\\" => d.infinite = !d.infinite,\\n            \\\"No jams\\\" => d.no_jams = !d.no_jams,\\n            \\\"No fever\\\" => d.no_fever = !d.no_fever,\\n            \\\"Noclip\\\" => d.noclip = !d.noclip,\\n            \\\"Invisible\\\" => d.invisible = !d.invisible,\\n            \\\"Show AI\\\" => d.show_ai = !d.show_ai,\\n            \\\"Show fire\\\" => d.show_fire = !d.show_fire,\\n            \\\"Show nav\\\" => d.show_nav = !d.show_nav,\\n            \\\"Show stats\\\" => d.show_stats = !d.show_stats,\\n            _ => {}\\n360→        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let all: Vec<String> = match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => {\\n                let mut r = Vec::new();\\n                if self.has_save {\\n                    r.push(\\\"Continue\\\".into());\\n                }\\n370→                r.extend([\\\"New contract\\\".into(), \\\"Multiplayer\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"About\\\".into()]);\\n                r\\n            }\\n            Screen::Difficulty => vec![\\\"Easy\\\".into(), \\\"Normal\\\".into(), \\\"Hard\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Merc => vec![\\\"Ada Okoro\\\".into(), \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(), \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(), \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Prologue => vec![\\\"Begin\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Ledger => vec![\\\"Burn the ledger\\\".into(), \\\"Read the names\\\".into(), \\\"Take the chair\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Pause => {\\n                let mut rows = vec![\\\"Resume\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"Controls\\\".into()];\\n                if !self.hub {\\n380→                    rows.push(\\\"Dev mode\\\".into());\\n                }\\n                rows.push(\\\"Quit to title\\\".into());\\n                rows\\n            }\\n            Screen::Settings => self.settings_rows(),\\n            Screen::About => vec![\\\"Next\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Dev => self.dev_rows(),\\n            Screen::Mp => vec![\\\"This computer\\\".into(), \\\"Invite code\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Attract => vec![\\\"Press any button\\\".into()],\\n390→            Screen::Playing => vec![],\\n        };\\n        all.into_iter().take(7).collect()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn settings_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab % 4 {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Master\\\".into(), \\\"Music\\\".into(), \\\"Effects\\\".into(), \\\"Voices\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            1 => vec![\\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Invert look\\\".into(), \\\"Sensitivity\\\".into(), \\\"Aim assist\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            2 => vec![\\\"Fullscreen\\\".into(), \\\"Field of view\\\".into(), \\\"Brightness\\\".into(), \\\"Head bob\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n400→            _ => vec![\\\"Subtitle size\\\".into(), \\\"Reduce motion\\\".into(), \\\"Assist markers\\\".into(), \\\"Immersive hud\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn dev_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Cheats\\\".into(), \\\"Teleport\\\".into(), \\\"Spawn\\\".into(), \\\"World\\\".into(), \\\"Balance\\\".into()],\\n            1 => {\\n                let names = [\\\"God mode\\\", \\\"Infinite ammo\\\", \\\"No jams\\\", \\\"No fever\\\", \\\"Noclip\\\", \\\"Invisible\\\", \\\"Show AI\\\", \\\"Show fire\\\", \\\"Show nav\\\", \\\"Show stats\\\"];\\n                self.page_of(&names)\\n410→            }\\n            2 => {\\n                let names: Vec<&str> = super::geom::PLACES.iter().map(|p| p.name).collect();\\n                self.page_of_owned(names)\\n            }\\n            3 => vec![\\\"Soldier\\\".into(), \\\"Animal\\\".into(), \\\"Truck\\\".into(), \\\"Technical\\\".into(), \\\"Boat\\\".into(), \\\"Barrel\\\".into()],\\n            4 => vec![\\n                \\\"Night\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Noon\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Rain\\\".into(),\\n420→                \\\"Clear sky\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Strong wind\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Calm\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Ignite grass\\\".into(),\\n            ],\\n            5 => {\\n                let mut rows = Vec::new();\\n                let start = self.page * 6;\\n                for i in start..(start + 6).min(self.tune.count()) {\\n                    rows.push(format!(\\\"{} {:.2}\\\", self.tune.name(i), self.tune.get(i)));\",\"content_concise\":\"150→        }\\n        if m.down {\\n            self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\\n        }\\n        self.focus = self.focus.min(n - 1);\\n        let activate = m.confirm || m.click;\\n        if m.left || m.right {\\n            self.nudge_slider(if m.right { 1.0 } else { -1.0 });\\n        }\\n        if m.back {\\n160→            self.go_back();\\n        }\\n        if activate {\\n            let rows = self.rows();\\n            let label = rows.get(self.focus).cloned().unwrap_or_default();\\n            self.activate(&label);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\\n170→        self.focus = 0;\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Difficulty | Screen::Settings | Screen::About | Screen::Mp => self.screen = Screen::Title,\\n            Screen::Merc => self.screen = Screen::Difficulty,\\n            Screen::Prologue => self.screen = Screen::Merc,\\n            Screen::Dev if self.tab != 0 => self.tab = 0,\\n            Screen::Dev => self.screen = Screen::Pause,\\n            Screen::Pause => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n            Screen::Ledger => {}\\n            _ => {}\\n180→        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn nudge_slider(&mut self, dir: f32) {\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Dev || self.tab != 5 {\\n            if self.screen == Screen::Settings && self.tab == 0 && self.focus == 1 {\\n                self.music = (self.music + dir * 0.05).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n190→        let count = self.tune.count();\\n        let page_size = 6;\\n        let index = self.page * page_size + self.focus;\\n        if self.focus == 6 || index >= count {\\n            if dir < 0.0 && self.page > 0 {\\n                self.page -= 1;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n200→        let (lo, hi, step) = self.tune.range(index);\\n        let v = (self.tune.get(index) + dir * step).clamp(lo, hi);\\n        self.tune.set(index, v);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => match label {\\n                \\\"Continue\\\" => self.continue_save(),\\n                \\\"New contract\\\" => {\\n210→                    self.screen = Screen::Difficulty;\\n                    self.focus = 1;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Multiplayer\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Mp;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n220→                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"About\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::About;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Difficulty => {\\n230→                self.difficulty = match label {\\n                    \\\"Easy\\\" => 0,\\n                    \\\"Hard\\\" => 2,\\n                    _ => 1,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Merc;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Merc => {\\n                self.merc = match label {\\n240→                    \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\" => 1,\\n                    \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\" => 2,\\n                    \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\" => 3,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                self.screen = Screen::Prologue;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Screen::Prologue => {\\n                if label == \\\"Begin\\\" {\\n250→                    self.start_playing();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Pause => match label {\\n                \\\"Resume\\\" => self.screen = Screen::Playing,\\n                \\\"Settings\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Controls\\\" => {\\n260→                    self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n                    self.tab = 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                \\\"Dev mode\\\" if !self.hub => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Dev;\\n                    self.tab = 0;\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n270→                \\\"Quit to title\\\" => {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Screen::Settings => {\\n                if label == \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\" {\\n                    self.xbox = true;\\n                } else if label == \\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\" {\\n280→                    self.xbox = false;\\n                } else if label.starts_with(\\\"Page\\\") {\\n                    self.tab = (self.tab + 1) % 4;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Dev => {\\n                if self.tab == 0 {\\n                    self.tab = match label {\\n                        \\\"Cheats\\\" => 1,\\n290→                        \\\"Teleport\\\" => 2,\\n                        \\\"Spawn\\\" => 3,\\n                        \\\"World\\\" => 4,\\n                        \\\"Balance\\\" => 5,\\n                        _ => 0,\\n                    };\\n                    self.page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n300→                if label == \\\"Reset to defaults\\\" {\\n                    self.tune = self.tune0.clone();\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if label == \\\"Next page\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    return;\\n                }\\n                if self.tab == 1 {\\n310→                    self.toggle_cheat(label);\\n                } else if self.tab == 2 {\\n                    self.dev_teleport(label);\\n                } else if self.tab == 3 {\\n                    self.dev_spawn(label);\\n                } else if self.tab == 4 {\\n                    self.dev_world(label);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Ledger => {\\n320→                let n = match label {\\n                    \\\"Read the names\\\" => 1,\\n                    \\\"Take the chair\\\" => 2,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                self.choose_finale(n);\\n            }\\n            Screen::About => {\\n                if label == \\\"Next\\\" {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n330→                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" && self.page > 0 {\\n                    self.page -= 1;\\n                } else if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Screen::Mp => {\\n                if label == \\\"Back\\\" {\\n                    self.screen = Screen::Title;\\n340→                }\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn toggle_cheat(&mut self, label: &str) {\\n        let d = &mut self.dev;\\n        match label {\\n            \\\"God mode\\\" => d.god = !d.god,\\n350→            \\\"Infinite ammo\\\" => d.infinite = !d.infinite,\\n            \\\"No jams\\\" => d.no_jams = !d.no_jams,\\n            \\\"No fever\\\" => d.no_fever = !d.no_fever,\\n            \\\"Noclip\\\" => d.noclip = !d.noclip,\\n            \\\"Invisible\\\" => d.invisible = !d.invisible,\\n            \\\"Show AI\\\" => d.show_ai = !d.show_ai,\\n            \\\"Show fire\\\" => d.show_fire = !d.show_fire,\\n            \\\"Show nav\\\" => d.show_nav = !d.show_nav,\\n            \\\"Show stats\\\" => d.show_stats = !d.show_stats,\\n            _ => {}\\n360→        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let all: Vec<String> = match self.screen {\\n            Screen::Title => {\\n                let mut r = Vec::new();\\n                if self.has_save {\\n                    r.push(\\\"Continue\\\".into());\\n                }\\n370→                r.extend([\\\"New contract\\\".into(), \\\"Multiplayer\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"About\\\".into()]);\\n                r\\n            }\\n            Screen::Difficulty => vec![\\\"Easy\\\".into(), \\\"Normal\\\".into(), \\\"Hard\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Merc => vec![\\\"Ada Okoro\\\".into(), \\\"Tomek Wrona\\\".into(), \\\"Rafael Quintero\\\".into(), \\\"Mirela Dragan\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Prologue => vec![\\\"Begin\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Ledger => vec![\\\"Burn the ledger\\\".into(), \\\"Read the names\\\".into(), \\\"Take the chair\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Pause => {\\n                let mut rows = vec![\\\"Resume\\\".into(), \\\"Settings\\\".into(), \\\"Controls\\\".into()];\\n                if !self.hub {\\n380→                    rows.push(\\\"Dev mode\\\".into());\\n                }\\n                rows.push(\\\"Quit to title\\\".into());\\n                rows\\n            }\\n            Screen::Settings => self.settings_rows(),\\n            Screen::About => vec![\\\"Next\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Dev => self.dev_rows(),\\n            Screen::Mp => vec![\\\"This computer\\\".into(), \\\"Invite code\\\".into(), \\\"Back\\\".into()],\\n            Screen::Attract => vec![\\\"Press any button\\\".into()],\\n390→            Screen::Playing => vec![],\\n        };\\n        all.into_iter().take(7).collect()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn settings_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab % 4 {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Master\\\".into(), \\\"Music\\\".into(), \\\"Effects\\\".into(), \\\"Voices\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            1 => vec![\\\"PlayStation glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Xbox glyphs\\\".into(), \\\"Invert look\\\".into(), \\\"Sensitivity\\\".into(), \\\"Aim assist\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n            2 => vec![\\\"Fullscreen\\\".into(), \\\"Field of view\\\".into(), \\\"Brightness\\\".into(), \\\"Head bob\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n400→            _ => vec![\\\"Subtitle size\\\".into(), \\\"Reduce motion\\\".into(), \\\"Assist markers\\\".into(), \\\"Immersive hud\\\".into(), \\\"Page\\\".into()],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn dev_rows(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        match self.tab {\\n            0 => vec![\\\"Cheats\\\".into(), \\\"Teleport\\\".into(), \\\"Spawn\\\".into(), \\\"World\\\".into(), \\\"Balance\\\".into()],\\n            1 => {\\n                let names = [\\\"God mode\\\", \\\"Infinite ammo\\\", \\\"No jams\\\", \\\"No fever\\\", \\\"Noclip\\\", \\\"Invisible\\\", \\\"Show AI\\\", \\\"Show fire\\\", \\\"Show nav\\\", \\\"Show stats\\\"];\\n                self.page_of(&names)\\n410→            }\\n            2 => {\\n                let names: Vec<&str> = super::geom::PLACES.iter().map(|p| p.name).collect();\\n                self.page_of_owned(names)\\n            }\\n            3 => vec![\\\"Soldier\\\".into(), \\\"Animal\\\".into(), \\\"Truck\\\".into(), \\\"Technical\\\".into(), \\\"Boat\\\".into(), \\\"Barrel\\\".into()],\\n            4 => vec![\\n                \\\"Night\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Noon\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Rain\\\".into(),\\n420→                \\\"Clear sky\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Strong wind\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Calm\\\".into(),\\n                \\\"Ignite grass\\\".into(),\\n            ],\\n            5 => {\\n        