{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_580","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nBus travel is explicitly allowed. The prior gap only named Town, Boat, Night, and script_ignite as teleport violations. Spec::Drive was not listed. Anti-ratchet rules generally forbid raising fresh nitpicks. However, Criterion 4 explicitly forbidsThe ledger test and play_route are critical. all warps and cheats. If the Drive teleport is a real defect, it could be a gating criterion issue.\n\nThe prior round implicitly accepted mission setups like spawning soldiers and arming weapons. It only explicitly called out the specific teleport and cheat violations it found. If the Drive auto-seat teleport existed then but was never flagged, raising it now would be re-litigation.\n\nThe prior gap requires adding an in-play choice to reach each ending from normal inputs. The test names reveal a mismatch: burn uses Route::Human, but chair and read use Route::Chair and Route::Read.\n\nplay_route constructs the campaign with a fixed route, so the three endings are reached by pre-selected routes rather than an in-play choice. present_ending sets the route to Human before jumping to Ending. The bot_ledger uses self.route to pick its menu item, meaning a Route::Chair start triggers the \"Take the chair\" choice.\n\nThe gap remains unfixed. The tests still construct campaigns with fixed","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aceef624-152c-4e45-b80d-c6508c3962d0-14","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn tick\\(|fn menu|fn apply_menu|Ledger|present_ending|bot_ledger|fn bot_input","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aceef624-152c-4e45-b80d-c6508c3962d0-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn first_person|fn ledger|fn dev_menu|fn bot_plays|overlook|noclip|choose_finale|eye_pos|town_burned|boat_driven|night_contract","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aceef624-152c-4e45-b80d-c6508c3962d0-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":270,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aceef624-152c-4e45-b80d-c6508c3962d0-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":1200,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":18309,"output_tokens":2058,"cache_read_input_tokens":43392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"1a48ae7b-df63-43f5-8775-6b0422f9ae44"}
