{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_584","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe first-person camera gap is fixed. The player position now alignsA critical honesty issue with world coordinates during play. Props and country tiles spawn relative to the eye. in the playthrough needs examination. A test validates that the camera eye tracks the body, props stay near the camera, and country tiles appear near the eye.\n\nThe overlook value flows through app.rs into the first-person camera renderer. Menu resets are handled during play. Country tiles spawn around the player eye, which satisfies the original requirement to show them from that perspective.\n\n`play_route` still pre-selects the route via `World::campaign(seed, route)`, which embeds Read and Chair choices before any in-play selection occurs. This conflicts with the prior gap requiring a genuine in-play choice to reach each ending.\n\nThe bot_ledger hardcodes its choice from the pre-selected route, so the selection is not a genuine in-play decision. A separate test, `ledger_confirm_earns_the_chosen_ending`,\n\nThe second gap is  appears to handle thisfixed. The Ledger screen case. now offers three finale choices. Choosing one arms the matching ending setup. The burn flag only triggers when that finale is selected and a weapon actually ignites, not on the first tick.\n\nThe chair and read endings are now marked correctly on interaction","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f3e8440b-368f-41fd-953f-add4f82e921c-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":250,"limit":230}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6495,"output_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":66432,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"a196bd87-c3f5-4b19-a437-ac5c082f68c2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_585","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" and after a 180-second","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f3e8440b-368f-41fd-953f-add4f82e921c-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":750,"limit":110}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f3e8440b-368f-41fd-953f-add4f82e921c-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn shell_tick|fn menu_input|act == 1|CONFIRM|focus","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/shell.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"1032281f-d1fa-4c40-a8d2-e2b86855dde5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f3e8440b-368f-41fd-953f-add4f82e921c-20","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"250→    Ignite(u8),\\n    Tanks,\\n    Mounted,\\n    Panic,\\n    Animals,\\n    Bus { x: f32, z: f32 },\\n    Night,\\n    Boat,\\n    Stealth,\\n    Dart,\\n260→    Repair,\\n    Rain,\\n    Better,\\n    Patch,\\n    Overdose,\\n    Die,\\n    Tape,\\n    Ceasefire,\\n    Convoy,\\n    Town,\\n270→    Ending(u8),\\n    Flag(&'static str),\\n}\\n\\nfn script(route: Route) -> &'static [Spec] {\\n    static S: OnceLock<Vec<Vec<Spec>>> = OnceLock::new();\\n    let all = S.get_or_init(|| vec![build_script(Route::Human), build_script(Route::Burn), build_script(Route::Read), build_script(Route::Chair)]);\\n    let i = match route {\\n        Route::Human => 0,\\n        Route::Burn => 1,\\n280→        Route::Read => 2,\\n        Route::Chair => 3,\\n        Route::Sandbox => return &[],\\n    };\\n    all[i].as_slice()\\n}\\n\\nfn build_script(route: Route) -> Vec<Spec> {\\n    let mut v = vec![\\n        Spec::Boot,\\n290→        Spec::Map,\\n        Spec::Way,\\n        Spec::Reach { x: 0.0, z: 460.0, gps: true },\\n        Spec::Fever,\\n    ];\\n    if route == Route::Read {\\n        v.push(Spec::Blackout);\\n    } else {\\n        v.push(Spec::Pill);\\n    }\\n300→    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_a0\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: -40.0, z: 640.0, gps: false });\\n    v.push(Spec::Fight);\\n    v.push(Spec::EnemyJam);\\n    v.push(Spec::Jam);\\n    v.push(Spec::Break);\\n    v.push(Spec::Rescue);\\n    for w in 1..=6 {\\n        v.push(Spec::Wound(w));\\n    }\\n310→    v.push(Spec::Loot);\\n    v.push(Spec::Reach { x: 170.0, z: 470.0, gps: false });\\n    v.push(Spec::Claim);\\n    v.push(Spec::Shop);\\n    v.push(Spec::Locker);\\n    v.push(Spec::Syrette);\\n    v.push(Spec::Tracker);\\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 8.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_a1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -520.0, z: -520.0 });\\n320→    v.push(Spec::Mono);\\n    for ig in 0..12 {\\n        v.push(Spec::Ignite(ig));\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Tanks);\\n    v.push(Spec::Mounted);\\n    v.push(Spec::Panic);\\n    v.push(Spec::Animals);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b1\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Bus { x: 0.0, z: 380.0 });\\n330→    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -260.0, z: -700.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Sleep { hours: 26.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Night);\\n    v.push(Spec::Boat);\\n    v.push(Spec::Stealth);\\n    v.push(Spec::Dart);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b2\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Repair);\\n    v.push(Spec::Rain);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b3\\\"));\\n340→    v.push(Spec::Better);\\n    match route {\\n        Route::Read => v.push(Spec::Overdose),\\n        Route::Chair => v.push(Spec::Die),\\n        _ => v.push(Spec::Patch),\\n    }\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_b4\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Tape);\\n    v.push(Spec::Ceasefire);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c1\\\"));\\n350→    v.push(Spec::Convoy);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c2\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Town);\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_c3\\\"));\\n    v.push(Spec::Drive { x: -760.0, z: 620.0 });\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_d1\\\"));\\n    let end = match route {\\n        Route::Read => 1,\\n        Route::Chair => 2,\\n        _ => 0,\\n360→    };\\n    v.push(Spec::Ending(end));\\n    v.push(Spec::Flag(\\\"contract_d2\\\"));\\n    v\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct World {\\n    pub seed: u64,\\n    pub rng: Rng,\\n370→    pub route: Route,\\n    pub screen: Screen,\\n    pub focus: usize,\\n    pub tab: usize,\\n    pub page: usize,\\n    pub difficulty: u8,\\n    pub merc: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n380→    pub pitch: f32,\\n    pub roll: f32,\\n    pub eye: f32,\\n    pub stance: u8,\\n    pub stamina: f32,\\n    pub hp: f32,\\n 