{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_588","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nblow_tanks is a demonstrable cheat for cells_500 and explosion_chain. It was not among the four bugs raised in the prior gap, but anti-ratchet permits newly litigating defects that are demonstrable in shipped behavior. Criterion 4 requires every coverage flag to be set by real play, so this director shortcut remains a valid objection.Reviewing boat boarding, town molotov, and noclip\n\nSpec::Drive forces the player into the vehicle and sets the look. seat to 1 without requiring boarding. The prior gap may have overlooked blow_tanks because it focused on named weapon ignites, or because it treated tank destruction as a scripted set piece. I will verify whether town, boat, and ignite actually work without warps by reading the playthrough log and relevant code paths.\n\nSpec::Drive warps the player into the driver's seat by setting ride.x and ride.z to the player's current coordinates. The bot_spec then skips boarding and drives directly.\n\nChecking captured  This is a teleport into a vehicle, whichlogs to verify the test violates criterion  passes without re-running4 against teleport.  the full suite. ReviewingThe prior gap did not playthrough and run-all flag this warp because logs for new tests. it only named director actions. Looking for remaining cheats from prior gap 3, including Town x/z and town_burned, Boat water teleportation, Night night_contract stamping, and script_ignite stamping.\n\nThe prior gap likely accepted other scripted setup as scenario preparation\n\nTown molotov fires rather than director at (18, 424) after  cheats. Spawning a vehicle next to the walking there. Boat player and forcing entryplaces the boat at the into the driver's seat nearest water with the bot in the seat, then drives. Night sets time to 22:00 and moves forward to satisfy the night_contract flag. is a warp, whereas placing the vehicle nearby and requiring the player to press USE is fair play. Boat now follows the latter approach.\n\nThe time-skip for the night contract is acceptable since the prior gap only required stamping the flag. script_ignite now triggers weapon flags through","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-280f253d-7ff3-49e5-975c-503c2303ba18-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"boat_driven|town_burned|technical_driven|fn use_vehicle|seat == 2|mounted_gun","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-280f253d-7ff3-49e5-975c-503c2303ba18-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ending_burn|ending_read|ending_chair|boat|town|ignite_flare|PASS|FAIL|stuck","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/playthrough.log","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-280f253d-7ff3-49e5-975c-503c2303ba18-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"first_person|ledger_confirm|dev_menu|bot_plays|test result|ok$|FAILED","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/run-all.log","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7445,"output_tokens":3036,"cache_read_input_tokens":70912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"111d7d7b-c67b-4586-a06f-552b5a1e6585"}
