{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_601","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe camera stayed at the menu overlook while the eye moved to the airstrip. The screen was Playing after menu confirmation, but the camera did not update. This suggests aim_overlook was skipped, post() failed, or line numbers shifted.Line 2002 assigns `sx` to `self.x` and `sz`\n\nThe earlier failure to `self.z`. snapshot is stale. The current code includes the fix and merc-all2 passed first_person. I will verify whether post() is actually invoked by checking Sim::step.\n\nSafe house wake is intended game behavior, not a cheat. Bus teleport and airstrip spawn \n\nA global camera race is suspected. Another test might reset the camera after this test's post but before the assert. The passingare normal. The ledger ending teleport is only used by the unit test; the full playthrough reaches it organically. merc-all2 result suggests the lock works or the bug is fixed. I will check whether all Merc-stepping tests acquire camera_lock.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b53bc12-c467-4637-a7b4-2fb1fe04c9b8-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1920,"limit":140}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b53bc12-c467-4637-a7b4-2fb1fe04c9b8-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_view/src/camera.rs","offset":160,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3126,"output_tokens":415,"cache_read_input_tokens":99328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"52391e71-1927-4808-9355-c30bf74c8634"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7b53bc12-c467-4637-a7b4-2fb1fe04c9b8-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1920→                self.bodies[i].alert = 3;\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            if !self.dev.invisible && !smoked && self.bodies[i].alert < 2 {\\n                self.bodies[i].see += rate * falloff * dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].see > 1.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[i].alert = 2;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            // Fire under an enemy makes them run.\\n1930→            let (cx, cz) = (self.bodies[i].x, self.bodies[i].z);\\n            let cell = geom::cell_of(cx, cz);\\n            if self.fire.cells.get(&cell).map(|c| c.burning).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                self.bodies[i].alert = 4;\\n                self.bodies[i].x += 4.0 * dt;\\n                self.bodies[i].flee += 4.0 * dt;\\n                if self.bodies[i].flee > 3.0 {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"enemy_panicked\\\");\\n                }\\n            }\\n1940→            if self.bodies[i].kind == 1 && self.bodies[i].alert >= 1 && !self.bodies[i].gun.jammed {\\n                if shooters >= 4 {\\n                    // One extra soldier peels off to the side instead of adding a fifth gun.\\n                    self.bodies[i].x += 3.0 * dt;\\n                    self.bodies[i].z += 1.5 * dt;\\n                    continue;\\n                }\\n                shooters += 1;\\n                let gpull = {\\n                    let jam = self.tune.jam_chance;\\n1950→                    let wear = self.tune.weapon_wear;\\n                    let br = self.tune.break_threshold;\\n                    self.bodies[i].gun.pull(&mut self.rng, jam, wear, br)\\n                };\\n                if gpull == Pull::Jammed {\\n                    self.mark(\\\"enemy_jam\\\");\\n                }\\n                if gpull == Pull::Fired && self.rng.f32() < self.tune.enemy_accuracy * 0.15 {\\n                    let diff = match self.difficulty {\\n                        0 => 0.7,\\n1960→                        2 => 1.3,\\n                        _ => 1.0,\\n                    };\\n                    if !self.dev.god && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n                        self.hp -= self.tune.enemy_damage * 0.15 * diff * dt.max(0.05) * 10.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            self.bodies[i].gun.tick_clear(dt);\\n            if self.bodies[i].hp <= 0.0 {\\n1970→                self.bodies[i].alive = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_fever(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.dev.no_fever {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.fever_state == 0 {\\n1980→            self.fever_t += dt;\\n            if self.fever_t >= self.tune.fever_interval {\\n                self.fever_state = 1;\\n                self.fever_warn = 0.0;\\n                self.mark(\\\"fever_warned\\\");\\n            }\\n        } else if self.fever_state == 1 {\\n            self.fever_warn += dt;\\n            if self.fever_warn >= 40.0 {\\n                self.fever_state = 2;\\n1990→                self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        } else if self.fever_state == 2 {\\n            self.fever_attack += dt;\\n            if self.fever_attack >= 60.0 && self.pills == 0 {\\n                self.blackout();\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n2000→    fn blackout(&mut self) {\\n        let (sx, sz) = geom::nearest_safe(self.x, self.z);\\n        self.x = sx;\\n        self.z = sz;\\n        self.hp = 50.0;\\n        self.diamonds = (self.diamonds as f32 * 0.8).floor() as u32;\\n        self.fever_state = 0;\\n        self.fever_t = 0.0;\\n        self.fever_attack = 0.0;\\n        self.minutes += 6.0 * 60.0;\\n2010→        self.mark(\\\"blackout\\\");\\n    }\\n\\n    fn update_rescue(&mut self, dt: f32) {\\n        if self.hp <= 0.0 && self.rescue_t <= 0.0 && !self.companions.iter().any(|c| c.rescue_spent) {\\n            if let Some(c) = self.companions.iter_mut().find(|c| c.alive && !c.down) {\\n                c.rescue_spent = true;\\n                self.rescue_t = 3.0;\\n                self.hp = 1.0;\\n            }\\n2020→        }\\n        if self.rescue_t > 0.0 {\\n            self.rescue_t -= dt;\\n            let (sy, cy) = self.yaw.sin_cos();\\n            self.x -= sy * dt * 4.0;\\n            self.z -= -cy * dt * 4.0;\\n            if self.rescue_t <= 0.0 {\\n                self.rescue_t = 0.0;\\n                self.hp = 50.0;\\n                self.slot = 0;\\n2030→                self.mark(\\\"player_rescued\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn special_actions(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        let near_cache = geom::dist(self.x, self.z, self.tracker_cache.0, self.tracker_cache.1);\\n        if near_cache < 4.0 {\\n            self.mark(\\\"cache_tracker\\\");\\n        }\\n2040→        if input.down(buttons::INTERACT) {\\n            self.hold_t += dt;\\n        } else {\\n            self.hold_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::INTERACT) || (input.down(buttons::INTERACT) && self.hold_t > 0.4) {\\n            self.try_interact();\\n        }\\n        if input.just(buttons::MELEE) {\\n            let crouched = self.stance == 1;\\n2050→            let px = self.x;\\n            let pz = self.z;\\n            let mut stealth = false;\\n            for b in &mut self.bodies {\\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 1 && geom::dist(px, pz, b.x, b.z) < 2.2 {\\n                    b.hp = 0.0;\\n                    b.alive = false;\\n                    if crouched {\\n                        stealth = true;\\n                    }\",\"content_concise\":\"1920→                self.bodies[i].alert = 3;\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            if !self.dev.invisible && !smoked && self.bodies[i].alert < 2 {\\n        