{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_606","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nDrive auto-seat is a boarding shortcut. It places the player in the driver's seat but still requires actual driving to reach the destination. This mirrors the prior boat teleport bug, which also bypassed the required interaction.A significant potential bug was found for the town burn.\n\nblow_tanks is incomplete because it completes the objective without firing any shots. The Night clock is acceptable as scene setup; the prior objection was specifically about flag stamping in begin, which is now fixed.\n\nThe prior skeptic cited world.rs:971, but the file has shifted and the baseline is unclear. The Town, Boat, Weapon ignites, and ending_burn fixes are confirmed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d4d82976-c6d8-4e05-92bb-bda5cedc5ae4-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs","offset":219,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d4d82976-c6d8-4e05-92bb-bda5cedc5ae4-44","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn ignite_at|town|fuel","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/fire.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d4d82976-c6d8-4e05-92bb-bda5cedc5ae4-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Spec::Town|x = |self\\.x =","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7794,"output_tokens":435,"cache_read_input_tokens":106368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1