{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_609","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Animals flee if any gun has shots fired earlier in the campaign. Shots fired during the animal step do not trigger this.The HTML does not contain the target strings. They are likely embedded in a base64-encoded WASM binary.\n\nThe bot holds aim without firing. The flee condition is a gameplay rule, not a director stamp. I am checking for another missed bug in the ledger test. The ending read may not be reached there. Playthrough might mark it incorrectly.\n\nThe absence of the strings in the HTML does not prove the WASM is stale. I will check the HTML structure, packing timestamps, and pack logs for a real logic bug. The town bot target and\n\nThe ledger timer advances ceasefire are the next even though the script focus. does not run. After 180 seconds, choosing \"read\" can trigger \"ending_read\" immediately without holding the\n\nSpec::Drive auto-seat mast. The bot selects quickly, so this bug remains a cheat. Spec::Flag is unlikely to surface instant completes.  in tests.The bot calls blow_tanks without checking the shot.\n\nThe ledger timer bug is minor and does not refute the test. The human route gap is fixed. All three endings are reachable from a single human campaign via the ledger menu. The bot's three runs correctly hit blackout,\n\nThe prior gap removed overdose, and die under weapon ignite stamps the union design. but left Spec::Tanks calling blow_tanks() every tick. This ignites disks and stamps explosion_chain and cells_500 without a shot. Both cells_500 and explosion_chain are in the coverage list.\n\nThe dev menu world tab has seven items, matching the rows function. The Night confirmation logic correctly handles minute increments after shell execution. Noclip toggles properly return to pause and resume; the test manually sets the vehicle seat for setup but uses move_body for flight, which is honest. Teleport is tested at the first place.\n\nspecial_actions invokes script_ignite every tick while step_ready is active. blow_tanks instantly destroys all 49 tank farm barrels","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6f4709d1-8b68-4939-842b-5ad6894d0b19-46","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/merc-all.log","offset":40,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6f4709d1-8b68-4939-842b-5ad6894d0b19-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","offset":55,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3328,"output_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":106880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"5c412e80-14ed-4dda-9d90-a177c4c09ef5"}
