{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_613","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe human route gap is fixed. The bot selects Read at the ledger, satisfying the criterion. First-person and dev-menu gaps are also resolved. I am now evaluating whether blow_tanks alone is sufficient to refute the remaining scripted ignite cheat.\n\nThe blow_tanks path is a valid refutation of the prior gap. It remains an incomplete fix because script_ignite still stamps flags without firing weapons. I will now check Panic, Rain, and Animals for similar director cheats.The patch file might be large or the path could differ.\n\nThe prior gap's \"etc.\" likely covered the remaining ignite flags such as mortar, molotov, and frag. Those are now fired via weapons or interaction. Tanks is a separate path from Spec::Ignite. The explosion_chain and cells_500 flags are produced by blow_tanks.\n\nThe player cannot chain barrel kills during the Tanks step. Only blow_tanks ignites ","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cbf1525c-1245-4aa7-ba08-d70e5a3a5852-51","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"wc -l \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-2.patch\"; rg -n \"blow_tanks|seat = 1|script_ignite\" \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-2.patch\" | head -40","description":"Search patch for remaining director cheats"}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1022,"output_tokens":287,"cache_read_input_tokens":114816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"f805c45b-cc10-4170-a6c8-fa3516be5448"}
