{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_626","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A panic scenario was described: a director ignites fire near a soldier, causing the soldier to flee and a flag to set.\n\nThe director lights six fire disks in begin() as scenario setup. The soldier flees from the fire. The fire source is cheated. This mirrors the old script_ignite cheat. It may be treated as setup rather than a director action.\n\nBlow_tanks remains inside script_ignite. It stamps coverage flags without firing a weapon. Drive auto-seat warps were left in place. Criterion 4 requires removing them so the bot uses player actions.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bfc89211-1565-472c-bb9e-62ecb7477911-61","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"better.way|alternate|companion","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bfc89211-1565-472c-bb9e-62ecb7477911-62","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PLAN.md","offset":650,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2713,"output_tokens":415,"cache_read_input_tokens":131328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"c7086170-7187-4122-8ce9-8cd37276ef96"}
