fered approach.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": \"merc-all2.log shows first_person, ledger, and dev_menu passing, and playthrough.log shows bot_plays_all_three_endings ok, but world.rs:2114 and world.rs:861 still stamp tanks/cells_500 and seat the driver without a player action.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"Prior gaps 1, 2, and 4 are fixed. Gap 3 is not: `script_ignite` still calls `blow_tanks` (`world.rs:2114`), which stamps `explosion_chain` and `cells_500` without a shot; `Spec::Drive` still sets `ride.seat = 1` (`world.rs:861`); `Spec::Better` stamps `better_way` in `begin` so the step completes with no input (`world.rs:957`). `playthrough.log` is green because those stamps satisfy the assertions. Remove the stamps and use the same actions a player uses.\"\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2537,"output_tokens":921,"cache_read_input_tokens":146048,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"f4d27d9d-2d64-4009-a8c7-9d0c3eac78c3"}
