{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_631","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Resuming work from the verification rejection.\n\nTwo bugs remain. `script_ignite` ignores the fire button and destroys all barrels instead of igniting them properly. `Spec::Drive` places the player on their feet rather than boarding the vehicle nearby.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The playthrough still stamps the tank blast, seats the player in the truck, and marks the alternate approach before anyone takes it. I’ll read those three steps and make the bot earn them the way a player would."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2bf6e42b-63b0-4a74-b595-0e7e7237bc48-128","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"tanks","content":"Earn explosion_chain and cells_500 by shooting the tanks","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"drive","content":"Spawn the technical nearby and board it with USE","status":"pending"},{"id":"better","content":"Set better_way only after the player takes the approach","status":"pending"},{"id":"verify","content":"Re-run playthrough, wasm pack, and verification checks","status":"pending"}],"merge":false}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2bf6e42b-63b0-4a74-b595-0e7e7237bc48-129","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":820,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2bf6e42b-63b0-4a74-b595-0e7e7237bc48-130","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1030,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2bf6e42b-63b0-4a74-b595-0e7e7237bc48-131","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261