{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_632","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand how tanks should be shot.\n\nI'm examining the current tank mechanics. The spawn_tank_farm creates 7x7 barrels at 10m spacing, and blow_tanks kills them with radius-6 ignitions that mark explosion_chain and cells_500. I need to check PLAN.md and shots_tick to understand how the intended chain explosion and barrel shooting mechanics should work.\n\nI'm examining the Drive step for technical vehicles. The spec says to spawn the vehicle nearby and board it with USE input, but the current code sets ride.seat = 1 on the player's feet. The first technical leg never presses USE, which is a bug.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f80fb91-a732-4773-981a-7a4f6afe9176-133","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ride\\.kind|better_way|explosion_chain|cells_500|blow_tanks","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f80fb91-a732-4773-981a-7a4f6afe9176-134","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"better_way|tank|explosion|technical","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6417,"output_tokens":528,"cache_read_input_tokens":186496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"bea809ea-c7ef-47f2-b4fc-f4200ff4a508"}
