2,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,53,48,51,95,95,120,98,100,55,100,57,49,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"f746a759-a845-4270-ba97-73a9fe1f2881"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_635","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ride starts as default kind 0. The first Drive begin sets kind 1, seat 1, and position on the player.\n\nThe bug is that begin() sets seat 1 on the player's feet. The fix is to set seat 0 and spawn the ride nearby so the bot walks and USEs. Later drives drop the ride at the destination with seat 0, so the player boards by pressing USE.\n\nThe second and third drive paths are fine as-is. The fix only affects the first Drive begin.\n\nThe first drive occurs before the depot, so no truck exists yet. The fix is confirmed safe for this case.\n\nThe Better Way step has a logic flaw. It marks the flag and downs the companion in begin(), so the step finishes immediately when the companion is downed. The flag should only be set when the player actually takes the approach.\n\nThe bot takes the Better Way offer by pressing INTERACT. The next steps are Patch, Overdose, or Die.\n\nThe Better Way step should only offer the companion in begin(). It must not mark the flag or down the companion yet. The flag and the companion's fall should happen after the player presses INTERACT.\n\nThe Better step should mark the flag and down the companion only when the player presses INTERACT. Patch, Overdose, and Die begin also mark the flag and down the companion. If Better already did this, those steps would be redundant.\n\nPatch, Overdose, and Die begin also mark the better_way flag. Patch completes on companion_patched rather than on that flag. The flag is therefore already set by Better Way before those steps run. Patch's mark is redundant.\n\nThe fix requires removing mark(\"better_way\") from Better, Patch, Overdose, and Die begin. done(Better) must no longer be true immediately. The flag should only be set when the player actually takes the approach.\n\nThe flag should be set when the player accepts the companion's offer, not when they patch, overdose, or let them die. The phrase \"better-way taken\" refers to accepting the alternate plan, so the flag must be marked on INTERACT during the Better step.\n\nThe implementation will keep the companion alive and near the player during the Better step, then mark the flag inside try_interact when the player presses INTERACT.\n\nThe INTERACT handler will down the companion and set their position. done(Better) will check only the better_way flag, dropping the companion-down shortcut. Patch, Overdose, and Die begin will no longer mark better_way.\n\nPatch, Overdose, and Die begin will only down the companion if they are still alive. Patch requires a three-second hold to heal. Die requires no action; the companion simply dies after forty-five seconds.\n\nThe bot already presses INTERACT during Better, so the flag and companion fall happen in the same tick. The step completes immediately after simulation. All three human routes pass through Better first, so the flag is set once on any valid path.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4bb61f9f-8787-4c2a-bd39-32735863586c-142","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"blow_tanks|better_way|Spec::Drive|seat = 1|explosion_chain|spawn_tank","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4bb61f9f-8787-4c2a-bd39-32735863586c-143","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":720,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3418,"output_tokens":2268,"cache_read_input_tokens":199296,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"9732d036-8fba-469d-9964-db9d3105806b"}
