{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_636","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions. I will complete all tasks from PLAN.md that can be done on this computer and ensure all items from TASK.md are present in the folder.\n\nThree bugs in world.rs need fixing. The Tanks spec still calls blow_tanks and deletes barrels. The Drive spec incorrectly sets the player's seat to 1 on their feet. The Better spec marks its flag immediately without waiting for the player to take the offered approach.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The three campaign cheats are still in the sim. I'll read the tank, drive, and better-way paths and earn those flags from real player actions."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ed7cf238-07cf-4b5c-aa7e-d0e170640454-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"tanks","content":"Earn explosion_chain and cells_500 by shooting the tanks","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"drive","content":"Spawn the technical nearby and board it with USE","status":"pending"},{"id":"better","content":"Set better_way only after the player takes the approach","status":"pending"},{"id":"verify","content":"Re-run playthrough, wasm pack, and verification checks","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ed7cf238-07cf-4b5c-aa7e-d0e170640454-1","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn script_ignite|fn blow_tanks|fn spawn_tank_farm|Spec::Drive|Spec::Better|Spec::Tanks|fn done\\(|fn try_interact|fn bot_input|mark\\(\\\"better_way\\\"\\)|seat = 1","glob":"**/merc/world.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":25702,"output_tokens":486,"cache_read_input_tokens":14848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"eeb441e0-d08e-435d-b66a-713f52282423"}
