{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_644","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the fuel() function to confirm that Ombe grass burns.","signature":"mLYVWP3MyUPSfGJkRlATgzBRLyjF+beIkhcH8AhJEkd7br9gqioRPiHh21FniI4FjnELsTodnSqSWtPM44pprO/vC9qSL/E6RRcR"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1a3c64c3-1096-44ae-8469-b6a093ba6d2b-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs","offset":210,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1a3c64c3-1096-44ae-8469-b6a093ba6d2b-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn doomed_enough|struct Companion","glob":"**/merc/**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3498,"output_tokens":134,"cache_read_input_tokens":83328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"92f455b0-2c63-4458-be24-b3566b541426"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1a3c64c3-1096-44ae-8469-b6a093ba6d2b-29","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"210→pub fn tall_grass(x: f32, z: f32) -> bool {\\n    if on_road(x, z) || on_water(x, z) || in_town(x, z) {\\n        return false;\\n    }\\n    let ix = (x / 6.0).floor() as i32;\\n    let iz = (z / 6.0).floor() as i32;\\n    hash_f32(99, ix, 0, iz) > 0.35\\n}\\n\\n/// Fuel per 2 m cell. Roads, water and rock are breaks.\\n220→pub fn fuel(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    if on_road(x, z) || on_water(x, z) || on_rock(x, z) {\\n        0.0\\n    } else if tree_at(x, z) {\\n        3.0\\n    } else if bush_at(x, z) {\\n        1.5\\n    } else {\\n        1.0\\n    }\\n230→}\\n\\npub fn height(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    if x > 180.0 && x < 760.0 && z < -380.0 && z > -820.0 {\\n        ((x - 180.0) / 520.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0) * 42.0\\n    } else if on_water(x, z) {\\n        -1.2\\n    } else {\\n        0.0\\n    }\\n240→}\\n\\npub fn cell_of(x: f32, z: f32) -> (i32, i32) {\\n    (x.div_euclid(2.0) as i32, z.div_euclid(2.0) as i32)\\n}\\n\\npub fn cell_center(c: (i32, i32)) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    (c.0 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0, c.1 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0)\\n}\\n\\n250→pub fn safe_houses() -> [(f32, f32); 3] {\\n    [place(\\\"Pump House\\\"), place(\\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\"), place(\\\"Boat Shed\\\")]\\n}\\n\\npub fn nearest_safe(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    safe_houses().into_iter().min_by(|a, b| dist(x, z, a.0, a.1).total_cmp(&dist(x, z, b.0, b.1))).unwrap_or((170.0, 470.0))\\n}\\n\\n/// Detection multiplier from posture, grass, light and motion. Distance falloff is separate.\\n/// Crouched in tall grass at night, still: 0.6 * 0.35 * 0.45 * 0.5.\",\"content_concise\":\"210→pub fn tall_grass(x: f32, z: f32) -> bool {\\n    if on_road(x, z) || on_water(x, z) || in_town(x, z) {\\n        return false;\\n    }\\n    let ix = (x / 6.0).floor() as i32;\\n    let iz = (z / 6.0).floor() as i32;\\n    hash_f32(99, ix, 0, iz) > 0.35\\n}\\n\\n/// Fuel per 2 m cell. Roads, water and rock are breaks.\\n220→pub fn fuel(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    if on_road(x, z) || on_water(x, z) || on_rock(x, z) {\\n        0.0\\n    } else if tree_at(x, z) {\\n        3.0\\n    } else if bush_at(x, z) {\\n        1.5\\n    } else {\\n        1.0\\n    }\\n230→}\\n\\npub fn height(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    if x > 180.0 && x < 760.0 && z < -380.0 && z > -820.0 {\\n        ((x - 180.0) / 520.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0) * 42.0\\n    } else if on_water(x, z) {\\n        -1.2\\n    } else {\\n        0.0\\n    }\\n240→}\\n\\npub fn cell_of(x: f32, z: f32) -> (i32, i32) {\\n    (x.div_euclid(2.0) as i32, z.div_euclid(2.0) as i32)\\n}\\n\\npub fn cell_center(c: (i32, i32)) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    (c.0 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0, c.1 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0)\\n}\\n\\n250→pub fn safe_houses() -> [(f32, f32); 3] {\\n    [place(\\\"Pump House\\\"), place(\\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\"), place(\\\"Boat Shed\\\")]\\n}\\n\\npub fn nearest_safe(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    safe_houses().into_iter().min_by(|a, b| dist(x, z, a.0, a.1).total_cmp(&dist(x, z, b.0, b.1))).unwrap_or((170.0, 470.0))\\n}\\n\\n/// Detection multiplier from posture, grass, light and motion. Distance falloff is separate.\\n/// Crouched in tall grass at night, still: 0.6 * 0.35 * 0.45 * 0.5.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs\",\"offset\":210,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"pub fn tall_grass(x: f32, z: f32) -> bool {\\n    if on_road(x, z) || on_water(x, z) || in_town(x, z) {\\n        return false;\\n    }\\n    let ix = (x / 6.0).floor() as i32;\\n    let iz = (z / 6.0).floor() as i32;\\n    hash_f32(99, ix, 0, iz) > 0.35\\n}\\n\\n/// Fuel per 2 m cell. Roads, water and rock are breaks.\\npub fn fuel(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    if on_road(x, z) || on_water(x, z) || on_rock(x, z) {\\n        0.0\\n    } else if tree_at(x, z) {\\n        3.0\\n    } else if bush_at(x, z) {\\n        1.5\\n    } else {\\n        1.0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn height(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    if x > 180.0 && x < 760.0 && z < -380.0 && z > -820.0 {\\n        ((x - 180.0) / 520.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0) * 42.0\\n    } else if on_water(x, z) {\\n        -1.2\\n    } else {\\n        0.0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn cell_of(x: f32, z: f32) -> (i32, i32) {\\n    (x.div_euclid(2.0) as i32, z.div_euclid(2.0) as i32)\\n}\\n\\npub fn cell_center(c: (i32, i32)) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    (c.0 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0, c.1 as f32 * 2.0 + 1.0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn safe_houses() -> [(f32, f32); 3] {\\n    [place(\\\"Pump House\\\"), place(\\\"Ranger's Lodge\\\"), place(\\\"Boat Shed\\\")]\\n}\\n\\npub fn nearest_safe(x: f32, z: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    safe_houses().into_iter().min_by(|a, b| dist(x, z, a.0, a.1).total_cmp(&dist(x, z, b.0, b.1))).unwrap_or((170.0, 470.0))\\n}\\n\\n/// Detection multiplier from posture, grass, light and motion. Distance falloff is separate.\\n/// Crouched in tall grass at night, still: 0.6 * 0.35 * 0.45 * 0.5.\\n\",\"total_lines\":284}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1a3c64c3-1096-44ae-8469-b6a093ba6d2b-30","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,53,48,51,95,95,120,98,100,55,100,57,49,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,53,48,51,95,95,120,98,100,55,100,57,49,47,119,111,114,107,47,74,97,109,32,67,114,121,45,70,97,114,32,67,114,121,32,50,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,53,48,51,47,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,99,114,97,116,101,115,47,112,97,118,95,99,111,114,101,47,115,114,99,47,103,97,109,101,115,47,109,101,114,99,47,119,111,114,108,100,46,114,115,10,49,57,49,58,112,117,98,32,115,116,114,117,99,116,32,67,111,109,112,97,110,105,111,110,32,123,10,50,54,56,57,58,32,32,32,32,102,110,32,100,111,111,109,101,100,95,101,110,111,117,103,104,40,38,115,101,108,102,41,32,45,62,32,98,111,111,108,59,10,50,54,57,50,58,32,32,32,32,102,110,32,100,111,111,109,101,100,95,101,110,111,117,103,104,40,38,115,101,108,102,41,32,45,62,32,98,111,111,108,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":3,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":191,\"content\":\"pub struct Companion {\"},{\"line_number\":2689,\"content\":\"    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool;\"},{\"line_number\":2692,\"content\":\"    fn doomed_enough(&self) -> bool {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"b29aba96-0747-45dc-882f-e03a64fb96a1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_645","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Ombe flats at (-520, -520) are grass with fuel 1.\n\nThe farm spans +60 x and -20 to +40 z. All terrain is grass with no roads. The geom.rs comment at line 258 does not contain \"apr\". Proceeding to implement edits. The closest tank spawns at z-20 when the player sits.\n\nBot aim will turn to face the player. Chain logic correctly starts from the killed tank index. Ignite-6 barrels are excluded from chain explosions; only tank kills trigger chaining. The borrow checker is satisfied because chain_tanks runs after alive is set to false.\n\nChain radius is 16.0 to cover diagonal neighbors safely. Disk radius is 8.0 for cell coverage, safer than the old 6.0 if cells are pre-burned. The 49-tank test may be slow: roughly 17,700 hashmap lookups.\n\nThe 49-tank burn is negligible across six routes. Wind during tank rounds ignites instantly via disk, so cells_500 tracks burn count rather than spread. The Better companion now spawns 4 units behind the player.\n\nThe bot now follows the nearest alive companion within 2.2 units, or presses INTERACT if none are available. The Better spec is removed from the Rain | Better | Flag line. try_interact is being updated to handle Better mode.\n\ntry_interact for Better mode now marks the companion down within 3.2 units and teleports it to the player's position. The code is being restructured to avoid borrow checker conflicts between mutating companions and calling self.mark or self.fire.\n\nThe try_interact block now defers the ignite_disk call until after the companion borrow ends, preventing a borrow checker conflict. The \"better_way\" flag is set only when a companion is actually taken.\n\nThe bot will press USE to exit the seat if the player is not on foot during Better mode. This prevents move_body from returning early and blocking approach.\n\nPatch, Overdose, and Die now place the nearest alive companion down at the player's position. Die mode places the companion 40 units ahead; Patch and Overdose place it 1.5 units ahead. Overdose also resets the companion's down timer.\n\nBetter mode is now complete. The done check returns true only when the better_way flag is set.\n\nDrive mode sets wind to (9, 0). It spawns a boat 8 units ahead of the player and resets the seat.\n\nDrive mode also sets the boat's yaw, health to 100, stage to 0, and resets speed, fuse, and distance. Resetting distance to zero is safe because the technical_driven flag persists across drives. The first drive walk covers about 8 meters in roughly 1.5 seconds plus turn.\n\nThe drive to Ombe is roughly 1200 meters at 16 m/s, taking about 75 seconds plus the walk. The 140-second budget is sufficient.\n\nAfter sleep, yaw is PI at the pump house. The truck spawns 8 meters north, away from the river.\n\nThe player reaches the pump house before Drive begins. Sleep sets yaw to PI.\n\nThe tracker might walk the player away from the pump house to a cache. Sleep returns them to the nearest safe house if they are more than 8 meters away. The Drive start position depends on which safe house is closest after sleep.\n\nThe lodge is closer to Ombe than the pump house, so the drive from there is still long but viable. After reaching Ombe, the player sits in the driver's seat and spawns the tank farm at that position; shooting from the seat works correctly. The pistol is already armed before the tank round begins because the previous ignites selected it.\n\nArming the pistol before the tank round refills its magazine. The 12-shot magazine should survive the tracer sequence, and arm sets condition to 100 so jam probability stays zero.\n\nThe bot reloads if its gun is empty or jammed before aiming at the nearest tank. The nearest-tank search will be inlined to keep the diff small.\n\nThe origin tank is ignited by the same shot that kills it. The explosion_chain flag is set only when a neighbor dies, not when the shot tank itself dies; the farm's 7x7 layout guarantees at least one neighbor. cells_500 is not marked inside chain_tanks because simulate handles that burn count after shots_tick.\n\nThe tank round chain is triggered by shots_tick during the current tick, before advance_script runs. The fire button press occurs while the script is still in the Tanks state, so the step completes immediately after the shot. script_ignite does not call blow_tanks directly; chaining happens from shots_tick when a tank dies.\n\nThe tank round may take several ticks to fire. The bot aims in the first tick, misses due to aim error, and waits until later ticks before the shot finally lands. This delay ensures the Tanks step completes visibly before advance_script moves on to Mounted.\n\nThe existing playthrough already proves the Drive USE behavior. No new test is needed for the seat starting at zero.\n\nThe Drive test catches a stalled boarding attempt. If the bot fails to board, the technical_driven flag never sets and the drive step hangs. The flag only activates after the player drives more than twenty meters while seated. The bot walks to the truck eight meters away, presses USE within five meters, and boards before six meters.\n\nThe bot stops walking before USE because the distance check runs first. One frame is enough for just() to register the press and cycle the seat. After boarding, bot_drive stops pressing USE. The 8-meter spawn offset keeps the truck away from the player.\n\nThe truck spawn offset is safe because the pump house is central and the 8-meter offset keeps it inside the map. After repair, the player remains on foot through the remaining campaign stages, then enters Drive mode with seat 0 and a boat.\n\nDrive spawns a fresh technical 8 meters ahead of the player, overwriting the old boat's coordinates. The town stage does not enter the vehicle, so the player remains on foot.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-899c8dc7-d4f6-41c2-914b-673c697d7af9-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"burn|fire\\.cells|hp -=","glob":"**/merc/world.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-899c8dc7-d4f6-41c2-914b-673c697d7af9-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1860,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1010,"output_tokens":4511,"cache_read_input_tokens":86784,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"f0e44c9a-9a02-486d-99e0-78b37114d77a"}
