500\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\",\"new_string\":\"    /// A shot tank cooks its neighbours. The chain flag waits for a second tank to die from the blast.\\n    fn chain_tanks(&mut self, origin: usize) {\\n        let mut queue = vec![origin];\\n        let mut head = 0;\\n        let mut chained = false;\\n        while head < queue.len() {\\n            let i = queue[head];\\n            head += 1;\\n            let x = self.bodies[i].x;\\n            let z = self.bodies[i].z;\\n            let _ = self.fire.ignite_disk(x, z, 6.0, self.tune.burn_time, self.minutes);\\n            for j in 0..self.bodies.len() {\\n                if queue.contains(&j) {\\n                    continue;\\n                }\\n                let b = &self.bodies[j];\\n                if b.alive && b.kind == 5 && geom::dist(x, z, b.x, b.z) <= 16.0 {\\n                    self.bodies[j].hp = 0.0;\\n                    self.bodies[j].alive = false;\\n                    queue.push(j);\\n                    chained = true;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if chained {\\n            self.mark(\\\"explosion_chain\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    fn blow_tanks(&mut self) {\\n        if self.bodies.iter().any(|b| b.kind == 5 && b.aliv