{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_653","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Die took 45 seconds from t=512 to t=557.\n\nPatch and overdose hold times are confirmed at 3 seconds each. All three bugs are fixed and the playthrough passes. Next steps are running the full merc suite, rebuilding the WASM distribution, packing the output, relaunching both viewports to inspect PNGs, and rerunning the complete test suite including hub until all failures are resolved.\n\nI will refresh scratch evidence and re-judge the goal plan checklist. I will check PROGRESS.md for any fact changes. I will not rewrite the exit interview or inflate the 26/6 date. Chat replies must repeat source information and feedback. I am reading the verification plan, STAGE.md, TASK.md, and PROGRESS.md to confirm exact requirements before running tests.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The playthrough finished all three endings. Tanks, the first drive, and the better-way offer each took a real action. I’ll run the full merc suite, then rebuild and pack."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-16b8e3f4-9dc1-4226-a809-232c5100901d-51","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"tanks","content":"Earn explosion_chain and cells_500 by shooting the tanks","status":"completed"},{"id":"drive","content":"Spawn the technical nearby and board it with USE","status":"completed"},{"id":"better","content":"Set better_way only after the player takes the approach","status":"completed"},{"id":"verify","content":"Re-run playthrough, wasm pack, and verification checks","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-16b8e3f4-9dc1-4226-a809-232c5100901d-52","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^## ","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91%2Fwork/01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558/goal/plan.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-16b8e3f4-9dc1-4226-a809-232c5