{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_659","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A quiet monitor will be set up to print only when EXIT appears in wasm.log.\n\nA Python handin verification script will be prepared to run while the WASM build completes. It will check for the HTML path, dev subfolder, PROGRESS.md, title notes, exit-interview.json contents, TASK.md structure, and forbidden names in source files only.\n\nI will search scratch for a previous handin script. The checker will scan merc source and about text, not the wasm blob. I will also review the fiction test to replicate its scanning logic for handin.log.\n\nThe monitor will poll every 20 seconds and print only when an EXIT line appears. I will not launch two browsers during the build. I am also checking exit-interview.json to confirm it should not be rewritten.\n\nThe monitor will time out after 800 seconds. I will inspect exit-interview.json now to prepare the handin script for immediate execution once packing begins. PROGRESS.md will be updated only after the final run count is known.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9248538a-9a01-47fe-b69e-6112367038fa-66","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/tests/browser.py","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9248538a-9a01-47fe-b69e-6112367038fa-67","name":"monitor","input":{"command":"LOG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/wasm.log\"; for _ in $(seq 1 40); do if grep -q '^EXIT:' \"$LOG\" 2>/dev/null; then code=$(grep '^EXIT:' \"$LOG\" | tail -1); if [ \"$code\" = \"EXIT:0\" ]; then echo \"DONE: $code\"; else echo \"FAILED: $code\"; tail -40 \"$LOG\"; fi; exit 0; fi; sleep 20; done; echo \"FAILED: wasm timed out\"; exit 1","description":"Watch dist wasm build until it exits"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2121,"output_tokens":1019,"cache_read_input_tokens":128896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"e69dba24-7e8f-4313-aa5b-d24cef879a08"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9248538a-9a01-47fe-b69e-6112367038fa-66","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Drive the packed Jam Cry page. Prints FAIL lines and one CHECKS line.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport struct\\nimport sys\\nimport zlib\\nfrom collections import Counter\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n10→\\nDEV = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\\nWORK = DEV.parent\\nHTML = WORK / \\\"Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503.html\\\"\\nLOGS = DEV / \\\"test-logs\\\"\\nGPU = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n20→    \\\"--disable-background-timer-throttling\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-renderer-backgrounding\\\",\\n]\\nFAILS = []\\nCHECKS = 0\\n\\n\\ndef check(ok, detail):\\n    global CHECKS\\n    CHECKS += 1\\n30→    if not ok:\\n        FAILS.append(detail)\\n        print(f\\\"FAIL: {detail}\\\", flush=True)\\n\\n\\ndef finish():\\n    print(f\\\"CHECKS {CHECKS}\\\")\\n    return 1 if FAILS else 0\\n\\n\\n40→def png_samples(data, step=24):\",\"content_concise\":\"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Drive the packed Jam Cry page. Prints FAIL lines and one CHECKS line.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport struct\\nimport sys\\nimport zlib\\nfrom collections import Counter\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n10→\\nDEV = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\\nWORK = DEV.parent\\nHTML = WORK / \\\"Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503.html\\\"\\nLOGS = DEV / \\\"test-logs\\\"\\nGPU = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n20→    \\\"--disable-background-timer-throttling\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-renderer-backgrounding\\\",\\n]\\nFAILS = []\\nCHECKS = 0\\n\\n\\ndef check(ok, detail):\\n    global CHECKS\\n    CHECKS += 1\\n30→    if not ok:\\n        FAILS.append(detail)\\n        print(f\\\"FAIL: {detail}\\\", flush=True)\\n\\n\\ndef finish():\\n    print(f\\\"CHECKS {CHECKS}\\\")\\n    return 1 if FAILS else 0\\n\\n\\n40→def png_samples(data, step=24):\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/tests/browser.py\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Drive the packed Jam Cry page. Prints FAIL lines and one CHECKS line.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport struct\\nimport sys\\nimport zlib\\nfrom collections import Counter\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n\\nDEV = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\\nWORK = DEV.parent\\nHTML = WORK / \\\"Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503.html\\\"\\nLOGS = DEV / \\\"test-logs\\\"\\nGPU = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-background-timer-throttling\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-renderer-backgrounding\\\",\\n]\\nFAILS = []\\nCHECKS = 0\\n\\n\\ndef check(ok, detail):\\n    global CHECKS\\n    CHECKS += 1\\n    if not ok:\\n        FAILS.append(detail)\\n        print(f\\\"FAIL: {detail}\\\", flush=True)\\n\\n\\ndef finish():\\n    print(f\\\"CHECKS {CHECKS}\\\")\\n    return 1 if FAILS else 0\\n\\n\\ndef png_samples(data, step=24):\\n\",\"total_lines\":384}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9248538a-9a01-47fe-b69e-6112367038fa-67","content":"{\"type\":\"Monitor\",\"taskId\":\"8727fca6-741a-430e-8658-0c789adb10db\",\"timeoutMs\":36000000,\"persistent\":false}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid