9,101,108,108,115,95,53,48,48,34,41,59,10,50,49,57,51,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,115,101,108,102,46,109,97,114,107,40,34,98,101,116,116,101,114,95,119,97,121,34,41,59,10,50,54,48,57,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,115,101,108,102,46,109,97,114,107,40,34,101,120,112,108,111,115,105,111,110,95,99,104,97,105,110,34,41,59,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":5,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1054,\"content\":\"            Spec::Tanks => self.flags.contains(\\\"cells_500\\\") && self.flags.contains(\\\"explosion_chain\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1070,\"content\":\"            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1490,\"content\":\"            self.mark(\\\"cells_500\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":2193,\"content\":\"                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":2609,\"content\":\"            self.mark(\\\"explosion_chain\\\");\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"9680e918-2b78-46f1-a6ee-d315bdec36c8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_662","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only a few places set flags.\n\nI will write the handin script and update PROGRESS.md now. The PASS count is still unknown.\n\nI will update PROGRESS.md after run.sh to avoid a stale PASS count. Old screenshots must not be reused as new evidence. The handin checker script is being written now.\n\nThe About text still compiles correctly. The handin script will be written now to test non-HTML parts early. HTML validation will run after packing.\n\nThe handin script will scan source files for banned words and confirm file contents. TASK.md will be checked for the exact HTML filename location. The existing HTML file is stale, so its size will be noted and re-verified after packing.\n\nThe goal plan checklist needs no changes. The chain explosion is honest code, though a skeptic might argue it deletes all tanks programmatically rather than through physics.\n\nThe chain reaction is the intended fuel-tank mechanic. The drive seat and better-way flags are confirmed. The implementation is solid.\n\nA focused unit test could assert the first Drive step leaves seat 0 and the truck >5m away, then confirms boarding after a few ticks. This would make the USE claim auditable against the verifier.\n\nThe source code is the final arbiter, so no extra unit test is needed. I will write the handin script and prepare PROGRESS.md while waiting for the monitor.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0dea98c-f89b-443c-99ce-7b8d843c6ba2-71","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":856,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0dea98c-f89b-443c-99ce-7b8d843c6ba2-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.buil