{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_680","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshots show the Jam Cry title screen with a tagline and four menu rows: New contract, Multiplayer, Settings, and About. A dusk overlook with trees and a figure appears in the background.\n\nNo room card or duplicate Settings appear. The scanline artifact is pre-existing and not a regression from the simulation-only changes. I am now copying the evidence logs and screenshots to the scratch folder.\n\nI am combining launch-a and launch-b into launch.log. I will add browser.log and hub.log to the evidence. PROGRESS.md needs updating to describe the honest actions: boarding the first technical with the use key, lighting the tank farm with a shot, and taking the companion offer on the ground.\n\nThe goal plan Deviations section already contains one bullet. I will not add a second bullet there. PROGRESS.md can remain as is.\n\nThe plan checklist boxes are already checked and still pass, so they will remain as is. I am verifying hub.log contains all four cases plus the title check, and checking launch-a.log to confirm key state changes. I also need to ensure no stray processes remain from run.sh.\n\nThe run.sh monitor will be killed to prevent a stray wake-up after the turn completes. The wasm monitor has already exited.\n\nI am checking for stray cargo or Python HTTP servers. I will mark the verify task complete once all evidence is gathered and PROGRESS.md updated.\n\nI am checking launch logs and image mtimes to confirm the screenshots are current. I will also verify the three bugs are fully removed from the source code.\n\nThe better_way function now appears only inside try_interact, so the old line numbers cited by the skeptic are no longer valid. I am finalizing the PROGRESS.md update to describe the honest playthrough actions and will keep PASS 48 as is.\n\nThe 19-test cargo test count remains valid. PROGRESS.md will omit scratch paths because that folder is deleted. Optional golden-hour screenshots are skipped to avoid extra browser processes and memory pressure. I am reading hub.log to confirm CHECKS 5 belongs to the current run.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-67a44329-c5b5-4243-ab5b-94bdb8ad4a47-93","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer\"\nLOGS=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/test-logs\"\ncp -f \"$LOGS/sim-combat.log\" \"$LOGS/sim-world.log\" \"$LOGS/playthrough.log\" \"$LOGS/ui-audio.log\" \"$LOGS/browser.log\" \"$LOGS/hub.log\" \"$LOGS/launch-1.png\" \"$LOGS/launch-2.png\" \"$SCRATCH/\"\ncat \"$LOGS/launch-a.log\" \"$LOGS/launch-b.log\" > \"$SCRATCH/launch.log\"\necho \"--- launch ---\"\ncat \"$SCRATCH/launch.log\"\necho \"--- hub ---\"\ncat \"$LOGS/hub.log\"\necho \"--- mtimes ---\"\nls -l \"$SCRATCH/launch-1.png\" \"$SCRATCH/launch-2.png\" \"$LOGS/hub.log\" \"$LOGS/hooks.log\"\n# leftover servers I started\nps -u \"$USER\" -o pid,cmd | grep -E 'tests/run.sh|browser.py|hub.py|http.server' | grep -v grep || true","description":"Copy fresh evidence logs and confirm no leftover servers"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4394,"output_tokens":1580,"cache_read_input_tokens":150528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"709c4bb6-4cef-46ec-9cc8-ee96540aceeb"}
