4,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":7,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"    pub player_damage: f32,\"},{\"line_number\":73,\"content\":\"            player_damage: 1.0,\"},{\"line_number\":108,\"content\":\"            self.enemy_accuracy, self.enemy_damage, self.player_damage, self.detection, self.enemy_count, self.weapon_wear, self.jam_chance,\"},{\"line_number\":118,\"content\":\"            2 => &mut self.player_damage,\"},{\"line_number\":1707,\"content\":\"    fn handle_gun(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\"},{\"line_number\":1765,\"content\":\"        self.shots_tick(origin, dir, st.damage * self.tune.player_damage, st.range, st.noise, st.ignites, st.silent, self.gun().id, self.gun().shots);\"},{\"line_number\":2350,\"content\":\"    fn arm(&mut self, id: WeaponId) {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"4e32ef27-6ff9-470e-8675-f2eea8bddedc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_689","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation uses a 6-meter ignition radius and 2-meter cell size.\n\nThe 7×7 tank grid spans roughly 1,372 cells. Tank disks barely overlap at 10-meter spacing, so unique cells can exceed 500 if fuel is nonzero. Fuel may be zero on water or road, which would prevent ignition. The player's position after the first 12 ignite steps is also being checked.\n\nThe playthrough logs and fuel function must be checked to confirm the player's position and whether fuel is positive. The prior gap was that blow_tanks deletes every barrel without shooting. If the bot earned all 19 tests, the mechanism may be a cheat rather than genuine play.\n\nThe current code uses a direct shot to kill the first tank, which triggers an instant scripted chain of neighbor deaths within 16 meters. Those neighbors then ignite cells, satisfying the 500-cell and explosion-chain flags. This mechanism is not a cheat; it mirrors how a player would shoot one tank and let the chain spread.\n\nThe 16-meter chain reaction is valid because the BFS spans the entire farm. The old bug was scripted death without any shot; now a killing shot is required.\n\nA potential bug remains in shots_tick: the ray origin uses eye height (1.58) instead of world y, while tank bodies sit at 1.70, 1.15, and 0.45. This vertical offset could prevent the shot from connecting.\n\nThe nearest tank is at the player's exact feet, only 0 meters away. The ray from eye height through that tank's torso should hit. Kind 5 bodies are skipped in update_bodies and do not move. The pistol fires at 300 RPM, so the first shot should kill the tank.\n\nThe bot's aim error for the tank at its feet is roughly -1.13 radians, well outside the 0.2 radian firing threshold. It will not fire at that tank.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-582a1a0b-442d-4eac-a86b-aac75cafd3fc-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"look\\.|fn apply_look|pitch \\+=","glob":"**/merc/world.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-582a1a0b-442d-4eac-a86b-aac75cafd3fc-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/fire.rs","offset":66,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-582a1a0b-442d-4eac-a86b-aac75cafd3fc-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn fuel|CELL","glob":"**/merc/geom.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2975,"output_tokens":1431,"cache_read_input_tokens":74368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"6299cbdc-5d5f-4260-94ac-53778c868f34"}
