{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_690","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The look command is applied as yaw += look.\n\nThe bot can fire immediately. Pitch clamps to -1.15 after one frame. The error is only about 0.13. This satisfies the 0.2 firing threshold.\n\nThe ray origin sits 0.43 above the tank sphere. The downward pitch and yaw direction may miss the small target.\n\nWhen the nearest tank is directly below, yaw defaults to zero and the ray travels forward instead of downward. The bot then misses the tank underfoot and never fires. The grid includes the player's exact position.\n\nThe exact ray direction is (0, -0.905, -0.426). The vector to the tank is (0, -0.43, 0). The ray is aimed straight down but slightly forward. It likely misses the sphere.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ca8abdf-3457-4326-a4bb-000072ed606c-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn ray_sphere|fn ray_aabb","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ca8abdf-3457-4326-a4bb-000072ed606c-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/geom.rs","offset":200,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ca8abdf-3457-4326-a4bb-000072ed606c-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"passed|failed|better_way|tanks|explosion|technical|seat","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/merc-all3.log"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2258,"output_tokens":1251,"cache_read_input_tokens":77312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"8df14289-8062-4dd2-9301-752814def9ec"}
