{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_701","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The patch omits game files. They are likely untracked.\n\nI read the source directly. I will spot-check that explosion_chain requires a shot and drive starts unseated. The playthrough log shows behaviors complete. I will not build a Rust test if evidence is missing.\n\nThe playthrough log confirms drive takes 76 seconds, tanks completes, and better moves the player two meters. Coverage union passed with all nineteen tests including bot_plays_all_three_endings.\n\nThe key question is whether that two-meter movement proves an interaction or a stamp. If begin() stamped better_way, done() would be true in the same advance_script call before any movement in a later tick. The advance_script logic is being examined to see if it allows a stamp without actual movement.\n\nThe tick order is being checked to see if simulate runs before advance_script. If better_way were stamped in begin(), the step would advance twice in the same call, leaving the player at the same position. The log prints after tick, so a stamp would show no movement. This suggests the two-meter shift proves a real interaction.\n\nThe log shows both \"rain -> better\" and \"better -> patch\" as separate prints. They did not occur in the same tick. The player moved during the better step before it completed. This refutes the bug where done() fires immediately in begin(). The flag is not set there.\n\nThe tanks transition also appears as separate prints, so the goal remained active for at least one full tick. This suggests blow_tanks is not set in begin(), because an instant completion would have skipped the step entirely.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4fbd8364-a63c-423b-a906-7217fcfdb9f2-52","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ride\\.kind\\s*=","glob":"**/merc/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4fbd8364-a63c-423b-a906-7217fcfdb9f2-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":580,"limit":45}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5184,"output_tokens":1077,"cache_read_input_tokens":107392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"83a3b088-01a9-4f59-8504-b864fd5cbd32"}
