{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_704","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshots show the title menu filled with the scene.\n\nThe title screen is the static diorama, so the missing play-mode camera fix there is expected. All three gaps are resolved. Launch, hub, and all 19 tests pass with no regressions. The verdict will be Not Refuted, citing script_ignite tank fixes, shot path chain_tanks, bot aiming and firing, and the distinct tanks step in the playthrough log.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The three cheats are gone in the current sim, and the captured playthrough still finishes. I'll write the verdict."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d77c137f-7a02-46f8-a870-593a63d3799a-57","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-verdict-8215da6fd761-3-0.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"playthrough-honest.log: drive 76s (163,473)->(-513,-510), tanks and better are their own ticks; world.rs:856-872, 1178-1194, 1830-1831, 2147-2194, 2585-2610; merc-all3.log 19 passed; run-all.log PASS 48 FAIL 0.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"All three prior gaps are fixed. A pistol shot cooks the tank farm, the technical is boarded with use, and better_way is set only after the player walks to the companion and interacts. merc-all3.log is 19 passed; tests/run.sh all is PASS 48 FAIL 0; both file:// launches show the Jam Cry title.\"\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d77c137f-7a02-46f8-a870-593a63d3799a-58","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-3-skeptic-0.md","content":"# Verdict: Not Refuted\n\nThe three campaign cheats are gone in the current sim. `implementer/playthrough-honest.log` is a full seeded bot after `world.rs` (05:51), and `implementer/merc-all3.log` is the same binary: **19 passed, 0 failed**. The packed page (11,552,939 bytes, 05:56) is newer than that sim. `tests/run.sh all` is `PASS 48 FAIL 0`. Both file:// shots after the pack show the Jam Cry title, the tagline, and the four menu rows over a filled dusk overlook.\n\n## Tanks cook off from a shot\n\n`script_ignite` only handles the ledger timer and the bus (`world.rs:2147-2170`). `Spec::Tanks` arms a pistol and spawns the farm (`879-881`). The bot aims at the nearest drum and fires (`1178-1194`). A killing hit calls `chain_tanks` (`1830-1831`), which lights a disk and knocks down a neighbour inside 16 m; `explosion_chain` is set only when that second drum dies (`2585-2610`). `cells_500` is the burned-cell count (`1489-1490`), not a stamp. `begin` does not set either flag: `advance_script` would have skipped the step in the same call (`759-780`), but the log records a distinct `ignite11 -> tanks` tick before `tanks -> mounted` (`playthrough-honest.log:64-65`).\n\n## The technical is boarded\n\nThe first drive parks a kind-1 technical 8 m ahead with an empty seat (`856-872`). Nothing before that spec sets `ride.kind`. The bot walks in when it is farther than 5 m and presses the same use key the boat step uses (`1146-1155`, `1318-1326`). Use is edge-triggered (`input.rs:103-105`), and the next frame is already seated so it drives instead of cycling the seat. Human seed 1 spends 76 s going from (163, 473) to (−513, −510), the Ombe target (`playthrough-honest.log:50-51`).\n\n## Better-way is taken, not stamped\n\n`Spec::Better` only moves a standing companion 4 m ahead (`962-969`). Patch, overdose, and die do not mark `better_way`. The only write is `try_interact`, after the player is within 3.2 m (`2177-2194`). The bot walks there and presses interact (`1236-1247`). The log keeps `better` for its own tick and moves the body from (−220, −34) to (−220, −36) before patch (`playthrough-honest.log:77-78`). A begin-time stamp would have fallen through in the same `advance_script` call and never printed that step.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1990,"output_tokens":1414,"cache_read_input_tokens":115456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"fdc78e1b-89f1-42f9-b0a9-4598a3e23002"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d77c137f-7a02-46f8-a870-593a63d3799a-57","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": false,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"playthrough-honest.log: drive 76s (163,473)->(-513,-510), tanks and better are their own ticks; world.rs:856-872, 1178-1194, 1830-1831, 2147-2194, 2585-2610; merc-all3.log 19 passed; run-all.log PASS 48 FAIL 0.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"All three prior gaps are fixed. A pistol shot cooks the tank farm, the technical is boarded with use, and better_way is set only after the player walks to the companion and interacts. merc-all3.log is 19 passed; tests/run.sh all is PASS 48 FAIL 0; both file:// launches show the Jam Cry title.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-verdict-8215da6fd761-3-0.json has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-verdict-8215da6fd761-3-0.json has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-verdict-8215da6fd761-3-0.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": false,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"playthrough-honest.log: drive 76s (163,473)->(-513,-510), tanks and better are their own ticks; world.rs:856-872, 1178-1194, 1830-1831, 2147-2194, 2585-2610; merc-all3.log 19 passed; run-all.log PASS 48 FAIL 0.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"All three prior gaps are fixed. A pistol shot cooks the tank farm, the technical is boarded with use, and better_way is set only after the player walks to the companion and interacts. merc-all3.log is 19 passed; tests/run.sh all is PASS 48 FAIL 0; both file:// launches show the Jam Cry title.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d77c137f-7a02-46f8-a870-593a63d3799a-58","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"# Verdict: Not Refuted\\n\\nThe three campaign cheats are gone in the current sim. `implementer/playthrough-honest.log` is a full seeded bot after `world.rs` (05:51), and `implementer/merc-all3.log` is the same binary: **19 passed, 0 failed**. The packed page (11,552,939 bytes, 05:56) is newer than that sim. `tests/run.sh all` is `PASS 48 FAIL 0`. Both file:// shots after the pack show the Jam Cry title, the tagline, and the four menu rows over a filled dusk overlook.\\n\\n## Tanks cook off from a shot\\n\\n`script_ignite` only handles the ledger timer and the bus (`world.rs:2147-2170`). `Spec::Tanks` arms a pistol and spawns the farm (`879-881`). The bot aims at the nearest drum and fires (`1178-1194`). A killing hit calls `chain_tanks` (`1830-1831`), which lights a disk and knocks down a neighbour inside 16 m; `explosion_chain` is set only when that second drum dies (`2585-2610`). `cells_500` is the burned-cell count (`1489-1490`), not a stamp. `begin` does not set either flag: `advance_script` would have skipped the step in the same call (`759-780`), but the log records a distinct `ignite11 -> tanks` tick before `tanks -> mounted` (`playthrough-honest.log:64-65`).\\n\\n## The technical is boarded\\n\\nThe first drive parks a kind-1 technical 8 m ahead with an empty seat (`856-872`). Nothing before that spec sets `ride.kind`. The bot walks in when it is farther than 5 m and presses the same use key the boat step uses (`1146-1155`, `1318-1326`). Use is edge-triggered (`input.rs:103-105`), and the next frame is already seated so it drives instead of cycling the seat. Human seed 1 spends 76 s going from (163, 473) to (−513, −510), the Ombe target (`playthrough-honest.log:50-51`).\\n\\n## Better-way is taken, not stamped\\n\\n`Spec::Better` only moves a standing companion 4 m ahead (`962-969`). Patch, overdose, and die do not mark `better_way`. The only write is `try_interact`, after the player is within 3.2 m (`2177-2194`). The bot walks there and presses interact (`1236-1247`). The log keeps `better` for its own tick and moves the body from (−220, −34) to (−220, −36) before patch (`playthrough-honest.log:77-78`). A begin-time stamp would have fallen through in the same `advance_script` call and never printed that step.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-3-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-3-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-3-skeptic-0.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Verdict: Not Refuted\\n\\nThe three campaign cheats are gone in the current sim. `implementer/playthrough-honest.log` is a full seeded bot after `world.rs` (05:51), and `implementer/merc-all3.log` is the same binary: **19 passed, 0 failed**. The packed page (11,552,939 bytes, 05:56) is newer than that sim. `tests/run.sh all` is `PASS 48 FAIL 0`. Both file:// shots after the pack show the Jam Cry title, the tagline, and the four menu rows over a filled dusk overlook.\\n\\n## Tanks cook off from a shot\\n\\n`script_ignite` only handles the ledger timer and the bus (`world.rs:2147-2170`). `Spec::Tanks` arms a pistol and spawns the farm (`879-881`). The bot aims at the nearest drum and fires (`1178-1194`). A killing hit calls `chain_tanks` (`1830-1831`), which lights a disk and knocks down a neighbour inside 16 m; `explosion_chain` is set only when that second drum dies (`2585-2610`). `cells_500` is the burned-cell count (`1489-1490`), not a stamp. `begin` does not set either flag: `advance_script` would have skipped the step in the same call (`759-780`), but the log records a distinct `ignite11 -> tanks` tick before `tanks -> mounted` (`playthrough-honest.log:64-65`).\\n\\n## The technical is boarded\\n\\nThe first drive parks a kind-1 technical 8 m ahead with an empty seat (`856-872`). Nothing before that spec sets `ride.kind`. The bot walks in when it is farther than 5 m and presses the same use key the boat step uses (`1146-1155`, `1318-1326`). Use is edge-triggered (`input.rs:103-105`), and the next frame is already seated so it drives instead of cycling the seat. Human seed 1 spends 76 s going from (163, 473) to (−513, −510), the Ombe target (`playthrough-honest.log:50-51`).\\n\\n## Better-way is taken, not stamped\\n\\n`Spec::Better` only moves a standing companion 4 m ahead (`962-969`). Patch, overdose, and die do not mark `better_way`. The only write is `try_interact`, after the player is within 3.2 m (`2177-2194`). The bot walks there and presses interact (`1236-1247`). The log keeps `better` for its own tick and moves the body from (−220, −34) to (−220, −36) before patch (`playthrough-honest.log:77-78`). A begin-time stamp would have fallen through in the same `advance_script` call and never printed that step.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"462afd6f-c8ea-4f87-b747-80f1c013a126"}
