{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_712","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe prior gap required the bot to shoot tanks manually. The new code still calls blow_tanks on Spec::Tanks, instantly deleting barrels and igniting disks. This likely remains a cheat rather than honest player behavior.\n\nThe tank farm spawns 49 barrels in a 7x7Checking whether the grid. The bot aims  tank chain producesat the nearest target and fires. chain_tanks 500 burned cells. ignites a disk and recursively kills all tanks within 16 meters when a kind 5 body dies. This matches the intended Far Cry 2 explosion chain mechanic rather than an instant cheat.\n\nAnalyzing the chain reaction mechanics. A 10m grid spacing and 6m ignition radius mean each dead tank ignites a disk. The chain kills neighbors within 16m, which covers adjacent and diagonal\n\nEstimating cell burn cells but not distant counts from the 7x7 ones. The algorithm tank grid. Each radius-6 starts from the origin disk covers roughly tank already dead from the shot. 28 cells, and with 49 overlapping disks across the farm area, the total likely reaches 500 burned cells. This suggests cells_500 reflects genuine fire spread rather than a manual stamp.\n\nThe 7x7 grid is fully connected, so all 49 tanks should die. Each tank ignites a disk of radius 6. At 2m cell size, that covers roughly 28 cells per tank. The total burned area spans about 60 by 60 meters.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8784a47e-a436-4ac1-aa01-f1f6d527a586-8","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":280,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8784a47e-a436-4ac1-aa01-f1f6d527a586-9","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1400,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8784a47e-a436-4ac1-aa01-f1f6d527a586-10","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"technical_driven|fn board|buttons::USE|cells_500|explosion_chain|better_way|fn bot_boat|seat = 1","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8784a47e-a436-4ac1-aa01-f1f6d527a586-11","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tanks|better_way|technical_driven|explosion_chain|cells_500|seat","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine","glob":"**/*test*"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12298,"output_tokens":1446,"cache_read_input_tokens":27136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"0cb3ba2c-8e13-445a-8f7c-a9552520ccaf"}
