\"line_number\":1070,\"content\":\"            Spec::Better => self.flags.contains(\\\"better_way\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":1140,\"content\":\"                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1152,\"content\":\"                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1164,\"content\":\"                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1204,\"content\":\"                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1238,\"content\":\"                    f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1318,\"content\":\"    fn bot_boat(&self) -> InputFrame {\"},{\"line_number\":1325,\"content\":\"            f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1335,\"content\":\"            f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1366,\"content\":\"                f.pressed = buttons::USE;\"},{\"line_number\":1490,\"content\":\"            self.mark(\\\"cells_500\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":1559,\"content\":\"        if input.just(buttons::USE) && self.ride.kind != 0 {\"},{\"line_number\":1612,\"content\":\"            self.mark(\\\"technical_driven\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":2193,\"content\":\"                self.mark(\\\"better_way\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":2609,\"content\":\"            self.mark(\\\"explosion_chain\\\");\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8784a47e-a436-4ac1-aa01-f1f6d527a586-11","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,53,48,51,95,95,120,98,100,55,100,57,49,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"9988e524-e2b2-47c6-b53f-9de16970db05"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_713","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe union of all ignition disks covers roughly 5,184 square meters. At 2m cell size that equals about 1,296 cells. At 4m cell size it equals about 324 cells. Neither matches the claimed 500 burned cells. The implementer's `burned >= 500` check would hang if the actual count never reaches that threshold.I need to read use_vehicle around line 1559, technical_driven at line 1612, bot_boat, and the tests.\n\nThe captured log shows the test passed. I need to verify its authenticity and recent timestamp, then check the ignite_disk math.\n\nA potential bug exists in chain_tanks: it marks explosion_chain when a second tank dies from blast damage. This matches the prior requirement that a pistol shot kills one tank and sets off neighbors.\n\nI also need to confirm whether pistol damage is sufficient to kill a 20 HP tank. The zone layout is now clear: head at y=1.70 with radius 0.18 for 3x damage, chest at y=1.15 with radius 0.28 for 1x damage, and legs at y=0.45 with radius 0.20 for 0.6x damage.\n\nThe player spawns exactly on the tank at (self.x, self.z). The nearest tank is at that same coordinate. A downward ray from eye height toward the chest zone should intersect the sphere. This means the bot can aim directly at the target.\n\nChecking if chain_tanks and ignite_disk with radius 6 from 49 tanks produces 500 cells through the fire simulation or via another stamping method. Also investigating whether shooting works correctly: tanks spawn at player position in a grid, so the nearest tank may be directly at the player's feet,\n\nThe chest sphere radius which could cause weird ray behavior. The spawn logic uses x = self.x + i * 10.0. is 0.28, but the eye sits 0.45 meters below the chest center. This means the player may be inside the target sphere when aiming, causing ray_sphere to miss or return a negative hit distance. The bot only rotates and fires; it does not move while aiming.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c5abfe9b-ea1f-422f-b99c-1da0df836b59-12","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn ray_sphere|fn ignite_disk|fn ignite_at|burned|CELL|cell_size|const CELL","glob":"**/merc/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c5abfe9b-ea1f-422f-b99c-1da0df836b59-13","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Pistol|fn stats|damage:","glob":"**/merc/gun.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c5abfe9b-ea1f-422f-b99c-1da0df836b59-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs","offset":800,"limit":180}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6360,"output_tokens":1235,"cache_read_input_tokens":41088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"dff943dd-40c0-4b23-b925-c2adecb284d0"}
