{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_722","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe script runs Ignite before Tanks, so the player's position at that moment determines whether a wall blocks the shot. If the test passed, the log is fresh and the wall-block bug is likely not the cause. I will verify the packed HTML matches the rebuilt world logic.An interesting observation was noted in playthrough-honest.log.\n\nI will compare the world.rs timestamp against the packed HTML or WASM artifact. The native bot test passes, but a stale packed page would mean the shipped game lacks the fix. I will check the pack log to confirm it ran after the world.rs change.\n\nThe tanks step completes in the same second it starts. The prior bug was that script_ignite instantly completed this step.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2549db80-1e4a-4e90-9027-0133c1993bb4-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/input.rs","offset":85,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2549db80-1e4a-4e90-9027-0133c1993bb4-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/playthrough.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2549db80-1e4a-4e90-9027-0133c1993bb4-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/run-all.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2549db80-1e4a-4e90-9027-0133c1993bb4-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/PLAN.md","offset":490,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2549db80-1e4a-4e90-9027-0133c1993bb4-30","name