{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2549db80-1e4a-4e90-9027-0133c1993bb4-26","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"85→    /// A menu action this tick (Shardfall: equip, sell, travel...), queued one per tick.\\n    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \\\"Option::is_none\\\")]\\n    pub cmd: Option<crate::arpg::GameCmd>,\\n    /// Radians of look since the previous tick (x = yaw, y = pitch). Summed and cleared like `pressed`.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n90→    pub look: Vec2,\\n    /// Analog vehicle axes: x steer, y throttle (positive) / brake (negative).\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub axes: Vec2,\\n    /// Encoded menu or world action for replays and the bot (Jam Cry). 0 means none.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub act: u32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl InputFrame {\\n100→    pub fn down(&self, b: u32) -> bool {\\n        self.held & b != 0\\n    }\\n    pub fn just(&self, b: u32) -> bool {\\n        self.pressed & b != 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"85→    /// A menu action this tick (Shardfall: equip, sell, travel...), queued one per tick.\\n    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \\\"Option::is_none\\\")]\\n    pub cmd: Option<crate::arpg::GameCmd>,\\n    /// Radians of look since the previous tick (x = yaw, y = pitch). Summed and cleared like `pressed`.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n90→    pub look: Vec2,\\n    /// Analog vehicle axes: x steer, y throttle (positive) / brake (negative).\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub axes: Vec2,\\n    /// Encoded menu or world action for replays and the bot (Jam Cry). 0 means none.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub act: u32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl InputFrame {\\n100→    pub fn down(&self, b: u32) -> bool {\\n        self.held & b != 0\\n    }\\n    pub fn just(&self, b: u32) -> bool {\\n        self.pressed & b != 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/input.rs\",\"offset\":85,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    /// A menu action this tick (Shardfall: equip, sell, travel...), queued one per tick.\\n    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \\\"Option::is_none\\\")]\\n    pub cmd: Option<crate::arpg::GameCmd>,\\n    /// Radians of look since the previous tick (x = yaw, y = pitch). Summed and cleared like `pressed`.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub look: Vec2,\\n    /// Analog vehicle axes: x steer, y throttle (positive) / brake (negative).\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub axes: Vec2,\\n    /// Encoded menu or world action for replays and the bot (Jam Cry). 0 means none.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub act: u32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl InputFrame {\\n    pub fn down(&self, b: u32) -> bool {\\n        self.held & b != 0\\n    }\\n    pub fn just(&self, b: u32) -> bool {\\n        self.pressed & b != 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":106}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2549db80-1e4a-4e90-9027-0133c1993bb4-27","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→warning: variable `goal` is assigned to, but never used\\n   --> crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs:876:9\\n    |\\n876 |     let mut goal = String::new();\\n    |         ^^^^^^^^\\n    |\\n    = note: consider using `_goal` instead\\n    = note: `#[warn(unused_variables)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\\n\\n10→warning: value assigned to `goal` is never read\\n   --> crates/pav_core/tests/merc.rs:888:13\\n    |\\n888 |             goal = now;\\n    |             ^^^^\\n    |\\n    = help: maybe it is overwritten before being read?\\n    = note: `#[warn(unused_assignments)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\\n\\nwarning: `pav_core` (test \\\"merc\\\") generated 2 warnings\\n20→    Finished `test` profile [optimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.07s\\n     Running tests/merc.rs (target/debug/deps/merc-b2f028caa874fecd)\\n\\nrunning 1 test\\ntest bot_plays_