{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_723","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe same-tick completion likely stems from `advance_script`'s loop. It begins the next spec and immediately checks if it is done. If the step finishes during that same tick, it skips ahead before the bot input can be processed.The passed playthrough.log finished in 1.\n\nThe same-tick completion might instead be caused by tick ordering. Simulation and script execution run before `advance_script`, so the previous tick's input was for `ignite11` rather than a tank shot.\n\nThe 1.55-second test duration is suspicious because it lacks the expected eprintln route transitions. Sim time\n\nThe first tick of  and wall clock time differ, so this durationthe tanks step still carries `ignite11`'s could still be plausible for an optimized test. input. The script begins `tanks` and finds it incomplete, so it breaks. The next tick processes the actual `tanks` input. If the step finishes within the same printed second, it is likely a few frames of aiming plus one shot plus chain reaction. The exact frame rate is needed to confirm this.\n\nCargo test suppresses stderr on success by default. The missing eprintln output is expected. Earlier logs used --nocapture and showed the route transitions.\n\nIf the world clock DT is 0.5, one second equals two ticks. The","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4f806bfd-4820-4432-8d2e-b2bd61c93767-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"better ->|ignite11 -> tanks|sleep -> drive|rain ->","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4f806bfd-4820-4432-8d2e-b2bd61c93767-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"better ->|tanks ->","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/test-logs"}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7766,"output_tokens":462,"cache_read_input_tokens":57984,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"d5bb198c-e153-4c94-97b0-87d98c5e8768"}
