{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_730","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nI found a potential hole in the tank chain logic. The 6-meter ignite radius around each tank may not burn enough cells to reach the 500-cell threshold if fuel is blocked or the tanks are spaced too far apart. If cells_500 has not already been set, the bot would get stuck and the test would fail.\n\nThe Drive, Better, and Tanks logic checks out. The bot presses USE only on the first frame within range, so just() detects it correctly. The distance thresholds for boarding and interacting are consistent.The test-logs playthrough finished in 0.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd40187e-9976-4230-b310-a767ea8c59b1-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":603,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd40187e-9976-4230-b310-a767ea8c59b1-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"try_interact|fn just|hold_t","glob":"**/merc/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd40187e-9976-4230-b310-a767ea8c59b1-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91%2Fwork/01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558/goal/plan.md","offset":1,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3963,"output_tokens":4041,"cache_read_input_tokens":68736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"a3e9a209-9863-4849-a29d-d2294adf83fc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fd40187e-9976-4230-b310-a767ea8c59b1-29","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"603→    pub fn tick(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32) {\\n        let dt = dt.clamp(0.0, 0.5);\\n        self.apply_console(input);\\n        if self.screen != Screen::Playing {\\n            self.shell_tick(input, dt);\\n        } else if input.act == 10 && !self.hub {\\n            self.screen = Screen::Pause;\\n610→            self.focus = 0;\\n            self.idle = 0.0;\\n        } else {\\n            self.simulate(input, dt);\\n        }\\n        if self.route != Route::Sandbox {\\n            self.advance_script(dt);\\n        }\\n        if self.wind.length() > 6.0 && self.screen == Screen::Playing {\\n            self.mark(\\\"wind_rag\\\");\\n620→        }\\n        self.minutes += dt;\\n        self.maybe_reman();\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Numbered actions from the page. These run on every screen, including play,\\n    /// because the shell does not tick while a contract is running.\\n    fn apply_console(&mut self, input: &InputFrame) {\\n        match input.act {\\n            11 => self.dev.god = !self.dev.god,\\n630→            12 => {\\n                let (lo, hi, step) = self.tune.range(8);\\n                self.tune.set(8, (self.tune.get(8) + step).clamp(lo, hi));\\n            }\\n            13 => self.tune = self.tune0.clone(),\\n            14 => self.xbox = !self.xbox,\\n            15 => self.write_save(),\\n            16 => self.continue_save(),\\n            18 => {\\n                self.screen = Screen::Settings;\\n640→                self.tab = 0;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.idle = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn continue_save(&mut self) {\\n        if !self.has_save {\\n650→            return;\\n        }\\n        let Ok(w) = Self::load_json(&self.save_blob) 