{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_734","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe later test reused the same binary and passed in 1.55s without recompiling. Wasm rebuilt at 05:55 and HTML packed at 05:56. All three gaps are fixed in source and exercised by the recompiled bot. Logs show improved rain-to-patch movement and a working tank step.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The three campaign cheats are gone in the recompiled sim, and the bot log shows the shot, the boarding, and the companion approach. I'll record that verdict."},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A variable `self.x` is set to -760.0.","signature":"lk4+fE9m7rhirZW8bR+UN+FMexAOC5pqKRqTGHEIMvnaG8a7xirIEdwBjBm8L9Xqw0J4/7k63YxuTwVp4GDLXPnqNelPPzbbin/Uazm2gfhMDNd7geO48ucMbgRIJBJgUi8VPQQ8uvwPVMI98od6tFOO4mceDyYZ4Xw33/MijY2ZTif6"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b0b17593-7742-4b19-a740-999fa3e34792-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":2430,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b0b17593-7742-4b19-a740-999fa3e34792-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/world.rs","offset":1980,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1776,"output_tokens":234,"cache_read_input_tokens":81536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"f3ea1665-30c9-431f-aec9-47a2240fc9c2"}
