{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_735","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The ending drive destination is located at (-760, 620).\n\nThe bot drives to the ending instead of teleporting. present_ending is a dev shortcut. I should verify the packed HTML contains the new chain_tanks logic if the game is WASM.\n\nThe hand-in is the HTML page. The campaign bot is tested natively. A stale WASM build would ship old behavior to players.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-78d9d4ec-3888-43f6-8f34-634e527abd43-45","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-verdict-8215da6fd761-3-1.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"world.rs:856 seat 0 + USE board, :1830/:2585 shot then chain_tanks, :962/:2193 better_way only on interact; playthrough-honest.log recompiled pav_core and reached burn/read/chair with rain->better->patch and tanks after ignite11; run-all.log PASS 48 FAIL 0; wasm 05:55 after world.rs 05:51\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"Not refuted. All three prior gaps are fixed in the shipped sim and exercised by a recompiled bot run.\\\\n\\\\n- **Tanks.** `script_ignite` no longer calls `blow_tanks`. `Spec::Tanks` only arms a pistol and spawns the farm (`world.rs:879`). A kind-5 kill during that step calls `chain_tanks` (`world.rs:1830`), which marks `explosion_chain` only after a second tank dies (`world.rs:2608`). `cells_500` is the real `fire.burned >= 500` counter (`world.rs:1489`), not a stamp. The bot aims and fires (`world.rs:1178`).\\\\n- **Drive.** The first technical is parked 8 m ahead with `seat = 0` (`world.rs:856`). The bot walks in and presses USE, the same input as the boat (`world.rs:1146`, `use_vehicle` at `world.rs:1559`). `technical_driven` still requires 20 m of travel (`world.rs:1611`).\\\\n- **Better way.** `Spec::Better` only moves the companion (`world.rs:962`). Patch, overdose, and die do not mark the flag. `better_way` is set in `try_interact` after the player is within 3.2 m and interacts (`world.rs:2177`).\\\\n\\\\n`playthrough-honest.log` compiled `pav_core` (52 s) after `world.rs` (05:51) and the binary `merc-b2f028caa874fecd` (05:52) passed `bot_plays_all_three_endings`. Every seed shows `ignite11 -> tanks -> mounted`, a depot drive of about 70 s, and `rain -> better` with the player moving about 2 m before patch, overdose, or die. Later `playthrough.log` and `tests/run.sh` reused that binary: `test result: ok` and `PASS 48 FAIL 0`. `shardfall.wasm` (05:55) and the packed HTML (05:56) are newer than the sim change.\"\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-78d9d4ec-3888-43f6-8f34-634e527abd43-46","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-3-skeptic-1.md","content":"# Skeptic verdict: Not Refuted\n\nAll three prior gaps are fixed in the shipped sim and exercised by a recompiled bot run.\n\n## Tanks\n\n`script_ignite` no longer calls `blow_tanks`. `Spec::Tanks` only arms a pistol and spawns the farm (`world.rs:879`). A kind-5 kill during that step calls `chain_tanks` (`world.rs:1830`), which marks `explosion_chain` only after a second tank dies (`world.rs:2608`). `cells_500` is the real `fire.burned >= 500` counter (`world.rs:1489`), not a stamp. The bot aims and fires (`world.rs:1178`).\n\n## Drive\n\nThe first technical is parked 8 m ahead with `seat = 0` (`world.rs:856`). The bot walks in and presses USE, the same input as the boat (`world.rs:1146`, `use_vehicle` at `world.rs:1559`). `technical_driven` still requires 20 m of travel (`world.rs:1611`).\n\n## Better way\n\n`Spec::Better` only moves the companion (`world.rs:962`). Patch, overdose, and die do not mark the flag. `better_way` is set in `try_interact` after the player is within 3.2 m and interacts (`world.rs:2177`).\n\n## Evidence\n\n`playthrough-honest.log` compiled `pav_core` (52 s) after `world.rs` (05:51) and the binary `merc-b2f028caa874fecd` (05:52) passed `bot_plays_all_three_endings`. Every seed shows `ignite11 -> tanks -> mounted`, a depot drive of about 70 s, and `rain -> better` with the player moving about 2 m before patch, overdose, or die. Later `playthrough.log` and `tests/run.sh` reused that binary: `test result: ok` and `PASS 48 FAIL 0`. `shardfall.wasm` (05:55) and the packed HTML (05:56) are newer than the sim change.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1189,"output_tokens":1514,"cache_read_input_tokens":79744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"23ae2106-bccd-469b-b8cd-57f95dc7b02d"}
