{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_741","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"world.rs was modified at 05:51:33.\n\nplaythrough-honest.log at 05:52:48 confirms the three fixes succeeded. The full route completed with tanks, drive, and better. run-all.log at 05:58:44 passed all 48 tests. playthrough.log at 05:59:16 also passed after the wasm and html updates.\n\nplaythrough-honest.log confirms all three endings were reached for seeds 1 and 2. playthrough.log only shows the test passed without listing the endings. It may have been re-run with --quiet, which would suppress stderr.\n\nThe honest log is additional evidence beyond Criterion 4's playthrough.log. I will not dispute the log format.\n\nI should quickly check the launch screenshots to confirm they are not blank, since criterion 6 gates on this. I will avoid re-litigating prior rounds that already passed this check.\n\nI will read browser.log and hub.log fully to verify checks 11, 2, and 4. I am also checking whether the better step completes in the same second and only moves two meters.\n\nThe companion placement and movement logic is correct. The bot walks until within 2.2 meters, then interacts. try_interact on Better sets the companion down, marks better_way, and ignites. Patch will also place a companion nearby, so the route remains viable even if the Better interaction fails. Drive begins with seat set to 0 and the companion parked 8 meters ahead.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1afff0bd-fdac-4268-a54d-6e1fca08c7d9-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/launch-1.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1afff0bd-fdac-4268-a54d-6e1fca08c7d9-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/implementer/launch-2.p