{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_742","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshots show a filled scene with the title.\n\nThe three prior gaps are fixed. script_ignite no longer destroys tanks. Shot path chains tank destruction. Explosion triggers only when a second tank dies. Cells_500 counts fire.burned. Bot aims and fires. Playthrough logs show tank steps complete.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The three campaign cheats are gone in the current sim, and the post-fix playthrough still reaches every ending. I'll record that as not refuted."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-45fd29c2-35ea-43f2-a958-72f27221487d-46","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-verdict-8215da6fd761-3-2.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"world.rs: script_ignite no longer blows tanks (chain_tanks on a pistol kill, cells_500 from fire.burned); Drive parks seat 0 at 8 m and the bot presses USE; better_way is marked only in try_interact. playthrough-honest.log (after world.rs) reaches ending0/1/2 on seeds 1 and 2; run-all.log PASS 48 FAIL 0.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"## Prior gaps\\n\\nAll three are fixed in the current sim and in a playthrough captured after `world.rs` was saved.\\n\\n- **Tanks.** `script_ignite` only handles the ending timer and the bus. A pistol kill while `Spec::Tanks` is current calls `chain_tanks`, which ignites disks and sets `explosion_chain` only after a second tank dies. `cells_500` is set only when `fire.burned >= 500`. The bot aims and holds fire. `blow_tanks` is absent from the wasm built after that edit.\\n- **Drive.** `Spec::Drive` parks a technical 8 m ahead with `seat = 0`. The bot walks in and presses USE, the same input as the boat. Human seed 1 spends ~75 s going from (163,473) to (-513,-510), which matches driving that leg rather than spawning already seated.\\n- **Better way.** `begin` for Better, Patch, Overdose, and Die does not mark `better_way`. The flag is set in `try_interact` only after the player is beside the companion. The log moves from (-220,-34) to (-220,-36) on that step before patch, overdose, or die.\\n\\n`playthrough-honest.log` shows all three endings on seeds 1 and 2 with `test bot_plays_all_three_endings ... ok`. `run-all.log` is `PASS 48 FAIL 0` after the pack. Launch shots show the Jam Cry title over a filled overlook.\\n\"\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-45fd29c2-35ea-43f2-a958-72f27221487d-47","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/tmp/grok-goal-8215da6fd761/goal-classifier-8215da6fd761-3-skeptic-2.md","content":"## Prior gaps\n\nAll three are fixed in the current sim and in a playthrough captured after `world.rs` was saved.\n\n- **Tanks.** `script_ignite` only handles the ending timer and the bus. A pistol kill while `Spec::Tanks` is current calls `chain_tanks`, which ignites disks and sets `explosion_chain` only after a second tank dies. `cells_500` is set only when `fire.burned >= 500`. The bot aims and holds fire. `blow_tanks` is absent from the wasm built after that edit.\n- **Drive.** `Spec::Drive` parks a technical 8 m ahead with `seat = 0`. The bot walks in and presses USE, the same input as the boat. Human seed 1 spends ~75 s going from (163,473) to (-513,-510), which matches driving that leg rather than spawning already seated.\n- **Better way.** `begin` for Better, Patch, Overdose, and Die does not mark `better_way`. The flag is set in `try_interact` only after the player is beside the companion. The log moves from (-220,-34) to (-220,-36) on that step before patch, overdose, or die.\n\n`playthrough-honest.log` shows all three endings on seeds 1 and 2 with `test bot_plays_all_three_endings ... ok`. `run-all.log` is `PASS 48 FAIL 0` after the pack. Launch shots show the Jam Cry title over a filled overlook.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3294,"output_tokens":1358,"cache_read_input_tokens":89600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"1034d692-f996-4f28-9b1a-5a33204f2375"}
