mber\":236,\"content\":\"    if ((k === 'Enter' || k === ' ') && !e.repeat) pending.pressed |= 16777216;\"},{\"line_number\":366,\"content\":\"      how.textContent = 'Stick or WASD to move. R2 or LMB fires. L2 or RMB aims. Square or R clears a jam. Enter says ready. M asks for more time.';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013503__xbd7d91/work/Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/hub/harness.html\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":443,\"content\":\"    // A game that shows its own card takes the players' answers on it: Enter is Ready.\"},{\"line_number\":447,\"content\":\"      for (const cell of players) poke(cell, 'Enter');\"},{\"line_number\":449,\"content\":\"      check('its own card: Enter answers Ready', sent && answered, players.filter((c) => !state.answers.ready.has(c.key)).map((c) => `${c.key}${c.cardSent ? '' : ' (no card yet)'}`).join(', '));\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aad8-e6b0-7c02-9fba-a7e5c5a4c558","uuid":"8976477f-334d-4a80-a038-13e88c6e317e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_747","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have enough context to write the closing summary.\n\nThe deliverable is a self-contained browser first-person survival shooter inspired by Far Cry 2. Open the HTML file in Chrome or Edge to play. Use WASD and mouse for movement, Enter or Space to confirm menus, and a gamepad is supported. Run `bash \"Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503/tests/run.sh\" all` to execute tests.\n\nEscape pauses the game. The closing summary must be at most four bullets total.\n\nThe draft totals about 72 words. It pairs one descriptive sentence with two bullets for opening and controls. The test command may be dropped to stay under the 80-word limit.\n\nThe description is trimmed to about 24 words. The test command is dropped because the user asked how to play, not how to test. The draft now uses two bullets: opening the HTML file from disk in Chrome or Edge with WebGPU, and confirming menus with Enter or Space.\n\nThe final draft pairs one descriptive sentence with two bullets. The sentence names the artifact and its key features: jamming guns, wind-driven fire, fever, vehicles, contracts, and three endings. The first bullet covers opening the HTML file in Chrome or Edge. The second covers movement with WASD and mouse or a gamepad, pausing with Escape, and dev mode access.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Jam Cry is a self-contained first-person survival shooter in one HTML page: jamming guns, wind-driven fire, fever, vehicles, contracts, companions, and three endings.\n\n- Open `Jam Cry-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013503.html` in Chrome or Edge. It runs from `file://` and needs WebGPU.\n- Confirm with Enter or Space. Move with WASD and the mouse, or a standard gamepad. Esc pauses; Dev mode is on that menu."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2571,"output_tokens":1610,"cache_read_in